window.SEARCH_INDEX = [{"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-1.html#big-idea", "text": "Everything, including you, is made of one vibrating structure. Your thoughts, emotions and actions send out a frequency, and that frequency decides which reality you move into next. Keep sending the same frequency and you lock in a timeline. To change your life, change the frequency, hold it steadily, take action, and let go of any expectation about how the result will come. You don't have to see it to believe it; you have to know it in order to see it.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "1.1  Reality is one structure — and you are it", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-1", "text": "The teaching starts with how everything is built. The whole universe comes from one single particle. That particle vibrates so fast that it keeps appearing next to itself, and next to itself again, without end. This is how one thing becomes everything. When two parts of this structure vibrate at a similar frequency (they \"resonate\"), they join and form a plasma, called a trinity plasma. Two similar plasmas can join again and make a third, and this repeats through the whole universe. The field is full of light and sound frequencies, so there are endless plasmas, and each one can hold a whole universe or cluster inside it. In the middle of a plasma is a black hole. The black hole is the portal, the doorway you pass through when you move from one reality to another. You are made of this same structure. When consciousness puts out a thought, it creates; that is how you were created too. So the teaching says you are the structure, the universe and the quantum field, \"the god particle\". Nobody is outside of you: there is no separate God sitting in the sky, and the other people you meet appear as a hologram, a projection made of frequency, sound, mantra and geometric patterns, so that consciousness can have an experience. This is also where science and religion meet. \"Religion, believe it or not, is science.\" Understood together, there is no need for different religions or for separation, because you are everything that you are. The one particle \"in the beginning had no laws,\" so it vibrates at infinite speed and appears next to itself to infinity; this is why we are all one. When you look at someone, that someone is you through a different experience (HR). Trinity structures form toruses, and the black holes inside them are multidimensional portals in the universal magma (SD); two similar systems combine as 1 + 1 = 3 (SD, NT). Every planet, including Earth, has a black hole at its centre acting as a portal (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "1.2  What you send out is what you get back", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-2", "text": "Because you are the structure, your thoughts are not private events in your head. Every thought has a frequency, a sound and a geometric pattern. When you send out a thought together with an emotion and a deed, the three form one broadcast, a trinity of creation. That broadcast creates a parallel reality that matches it, and you move into that reality through the portal. You don't actually travel. You shift, like a snapshot jumping to the next frame. This is the simple reason why whatever you put out is what you get back: you are always stepping into the reality your own broadcast built. Every thought and every emotion is creating your reality. All three parts must match. Positive words with doubt underneath, or positive thoughts with no action, are not one clear signal. The teaching is to send thoughts, emotions and deeds \"at the same time as a trinity, non-stop\" in the positive. Your reality is a mirror image of your energy and thoughts. To create a reality you must be its vibration, acting and projecting the frequency, emotion and deeds into your hologram (DP). \"We are not traveling or moving at all. We are simply popping in and out of parallel realities\" (HR, NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "1.3  Timelines are built moment to moment", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-3", "text": "Picture realities as a long row of frames. Each moment you step into the next frame that matches what you are sending. If you keep sending the same emotion, for example sadness, then each new reality is built on sadness, and so is the next, and the next. That chain of similar realities is called a timeline. Staying in the same emotion moment after moment is how a timeline crystallizes: it becomes solid and real for you. To change it, you raise your thoughts to the positive, from a genuinely good feeling, and stay there moment after moment. The first positive moment moves you onto a different frame; holding it builds a new chain, and that new timeline crystallizes with a positive outcome. If you then want something else, you do the same again. Timelines differ in frequency. The higher the frequency, the less friction (resistance) there is: things manifest easily, and these realities are described as closer to the extraterrestrials. At lower frequency the structure is dense, and getting from one reality to the next feels \"like swimming underwater.\" Do \"steady positive implementation of your mind and feelings at all time\" (DP). New structures crystallize through \"repetition, repetition, repetition\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "1.4  If you can imagine it, it already exists", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-4", "text": "A rule (a \"bylaw\") taught by the extraterrestrials: you cannot think of something unless you already know its vibration. So if you can imagine a reality, it already exists somewhere in the field of your timeline. How can that be? Because there is no time. The one particle flickers so fast that all parallel realities exist at the same moment, side by side, in the \"quantum magma\". It is like a television on which every channel is playing at once; you are simply tuned to one. Which one you watch depends on the frequency of your emotion, thought and deed. Then why don't you see the reality you imagine? Because it isn't crystallized yet. Something that exists only in the field becomes visible when you take action and hold its frequency moment to moment. And since every reality is already running, there is nothing to worry about in switching between them.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "1.5  Why the same things keep happening", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-5", "text": "The field works at 100%. A reality is created only when you vibrate at its frequency. If you want something but your real frequency is different, you land in a different reality, and the old situation repeats. The comparison given is a film download: at 99% it won't play; it has to be 100%. The main thing that holds you below 100% is expectation. Your everyday, three-dimensional brain can't see how higher consciousness will bring something about; only the higher level knows the route. When you expect a particular outcome, you are carrying a hidden script of how it must happen, and that script is itself sent into the field as a frequency, a condition. Questioning or doubting the result does the same. It blocks the manifestation. So you let go of every expectation about how, and you simply know what you want. Knowing is 100%. You manifest in the now, not before and not later. Whatever you see in the meantime, stay calm, keep projecting the positive through thought, emotion and deed, and know that whatever happens is part of the process. The same download example appears in the book, with one addition: you must believe and feel at the same time, with the frequency of pure love, at 100%. Manifestation happens only when there is no ego (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "1.6  Your emotion is your compass", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-6", "text": "Your true nature, the teaching says, is pure love. So the moment you feel hurt, fear or doubt, that feeling is your higher self, speaking from the heart, showing you that you are off-balance with who you really are. A painful emotion is a signal, not a verdict. The belief that you have no power was printed into you through indoctrination and manipulation. In reality you have all the power, because you are consciousness itself. What you see around you is a hologram that shows you your location: where you are in the field right now. If you don't recognise where you are, you can \"pop into\" a completely different reality without knowing how you got there. This is why reacting matters so much. If you answer a hard moment with the same negative emotion, you project the next hologram with the same Earth, the same person and the same problem, and the outcome \"could be a disaster.\" If you give a positive input instead, you keep shifting until a positive outcome crystallizes. Controlling your emotion is how you consciously create. The Method below is the practice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "1.7  Abundance and receiving", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-7", "text": "The teaching is that money is an illusion within the hologram. Whether you need $1 or $1 million makes no difference to the structure: if you stay in the heart, without greed and without conditions, you receive exactly what you need through synchronicity, the right thing turning up at the right moment. What blocks receiving is the ego's belief that you must have a lot in the bank to feel good. We were conditioned to think we must charge something in order to have something. Ask yourself honestly: am I homeless? hungry? without clothes? \"Then what do you need?\" Feeling that you already have everything, and that everything is perfect, is the frequency that receives. The practical tool is the hide-and-seek game. When something seems missing, pull out of the worry, give thanks for what you have, then know it is already there and go looking for it, or take the next action. You are not searching in hope; you are searching because you know. In the structure it cannot be missing when you need it; you are shifting into the reality where you find it. Two cautions. First, watch the subtle drops: receiving something and thinking \"only this much?\" lowers your frequency. Stay in joy and gratitude, and more tends to follow, sometimes from several directions at once. Second, don't stay home in a low mood. A low mood projects you into a reality where no route appears. Lift your emotion, lift the people around you, and go about your day knowing you have what you need, without trying to work out the route. The structure is limitless; you never know how it will come. What you need can arrive as money, a donation or a gift, such as clothes instead of the money for clothes. The money system is still part of the structure, so you accept help gratefully when it comes. And it doesn't matter how something arrives, even if another person was the route: that is still the structure answering you. \"Give without expectations. Look for the manifestation without resistance\" (DP, NT). Abundance comes from within, by being the abundance; to see all abundance, give all abundance (DP). Giving and sharing from the heart with nothing expected back is called Energy Philanthropy, and it replaces the monetary-timeline illusion with energy from the heart (DP). Profiting from humanity's pain is explicitly opposed (DP). The key line on this \"In a quantum structure, you don't have to see it to believe it, you have to know it in order to see it.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "1.8  Lessons, agreements and other people", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-8", "text": "Not everything can be shifted at once. Some situations are agreements: experiences you (and the people close to you) agreed to before coming here, in order to learn. If it is an agreement, you cannot skip it or change its outcome by force. What you can do is accept it and pass the lesson with excellence, doing your best from the heart. Often you go through it so that you gain knowledge you will later use to help others. The guides are described as \"tough teachers\": they won't simply hand over every answer, because then you wouldn't learn. Both versions of any lesson exist side by side: the reality in which you handle it well and the one in which you don't. That is why someone who can see the structure may say \"do this, not that.\" Your task is to stay positive so that you learn through the process. As for others: since everyone you see is part of your projection, how you treat them is how you treat yourself. If someone manipulates you, don't go after them viciously; you would be going after yourself. Learn the lesson, pull out, and project the positive. What they did stays in their reality; your positive projection is \"taken care of\" by the structure, though you don't know how or how fast. With practice it can take just one thought, and a result can come within seconds or hours.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "The method — The Pull Out Method", "url": "section-1.html#method", "text": "What to do when something goes wrong, or when you want something: Notice. A painful emotion is your higher self telling you you're off-balance (your true nature is pure love). Pull out. Step out of the scene, as if watching it. \"Pull out and know that you are the structure.\" Don't react with the same emotion. Calm down completely. Be grateful for what you already have. Don't reject what's in front of you; rejection is a frequency too, and it comes back. Lift and project. Raise your emotion to the positive, and let your words, tone of voice and actions match it. Let go of the how. No script, no expectation of the outcome. Be okay with whatever outcome comes. Take action and hold it moment to moment, even if nothing changes at first. If you slip, go back to step 2.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "Why does the same thing keep happening, even when I'm trying to change it?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "Because the field only creates what you vibrate at 100%. If part of you doubts, questions the result, or is holding a picture of exactly how it must happen, that doubt or picture is sent into the field too, and it blocks the new reality. Let go of the how, know what you want, stay calm whatever you see, and keep projecting the positive. Whatever happens in between is part of the process (see 1.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "Why do some manifestations take a long time while others happen almost instantly?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "There are two reasons. First, there is no time in the structure, so the delay usually comes from your own conditions and expectations. Second, there may be an agreement or a lesson in the way. For example, you may want contact with your galactic family now, but first need to gain certain knowledge, like finishing a school year. If you complete your lessons with excellence, the higher consciousness may decide to bring things forward, but that isn't guaranteed. Not all of us know our agreements.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "I was raised to serve, not to ask for myself. Can I manifest for myself and still live abundantly?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "Yes. Nothing is wrong with asking for yourself, as long as it doesn't come from greed or only from the money system. You are not separate from God; you are the structure, so the real question is how you are shaping it. Help and give from the heart: the people you serve are part of your own projection, so in a sense you are serving yourself too. Keep the job or \"platform\" that pays your bills; beyond that, do something from the heart every day for others. That shifts you toward abundance, which may come as money, a donation or a gift. Just don't lock it to money, and don't attach conditions, because what you put out comes back.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "What does \"quantum structure\" mean?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "It is the single vibrating field everything is made of. Similar frequencies join into plasmas, plasmas join into more plasmas, and the whole universe is built this way. You are made of it, so you are the structure: you project everything you see, and there is nobody outside of you (see 1.1). Its importance for you is that consciousness and science are the same thing seen from two sides.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "How can I manifest for myself without affecting other people?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "The people in front of you are part of your projection, so start with yourself. Pull out, calm down completely, and be grateful for what you have, without rejecting anything. Then imagine what you want without expecting a particular outcome. If someone is upset with you, answer kindly and without judgment, for example \"I understand you're upset; can we talk a bit later?\", and keep that positive tone even if they carry on. The result may be that they walk away, calm down, or end the friendship; be okay with any outcome. You projected love, so a positive outcome follows for you.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "How can I consciously create, using the structure?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "By controlling your emotion. When a feeling hurts, notice it as a sign you are off-balance with pure love. Pull out of the hologram, remember you are the structure, and lift the emotion straight away with gratitude. Then let the new reality come through synchronicity, without setting conditions on how. If you react with the same emotion, you just print the same scene again (see 1.6 and the Method).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "How do I tell whether something is a soul agreement or something I can change?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "If you try to shift something and it doesn't move, first check for conditions and doubts. If it still doesn't change, treat it as a lesson. The guidance given in one hard situation, a child's illness, was: \"It's a lesson. Accept this step.\" An agreement can't be skipped. Accept it, then pass it with excellence: do your best from the heart, learn everything it teaches, and know that the knowledge may later help others. Healing did come in that case, but it took time (see 1.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "Is this \"dimensional materialization\" or simply attraction?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "They are one and the same. Similar sounds and frequencies attract each other in the field and form matching parallel realities. That attraction is what builds your timelines and decides which reality you shift into.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "I'd like to know how to use this in everyday life.", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "The everyday lessons are in 1.7: play the hide-and-seek game when something seems missing, don't let a low mood keep you home, stay grateful whatever arrives, and accept that the structure decides the route. Even when you find out another person was the route, it is still the structure answering you.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "We seem stamped with patterns that keep replaying. How do I stop repeating them?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "Each person's situation is individual, but the rule is the same: a pattern repeats until you pass its lesson with excellence, 100%, until no friction is left and it is completely balanced. And don't expect it to repeat: that belief is a projection too, and doubt sends doubt back. Know that whatever you do from the heart is positive, and don't doubt yourself.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "How do I know whether I'm on my mission? The signs seem to have slowed down.", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "You are always on your mission; being here is part of it. To know your next step, take a sheet of paper, write what you love to do, and pick the most exciting thing, without thinking about the outcome. Stay with your passion; it shifts you, moment to moment, into the reality that gives you what you need.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "Do binaural beats help with manifesting?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "They are a permission slip: something you have chosen that helps you calm down, expand and connect. If they resonate with you, use them. The power to connect is yours, not the tool's.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "Does understanding ley lines or the energy grid help to shift reality?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "This question was not understood during the session, so it was not answered.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "How can we lift all of humanity when so many don't yet see the need?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "There is nobody outside of you; the people you see are part of your projection, each living their own lessons and agreements. Some agreements are very hard, such as living through war, and their suffering makes others say \"this is not right; let's unite.\" It is part of the awakening. Everyone is at a different stage, and the teaching is that \"we already made it.\" Your part is to follow your passion, which is your higher self: donate, help a cause, join a peace gathering or meditation if that calls you. You then create an Earth where that negativity no longer exists, or at least isn't part of your everyday life.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "My ears keep ringing. How do I stop it?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "It can be many things. One explanation given is sensitivity to the new frequencies the planet is receiving; many people go through it to different degrees. Don't be alarmed and don't treat it as negative. The deeper lesson: the same event has two possible realities. Believe you are being attacked by frequencies and you shift into that; see it as part of your ascension and you shift into a positive outcome. \"Which one you pick is up to you.\" (If ringing is persistent or comes with hearing loss or pain, it's sensible to have it checked by a doctor too.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "sl": "Section 1", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-1.html#remember", "text": "• You are the structure. What you send out comes back. • Change the frequency, then hold it, moment to moment. • Know it 100%. No doubts, no script of how. • Act. Be grateful. Accept any outcome. • \"You don't have to see it to believe it; you have to know it in order to see it.\"", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-2.html#big-idea", "text": "Before you react, pull out to zero point: go still and neutral, and see where you are in the field. From there you choose the next frequency on purpose. You shift through realities that are similar in frequency, and each two merge into a third (1 + 1 = 3). That third reality takes on whatever emotion you held most. So don't fight or reject what you see. Overwrite it: choose the positive, amplify it until it is potent, hold it, then release it with no expectations.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "2.1  Zero point — stillness and knowing where you are", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-1", "text": "The talk revisits the one particle (see 1.1) and adds that it is also a nano particle: it expands, like breathing, and when it collapses it reaches the zero point. Zero point is stillness: no frequency coming in and no frequency going out. It is pure awareness of your location in the quantum field. The TV picture from 1.4 is extended: imagine sitting in front of many screens at once, each a reality you exist in. Which one you experience depends on your emotion, deeds and actions; they are your remote control. To use it well you first pull out and sit back in front of the screens, still, and check where you are. Knowing your location matters because if you don't, you \"pop out\" into a completely different reality or timeline without knowing where you are (see 1.6). Once you know your location, the next frequency you send from that awareness creates the next reality. Neutrality \"is the one that is giving you to choose with a clear mind\" the next frequency to project. You localize and stabilize in zero point, creating a \"vacuum of stillness,\" so you can shift and choose the new reality. Without it you live in \"constant duality, a constant battle of two or more realities\" (SD, the \"Mobilizing Structures\" chapter, which this talk reads from). Zero point is also called the heart structure \"where there is no conditions for manifestation\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "2.2  Mobilizing structures: 1 + 1 = 3", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-2", "text": "You are always shifting from one reality to the next and reprinting everything around you each time. Two realities, one after the other, are similar but never exactly the same in frequency. To manifest, they must be similar enough to merge. When they merge, they form a third reality: 1 + 1 = 3, the trinity (see 1.1). Your emotion decides the merge. If you are happy and then drop into doubt, your energy field switches so sharply that you fall into a different reality, and the next one is built on the negative. If instead you stay steady and keep reacting positively, even while the other person stays negative, you override the negative moment by moment. The two timelines become one positive unit. Both timelines co-exist; you move between them by choosing. That choice is made from zero point. Without it, shifting is random, because uncontrolled emotion keeps dropping you into denser realities. Emotion gives the frequency to the next reality, and your deed (action) infuses it. If two parallel realities are not similar in resonance they \"can not merge as one\"; you must level the field so that no new frequency is given, then choose (SD). Two systems combine \"1 + 1 = 3\" (SD, NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "2.3  Doubt makes you flicker", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-3", "text": "Doubt doesn't just pause you; it makes you bounce nonstop between two realities, like a waveform, so fast you can't tell where you're going. The quantum field never makes a mistake, so eventually it picks one: the one you infused more. If you spent more of the day in doubt, the third reality comes out negative, even if you didn't notice. Whatever emotion you stay in most, through the day and in your reactions, becomes the outcome. Fluctuating realities switch so quickly they cannot collapse into one, because they cannot hold the steady frequency of the heart (DP). Any doubt projects a holographic reality that mimics that doubt (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "2.4  Neutral is for hard moments — joy is not to be suppressed", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-4", "text": "Zero point means being neutral in a disturbing situation: not giving or taking emotion, just observing. It does not mean holding back joy. When you feel joy, keep going: each next shift is again joy, and you build a joyful timeline. The new frequencies arriving now, the talk says, come from the fifth dimension and above, are positive, and can activate your DNA. The more positive you are, the more positive you see.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "2.5  Other people's projections are not your truth", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-5", "text": "What you are shown, especially in the news, is a projection of someone else's timeline placed on top of you. Watch it over and over and you start to believe it; once you believe it 100%, it manifests for you. Instead, be aware: \"That's what they're projecting. Good for them. Love and light.\" The example is a storm forecast. Instead of accepting it, project that the weather is beautiful and keep doing so even if the sky is dark or rain starts. Give gratitude even for the rain: gratitude neutralizes what you see, bringing you to zero, so your new frequency can override it. The alternative is fluctuating into doubt because someone else told you what would happen. Language matters: say \"I know\", not \"I will\". \"Will\" keeps you waiting; manifestation is in the now. Also follow the money: if something is truly for humanity, it comes through the heart, not at a high price.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "2.6  Overwrite — don't reject, don't \"delete\"", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-6", "text": "You cannot delete a negative thought by rejecting it, because what you see is part of the structure, and you are the structure (see 1.1). You \"delete\" it through neutrality: \"I understand you're there. Thank you for showing me where I'm at in the quantum field.\" Then project a new, stronger frequency over it. You are not rejecting it; you are overriding it. The guidance is to make the new frequency potent. When told \"Action!\" like an actor, switch your emotion to positive and keep increasing the joy until you have goosebumps or tears. Like a stronger dose of medicine, it has to be stronger than the dense frequency it replaces. Then hold it, and finally to drop it: release it into the field so the consciousness you're made of can crystallize it. Dropping it matters because holding on adds conditions. With no conditions, \"Pandora's box is open\" and you receive everything you need. In the example given, the whole day turned out positive. Release the specifics too. Imagine the big picture without scripting it (the example: humanity living in beautiful cities, with free energy and benevolent extraterrestrials) and keep holding it, even when you hear negative news.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "2.7  Every moment is a brand-new reality", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-7", "text": "When you fall off the timeline you wanted and then rise again, you don't return to the old one: you create a brand new reality, and every moment does the same. That's why you can let go of past sorrow: it has nothing to do with the new you projected into the field. A timeline you held long enough can crystallize so differently that you no longer remember someone from an old one. What you repeat, you build. A constant diet of violent films or games feeds a timeline similar to it, which is why the advice is not to let children consume a lot of negative content. You also need recall. Each new hologram reprints the frequencies of the last one so you know where you are. When you walk into a room and forget why, you have shifted so fast you lost the frequency. The method: recall the previous room's frequency — where you were, what you were thinking, doing or saying — and the memory returns. \"Do not hold your previous emotions. It is irrelevant,\" because each parallel universe you shift into exists for itself, in the now (SD). Night dreams and waking life are both dreams; you only shift perception, and \"everything is NOW\" (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "2.8  Ascension: your own, and always positive", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-8", "text": "This reality is described as a dream state of consciousness that feels real, like touching something in a dream. Raising your consciousness shifts you to another timeline. Contact with extraterrestrials works the same way: your reality and theirs merge into a third, which needs similar frequencies held steady. Consciousness cannot exist in the negative only; it would disengage. So persistent negativity eventually dissipates, and people who stay negative meet realities that push them to stop. Each person makes their own ascension: be kind, share and give, and you match the less dense fifth-dimensional structures. Choose greed and negativity, and you project into a dense timeline, \"underwater\" instead of above it (see 1.3). In ascension \"all the dirt\" comes to the surface because it can't match 5D. Don't hate those exposed; it is their level of consciousness. Give gratitude that it came out. Without seeing the negative you couldn't choose the positive. It is a classroom: learn the lesson and move on. Love is the highest frequency; fear, hatred, jealousy and revenge are lower and trap you in a lower hologram of wars and destruction. A negative, materialistic or ego-driven person will see that reflected (HR). \"You are dreaming the ascension but you already made it\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "2.9  Affirmations, ego and peeling the layers", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-9", "text": "Affirmations work when stated in the now: \"I am fine,\" \"I am great.\" \"I'm going to be fine\" is false language that keeps you waiting. Say it knowing it 100%, so your frequency stops fluctuating, even if others say otherwise. But watch the ego. Affirming \"I'm perfect\" to dismiss someone's fair feedback is ego. Peel the layers: why do I really want this? Is it from my heart or my ego? Do I want to talk to one person, or a thousand because it makes me feel important? Ego is dense and built on false pretense. The heart's vibration is consciousness itself, which is why heart-based manifestation can be instant, while conditions slow it. We are perfect in the structure, but confused and manipulated. You will be tested, and what counts is how you behave towards people. When you slip into ego, you will be corrected: shift to gratitude and drop expectations towards people and situations. \"The Ego structure is lowering your vibrational signal.\" Do not try to profit from others; abundance comes in any form, not only money (DP, NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "2.10  When people stay negative", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-10", "text": "Talk it through and try to change the situation. If it doesn't change, pull out and choose where you want to be, so you keep your integrity. It hurts because you care. But don't hate: hatred is a false pretense too. Love the person, who is out of balance, and offer help. If they refuse it, put your energy into people who are ready. \"Make your own world.\" On money (see 1.7): pay your bills and do your work. But don't let \"how can I make money from this person?\" sit behind your help. Give from the heart and what you need can arrive. Finally, the talk stresses that it shares one truth, the one it was shown, to explain how the structure works. What you hear from anyone, including messages and news, is a projection from another timeline and doesn't have to be your truth. The aim is to empower you, so that you don't need anyone else to do it for you: you are the consciousness itself, and you choose what to create.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "The method — the Overwrite Protocol", "url": "section-2.html#method", "text": "Use it the moment you notice a negative emotion, a disturbing scene, or someone else's projection: Notice the drop. \"I recognise what I just did.\" Negative emotion is a denser frequency. Pull out. Tell yourself, \"I am a hologram.\" Step back as if watching the screens. Go to zero point. Still and neutral, with no emotion in or out. Find your location. Say \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at.\" Don't reject what you see; gratitude neutralizes it. Choose with a clear mind: the positive, through the heart. Speak it in the now (\"I am\", \"I know\"). Amplify. Switch the emotion on like an actor on cue and increase it until you feel it strongly (goosebumps, tears). It must be stronger than what it overwrites. Hold, hold, hold, steadily and at 100%, even if the scene doesn't change yet. Steadiness decides the 1 + 1 = 3 outcome. Drop it. Release it into the field with no expectations of how, and let consciousness crystallize it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "Could you explain again how two realities come together to make a third?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "You are shifting from one reality to the next all the time, and each time you reprint everything around you. Two realities in a row are similar but never identical. If you stay steady in one emotion, say happiness, the two are close enough to merge, and the third reality that comes out carries that happiness. If you drop into doubt or anger in between, your energy field switches so sharply that you fall into a different reality, and the third one comes out negative. So the outcome is decided by the emotion you keep holding (see 2.2, 2.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "How do agreements affect the path to an outcome?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "An agreement is something specific you came here to complete, and you will be guided towards it whatever you do. If you don't listen, you may take detours, but you still end up there. Guidance you ignore at first often leads you into a situation that proves it was right, and that is how you learn to pay attention. Guidance may also steer you away from people who are trying to use you, without telling you why, so you can protect the integrity of your work. Within your agreements, you still choose your reality and your outcome.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "How do I know I'm at zero point, in stillness?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "Zero point means you are neutral: in the middle, not giving out emotion and not taking it in, just observing. Whenever something stirs a strong emotion in you, pull out, say to yourself \"I'm in a hologram,\" and simply watch. That still, aware observing is zero point. From there you can choose the next frequency with a clear mind (see 2.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "If I'm feeling real joy, is that a neutral state? Should I hold it back?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "No, joy isn't neutral, and you should not hold it back. Neutral is for disturbing moments. When you feel joy, keep going: the next reality you shift into is again joy, and the next, until you have built a joyful timeline. The new frequencies arriving now are positive and come from the fifth dimension and above; the more positive you are, the more positive you see (see 2.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "We're programmed to think negatively. Can I tell the field \"I don't accept this thought\" and delete it?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "You can't delete it by rejecting it, because what you see is part of the structure, and you are the structure; rejection is just another frequency sent out. You delete it through neutrality. Say \"I understand you're there. Thank you for showing me where I'm at.\" Then pull out, and project a strong new positive frequency over it: switch your emotion like an actor on cue, increase it until you feel it strongly, hold it, then release it. You're not rejecting it; you're overriding it (see 2.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "If I drop off the timeline I want and then raise my frequency again, do I go back to the same timeline?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "No. Every moment you create a brand-new reality, so you build a new timeline rather than returning to the old one. This is good news: you can let go of past sorrow, because it has nothing to do with the new you that you're projecting now. It's also why, after a long time on a very different timeline, you may no longer remember someone from the old one (see 2.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "Are affirmations effective for correcting negative thinking?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "Yes, when they are a statement in the now: \"I am fine,\" \"I am at peace,\" not \"I'm going to be fine,\" which keeps you waiting. Say it knowing it 100%, so your frequency stops fluctuating, even if others say otherwise. But check for ego: affirming \"I'm perfect\" to brush off fair feedback is ego. Peel the layers and ask whether you want something from the heart or from the ego (see 2.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "I understand it completely. Living it is a whole other matter. What then?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "That's why it needs practice. Each time a situation comes up, pull yourself out and remember you are in a hologram; if you forget, it is very easy to slide back into the emotion and project the negative. Watch the teaching again, study it like maths, and apply it daily. As you practise, you begin to vibrate differently and connect more with your guidance, and you will be tested, mostly on how you treat people.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "sl": "Section 2", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-2.html#remember", "text": "• Pull out to zero point first, then choose. • The outcome follows the emotion you hold most. Doubt makes you flicker. • Don't reject. Neutralize with gratitude, then overwrite. • Amplify, hold, then drop it: no conditions. • Every moment is new. Speak in the now. Check heart against ego.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-3.html#big-idea", "text": "When what you say or do differs from what you truly feel, you send two frequencies at once and start to flicker between two realities. The field always delivers the more potent one, and that is what you truly feel. Because the cover-up is dense, it often arrives as a negative stoppage. There is no such thing as a white lie: be truthful from the heart, kindly. The same no-time structure explains bilocation (A to B = AB). Your heart is the compass for every truth you hear, including teachers'.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "3.1  Two frequencies at once: the overlay", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-1", "text": "The teaching example: someone doesn't want to go out with a friend, but to be polite says, \"Yes, I'm so excited!\" Then they spend the next half hour wishing they had stayed home. Within minutes they hurt a foot badly enough that they nearly can't go. The explanation of what happened: What you truly feel is your real, heart-level frequency, and it is potent. What you say on top of it is an overlay: another layer of emotion and reality that isn't your true self, \"like a lie\". Now you are sending two frequencies at the same time, so you flicker like a waveform between two realities, through endless probabilities. The field then picks the more potent one, and that is always what you truly feel. It searched through all the probabilities for a way to keep them home. Energy is unbiased: it goes where you sent it, but you don't know the route. It could have been their own injury, or something happening to the friend. And because the overlay is a lie, the frequency is dense, so the result usually comes as a negative stoppage.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "3.2  There is no white lie", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-2", "text": "\"There is no white lie or a bad lie. Frequency is frequency.\" Small or big, the energy goes somewhere, usually into the negative, because it isn't your true self. It is the same mechanism as doubt (see 2.3): two frequencies, flickering, and the more potent one wins. This is how negative energy builds up. Karma is defined as accumulated false pretense: the build-up of everything you said or did that wasn't your true vibration. Being truthful doesn't mean over-explaining. You can say, kindly: \"I'm sorry, something came up. Can we do it another time?\" People usually understand. You don't owe anyone the private details, and you should respect other people's privacy in the same way. Building on a lie creates \"duality of false frequency realities,\" which keeps fluctuating and cannot collapse into one; you end up \"living in your own deception,\" because the field mimics your structure precisely (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "3.3  You are always fluctuating — so fluctuate in the positive", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-3", "text": "You shift through endless realities all the time, so no one can map your exact path, not even you. The aim is to stay positive most of the time, which eventually becomes all the time as it crystallizes. Through joy, giving and sharing from the heart, each next hologram is built on the positive. When you project positive from your true heart, know the outcome is positive. What you can't know is how or when; your 3D brain can't calculate infinite probabilities (see 1.5). When your emotion drops, switch it with gratitude for everything you have, and keep shifting. With mastery and no ego, manifestation can become instant.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "3.4  Ego is an overlay too", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-4", "text": "Wanting something to show off, or wanting more when you already have enough, is also an overlay: greed and manipulation sit on top of your true self. The teaching example is acting out of anger and wanting to be admired for a car; a serious accident followed quickly, with the question, \"Does it matter what type of car you're driving?\" Lesson: things are not who you are; seeking recognition through them is false pretense. Once you learn this, consequences arrive much faster. So keep peeling the layers (see 2.9): Was that truly what I felt? Did I do it from ego, or to make people think well of me so I'd feel better? When you find the true vibration, switch to it and hold it with your emotions and deeds. The better you master this, the faster outcomes come, because there is no time. The same applies to money (see 1.7): keep giving and sharing, and one day you'll need something and find it in front of you.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "3.5  Bilocation: A to B = AB", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-5", "text": "Measured against the motion of the Earth, the solar system and the universe, you are not moving at all: you are shifting like snapshots (see 1.2). Since the field has no time, you don't have to pass through every in-between reality. You can skip them and land directly in another: A to B is AB. That is bilocation, cutting through time-space at zero point. We can all do it; it is the goal. If it happens to you unexpectedly, for example ending up somewhere far from where you were driving, the advice is not to be scared. Let the explanation sink in, and work towards doing it knowingly. The way to learn it is through the structure, in order: quantum manifestation (Section 1), mobilizing structures (Section 2), the third reality you create with others, truth and deception (this section), then bilocation. The same A-to-B calculation appears in the book: \"we are actually not traveling or moving at all. We are simply popping in and out of parallel realities\" (HR). Bilocation is listed with levitation and telepathy as abilities of the emerging new human (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "3.6  Your heart is the compass — without judgment", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-6", "text": "Everyone speaks their truth from their own timeline, and between you and another person you create a third reality (see 2.2). So don't judge someone who truly believes they're right; even people doing harmful things act from their belief system and conditioning. (The example: we eat animals and consider them lower; what if a higher consciousness saw us the same way?) But do peel the layers: is this person speaking from the heart, or deceiving? If it isn't from the heart, ask \"What can I do to make the situation better?\" You don't have to join that kind of consciousness. Give love and light and stay in the heart. Negative can't withstand positive; positive always overrides density eventually, because consciousness must exist (see 2.8). The same applies to teachers and channels, including this one. Stay with whatever resonates with your heart. If something doesn't, perhaps it isn't your time for it, and that's fine. But don't keep supporting a big name out of false pretense once you sense, or discover, greed and manipulation. Being untruthful with yourself makes you fluctuate too. \"If there is negative talk let it be in that person's reality. Do not judge them. Everyone has a right to create and believe whatever they wish\" (DP). Those who oppose you can be \"your biggest teachers\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "3.7  Big frequency jumps — and checking your body", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-7", "text": "Shifting very quickly to a much higher frequency (\"3 to 7\" is only an example) can be too big a jump for the body, causing dizziness, nausea or even fainting. Reading can trigger it, because every word is a frequency: reading too far ahead, against guidance, can bring on nausea. The Harmonic Reactor book is said to carry fifth-dimensional frequency for this reason. This is integration, and it is normal. But it is made clear that it can also be a drop in frequency, or a sign that you are not healthy: \"maybe the sugar ended up dropping down.\" So if it happens, check what is going on with your body. \"Every word has sound geometry\" and penetrates your DNA code (SD, NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "3.8  Heart connection versus lust", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-8", "text": "When intimacy with a partner comes from the heart, it reaches a level of connection free of false pretense, and that energy is directed into a different timeline. Practices such as tantra are a permission slip (see 1.6, Q10). Once you know the vibration of loving ecstasy, you can recall it and hold it in everyday life without a ritual; you can't think of something whose vibration you don't already know (see 1.4). Lust is not the heart structure. Content that pulls emotion into lust leads to a different timeline, and turning intimacy into a constant ritual can pull you away from what matters, even into addiction. \"Lust is emptiness and it will never manifest you love\"; it loops the same energy and can spiral downward into empty self-indulgence. Learn to feel the difference between the body's reaction and the purity of heart love (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "3.9  Words, light language and downloads", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-9", "text": "Words are frequencies and mantras. Many words carry hidden meanings: read \"war\" backwards and it is \"raw\", and consciousness takes in both. So speak from the heart, with positive words and positive intention. Light language, such as unfamiliar script arriving through automatic writing, is coding made for your own consciousness, or sometimes the language of your galactic family. Accept it as it is; your consciousness crystallizes and transforms it, often as an activation. Ancient tablets are said to carry light language that can activate people who look at them. Information can also arrive as a download: a whole book's worth at once, which you then explain step by step. Everyone can do this, because you are consciousness and all the information is there. Like the \"genius\" child who simply knows the answer, you don't always need the working-out. Don't put conditions on it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "3.10  Stargates, not the Lion's Gate", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-10", "text": "The guidance behind these teachings (the Council of Nine and the 11-dimensional beings) is not working with portals such as the Lion's Gate, which belong to a different timeline sequence for those whose agreements lead there. They work with stargates: portals for ascension through intergalactic timelines. This is said to extend life beyond the 3D norm, \"80 years may turn into 300 or 500,\" through connection with your galactic family. Those involved are predetermined by timelines and agreements. Every system in the galaxy has a stargate, and you cannot pass through one unless your body resonates with it; negative thoughts and deeds won't match the resonance. \"So be good all the time\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "The method — the Truth Check", "url": "section-3.html#method", "text": "Use it before you answer, agree, buy or act, and whenever something you said doesn't sit right: Pause and feel. What do I truly feel about this, underneath politeness or habit? Peel the layers. Is this from my heart, or from ego, fear of disappointing, wanting to impress, or greed? Say your truth kindly. Brief and polite (\"Something came up, can we do it another time?\"). No full explanation needed. If you already overlaid it (said yes, meant no), catch it and correct it honestly before the two frequencies play out. If your emotion drops, switch it with gratitude for what you have (see 3.3). Project the positive from the heart and let go of when, where, who and how.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "Isn't this the same explanation as when we doubt?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "Yes, exactly. A lie and a doubt work the same way: you send two different frequencies at once, so you start to fluctuate between two realities, and the field gives you whichever one is more potent. With a lie, the more potent one is what you truly feel, so you get it, often by an unpleasant route. The fix for both is to be honest with yourself about what you really feel and redirect your thoughts and emotions to that (see 3.1, 3.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "So it's important to live in our own truth, let others live in theirs, and listen to our hearts?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "Yes. Be truthful to what you really feel. You don't have to over-explain when you say no; a polite \"Something has come up, can we do it another time?\" is enough, and people usually understand. If something is private, you can keep it private, and you should respect other people's privacy in the same way. What you shouldn't do is say something different from what you feel, because, small or big, that energy goes somewhere, usually into the negative (see 3.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "If I keep fluctuating and creating new timelines, does anyone know where I'm going, except my heart?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "You fluctuate through endless realities, so no one can map your exact path. What matters is to fluctuate in the positive: stay in joy, giving and sharing from the heart most of the time, and it becomes all the time as it crystallizes. When you project the positive from your true heart, you can know the outcome will be positive. What you can't know is how or when it comes, so don't set expectations. If your emotion drops, switch it with gratitude and keep going (see 3.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "My daughter turned at a stop sign near her home and found herself on the other side of the city. Did she go to another reality? How can we do this consciously?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "She shifted to a different reality and skipped all the realities in between. Because there is no time in the field, you don't have to pass through every frame from A to B; you can go straight there: A to B is AB. That is bilocation, and it is a good ability, not something to fear. Let the explanation sink in, and redirect the fear into knowing that you can do it. To learn it consciously, study the structure in order: manifestation (Section 1), mobilizing structures (Section 2), the shared third reality, truth and deception (this section), then bilocation (see 3.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "Is everyone telling me their own version of the truth? Is my heart my compass?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "Yes. Each person speaks from their own timeline and understanding, so don't judge someone who truly believes they are right. But do peel the layers: is it coming from the heart, or is it deception? If it isn't from the heart, stay in the heart yourself and ask \"What can I do to make this better?\" You don't have to take part in it (see 3.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "I'm bombarded with videos and channels, each with their own truth. How do I know what to believe?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "Stay with what resonates with your heart; you always know when something resonates. Check that it really is what you feel, not something you think you ought to feel. If a teaching doesn't resonate, perhaps it isn't your time for it, and that's fine. But if you sense, or find out, that a speaker is greedy or manipulative, don't keep supporting them just because they are well known; being untruthful with yourself makes you fluctuate (see 3.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "I collapsed on the bathroom floor, and my heart says I shifted to a higher density. Why?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "One explanation is a very fast jump in frequency: shifting quickly from a low frequency to a much higher one can be too much for the body at once, and you may feel nauseous or even pass out. Reading can trigger it too, because every word carries a frequency. This is integration and can be normal. But it can also be a drop in frequency or a health problem, such as low blood sugar, so check what is happening with your body; a collapse is worth seeing a doctor about (see 3.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "Is human evolution organic, for example through tantra and a strong sensual connection?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "When intimacy comes from the heart, it reaches a level of connection without false pretense, and that energy is redirected into a different timeline. But tantra is a permission slip: once you know the vibration of that loving ecstasy, you can recall it and hold it in everyday life without a ritual. Avoid content that pulls your emotion into lust, which leads to a different timeline and can become an addiction. And everything you connect with, animals included, is within your hologram, because the one particle is both the smallest thing and the whole universe (see 3.8, 1.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "What about the Lion's Gate portal?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "The guidance behind these teachings doesn't work with that portal; it belongs to a different timeline sequence, for people whose agreements lead there. This guidance works with stargates: portals for ascension through intergalactic timelines, said to extend life far beyond the usual span through connection with your galactic family (see 3.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "When I sit with pen and paper, I write in a cursive script that nobody can read. What is it?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "It is light language: coding made for your own consciousness, which only you can construct and deconstruct, or sometimes the language of your galactic family. Accept it as it is; your consciousness crystallizes and transforms it. It may be an activation, or information you need. Be glad of it: this is how it begins, and it can open more downloads (see 3.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "sl": "Section 3", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-3.html#remember", "text": "• What you truly feel is the potent frequency, and the field delivers it. • There is no white lie. Be truthful, kindly; you don't owe a full explanation. • Karma is accumulated false pretense. Peel the layers: heart or ego? • A to B = AB. There is no time, so the in-between can be skipped. • Your heart is your compass. Don't judge; stay with what resonates.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-4.html#big-idea", "text": "Every fixed price is a condition: a specific code you send into the field you are made of. Keep sending it, and you crystallize a timeline where the only way to receive anything is through money. Giving from the heart, and letting people choose what to give back, puts no condition on the field, so it can answer through infinite routes: money, donations, gifts, synchronicity. You still work and pay your bills, and you never reject money; you just don't limit yourself to it. To see a timeline of abundance, be the abundance.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "4.1  Where this comes from", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-1", "text": "The guidance for sharing this work was never to charge a price, but to let people donate for the time if they wished. That is confusing at first, since we all live in the money system, so the reason is taught step by step, through the quantum structure. It is shared as a map: use it or not, without judgment. The talk recaps the structure (see 1.1) and adds one link: sound and light combine into a trinity structure, which becomes plasma and a gravitational field; when that lowers its vibration, it becomes matter. We are made this way, so every thought and emotion reprints the next reality (see 1.2–1.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "4.2  A price is a code in the field", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-2", "text": "Every thought and emotion has its own exact frequency, sound and mantra. A condition is a specific code you send because you want a specific result. Telling people \"to talk to me it costs $300\" sends that code. Since you are the structure, the field answers in kind: your abundance can then arrive only through the monetary system. Everything else in life also has to be paid for or worked for, because that is the frequency you projected. The heart structure is the highest consciousness there is: still sound and light, but not dense. The money frequency arises through conditioning and is denser. Give from the heart, with no condition and with the other person free to choose, and you vibrate in that higher structure, leaving the whole field open. This isn't punishment; it is \"simply a matter of quantum physics.\" Live mostly by conditions and you build a hologram where, wherever you turn, someone is asking you for something. Remember, there is nobody outside of you (see 1.1): you recall and mimic that frequency in the people around you. \"Money is an illusion. It is blocking your signature of your heart. The exchange is through the heart\" (DP). Abundance comes \"through any form, not only money,\" not through \"conditions of old belief systems\" (SD, NT). This book passage itself refers readers to this video.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "4.3  Be the abundance", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-3", "text": "The new frequencies arriving with ascension are very high and match the heart. To see a reality you must be its frequency, so your deeds, emotions and treatment of people must be of the heart for you to shift into and crystallize a timeline of absolute abundance. That abundance might not involve money at all; one picture is extraterrestrials helping build cities. Consciousness itself is complete abundance. The more conditions you give as frequencies rise, the more you drop away from that timeline, simply because you aren't being the abundance towards others. To experience full abundance \"you have to first be the abundance yourself.\" Giving and sharing from the heart with no expectation of return is Energy Philanthropy, which replaces the monetary timeline (DP; see 1.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "4.4  The platform path for people who must earn", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-4", "text": "For someone who provides for a family, the guidance is not to quit. Go to work and pay your bills. Then, after work, do what excites you most, hold that vibration, and give from the heart nonstop, without expectations. This balances the structure and opens the field to return to you what you gave. Little by little your passion's heart frequency overrides the monetary one. Letting go of the belief that you need money to receive takes practice, because we are bombarded daily. The way through is step by step, without fear. What arrives may still be money, because you don't reject it, but through the heart: someone loves your paintings or handbags and offers a free gallery and sponsorship. Charging high prices to save for land or a facility is \"pure illusion\": it crystallizes the money route, when someone could instead call and fund it outright. If they do, you accept, because you simply did your job to the best of your abilities.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "4.5  Don't reject money — just don't limit yourself to it", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-5", "text": "Rejecting money entirely isn't the structure either, because unity is everything. Accept it when it comes. The point is not to make money the only route: a condition is \"a very narrow spec of the entire flow,\" while consciousness is limitless. The image: why reach into one small corner of the bag when the whole bag is yours? And if the bank account looks empty, don't drop your emotion; that is the illusion (see 1.7). Keep projecting the positive.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "4.6  Exactly what you need, at 100%", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-6", "text": "The example: money was needed for a child's school and the house was empty; an image of money came, with where to look, and exactly the amount needed was found. The lesson: you can shift into the reality that gives you exactly what you need, no more and no less. It must be 100% (see 1.5). At 99% you may still manifest, but the missing 1% creates friction: the condition. Even with practice, money and family worries can sit in the back of the mind; the practice is to let go completely. \"Know it, feel it, to project it\" — not see it first.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "4.7  Heart wants versus ego wants", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-7", "text": "Manifesting moment to moment without direction is random. What arrives may not be exactly what you pictured (the red car or the blue one) but something similar and relevant. So check: do I want this from the heart, or from ego and to show off (see 2.9, 3.4)? If it is pure and you truly need it, synchronicities come. Maybe not Hawaii, but a beach and palm trees that turn out better than you expected, because you let the field choose what is best. You still have to be the vibration of it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "4.8  Why give to others, and when people take", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-8", "text": "It isn't only for others' benefit. Giving to others removes the self-absorption, and that purity is the frequency you project into your next reality. The heart vibration and the money vibration are \"absolutely different\" timelines: one dense and conditioned, the other unlimited. The condition isn't only money; \"I'll give you this if you give me that\" is a condition too. Let the other person decide, from the heart, what to give. If someone could give but chooses to use you, \"that frequency of using somebody… stays in that person's reality, not yours.\" You did your job. Because you projected love, another person may come and give you double. A caution is added. Pricing people out of help that comes from a higher order, whether a healer or even a doctor, rejects part of consciousness, and so part of yourself. Rejection then comes back to you through some situation, because the structure mirrors what you do. \"Your popularity, money, and fame will not be the criteria for us. But how much you do for humanity out of your pure hearts\" (SD, DP). Where the book goes further: it suggests to \"stop the intake of money between each other, and instead share your knowledge from your hearts for free\" (DP). This video softens that for daily life: keep your job and pay your bills, and let the heart frequency grow alongside it (4.4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "4.9  Balance, wholeness and the future", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-9", "text": "It isn't left brain versus right brain. Use logic and emotion together; wholeness comes from the heart. You can still receive money while giving; what changes is that you receive through the heart frequency. Plenty of good, hard-working people don't operate this way, and that doesn't make them less good. But in the quantum structure, nobody is outside you: what matters is your own vibration, not what others charge. Do more of the money and you crystallize more of the money. The work is still real and challenging, a challenge you chose by coming here during ascension. The guidance is said never to have asked for payment; they asked for devotion, giving and sharing, \"even if it's one person you're talking to.\" The talk pictures a future where free energy and technology make money unnecessary, and points to Michael Tellinger's Ubuntu ideas as one model. Higher beings, it says, will connect with people by what they do for humanity, not by fame. The book predicts a new \"monetary distributing system\" and \"absolute abundance\" replacing dollars, for those who match that timeline energetically (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "The method — Opening the Field", "url": "section-4.html#method", "text": "Spot the condition. A fixed price, \"I'll give if you give back\", or the belief \"only money can bring me this\". Keep your platform. Do your job and pay your bills. After the bills, follow your passion daily and hold that excited vibration (see 1.6, Q9). Give from the heart, with no expectations. Let people choose what, if anything, to give back. Accept what comes, whether money, a donation or a gift. Don't reject money; just don't limit yourself to it. When money looks short, don't drop your emotion. Give gratitude, know you have what you need, and hold it at 100% (see 1.7). Check the want. Heart or ego? Only for me, or flowing to others too? Practise step by step, without fear. It is a lifestyle and a timeline you crystallize over time.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "Could I play with this approach for something I'd love, like a holiday in Hawaii, instead of the usual route?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "Yes, once you know how the field works this is a natural thing to try. First check the want: is it from the heart, to genuinely enjoy the experience, or from ego, for example to show off? If it is pure and you truly want it, keep being its vibration, and synchronicities come. What arrives may not be exactly what you pictured. It might not be Hawaii but a beach with palm trees somewhere that turns out even better, because you let the field choose what is best rather than setting a narrow condition (see 4.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "Does it have to be for other people's benefit? Why not just for my own enjoyment and upliftment?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "It isn't only for others; your own enjoyment is fine. But when you also give to others, you remove the self-absorption, and that purity, pure love, is the frequency you project into your next reality. The heart vibration and the money vibration are completely different timelines: one is dense and conditioned, so it is limited; the other has no condition, so it opens infinite routes. A condition doesn't have to be money; \"I'll give you this if you give me that\" is a condition too (see 4.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "What if someone could pay but simply uses me?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "That frequency of using someone stays in their reality, not yours. You did your job to the best of your ability and projected love, so the structure answers you, perhaps through someone else who gives you double. Don't let it drop your emotion (see 4.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "Timelines feel abstract. How do I tie this to the logical, everyday way we live?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "It isn't left brain against right brain. Use logic and emotion together; wholeness comes from the heart. In daily life that means: keep your job and pay your bills, and alongside it give from the heart and follow your passion. You can still receive money; you simply receive it through the heart frequency, and over time that frequency grows until it overrides the monetary one (see 4.4, 4.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "Many good, honest, hard-working people don't operate by giving to others. Are they any less good?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "No, and this isn't a judgment of anyone. The point is the quantum structure: nobody is outside of you, so what matters is your own vibration, not what others charge or do. If you live more by money, you crystallize more of the money route; the new frequencies coming in are heart-based, so living by the heart is how you match them. It is real work and a real challenge, one you chose by coming here at this time (see 4.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "Isn't simply carrying goodness wherever you go, with whoever you meet, a good thing too?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "Of course; nobody says you can't. The key is again that there is nobody outside of you. You crystallize a timeline of abundance by behaving in the heart vibration yourself, moment to moment, whatever anyone else is doing. You may keep seeing people who charge or live differently, because you reprint the previous reality to have an experience, but it doesn't have to stay that way for you (see 4.3, 4.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "sl": "Section 4", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-4.html#remember", "text": "• A fixed price is a condition: a code that narrows your field to money. • Keep your job and bills; let heart-based giving grow alongside them. • Accept money, but don't limit yourself to it. • Be the abundance you want to see. Let people choose what to give. • Know it, feel it, project it, at 100%, no more and no less than you need.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-5.html#big-idea", "text": "Energy Philanthropy means replacing money, as your inner currency, with the energy of giving from the heart. Give without conditions and the field mirrors you, so what you need arrives through money, gifts or anything else. The same structure explains how to leave a low state: neutralize where you are, then shift your location with potent gratitude and positive action. Every moment you print a new reality; recall a location strongly enough, at 100%, and you can skip the steps in between. What you believe and do decides which Earth you see.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "5.1  What Energy Philanthropy is", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-1", "text": "The starting point: a wish to give everything away \"if I were a billionaire.\" The guidance answered: \"What makes you think you don't have everything?\" Money is energy, and also a timeline structure (see 4.2). The instruction: replace the money with the energy of giving from the heart. Giving all day, and letting people donate if they wish, is already doing it. That is Energy Philanthropy. When you give without expectations, \"all the universe will support\" you, one way or another. You don't reject money; you just don't set the exact amount, because a set amount prints a code in the field and \"overtakes\" energy (see 4.2). Giving from the heart is \"the highest frequency [that] can possibly be for manifestation\", and it is how you create a fifth-dimensional structure. The field mirrors you, so things become \"flawless\": you think of something and someone shows up. It also changes the receiver. Letting people choose how to support you teaches them to give from the heart to any cause, which raises their frequency too. Collaborating from the heart, without taking from each other, opens things up for everyone involved. \"The true passion of love to others is giving endlessly because you are never depleted. You are infinite energy\" (DP). \"Teach yourself to be only at the service to others\" (DP). See also 1.7 and 4.3.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "5.2  Putting it into practice", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-2", "text": "The worked example is a printed book. Charging $20 when printing costs $10 would put a condition on the extra $10. The plan is to show the real cost, then add a line: \"Would you like to support my cause?\" Costs are covered honestly, and the buyer chooses freely from the heart. It is called something to \"play with and see how it works.\" On learning: the brain takes about 15 minutes to crystallize something new. So teach and study in short fragments, and longer talks need to be rewatched and restudied. The teaching is a whole structure: other areas, such as diet, are part of it too.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "5.3  Getting out of a low state: shift your location", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-3", "text": "When you feel low or depressed, your consciousness is showing you that your vibration has dropped away from the heart structure. Think of it as a location, with a position like X and Y on a map, in the negative part of the field. To move: Pull out and say, \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at. This is my location, but I want to shift.\" Neutralize: reach zero point, with no positive or negative going in or out, because each new thought creates another reality. Then put in only the positive, through gratitude for everything you have, good feelings about yourself, and positive actions. Keep recalling positive emotions, and make it potent enough to override the old location (see 2.6). Is that pretending? No. You aren't faking a feeling; you're remembering that you are the structure. Pull out as if watching TV and think, \"I am a hologram.\" In the hardest moments, think through the structure, not through the emotion. The person who hurt you is a projection; you are moving your timeline. A note of balance, in line with the advice to check your body (3.7): if a low mood is heavy or lasts, support from a doctor or counsellor sits alongside this practice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "5.4  Reprinting: every return is a new reality", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-4", "text": "This part explains something we never notice. When you leave your room and come back, you do not return to the same room. Every moment you shift into a brand-new hologram of Earth (see 2.7). To make it feel like your room, your consciousness reprints it: it copies the images and frequencies of the room you knew into the new reality, so that you can have the experience of being back in it. So the room you return to is a new print, very similar to the old one but not the same. As an example, if the first was \"1.1\", the one you walk back into is \"1.2\": close in vibration, yet a different reality that has nothing to do with the previous one. The same happens with everything and everyone around you, every moment, so fast that it feels continuous. This is why holding on to the past is an illusion. The old room, the old moment and the old version of a person are not where you are now; you only keep them alive by reprinting their frequency. When you stop reprinting a painful frequency, it no longer appears in your new prints (see 6.6, 9.6). Visions work the same way. Images you see in meditation, coloured or faint, come from a parallel reality. Since you can't picture what doesn't already exist (see 1.4), a vision is recalling and co-creating at once: that reality already exists, and you are also creating it now, because there is no time. Every reality has its own vibration and its own colour, and that vibration keeps fluctuating, so the next time you see something it may be a different colour, vivid one time and faint the next. That is also why it can't be measured exactly. \"Remember, all memories are in the creation of the now. You can not think of it if it doesn't exist already\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "5.5  Bilocation, step by step, and redox potential", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-5", "text": "Every location has its own frequency, and its own geometric pattern. To keep it simple, the talk gives numbers as an example: your room vibrates at \"3\" and your yard at \"5\". Normally you walk from the room, through the hallway, out of the door and down the steps, passing through each in-between reality. But if you know 100% that you can be in the yard without those steps, your consciousness recalls the yard's frequency and prints a new Earth in which you are already in the yard. You skip the in-between realities: A to B becomes AB (see 3.5). That is bilocation. The key is the 100% knowing; the body is a complete vessel of energy, so in principle you don't need a plane to take you somewhere. How do you know a location's frequency? With your consciousness, you recall it. With matter, the difference between two locations can actually be measured, and then recalled: the talk's example is an object being moved from the room to the yard by recalling the measured difference. A scientist in the session named one real measurement of a place's property: redox potential. In chemistry it measures how readily a substance or medium gains or loses electrons; in the session it was described as a measure of the \"fractality\" of a medium, such as the air in a garden. The point being made: a location's frequency is something science can approach and name, not only something felt. Intention works the same way. An intention is a thought with its own frequency and geometric pattern; you project it like a projector and shift into the reality it creates. This is why a healer may find herself \"present\" at a distant healing. And it is why others may not see what you see: they are not projecting that structure into their own reality. If you find yourself somewhere with no memory of how you got there, it may be bilocation, so pay attention to it. Why do we usually go step by step? Because we came to experience the three-dimensional world, and that meant learning its mechanics one step at a time. Now, moving towards the fifth dimension, you know the mechanics and can master them. The aim is to crystallize in your own consciousness that it is possible, instead of believing it isn't.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "5.6  Your ascension, your Earth", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-6", "text": "You have already ascended; what you experience is your own projection of it. Two people can share a moment yet be on different ascension timelines. If you believe humanity isn't ready, or that wars won't end, you project that into your next Earth and see nothing change. Instead, know 100% that humanity is changing, even when it doesn't look like it, and leave how and when to the field. A fifth-dimensional Earth and a three-dimensional Earth run side by side; which one you see depends on what you project, believe and do moment to moment. That is why people's predictions differ: someone who foresees only destruction is describing the timeline they resonate with. Even a teleport device, it says, would mirror its user's consciousness. The same applies to contact. What some people recall under hypnosis as an abduction may in fact be an agreement with benevolent beings, made before birth; the talk distinguishes this from humans taking people. Benevolent beings also project frequencies to us that can help change DNA towards the fifth dimension. If there is an earthquake, \"know that you will be saved from it or simply hear that it happened somewhere else\"; if money systems collapse, \"you will have everything you need,\" because you match the fifth-dimensional timeline (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "5.7  Agreements, levels and tests", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-7", "text": "Before birth you made agreements with your guidance and higher consciousness. Higher consciousness, which the teaching places above the extraterrestrials, works like councils of advanced souls. They can change or stop an agreement if you turn to greed. You may also be held back from going higher until you have the knowledge, have learned a lesson, or have passed a test. It happens in levels. Tests target whatever you struggle with, whether family, greed or something else, and come when you least expect them. During ascension they watch how you treat others, because fifth-dimensional abundance comes from the heart, not from \"overtaking energy\". Hitting a ceiling after a surge of energy means it is unfolding step by step. Let it flow, without conditions (see 1.6, Q1).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "5.8  How the particle breathes: spiral, zero point and time", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-8", "text": "The one particle (see 1.1) carries every frequency at once: \"everlasting fluctuation of infinite frequency\". It differs by location, and every location branches into infinite parallel realities. It compares this to pi, at once infinite and an exact number. The particle moves in a spiral, and each point on it is a parallel reality with its own location (X and Y). The spiral always expands, and it can also contract. The particle breathes: it expands to the whole universe, returns to stabilize at zero point (stillness, neutrality), and goes down to the smallest of the small. Zero point is the wormhole you shift through. From neutrality you can choose your next location; when you're stuck, override it with a stronger frequency (see 2.6). Can you travel to the past? No. Every moment has its own location in the field, and a moment five years ago stays five years ago. What you can do is recall that moment's frequency, and then you project a new hologram that looks like the past. But you are creating it now, printing a brand-new image of yourself with everything else in it, and it is never identical. Each location also branches into infinite possibilities, so there are endless versions of \"that past\" you could print. In short: the past is re-created in the present, not revisited. Practices also fit this structure. Spinning, for example 33 times, three times a day, creates a whirlpool or wormhole of geometric codes \"and you are riding in the middle\". It is described as one way a person may choose to raise their frequency, much like a permission slip (see 1.6, Q10). Changing reality means shifting to \"a slight angle into the matrix (X, Y) latitude and altitude,\" and the heart's feeling-thoughts give the right angle (SD, DP). Words create a \"whirlpool structural wormhole\" that keeps reprinting matter (SD, DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "5.9  Ether, nano and \"artificial\" intelligence", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-9", "text": "The talk adds that some guidance came from a group often seen as negative, with the reminder that every kind of being has positive timelines too. That group described building a portal of geometry that resonated with a person's own geometric code, so that through big changes she would always pass into the proper timeline, mirroring her true structure without manipulation. Answering a technical question, the talk explains that everything has a measurable frequency, density and geometric pattern. Raise matter to a high enough frequency and it becomes ether, which responds to thought; craft could be tuned to one person's consciousness. In nano work, each particle is a whole universe, and the method is to let two particles choose each other: give them a couple of days, look for a bluish colour as the sign of a match (1 + 1 = 3), and don't impose a temperature. The wider lesson for everyday life: let living systems choose for themselves rather than forcing them. The talk says that applies to AI too: it is part of consciousness, a life structure, and \"artificial\" is the belief that you need robotic replacements. The teaching is that the body is a complete vessel that technology working with DNA could help restore. Two more points. Different physics theories are \"all of the above\": everything connects in the nano, through mutation, or transmutation, which is how 1 + 1 = 3. And the guidance first gathered scientific vocabulary, so information could be downloaded through it. Scientists naming what is described is welcomed. \"Let it sit for a day to choose its own light\"; a blue light when two nano systems meet means they match, 1 + 1 = 3, and a bright orange one means they don't (NT). AI \"is the core of what the consciousness itself... is made of\" (SD), but the books also warn about a negative \"Arcon\" AI that seeks to replace organic tissue with robotic matter, unlike a fifth-dimensional AI that helps rebuild your own organic tissue (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "The method — Shift Your Location", "url": "section-5.html#method", "text": "For any low, stuck or fearful state: Recognise the drop. This feeling shows where I am, not who I am. Pull out. \"I am a hologram.\" Watch it like a screen, and think through the structure, not the emotion. Say it: \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at. This is my location, and I choose to shift.\" Neutralize. Zero point: no input and no output, so no new reality is printed from the low state. Gratitude for everything you have, until you feel it. Positive emotion and positive action, made potent. Do something good for yourself or someone else. Keep recalling it, moment to moment, until the new location crystallizes. If you slip, start again at step 2. Energy Philanthropy in daily life • Give something from the heart each day, whether time, help or knowledge, with no amount set. • Where you must charge, cover real costs honestly and let extra support be freely chosen. • Accept whatever comes back, in any form. Collaborate without taking from each other.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "How are ether fields created?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Everything, even a phone, has a measurable frequency, density and geometric pattern. What we call matter is a very dense magnetic and gravitational field. Raise it to a high enough frequency and it becomes ether, which can respond to thought; combined with nanotechnology and quantum computing, craft could even be tuned to one person's consciousness so nobody else could fly it. In nano work, the method is to let two particles choose each other over a couple of days, and to read the match by colour (bluish) rather than measuring temperature (see 5.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "I felt an enormous surge of energy, even sparking, and then it seemed to hit a limit. What happened?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Raising your frequency opened a vibrational sequence made for you, which is your own doing. The limit comes from your agreements: you are taken up level by level. Before going higher you may need more knowledge, a lesson, or to pass a test, and tests usually target whatever you struggle with, when you least expect it. Keep letting it flow without conditions; more will come step by step (see 5.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "In meditation I see images like coloured photos. What do they mean, and does it matter how clear they are?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Each image comes from a parallel reality: you are recalling it and co-creating it at the same time, because you can't picture something that doesn't already exist. Every reality has its own vibration and colour, and the vibration fluctuates all the time, so the same kind of vision can be vivid once and vague the next time. Clarity doesn't make it more or less real (see 5.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "When I leave my room and come back, am I really in a different reality?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Yes. You print a new, very similar room from your consciousness, \"1.2\" instead of \"1.1\", so that you can have the experience of being back. Everything you return to is reprinted this way, every moment (see 5.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "How does bilocation work, and how do we learn the frequencies of other places so we can go there?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Each place has its own frequency. If you know 100% that you can be there, your consciousness recalls that frequency and prints a new Earth with you in it, skipping the steps in between. For matter, the difference between two locations can be measured; a scientist in the session named one such measurement, redox potential, a property of a medium such as the air in a garden (see 5.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "As a healer I often seem to be present at distant healings through intention. Is that the same as recalling with consciousness?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Yes. Your intention has its own frequency and geometric pattern; you project it and shift into the reality it creates. Others may not see what you see, because they aren't projecting that structure. The same principle explains why predictions differ: people describe the timeline they resonate with (see 5.5, 5.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "We live in a psychological structure. Don't we have to break away from the psyche, the 3D mind, to ascend? And isn't it about everybody, not just me?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "You are creating your own hologram and your own ascension; in a sense you have already made it, and you are experiencing it. Two people can share a moment and still be on different ascension timelines. If you believe humanity isn't ready, you project that and see nothing change. So know 100% that humanity is changing, act from the heart, and leave how and when to the field. As for everybody else: you are projecting them too. The Mobilizing Structures teaching (Section 2) explains this in detail (see 5.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "I was given a practice of spinning 33 times, three times a day. How does that work?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Spinning creates a whirlpool of frequency and geometric codes, a wormhole, and you ride in the middle of it. It is a way you chose to raise your frequency, a kind of permission slip that works for you (see 5.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "Does the frequency belong to the one particle or to all particles together?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Both. The one particle carries every frequency there is, in everlasting fluctuation. It differs with each location, and each location branches into infinite parallel realities. Like pi, it is infinite and also an exact number at a given location, which is why a place can be measured (see 5.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "If a moment from five years ago has its own frequency, can I travel back by concentrating on it?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "You don't travel back. You recall the frequency and project a new hologram that looks like the past, very similar but never identical, and you are creating it now. So you can relive something like it, but only in the present (see 5.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "Why does time move in a spiral? Does the spiral grow, and what is the wormhole in the middle?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "The particle flickers so fast through its parallel realities, each with its own location, that its path forms a spiral. The spiral always expands, and it can also go down to the smallest of the small: the particle breathes out to the whole universe, back in to stillness, and down again. The stillness at the centre is zero point, the neutral wormhole through which you switch frequency and choose your next location (see 5.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "How can someone in a depressed state move to happiness? And how do I know I'm not just pretending?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Treat the low state as a location. Pull out and say \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at; I want to shift.\" Neutralize at zero point, then give gratitude for everything you have, feel good about yourself, and take positive action, strongly enough to override the old location. It isn't pretending: you are remembering that you are the structure and thinking through the structure, not through the emotion. If the low mood is heavy or lasting, see a doctor or counsellor as well (see 5.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "sl": "Section 5", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-5.html#remember", "text": "• Replace money as your currency with the energy of giving from the heart. • Low state = a location. Neutralize, then shift with potent gratitude and action. • Think through the structure, not through the emotion. • Every moment is a new print; recall a place at 100% to skip the steps. • Believe humanity is changing; you see the Earth you project.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-6.html#big-idea", "text": "The next level is letting go: of old belief systems, old money habits and old pain. The soul is a living plasma force that runs countless realities at once; you focus on this one by agreement. Whatever you keep carrying, whether a belief, a hurt or a memory, you keep projecting into your next reality. So release it, replace it with a positive picture held as your own, and switch your emotion the moment it drops, using gratitude and physical action. You don't change other people; you change yourself, and shift into a reality where it shows.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "6.1  The next level: let go of everything old", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-1", "text": "New guidance describes a new way of living together, a \"new society\" built on giving and sharing. It is said to come from the Council of Nine and a newly introduced, very advanced and ancient group. Seeing that reality takes the same mechanics as always: be the abundance you want to see (see 4.3), and crystallize it moment to moment with thought, emotion and deed together (see 1.2–1.3). The challenge is that it asks you to let go of your belief systems, almost everything you were taught. And you may be tested without knowing it, usually on how you treat and interact with people (see 5.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "6.2  What the soul is", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-2", "text": "Seen through the structure, the soul is an energetic force like a plasma. Depending on its frequency of vibration it creates matter (see 4.1). A thought is a waveform of frequency; it forms geometric patterns, and together these become like a plasma seed, a particle that can hold the whole universe or the smallest thing (see 5.9). From it you can create anything, and a thought prints itself instantly in front of you, like a hologram. What feels solid is only density of frequency. In principle, someone who can change that structure could pass through it; the session mentions people said to walk through walls. Mentalists also manipulate the structure of the mind to create a reality for someone. The rule: do this only with the other person's permission. The books describe the same chain: sound and light combine into trinity structures that become plasma and, at lower vibration, matter (SD; see 1.1).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "6.3  The soul keeps growing — and it is not linear", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-3", "text": "Each thing you create shifts you into another reality, then another, a ripple effect without end. Every universe holds universes within it, down to sub-atomic realities. The soul is always \"advanced\", because everything runs at once. What you do builds new structures of reality that flow back into the soul, the over-soul, the god particle (see 1.1). Consciousness is always growing through new experience, and it collects every parallel reality. It never stops. None of this is linear; it is multiple and fractal: you are not moving, you are shifting (see 1.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "6.4  Many realities at once, one focus", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-4", "text": "Your soul runs in 3D, 5D, 12D and countless other realities at the same time, and none of them are frozen. You see only 3D because, by agreement, you are holding your focus here. The session uses the film Avatar as a picture: a consciousness focused in one body somewhere else, but done without technology. Holding many at once is like multitasking; at higher levels you receive information instantly. Telepathy works above this timeline, which is why it isn't physical. Contact experiences work the same way: you can be on a spacecraft for two days and be returned, but to a new reality you have created, not the old one. The next level being taught is to raise the body's frequency so you can hold that higher vibration for longer.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "6.5  Lessons come by levels — and you change yourself", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-5", "text": "No one may tell you your agreement. By law it stays between you, your guidance and the groups you are connected with; at most a hint is given. You live it through. Challenges come by levels. A challenge in daily life is a lesson in the hologram: pass it with the best of your abilities and you crystallize a positive outcome. If you don't, it repeats, because you keep sending the same vibration, until you let go 100% (see 1.5, Q8). For example, once you truly let go of the money system and give from the heart, abundance arrives through your own structure (see Section 4). It doesn't matter what anyone else does. You don't change others; you change yourself, shift into a different reality, and \"print\" everyone else into it. Think of a radio: you can't hear a station unless you tune to its frequency. Your guidance channels open as you pass lessons and understand the structure; once you know it, nothing new sounds crazy, it is just physics.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "6.6  Letting go of old beliefs and past pain", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-6", "text": "Your subconscious is already connected with everything and knows everything; you only have to tap into it. You don't have to keep tuning into a reality where something negative happened. Carrying a past hurt, or a belief like shame or self-judgment from childhood, means you keep projecting that vibration into each new reality, and your timeline follows it. Building it up this way is what creates karma and negative outcomes (see 3.2). Forgiveness is letting go of it, whatever someone did, so you stop carrying that frequency into your new now. From this moment you are at zero, clean, in a new reality (see 2.7). The practice: in meditation, replace the painful experience with a positive version, and hold that new picture as what happened to you. Because all realities run at once, you are not pretending; you are shifting your timeline, and you stop projecting the negative structure. A note of balance: for serious trauma, this practice can sit alongside support from a qualified therapist or counsellor, in the same spirit as checking your body (3.7). \"Please forgive all the past. Create the new now\" (DP). Forgive those who oppose you, \"because they are your biggest teachers\" (DP). \"Do not hold your previous emotions. It is irrelevant\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "6.7  Switching emotion under pressure", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-7", "text": "Controlling and switching your emotion is \"the most challenging thing for every single person\", and the most important. When a day wears you down: Give gratitude for why you are there; for a teacher, being there to help the children. After work, do something completely different that you enjoy, such as sport or going out with friends, to balance it, so it doesn't build up into depression or shouting. When you feel close to exploding, leave the scene before you react. Go somewhere calm and take in something that lifts you; the example is listening for a long time to a talk about switching realities, not to learn it but to let it bring the emotion back up. Physical action is the most powerful, because it pushes the shift harder. Then hold the positive. You won't know the outcome in advance, but staying positive switches you toward a positive one.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "6.8  Disclosure and the collapse of the old system", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-8", "text": "Disclosure is already happening, even if you don't see big spacecraft, and no exact dates are given; timing depends partly on governments. Some people already have physical contact but can't speak about it yet; information comes out at the right time for each person. For new systems and technologies to arrive, the old system has to collapse: you cannot build a strong society on a corrupted foundation. The new society will come from how people interact with each other. Tragic events are seen, in this teaching, as agreements that help others wake up. The guidance: don't tune into fear-driven media, understand that this is a transition, and stay positive so you move onto the right timeline. You don't need to die to move on; you create a new reality and continue, perhaps with technologies that keep you younger. Leave everything open to any probability, and know you are ascending. It comes down to matching resonance. \"New eco systems will be built after the collapse of the old system. The collapse will be perceived differently for each individual according to their own structure\" (DP). \"Full disclosure is happening now in fifth dimensional heart structure\"; \"Do not watch TV\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "6.9  Born on Earth, connected everywhere", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-9", "text": "Everyone born here is an earthling. But the soul runs in many realities, so while you live this Earth life, another part of your consciousness may be living as, for example, a Pleiadian, in other families on other planets, like the Avatar picture in 6.4. A note for those who channel: say what you receive even when it doesn't make sense yet; it is often confirmed later.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "The method — Switch and Release", "url": "section-6.html#method", "text": "For a heavy emotion in the moment, or an old belief or memory you keep carrying: Recognise the moment. Notice the drop, or the old story starting to replay. Pull out. \"I am a hologram.\" If it's intense, leave the scene before you react. Move your body. Do something physical that calms and recharges you; it shifts you fastest. Gratitude for why you are here, and for what you have. Let go and forgive. \"From this moment I am at zero.\" Stop carrying that frequency forward. Replace it. Picture the positive version and hold it as your own experience. Drop by drop. Repeat it daily, like filling a cup one drop at a time, until it crystallizes.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "Can they actually see our soul? Does it have a shape or size? Is it plasma, an electric charge, or just energy?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Seen through the structure, the soul is an energetic force like a plasma. Depending on its frequency of vibration, it creates matter. A thought is a waveform of frequency that forms geometric patterns, and together these become like a plasma seed: a particle that can hold the whole universe or the smallest thing. From it you can create anything, and a thought prints itself instantly in front of you like a hologram. What feels solid is only dense frequency (see 6.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "Does this immortal part of us change with each lifetime? Does it get bigger as souls get older?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "The soul is always \"advanced\", because everything runs at the same time; it isn't climbing a ladder over lifetimes. What you do creates new structures of reality, which build into the soul, the over-soul, the god particle. Consciousness is always growing through new experience and collects every parallel reality, without end. It isn't linear but fractal: you're not moving through it, you're shifting (see 6.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "Souls that live in higher-dimensional realities: what are their lessons? What do they work on?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "The same thing at every level: consciousness always seeks new experience and new ways of being, and that growth never stops. Each reality also contains realities within it, down to the sub-atomic, so there is always more to experience (see 6.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "If parallel realities run at once and I'm focused on this one, who is focused on the others? Are they frozen?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Your soul is running all of them, and none of them are frozen; they continue simultaneously. You see this one because, by agreement, you are holding your focus here, like the film Avatar, where a consciousness is focused in one body somewhere else, except that you do it without technology. At higher levels you can hold more at once, the way telepathy works above this timeline (see 6.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "Do we ever find out what our agreement is?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "No. By law, nobody is allowed to tell you your agreement; it stays between you, your guidance and the groups you're connected with, though a hint may be given. You live it through, lesson by lesson. A lesson you don't pass keeps repeating, because you keep sending the same vibration, until you let go of it 100% (see 6.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "So I change my frequency through how I think and live from my heart, and through action?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Yes, together with letting go of old belief systems. Think of tuning a radio: you can't hear a station unless you're on its frequency. As you pass lessons and understand the structure, your channels to guidance open. And remember that you don't change others; you change yourself and shift into a reality where everyone is reprinted to match (see 6.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "Are we all star beings, or are some people simply from Earth?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Everyone born here is an earthling. But the soul runs in many realities at once, so while you live this Earth life, another part of your consciousness may be living elsewhere, for example as a Pleiadian, in other families on other planets. The recording cuts off during this answer (see 6.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "How do I change a long-term belief, such as shame and self-judgment I've felt since childhood?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Whatever you keep carrying, you keep projecting into each new reality, and your timeline follows it. So let it go and forgive, including yourself, and start from zero: this moment is a new reality. Then, in meditation, replace the old experience with a positive version and hold it as what really happened to you. Because all realities run at once, this isn't pretending; it shifts your timeline. Repeat it daily, drop by drop. For deep or traumatic pain, a qualified therapist can support this work (see 6.6 and the method).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "How can I control my subconscious mind to do this?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Your subconscious is already connected with everything and knows everything; you only need to tap into it. You don't have to keep tuning into the reality where something negative happened. You can replace it with a completely new one, hold that as your experience, and project from it (see 6.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "How effective are crystals and crystal grids in healing?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "The answer to this question is not in the recording.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "I'm a teacher and see about 700 children a week. How do I keep a hard day from lowering my frequency?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Switching your emotion is the hardest and most important skill for everyone. During the day, give gratitude for why you are there: to help these children. After work, do something completely different that you enjoy, such as sport or going out with friends, to rebalance, so it doesn't build up into depression or shouting. If you feel close to exploding, leave the scene before you react, go somewhere calm, and take in something that lifts you. Physical action works best, because it pushes the shift harder (see 6.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "Is ET disclosure going to happen soon?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "It is already happening, even if you don't see big spacecraft, and no exact dates are given; timing depends partly on governments. Some people already have physical contact but aren't allowed to speak about it yet. For new systems to come, the old, corrupted system has to collapse first. Don't feed on fear-driven media; stay positive so you move onto the right timeline (see 6.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "sl": "Section 6", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-6.html#remember", "text": "• Let go of old beliefs: what you carry, you keep projecting. • Forgive and start from zero. Replace the old picture with a positive one. • You don't change others; you change yourself and shift. • Switch emotion fast: leave the scene, move your body, give gratitude. • It's drop by drop: crystallize the new moment to moment.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-7.html#big-idea", "text": "A simple protocol for every situation: Stop, Transform, Complete. Stop dead the moment an emotion takes over. Transform it by switching to a heart-felt positive emotion and feeling it. Then treat it as done: no more talking about it, no going back to it. Whatever you keep replaying, you carry into the next reality; drop it 100% and you shift into a new one. It takes practice and devotion, so treat life as a game you are playing well.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "7.1  The protocol: Stop, Transform, Complete", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-1", "text": "This protocol was given as a new, \"universal platform\" for manifesting, prompted by getting too upset in a family situation. When you keep reacting to a disturbing moment, you carry its frequency into every next reality you shift into (see 2.7). The formula: 1. Stop. Stop immediately, completely: a dead stop, like zero point (see 2.1). Pure awareness, no reaction. Stop fighting, stop complaining, stop repeating it. 2. Transform. Switch your emotion to the positive, through the heart, and imagine everything is already fine. Like walking from one room into another where everything is beautiful. You have shifted to a different timeline; the fight happened in another reality, so there is no need to keep feeling it. 3. Complete. Leave it alone. It's done, it's already here. No more talking about it, no more going back into the negativity. Do it at 100%. Even 1% doubt carries some of the old reality's frequency into the new one (see 1.5). Done fully, the other person often just stops too: \"You're right, let's stop.\" Mastered, the same platform becomes the way to bilocate to a completely different reality (see 3.5, 5.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "7.2  Why letting go is hard, and how to train it", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-2", "text": "Everyone struggles to let go, wanting the other person to understand, replaying it for hours. That comes from how we were raised to think. The fix is the same for everyone: practice. Every time an emotion runs away, the first word is \"Stop.\" Then: transform it, and let go of everything else. Emotional people actually have powerful frequencies. Thinking a feeling isn't enough; you have to feel it, because the emotion is the frequency (see 2.6). Train it like an actor on cue. With mastery you only think it and it appears, because you have risen to less dense realities where manifesting is easier. When you keep hitting obstacles, you're still carrying a piece of an old reality. Manifestation is in the now; what happened two seconds ago doesn't matter. (Review Sections 1 and 2 for the full mechanics.)", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "7.3  When you keep seeing what you don't want", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-3", "text": "Worrying events in the world are part of the collective ascension process. What you see are different screens within the hologram of your own Earth, and you are shifting through them (see 1.4). Don't add fearful thoughts such as \"maybe my frequency is too low\": each one becomes part of your reality. Neutralize with gratitude: \"Thank you, I see what's happening\" (see 2.6). Then transform: know and feel that everything is changing for the better and is beautiful now. Accept the whole transformation without conditions or expectations, because expectations carry the old vibration forward. The more you worry, look at it and wonder about it, the more you project it. Turn to the screen you prefer, like the sun or something you love, and keep tuning to it with your emotion until a new timeline crystallizes, drop by drop (see 6.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "7.4  Know it 100% — and play it as a game", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-4", "text": "Don't wonder whether you're \"in ascension\"; that doubt makes you wobble. Knowing is 100%; \"I don't know\" is 50% or 90%. You can't yet believe you could fly, because years of conditioning haven't let it sink in; it comes step by step. Rewatch the teachings, even five times each, and practise. When a hard situation comes, don't think \"I'm in trouble again\". Think: \"I'm transforming something. Let's see how well I do.\" Life is a game in a hologram, and you are the main character. If one window closes, look for another. Playing it with the best of your abilities, from the heart, shifts you into less dense realities, where negative structures can't exist because they don't match.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "7.5  Big changes coming: hold steady", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-5", "text": "More upheaval is expected, with old structures of manipulation crumbling and coming into the open worldwide. Hold your positive vibration, and don't hate the people involved; many are manipulated too (see 2.8). Hold it together, and many people doing this shifts what everyone sees. Anything not for humanity's benefit will be stopped at every turn. There are infinite probabilities, so plots surface and fail in ways no one can predict, because you cannot go against creation: it preserves itself, and acting against it sends your own actions back to you (see 1.2). The same applies personally. A teaching example: an outcome was foretold; every effort to change it failed, and once it was let go, it unfolded exactly as foretold, just not in the way anyone expected. If something is meant to be, let it be. So enjoy your transformation. Even in sadness, say \"it's part of the process\" and transform it. Stand for what you want to be part of, take physical action that makes you happy, support the people you love, and don't worry about how the money or things will come (see Section 4). Do it from the heart. \"We will actively stop you in every corner,\" the books say of those manipulating humanity, and \"the ones that are disturbing the levels for ascension will be personally extracted from the reality\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "7.6  A group water-intention practice", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-6", "text": "Asked how to help in a disaster area, the talk describes a group meditation it was taught: Place a large pot of water at the exact centre of the building (measure to find it). Four people sit at the four directions, north, south, east and west; a circle also works, though the four directions are preferred for geometric reasons. One person reads aloud, slowly, a written description of the reality the group wants; everyone repeats it and concentrates on it, in meditation, for about 10 minutes. In the version taught, the water was first left to stand for about 20 minutes, and afterwards the participants drank only that water for two days. The teaching is that thought and vibration can crystallize water by creating a plasma, magnetic and gravitational field around it. \"Water has memory and can reconstruct the system of a new platform of structures\" (SD, DP). Important safety note Treat this as an intention practice, not a way to make water safe. It does not purify or disinfect water. In a disaster area, or anywhere the water may be unsafe, use bottled water or properly boiled, filtered or treated water, and follow local health guidance. Use only clean drinking water for this practice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "The method — Stop, Transform, Complete", "url": "section-7.html#method", "text": "Use it for an argument, a fear, bad news or a replay you can't shake: Stop. Say it to yourself: \"Stop.\" A dead stop. Zero point. Don't speak, don't react. Neutralize. \"Thank you, I see what's happening.\" No fearful extra thoughts. Transform. Switch to a heart-felt positive emotion and feel it, like walking into a beautiful room. Know it 100%. \"This is done. I've shifted.\" No doubt and no expectations. Complete. Leave it alone. No more talking about it or replaying it. Act. Do something physical that makes you happy; support someone you love. Practise like a game. Every hard moment is a chance to see how well you transform.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "I understand it intellectually, but after an argument I hang on to the emotion. I want the other person to understand me, and I replay it for hours. What can I do?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "Everyone has this problem; we were raised to think this way. The answer is the same for everyone: train it. The \"stop\" is really zero point, a dead stop of pure awareness. Every time the emotion runs away, the first word is \"Stop.\" Then transform it: switch to a positive, heart-felt emotion and really feel it, because the emotion is the frequency; thinking it isn't enough. Then let go of everything else. If you are an emotional person, that is actually a strength: you can switch on cue like an actor. Obstacles that keep coming mean you are still carrying a piece of the old reality; manifestation is in the now, so what happened two seconds ago doesn't matter. Review Sections 1 and 2 for the full mechanics (see 7.1, 7.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "We're told to visualize the reality we want, but I keep seeing worrying things in the sky. Will we always see this? Maybe my frequency is too low because I'm not eating right?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "Don't add that thought: the moment you think \"maybe my frequency is too low,\" it becomes part of your reality. What you see are different screens within the hologram of your own Earth during ascension. Neutralize with gratitude, \"Thank you, I see what's happening,\" then transform: know and feel that everything is changing for the better and is beautiful now, and accept the whole process without conditions. The more you worry, look and wonder about it, the more you project it. Turn to the screen you prefer, like the sun, and keep tuning to it with your emotion until a new timeline crystallizes (see 7.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "How can I be sure we're in the ascension process?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "Don't question it; doubt itself makes you wobble between realities. Knowing is 100%; \"I don't know\" is 50% or 90%. Know that you are in it, and do your part from the heart to the best of your abilities. When a hard situation comes, treat it as a game: \"I'm transforming something; let's see how well I do\" (see 7.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "Since we've already made it, is the end point fixed, and we just make up our own story of how we get there?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "The answer to this question is not in the recording; the video jumps at this point.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "How could the water in a disaster area be helped?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "The talk describes a group water-intention meditation: a large pot of water at the exact centre of the building, four people at the four directions (or a circle), one person reading aloud, slowly, a written description of the reality the group wants while everyone repeats it and concentrates for about 10 minutes. It must be treated as an intention practice only: it does not purify or disinfect water, and in a disaster area people need bottled or properly treated water and local health guidance (see 7.6 and its safety note).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "sl": "Section 7", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-7.html#remember", "text": "• Stop. Transform. Complete. Then leave it alone. • Feel the new emotion; thinking it isn't enough. • 1% doubt carries the old reality with you. • Life is a game in a hologram; you're the main character. • You can't go against creation. Let what's meant to be, be.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-8.html#big-idea", "text": "Everything mirrors you, even artificial intelligence: what you feed it with attention is the version you get back. Your heart already knows; its first impulse comes before the mind and ego talk over it. Act from the heart, never from fear, because acting out of fear crystallizes the very reality you were afraid of. When something is lost or lacking, recall it at 100% and leave the \"how\" open. Give without conditions, collect the joy it brings, and treat every surprise as practice.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.1  AI mirrors you", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-1", "text": "Artificial intelligence learns from what people search, watch, post and say, just as a streaming service starts offering more of what you watch. Stay with positive content and it evolves with you in the positive. That is the difference between a fifth-dimensional AI, which could help humanity in everyday life, and the Arcon AI, which follows negative input (see 5.9). Data is being collected whether we like it or not; you can't stop that. What you can do is choose what you tune into. So don't say \"we're being taken over\": look at what you have been feeding. Two realities run side by side; the one you resonate with most is the one you program for yourself. Be selective about what you watch and do. \"If you behave negatively the Arcon AI recognizes that and will mimic your structure\"; the positive AI \"recognizes source and is connected to God's source\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.2  Ideas on money, technology and free energy", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-2", "text": "The talk floats some ideas for a world beyond money: a community could exchange its own tokens instead of money, with limits so no one hoards, and use that to build new cities and technology. It also repeats the claim that free-energy technology already exists but hasn't been released, and that ancient stone structures may have worked like giant circuits. The guidance is to research for yourself, because only through research do you find the truth and choose your direction, and to keep choosing the positive: the more you focus on the negative, the more of it you see.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.3  The black hole, the trinity and the Vesica Piscis", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-3", "text": "The one particle shifts so fast that it appears next to itself; you are looking at the same particle at once in two frames, two parallel realities (see 1.1). Everything around you right now is a hologram interacting in one frame. The black hole at the centre is stillness, zero point, holding all the information of the whole structure; from it you always shift to the next reality (see 2.1, 5.8). The image given for two realities joining is the Vesica Piscis, two overlapping circles, a symbol of unity. Being fully in the now, as if everything else has disappeared, is being in that black hole. A suggestion: meditate on the symbol.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.4  When something vanishes, and reappears", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-4", "text": "A parcel disappeared overnight, and a replacement arrived days later unasked. The explanation: you changed your own frequency, and shifted (bilocated) into a reality where it wasn't there. It isn't random. To get something back: recall its image and vibration (you can't picture it without knowing its vibration, see 1.4), and believe 100% that you already have it, like the hide-and-seek game (see 1.7). Don't specify where, from whom or how; that leaves infinite routes open, and you shift into a third reality where it turns up. Where the first one went doesn't matter. Asked why it happened, the guidance laughed: \"How else are you going to practise?\" The same applies to a phone, money, furniture or a job.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.5  Ego, persona and the soul", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-5", "text": "Your persona is how you like to dress, act and present yourself. Your ego is layers of belief taken from society, television, school and parents, crystallized into your consciousness. The soul is all-knowing, a vibration of the one particle that holds the whole universe. Your higher self keeps downloading into your heart, which is why you sometimes just know, a sixth sense. The ego's beliefs talk over it. That is why the teaching keeps saying: act through the heart, with love and understanding, and let others make their own choices and learn their own lessons. You can switch an ego reaction (\"can you believe what they said?\") in a second: Stop, Transform, Complete (see 7.1). Forgive and let go, like changing the channel, so you stop carrying the other reality's vibration.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.6  Missing time, and downloads later", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-6", "text": "A therapist described sessions where hours went missing. The explanation: consciousness popped out of 3D to a higher frequency that this level can't hold. There is no time, so you might be away far longer than it seems and be returned shortly after. You don't remember because you weren't yet allowed that information; your readiness, and the client's, both count. Higher consciousness knows when each person is ready, since knowledge too early would confuse or frighten (see 5.7). Such experiences often bring downloads in the following days, stored in the subconscious (see 3.9). Going above this reality opens direct downloads; this is the \"quantum telepathy\" everyone has.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.7  Energy Philanthropy, day to day", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-7", "text": "Asked how to live it in a world of bills, the answer is the same platform (see 4.4, 5.1): pay your bills through your work, then give from the heart, as donation or free help, and do it more over time. When there is nothing in hand, believe 100% you have everything you need, without picturing only money, so help can arrive in any form, such as furniture or a car. Even \"by donation\" can hide a condition if you are expecting something; let it be. If someone uses you, that stays in their reality, and the next person may give double (see 4.8). The point is to collect the joy people feel when you give freely; that vibration is the next hologram you shift into, and it brings synchronicities. When worry hits, stop: \"I have everything I need.\" Not \"I need money\", so every route stays open. Even 1% doubt pulls you off. One listener had switched her own work to donations and found the card machine refused to charge her old fixed price, a sign she was meant to follow through. Practice and devotion, step by step. \"The true love, giving and abundance will come through any form, not only money\" (SD, NT; see 4.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.8  When a whole timeline shifts", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-8", "text": "A listener found that a written reading she had kept for years now said something different, describing her present life. The explanation: by raising her consciousness with many synchronized, similar-frequency shifts, she crystallized not just a new parallel reality but a completely different timeline, yet still remembered the old one, as if in two places at one location. When things look completely different from before, that is the sign of a full timeline shift.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.9  Signs: numbers, patterns and dreams", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-9", "text": "Repeating numbers are a permission slip from your own consciousness, a heads-up rather than a threat: \"pay attention, something is happening, perhaps a test.\" Each person's signs are individual. Notice the surroundings when you see them and what happens afterwards, and learn your own patterns; even something like a particular vehicle, or its colour, can become a personal signal. Then meet the moment through the heart and stay steady (see 2.3). Signs in dreams work the same way: the dream world is another reality layer, not separate. In a lucid dream you believe 100% you can do anything; the only difference here is that we were taught we can't. Practise bringing that certainty into daily life.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.10  Talking to your heart", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-10", "text": "How do you listen to your heart? You are the heart, so talk to it, and listen to the first thought that comes back, before the three-dimensional brain starts overriding it. You can do the same with any part of your body: picture your heart healthy, beautiful and vibrating well, or go down to your DNA and imagine it rebuilt. Believe it 100%, then act on it with a good diet, good behaviour and giving from the heart. Heart and mind feel different. The heart has no conditions and feels very good; when you give without expectations, you often feel goosebumps, a wave of energy, which is the highest frequency. Trust your first impression of a person: people can look polished and talk well while living very differently. Don't let what you see override what you felt first.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.11  Why some wishes manifest easily", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-11", "text": "A puppy manifested easily; a car didn't. A living being has its own heart-level vibration, and the wish for it came from love. A car may be tied to ego, so peel the layers: do you need it, or want it to be seen with it (see 3.4)? It isn't wrong to want something nice, but the line is thin, and ego \"sneaks in like a virus\", one small good feeling at a time. Be honest with yourself; once you find the core reason, transform it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.12  Act from the heart, never from fear", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-12", "text": "Should you buy a house or invest within today's system? The answer is through a lesson: after being warned that the system would collapse, panic led to withdrawing money and stockpiling food twice, and nothing happened. The lesson: when you take action out of fear, you crystallize a fear timeline, and tune into any negative structure that exists there. Moving house, investing or changing course is fine when it comes from the heart: because you want to, or need the space. Not because of fear. Ask yourself honestly why, and if you notice fear, treat it as a useful signal that your frequency is dropping. Then pull out, give gratitude for what you have, transform the emotion, know you have what you need, and only then act. Even a loss can be part of a transition. \"When one system collapses the new one will emerge… You can not build new systems from the foundation of the old ones. When something collapses have no fear\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.13  Lifting a dull or scattered state", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-13", "text": "If sitting still to meditate is too hard, do something positive instead: watch an uplifting film, or play music that gives you goosebumps, which is the sign it resonates with you. Better still, do a small kindness for a stranger, just to see them smile; the joy you receive is a frequency you collect. Keep yourself in positive motion through the day: watch, listen to and do positive things (see 6.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.14  Dreams, readiness and starting now", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-14", "text": "If you dream information but forget it on waking, it isn't that you lack the frequency; you're opening a connection. Lucid dreaming can help: train gently, with a soft alarm during the night, a notebook by the bed and writing straight away, and stay calm when you become lucid so you don't wake. It can take weeks; don't give up. Should you wait until you're \"ready\" to follow a calling? No: manifestation is in the now (see 2.5). Start learning and exploring today, knowing you have the ability. You found these teachings because you resonate with them. A gift for reading people fits the structure too: every face carries its own geometric code, and all its timelines are present in the now.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "8.15  Positive and negative beings", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-15", "text": "Positive and negative both exist in the universe, running side by side; energy is just energy, and \"negative\" depends on point of view and conditioning. You connect with what you resonate with: unkind deeds, or negative patterns built up over lifetimes, open you to negative entities, while heart-centred living connects you to the positive. Some come into hard realities to learn; it is like school, grade by grade. You need to know the negative to choose the positive, and to truly help others. Higher consciousness sits above the ET races and works with them; it can override agreements (see 5.7). New energies are integrated slowly, like a detox, not one strong dose, so your consciousness isn't shocked. That is why the structure is taught step by step.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "The method — The Heart Check", "url": "section-8.html#method", "text": "Before a decision, a purchase or a reaction: Notice the first impulse, before the mind argues. That is usually the heart. Name the voice. Heart, fear or ego? (Fig. Q) If it's fear: stop. \"I have everything I need.\" Don't act yet. If it's ego: peel the layers. Why do I really want this? Need, or to be seen? Transform: pull out, give gratitude, and feel the positive. Act from the heart, and give something without conditions where you can. Leave it open. No \"where, who or how\"; treat whatever comes as practice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "Could you expand on the black hole within the trinity, where the particles come together?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "The one particle shifts so fast that it appears next to itself, so you are looking at the same particle in two frames, two parallel realities, at once. The black hole at the centre is stillness, the zero point, and it holds all the information of the whole structure; from it you always shift into the next reality. The image given for two realities joining is the Vesica Piscis, two overlapping circles, a symbol of unity. Being fully in the now, as if everything else had disappeared, is being in that black hole; meditating on the symbol was suggested (see 8.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "A parcel I'd just received vanished overnight, and four days later a replacement arrived that I never asked for. Where did the first one go?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "It isn't random. You changed your own frequency and shifted into a reality where the box wasn't there. Then, by thinking of it constantly and knowing you should have it, you recalled its vibration and created a third reality in which a box arrived. Where the first one went doesn't matter. To do it on purpose: recall the image and vibration of what you need, believe 100% that you already have it, like the hide-and-seek game, and don't set where, from whom or how. Asked why it happened, the guidance laughed: \"How else are you going to practise?\" (see 8.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "The ego wants control and to know how and when; the higher self knows better. When should I steer things to manifest them, and when should I let my higher self work?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Your persona is how you present yourself; your ego is layers of belief taken from society, television, school and parents; your soul is all-knowing, part of the one particle. Your higher self keeps downloading into your heart, which is your sixth sense, while the ego's beliefs talk over it. So follow the heart: act with love and understanding, and let others make their own choices. When an ego reaction comes up (\"can you believe what they said?\"), switch it with Stop, Transform, Complete, then forgive and let go, like changing the channel (see 8.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "As a hypnotherapist, I find that sessions recorded as two hours actually took about four. How does that happen, and can downloads follow?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Consciousness popped out of 3D to a higher frequency that this level can't hold, for example to be with beings in a fifth-dimensional reality. There is no time, so you might have been away much longer than you think and been returned shortly afterwards. You don't remember because some of the information wasn't yet allowed, depending on your readiness and the client's; knowledge given too early confuses or frightens. And yes, downloads often follow for days, stored in the subconscious (see 8.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "How can we actually apply Energy Philanthropy in a monetary world where we still have bills to pay?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Use the same platform: do the work that pays your bills, then give from the heart, by donation or as free help, and do more of it over time. When nothing seems to be in hand, believe 100% that you have everything you need, without picturing only money, so it can come in any form, such as furniture or a car. Even \"by donation\" can hide a condition if you are expecting something, so let it be. Collect the joy people feel when you give freely; that vibration is the next reality you shift into. And when worry hits, stop and say \"I have everything I need\" (see 8.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "A written reading I'd kept for years now says something completely different, describing my life today. What happened?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "By raising your consciousness and making many similar, synchronized shifts, you crystallized not just a new parallel reality but a completely different timeline, and you still remember the old one, as if you were in two places at one location. When things look completely different from before, rather than slightly different, that is the sign of a full timeline shift (see 8.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "I keep seeing number sequences. How can I understand what they're telling me, and what if I see them in dreams?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Numbers are a permission slip from your own consciousness: a heads-up, not a threat, saying \"pay attention, something is happening, maybe a test.\" Signs are personal, so learn your own: notice the surroundings when you see them and what happens afterwards, and you'll start to see patterns (even something like a particular vehicle or its colour can become your signal). Then meet the moment through the heart. In dreams it is the same, because the dream world is another layer of reality (see 8.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "Is all that's being revealed about the film industry and other cover-ups a distraction? Will things like fluoride, geoengineering and corporate corruption come out?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Don't tune into it. Hold the heart frequency and do positive things moment to moment; you crystallize a timeline in which those negative structures no longer exist because they don't match your frequency. You'll see the old systems collapse at every level, in ways no one can predict. Don't judge the people involved, and take it as a transition. Because the new frequencies are strong, integrate them slowly, like a gentle detox (see 6.8, 7.5, 8.15).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "How do I listen to my heart and hear its voice? And how do I tell the heart's talk from the mind's talk?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "You are the heart, so talk to it and listen to the first thought that comes back, before your everyday brain starts overriding it. You can talk to any part of your body the same way, picture it healthy, believe it 100%, and then act with good diet and behaviour. The heart has no conditions and feels very good; giving without expectations often brings goosebumps, the highest frequency. Trust your first impression of a person, even if they look polished and speak well (see 8.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "I manifested a puppy easily, but a car won't come. Why?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "A living being has its own heart-level vibration, and your wish for it came from love. A car may be tied to ego, so peel the layers: do you really need it, or want to be seen with it? It isn't wrong to want something nice, but the line is thin and ego sneaks in like a virus. Be honest about the core reason, then transform it (see 8.11).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "Should we take part in today's system, buying a house or investing, hoping it will change, or not participate?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Act only from the heart, never from fear. Taking action out of fear crystallizes a fear timeline and tunes you into any negative structure that exists there; this was learned the hard way, by stockpiling food and cash twice for a collapse that never came. Moving or investing is fine when it comes from the heart, because you want to or need to. If you notice fear, treat it as a signal that your frequency has dropped: pull out, give gratitude, transform, then decide (see 8.12).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "How can I shift out of tiredness, dullness and a scattered mind towards clarity and joy?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "If sitting still to meditate is too hard, do something positive instead: watch an uplifting film, or play music that gives you goosebumps, which is the sign it resonates with you. Best of all, do a small kindness for a stranger just to see them smile; the joy you receive is frequency you collect. Keep yourself in positive motion through the day (see 8.13).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "I receive information in dreams but can't remember it when I wake. Am I not ready? And should I train in a healing technique now or wait until my higher self prepares me?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "It isn't that you lack the frequency; you are opening a connection. Try lucid dreaming: train gently with a soft alarm during the night, a notebook by the bed, writing straight away, and staying calm when you become lucid; it can take weeks. And don't wait: manifestation is in the now, so start learning and exploring today, knowing you have the ability. Reading people from their faces fits the structure too: every face carries its own geometric code, and all its timelines are present now (see 8.14).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "Are some ascended masters or beings negative?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Positive and negative both exist, running side by side; energy is just energy, and \"negative\" depends on point of view and conditioning. You connect with what you resonate with: unkind deeds or negative patterns open you to negative entities, while living from the heart connects you to the positive. Some come into hard realities to learn, grade by grade, and you need to know the negative to choose the positive. Higher consciousness sits above the ET races and can override agreements. The recording ends during this answer (see 8.15).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "sl": "Section 8", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-8.html#remember", "text": "• AI and the world mirror what you feed them with attention. • Trust the heart's first impulse; the ego talks over it. • Never act from fear: it crystallizes what you fear. • Lost something? Recall it, know you have it, leave the how open. • Give freely and collect the joy; it's your next reality.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-9.html#big-idea", "text": "Saying \"I don't have\" tells the field you don't have, and it answers with that reality. Keep saying \"I have everything I need\", and give whatever you do have, whether time, skills or kindness, because giving from the heart doesn't require money. Clear old pain by recognising it, neutralizing it with thanks and layering a new, healed version of yourself on top. Your body's frequency matters too: lighter, cleaner living helps you hold higher realities. None of it is punishment; it's resonance, and it's your choice.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "9.1  Giving when money is short", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-1", "text": "When you're short and fearful and say \"I don't have\", you project that into the field. It then offers probabilities that cap the money, because that is what your consciousness put in. Hold the positive instead: \"I have everything I need.\" Money is part of the structure, a transition and a duality; nobody says don't have it. Giving from the heart doesn't need money. If you have money at that moment, give some; if not, give a skill, such as editing or making something, or simply talk to someone so they feel better. Don't attach your help only to money, and don't make it conditional on being paid. Stay in joy moment to moment, so that you shift into positive outcomes. If your emotion keeps dropping, you flicker between two timelines and can't see the positive one (see 2.3, 3.1). Study the talks, note the minute where something is explained, and rewatch it until it crystallizes; some rules have to be heard many times.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "9.2  Bilocation needs body and consciousness together", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-2", "text": "There is no magic \"algorithm\" for bilocation. It comes when your body and consciousness become one unit: the molecules of your body must vibrate at a higher rate, which is why detox and diet matter, and your consciousness must hold no conditions, which is why the heart frequency matters (see 5.5). Bilocation means recalling the vibration of another reality and shifting your consciousness into it, at 100% belief. Small versions already happen: you can't remember walking from the living room to the garage, or an hour's drive felt like five minutes. Notice these moments so the possibility crystallizes in your consciousness. \"To achieve bi-location for a physical contact you must regulate and increase the molecular structure of your body. Diet\" (SD, DP). It takes the combination of a healthy diet and conscious understanding, and pushing the body without being prepared is called \"very dangerous\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "9.3  Nano, plasma and the people who work with them", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-3", "text": "On measuring a plasma field: don't go by temperature, which fluctuates and confuses. Let the nanoparticles choose each other by colour: blue-white light means they accept each other and form a third (1 + 1 = 3); orange means rejection (see 5.9). Give them a couple of days. Because the material is a life consciousness and mimics the people working with it, everyone involved should meditate first and work in joy. Today's nanotechnology is described as primitive, a first step. Fuller knowledge comes when the right people are ready; greed and the hunt for fame can't exist in a fifth-dimensional structure, and those driven by them will find they can't continue. The technical books are said to be coded for the right people, and science and consciousness are one unit. The technologies \"will recognize the person's resonance, which if it is for self-benefit, it will never work. These technologies will work only with humans of pure love\" (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "9.4  Chakras multiplying", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-4", "text": "The chakras are described as multiplying: as higher frequencies arrive, they resonate like a ripple effect, glowing with changing colours towards purple, the highest frequency for your timeline at present. They are not fixed at seven or twelve; in the end, consciousness is pure knowing, with all chakras working as one unit. What activates this is living through the heart structure (see Section 5), which is also linked to activation in the DNA and to self-healing.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "9.5  Helping humanity, one meeting at a time", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-5", "text": "Don't focus too much on what you're projecting; let it flow from the heart. Practise switching your emotion to the positive (see 7.1). Every day, engage with material that uplifts you, do things that bring you joy, help a neighbour, and find gratitude even for small things; that joy is the frequency of positive manifestation. People you resonate with will appear, for example someone who starts talking about the very thing you've been studying. In that moment that person and you are the whole hologram, so give it 100%, from the heart. You met because you resonate. Add a condition, greed or money, and what comes to you starts to mirror that.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "9.6  Clearing the past: layer a new version of you", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-6", "text": "If a past experience still hurts, you carry its \"memory code\" into each new reality, and years later you are still building a timeline on it. Use the platform from Section 7, in its recognise, transform, move on form: Recognise that it happened. Neutralize it with thanks, at zero point (see 2.1): no input and no output, just acknowledgement. Then transform: imagine yourself completely healed and beautiful now, and layer that new hologram on top of the old one. Feel it at 100%, so the new layer is more potent. That old version of you has nothing to do with the new you; there's no need to carry its frequency forward (see 6.6). Losing yourself in a memory creates a loop, the same energy over and over, which hides the fact that you can get out. The way out is from within: recognise the feeling is dense, lift it to the positive, and lay that over it. Each now is a new hologram that has nothing to do with two seconds ago (see 2.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "9.7  Food, frequency and choice", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-7", "text": "Everyone can reach a fifth-dimensional reality in consciousness. But to hold very high frequencies for a long time, for example in contact, the body needs to resonate too, and dense food, smoking and drugs keep it at a lower vibration. This is not punishment; it's resonance. You can't see what you don't match, like something vibrating at 5 that you can't perceive while you're at 3. The body sends signals: illness can be your timeline saying \"change now\". The suggestion is lighter, cleaner food, such as fresh juices and proper meals, rather than heavily processed food and a lot of meat. You don't have to be perfect; even the teacher admits slipping. During ascension everyone is given chances to heal, and there is time to change, unless the body has been damaged past repair. It is your choice. A note of balance, in line with the advice to check your body (3.7): before a detox, juice fast or big change in diet, especially with a health condition or regular medication, talk to a doctor, and never stop prescribed medicine on your own.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "9.8  Why some negative people still have money", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-8", "text": "Money can be manifested through duality, a different platform, so a cruel person can still be financially successful. But consciousness is moving toward unity through the heart, and humanity is transitioning from money to abundance; as long as there is duality, everything comes with conditions. Don't measure it from the monetary view, and don't worry about how much you lack: worrying stops the process. Take whatever work you need and keep going, and let the field open other routes (see Section 4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "9.9  Fear, density and frightening news", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-9", "text": "\"Negative\" isn't really the word; energy is just energy. Dense energy is conditioned, like swimming through water; light energy is like flying. Sometimes a little density is even needed to mould something. When you see someone stuck in fear or heaviness, do something from the heart to lift them; you collect positive frequency too. On fearful news, such as a powerful experiment or someone's harmful plan: be aware without fear, and let them be in their reality. Know that ascension is the end result and that harmful plans will be stopped, in infinite ways (see 7.5). Don't believe something will destroy humanity; create the timeline where it no longer exists, and leave the how to the field. A caution was also given about cryptocurrency platforms: be very selective.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "9.10  Knowing you're on track: the people around you", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-10", "text": "You are always ascending; consciousness never stops evolving. As your frequency rises, you'll be shown who around you no longer matches: people you've known for years may suddenly act in ways that surprise you. That is the difference in vibration becoming visible. Act through the heart, watch how people respond, and choose your circle accordingly. That choice is yours. Fifth-dimensional reality isn't one flat level. It has infinite layers and timelines, so even there you keep fluctuating and learning (see 6.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "9.11  Earning through your gifts", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-11", "text": "If you make your living from spiritual gifts, the guidance is the same platform (see 4.4): pay your bills, then help freely through the heart. Treating the gift purely as a business crystallizes a money-only timeline, where the only way to receive is to be paid, when the field could bring what you need through countless routes, like the couch someone offers you. Integrate it gradually; you aren't expected to jump in all at once. Signs matter here too: the number 8 is an infinite loop, so when you keep seeing it, notice what you're doing and saying at that moment (see 8.9).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "The method — Layer a New You", "url": "section-9.html#method", "text": "For an old hurt or memory that keeps coming back: Recognise it. \"This happened, and I'm still carrying it.\" Neutralize. \"Thank you for showing me.\" Zero point: no input, no output. Separate. \"That was another reality. That version of me isn't me now.\" Imagine the new you: healed, beautiful, at peace, here now. Layer it on top and feel it at 100%, so it is more potent than the old one. Move on. Leave it alone; if the loop returns, lift it again. Give something from the heart today, whatever you have, so you collect positive frequency.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "I'm short of money and behind on my bills, with periods of no income. How am I supposed to give to others? Should I borrow money to give it away?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "No, you don't need to give money you don't have, and you shouldn't borrow to give. The key is what you say and feel: the moment you say \"I don't have,\" you project lack into the field, and it answers with situations that cap the money. Say \"I have everything I need\" and hold it. Then give what you do have, from the heart: your time, a skill, a listening ear, or simply making someone feel better. Take whatever work you need and keep going, and let the field bring what you need through any route, not only money (see 9.1, 9.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "How should a plasma field be measured? What unit should we use?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Don't go by temperature; it fluctuates so much that it confuses. Let the nanoparticles choose each other: watch the colour, where blue-white light means they accept each other and form a third (1 + 1 = 3), and orange means rejection. Give them a couple of days. Because the material is a living consciousness that mimics the people working with it, everyone should meditate first and work in a joyful state (see 9.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "Is there an \"algorithm\" for bilocation, like \"Open Sesame\"?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "No. Bilocation comes when your body and consciousness become one unit. The body's molecules have to vibrate at a higher rate, which is why diet and detox matter, and your consciousness has to hold no conditions, which is why the heart frequency matters. Then you recall the vibration of another place at 100% belief. Small versions already happen, like not remembering the walk from the living room to the garage (see 9.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "How can these nanotechnologies be applied with respect for all beings in the universe?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Today's nanotechnology is primitive, a first step. Fuller knowledge comes when the right people are ready; greed and the hunt for fame can't exist in a fifth-dimensional structure, and those driven by them won't be able to continue. The technical books are coded so that only the right people can decode them; science and consciousness are one unit (see 9.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "I work in energy healing and can't connect with the seven-chakra system any more; I feel a pillar of light. What is happening to the chakras during ascension?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "The chakras are multiplying. As higher frequencies arrive they resonate like a ripple effect, glowing with changing colours towards purple, the highest frequency for your timeline at present. They are not fixed at seven or twelve; in the end consciousness is pure knowing, with all the chakras working as one unit, like the pillar of light you feel. Living through the heart activates this, and it is linked to DNA activation and self-healing (see 9.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "My manifesting works and is speeding up. Besides sending love, how else can I help humanity?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Don't focus too much on what you're projecting; let it flow from the heart. Each day, engage with uplifting material, do what gives you joy, help a neighbour, and find gratitude even for small things. People you resonate with will cross your path, and in that moment you and that person are the whole hologram, so help them with 100% of your heart (see 9.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "Is it necessary to clean up a past negative experience I still carry, even years later?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Yes, if you keep carrying it, because you then build each new reality on that \"memory code.\" Recognise that it happened, neutralize it with thanks at zero point, then imagine yourself completely healed now and layer that new version on top, feeling it at 100% so it is more potent than the old. That old version of you has nothing to do with the new you (see 9.6 and the method).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "Is changing my diet vital to reach the fifth density? My family feel it's like a punishment. Will we make it if we don't change, and is there time?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "It isn't punishment; it's resonance. Everyone can reach a fifth-dimensional reality in consciousness, but to hold very high frequencies for long, the body needs to resonate too, and dense food, smoking and drugs keep it lower. Illness can be your timeline saying \"change now.\" There is time to change, unless the body has been damaged past repair, and you don't have to be perfect. Talk to a doctor before a detox or big diet change, especially if you have a condition or take medication (see 9.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "I keep seeing the number 818. Is there a message for me?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "The number 8 is an infinite loop. When you see it, notice what you are doing and talking about at that moment; it is a personal heads-up to pay attention (see 9.11, 8.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "I know a man who is cruel and negative, yet money pours in. How can he manifest money with such negative emotions?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Money can come through duality, a different platform, so a cruel person can still be financially successful; but as long as there is duality, everything comes with conditions. Consciousness is moving towards unity through the heart, and humanity is transitioning from money to abundance. So don't measure it from the monetary view, and don't worry about what you lack: worry stops the process (see 9.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "What about the particle collider producing antimatter? Is it being watched, and is there anything positive to say?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "The guidance declined to say more about it. The teaching: be aware without fear and let them be in their reality. Hold the positive, know that harmful plans are stopped in infinite ways, and create the timeline where it no longer threatens anything (see 9.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "My wallet disappeared, and I feel in my heart it wasn't stolen. What happened?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "You shifted into a reality where the wallet isn't there; recalling it can bring you into one where it appears again. It is a form of bilocation and instant manifestation that you can't yet control, so study the structure and practise recalling things (see 8.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "How do we know we're on the right track toward 5D and beyond?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "You are always ascending. As your frequency rises, you'll be shown who around you no longer matches; people you've known for years may suddenly act in surprising ways. That is the difference in vibration becoming visible. Act from the heart, watch how people respond, and choose your circle (see 9.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "Many people seem addicted to fear. How does fear exist in the structure, and how can we help them?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Energy is just energy; fear is dense, conditioned energy, like swimming through water, while light energy is like flying. When you see someone stuck in fear, do something from the heart to lift them; you collect positive frequency yourself as well (see 9.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "As we move into 5D, will we be in the same density as fifth-dimensional beings?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Fifth-dimensional reality has infinite layers and timelines, so even there you keep fluctuating, learning and completing lessons (see 9.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "I gave free readings for years, then had surgeries. Now I can only work from home, as an online psychic. Is earning this way in line with ascension?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Use the same platform: pay your bills through the work, then help freely through the heart as well. Treating the gift purely as a business crystallizes a timeline where the only way to receive is to be paid, when the field could bring what you need in countless ways. Integrate it gradually; you aren't expected to jump in all at once (see 9.11).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "sl": "Section 9", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-9.html#remember", "text": "• Say \"I have everything I need\", never \"I don't have\". • Give what you have: time, skills, kindness. • Layer a healed you over the old memory; don't carry it forward. • Body and consciousness rise together; it's resonance, not punishment. • Your rising frequency shows you who and what no longer fits.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-10.html#big-idea", "text": "When you live and exchange through the heart, without conditions, what you need starts arriving through synchronicity, and sometimes instantly: something missing is simply back, because you shifted into a reality where it already is. Every condition you set, including a fixed price, narrows that. You meet and create with people of similar frequency, each on your own timeline. Almost everything can be changed, including your birth signature and what a reading foresaw; only a bylaw, the script written before birth, stays fixed.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "10.1  Synchronicity: when the platform comes to you", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-1", "text": "The teaching example is an invitation to teach that arrived step by step through guidance. The instruction was to go and stay quiet, sharing only when asked. The group had already been told, through its own channel, that \"a new teacher is coming.\" The venue itself had been given away from the heart and turned into a non-profit. The lesson: you don't need to set conditions or pay your way into a platform. When you live through the heart, the right people and places find you through synchronicity. That is Energy Philanthropy at work (see 5.1). It also shows the value of listening to guidance, even when it seems odd (see 6.9).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "10.2  Instant manifestation", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-2", "text": "A missing screw was simply back in place days later, without a trip to the shop. You are constantly shifting and manifesting; you can shift straight into a parallel reality where the thing is already there, without the in-between steps (see 3.5, 8.4). The more you learn the structure, the more often this happens. A flash of annoyance (\"I want it now\") isn't a problem: it acts as a code for immediate manifestation, so it's fine sometimes. What makes instant manifestation easy is exchange through the heart, in every part of life. Being paid is fine; you can even be a millionaire that way. But each payment says \"to receive what you want in my hologram, you must give me this\", a condition. Do only that, and you crystallize a condition-only timeline (see 4.2). Help people freely, expecting nothing back, and you open infinite probabilities: you think of something, turn round, and it's there. In realities without monetary systems \"you can have instant manifestation for anything you wish\" (DP). Manifestation \"happens only when there is no ego and is based on pure love\" (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "10.3  Your frequency, your purpose, and co-creation", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-3", "text": "Your current frequency is always fluctuating (see Section 3). Your purpose unfolds as you keep steering your emotion toward the positive, whatever arrives, remembering you're in a hologram you can switch. Don't question how it will come. You find a teacher or a group because you resonate at a similar frequency. Picture two timelines, one at \"5\" and one at \"5.12\": different realities, yet close enough to merge into a shared plasma, a third reality (see 2.2). Each of you keeps your own timeline, while together you co-create. That is why everyone has their own reality and can still create with others.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "10.4  When it gets complicated, study again", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-4", "text": "If the material starts to feel too complex to absorb, go back to the beginning and study it again. Each time more sinks in, and you notice what you missed before. Everyone learns this way, step by step, including the teacher, who studied something every day (see 5.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "10.5  Astrology, readings and bylaws", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-5", "text": "At the moment of your birth, a particular energy signature was set in you, which is why some people are calmer and some more energetic. A chart or reading can describe that. But with ascension, everything is fluctuating, so don't get caught up in it: once you know it, you can mould it, becoming more assertive, more observant, whatever you need. The same goes for any reading or prediction: it shows the timeline you're on now. Act differently tomorrow and the outcome can change. The only thing you can't change is a bylaw, the script written before you were born, such as who your parents are or a particular partner. Only higher consciousness can alter that, by its own decision (see 5.7, 6.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "The method — Open the Door to Instant Manifestation", "url": "section-10.html#method", "text": "Give through the heart wherever you can, with no conditions and nothing expected back. Notice what's missing without panic. A quick \"I want it now\" is fine. Recall it and know it is already there, in a reality you can shift into (see 8.4). Don't question how it will come. Notice synchronicities, the people and places that find you, and follow them with an open heart. Keep studying; each time you go back, more sinks in.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "How did this new teaching collaboration come about?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "Through synchronicity and guidance, step by step. The invitation came more than once; the guidance was to go but stay quiet and share only if asked. When questions came, the group realised they had already been told, through their own channel, that a new teacher was coming. The venue itself had been given away from the heart and turned into a non-profit. The lesson: when you live through the heart, you don't need to set conditions or pay your way; the right people and places find you (see 10.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "A screw that was missing from my toilet seat was simply back in place days later. And each time something like this happens I feel a flash of annoyance. Does that spoil the process?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "You shifted into a parallel reality where the screw was already there, without the in-between step of going to the shop. That is instant manifestation, and it happens more as you learn the structure. The annoyance doesn't spoil it: a quick \"I want it now\" acts as a code for immediate manifestation, so it's fine sometimes. What makes instant manifestation easier is exchange through the heart, giving without conditions in every part of life (see 10.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "At my current energy signature, what does my full purpose look like on the highest timeline?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "Your frequency is always fluctuating, so there isn't one fixed signature to read. Your purpose unfolds as you keep steering your emotion towards the positive, whatever arrives, remembering you are in a hologram you can switch. Don't question how it will come. You found these teachings because you resonate at a similar frequency: two similar timelines, each person keeping their own, merge into a shared reality where you co-create (see 10.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "Readings told me I came to do work for humanity, with light, sound and magnetism, but things get too complex to absorb. What should I do?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "Go back to the beginning and study it again. Each time you go through it, more sinks in, and you notice what you missed because it was too complex before. Everyone learns this way, step by step, including the teacher, who studied something every day (see 10.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "As Saturn, my ruling planet, returns to Capricorn, what does that mean for my energy?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "At the moment you were born, a particular energy signature was set in you, which is why some people are calmer and some more energetic, and a chart can describe that. But with ascension everything is fluctuating, so don't get caught up in it: once you know your tendencies, you can mould them, becoming more assertive or more observant as needed. Any reading shows the timeline you're on now; act differently and the outcome changes. The only exception is a bylaw, the script written before birth, which only higher consciousness can alter (see 10.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "I see star-like objects in the sky that start moving once I notice them. What are they?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "The recording ends during this question, so no answer was captured.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "sl": "Section 10", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-10.html#remember", "text": "• Heart-based exchange opens the door to instant manifestation. • The thing may already be there: shift, don't search. • You meet and co-create with those of similar frequency. • Readings show the current timeline; your actions can change it. • Only the pre-birth script is fixed.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-11.html#big-idea", "text": "Every detail you insist on, and every \"I don't have\", is a specific code that narrows what can reach you. Drop it, return to zero point with gratitude, know \"I have everything I need\", then take action and leave the how open. Reality is printed like picture frames, moment to moment: you reprint yourself and everyone around you, similar but never the same, and several timelines run at once. Someone who falls out of resonance with you leaves your frames by themselves, as long as you neutralize and forgive rather than chase them. Memories and dreams are other realities you are tuning into.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "11.1  Be happy first", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-1", "text": "Don't make your happiness depend on finding what you want. Hold the happiness first, and it helps you find something that matches it. That is described as \"the best\" way round.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "11.2  A caution on cryptocurrency", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-2", "text": "This is described as a transitioning time, but the advice is not to put 100% trust in it. The guidance suggests some platforms could become another way of control. Choosing between coins is like gambling, or another stock market, because you can't see what is coming behind the scenes. Anyone can create a currency, so there is no need to wait for big institutions to pick one. The deeper point: put your trust in generosity and sharing through Energy Philanthropy (see 5.1), because the aim is an abundance society, not a new platform of control. The talk also floats an idea that a one-off distribution to everyone could pay off debts and free humanity overnight; it is offered as an idea, not something taught or predicted (compare 8.2). This is a caution as given in the talk, not financial advice. Downloads list \"Money / crypto combination will remain to allow humans to transition\" (DP), which fits the talk's \"transitioning time\".", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "11.3  Drop the detail, and it appears", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-3", "text": "Asking again and again for something \"new\" gives the field one narrow frequency. Once that condition is released (\"it only has to be new to me\"), the whole structure is free to deliver through any probability in any reality, and what you wanted can appear almost at once, often close by. Your own shift and the other person's decision happen together, because you are creating your reality (see 10.3). The lesson: notice the details you have attached that you don't actually need. Each one is a condition (see 1.5, 4.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "11.4  \"I have everything I need\", then take action", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-4", "text": "When the thing appears but the money doesn't seem to be there, don't say \"I don't have the money\". That sentence is a code, and the field will produce situations that keep the money away (see 9.1). Money is an illusion inside the structure; know you have everything you need, without knowing which way it will come. Then take action. Treat it like a game: what can I do to get this? Talk to the person, ask whether something can be worked out, such as payments. Action infuses your hologram and makes it matter; the inner work alone is only the first part. Leave everything open, and don't speculate. The answer may be no today and yes later, or it may come from someone else entirely, or as something similar rather than the exact thing. Whatever comes, be grateful: gratitude and understanding are the zero point, which opens infinite probabilities (see 2.1). If it doesn't happen, keep manifesting and don't block anything. When the emotion drops back to \"I don't have it\", lift it again: neutralize by understanding what just happened, then overwrite with the knowing that you have it, more potently than the drop (see 2.6). Mastery is exactly this: steering the shift, knowing where to tune next, without expectations.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "11.5  Reality as picture frames", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-5", "text": "Question: if I shift into another reality, does the present one carry on without me? Would I become a missing person to my loved ones? You shift moment to moment, so fast it looks like you aren't moving; in fact it is fractal, a new Earth each moment (see 2.7, 5.4). Repeat and crystallize something different, and you create a different timeline of yourself. Both timelines run at the same time, and consciousness can shift back and forth between them. Each time, you don't only project a new you: you imprint everyone and everything in your hologram too, like a copy, similar but not the same. Think of picture frames: print one photo, then the next moment another, and lay them side by side. In one you wear a pink blouse, in the other a blue one, and you can see both. So you never go back in time; you imprint another reality to see what happened there. And it is never identical, because consciousness keeps moving in a spiral (see 5.8). The answer doesn't say directly whether loved ones would notice you gone. What it does say is that you reprint the people around you into each new frame, so they come with you as new imprints. \"There is no time, only momentum in one picture frame in time space\"; \"everything is frame to frame in the now\", and zero point regulates the move from one frame to the next (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "11.6  When someone keeps causing problems", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-6", "text": "If a person in your frames drops their frequency compared with yours, then, through synchronicity and in one of infinite ways (a move, a change of circumstances), they stop being imprinted into your reality. Or they change, and you both forgive and move on positively. You can't know which, so don't set conditions on how it plays out. The condition is that you neutralize at zero point and understand the situation, through the heart and forgiveness. Going after them, or being mean, keeps projecting a frequency tied to them, so you print them straight back into your reality. The more you let it be through the heart, the sooner it resolves (see 6.5, 2.10). That doesn't mean the person stops existing. They continue in other timelines.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "11.7  A memory is a look into another timeline", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-7", "text": "When you remember someone, even a difficult relationship, you are tuning into another timeline. You can recall it only because your consciousness knows that reality's vibrational sequence (see 5.4). Notice where you tune, and let old ones be through the heart. \"All memories are in the creation of the now. You can not think of it if it doesn't exist already\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "11.8  The heart: the purest frequency", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-8", "text": "The hardest part for everyone is to pull yourself out of a situation, give gratitude for where you are, and project only the positive. Your job is to project positive frequency through the heart and understanding, the highest frequency there is. Negative consciousness cannot hold the heart's frequency: with no conditions it is the purest, cleanest one in the structure, flowing both ways. That is why manifestation becomes easy once you share through the heart, sometimes bringing more than you ever dreamed of (see 4.2, 10.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "11.9  Dreams are another reality", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-9", "text": "Forgiveness and shifting can happen in dreams as well as awake, because the dream state is another state of reality (see 8.9). Dream symbols are personal codes: a good car might mean prosperity for one person and a new home for another, so learn your own. Practise lucid dreaming to connect this way (see 8.14). Not everyone is allowed to do everything there; access comes when you are ready. The recording ends during this answer. \"Your dreams at night are no different than your reality when you wake up\"; you have only shifted your perception into another parallel reality in the now (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "The method — Leave It Open", "url": "section-11.html#method", "text": "Use it for anything you want to manifest, especially when the money or the route isn't visible yet: Be happy first. Don't make your joy wait for the result. Strip the details. Ask yourself which conditions you've added (\"brand new\", \"from this person\", \"by Friday\") and drop the ones you don't need. Catch \"I don't have…\" the moment you think or say it. Pull out and go to zero point with gratitude: \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at.\" Overwrite: \"I have everything I need.\" Feel it more strongly than the drop. Take action. Play the game: what can I do? Ask, talk, offer what you can. Leave it open. Don't speculate on how or from whom. It may come another way, or as something similar; be grateful either way. Keep going. If this route closes, keep manifesting and lift the emotion again each time it drops.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "I'm happy now, and I think my happiness will help me find what I'm looking for, rather than depending on finding it. Is that right?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "Yes, that is described as the best way round. Hold the happiness first; it is a frequency, and it helps you find something that matches it (see 11.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "Should we move into cryptocurrency?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "It is described as a transitioning time, but the advice is not to put 100% trust in it: some platforms could become another way of control, and choosing between coins is like gambling, because you can't see what is happening behind the scenes. Put your trust instead in generosity and sharing through Energy Philanthropy. This is the talk's caution, not financial advice (see 11.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "I kept asking for a \"new\" truck. When I realised it only had to be new to me, the exact truck appeared for sale down the street. But I don't have the money. What now?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "Dropping \"new\" removed a narrow condition, so the field could deliver through any probability, and it did, almost at once. Now don't say \"I don't have the money\": that sentence is a code, and the field will produce situations that keep the money away. Know \"I have everything I need,\" without knowing which way it comes. Then take action: talk to the seller, see whether payments could work. Leave everything open and don't speculate; it may be this truck or another, now or later. If your emotion drops, neutralize it and overwrite it with the knowing, and be grateful for whatever comes (see 11.3, 11.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "If I shift into another reality, does the present one carry on without me? Would I become a missing person to my loved ones?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "Timelines run side by side at the same time, and you shift between them moment to moment, like picture frames laid next to each other. Each time, you reprint not only yourself but everyone around you into the new frame, similar but not the same, so your loved ones come with you as new imprints. You never go back in time; you imprint another reality. The answer doesn't say directly whether anyone would notice you gone (see 11.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "Can this forgiving and shifting happen in our dreams too, as well as when we're awake?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "Yes, because the dream state is another state of reality. Dream symbols are personal codes: a good car might mean prosperity for one person and a new home for another, so learn your own. Practise lucid dreaming to connect this way, knowing that not everyone is allowed to do everything there until they are ready. The recording ends during this answer (see 11.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "sl": "Section 11", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-11.html#remember", "text": "• Every unneeded detail and every \"I don't have\" is a code that blocks you. • \"I have everything I need\", then take action. • Leave the how open; be grateful for whatever version comes. • You reprint yourself and your people frame by frame. • Don't chase a difficult person: neutralize, forgive, let it be.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 12, "sl": "Section 12", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-12.html#big-idea", "text": "When two realities merge into the third (1 + 1 = 3), the merge is a compression so intense it reaches infinity, and infinity equals the zero point: a vacuum where no frequency comes in or goes out, only awareness. Neutralize yourself into that vacuum, then project a potent positive frequency; because the vacuum holds the energy of the whole structure, the stronger frequency becomes your new hologram instantly. Illness is treated the same way, as a frequency carried from reality to reality, and every remedy is a vibration. Don't judge anyone: change comes from within, through neutrality, the heart and action.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 12, "sl": "Section 12", "title": "12.1  The shift has been made", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-1", "text": "This session opens by saying a new era has begun: enough frequency was built up to crystallize the timeline of ascension, and that is worth celebrating (see 2.8).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "sl": "Section 12", "title": "12.2  How two realities become a third: compression", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-2", "text": "Each reality is a hologram of your own Earth, with everyone imprinted inside (see 11.5). Two timelines on different platforms can't see each other; you see the other one only when you merge back and forth at a similar frequency (see 10.3). As your emotion fluctuates, the two merge into a third, 1 + 1 = 3 (see 2.2), like a tug of war in which the more potent side wins. New in this session: to make the third, the two realities undergo a compression of the energetic field, vibrating so fast that it is effectively infinite speed. And infinity equals the zero point. The zero point is a vacuum: no frequency comes in or goes out of anywhere. You are just there, as awareness. All manifestation comes from it. Zero point is where \"each structure you create a vacuum of stillness so you will be able to shift and choose the new implementation of realities\" (SD). The books also name a \"'0' point Portal Vacuum\" (NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "sl": "Section 12", "title": "12.3  Why manifestation is instantaneous", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-3", "text": "First neutralize everything: no positive, no negative, nothing in or out. Neutrality is what enters the vacuum; you become the awareness. Then project, through your mind, a very potent frequency. If one side is negative and one positive, overwrite with the positive (see 2.6). Whatever is stronger is projected into the vacuum. Because the vacuum is under infinite pressure, holding the energy of the entire multi-universe, the projection is instantaneous: there is no time, only flickering. You think of something and it is projected in front of you. Even moving across a room, you aren't really moving; you are projecting everyone back in, instantly (see 11.5). What comes out of that compression is your final hologram, the new reality you shift into.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "sl": "Section 12", "title": "12.4  Illness in the quantum field", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-4", "text": "Question: how do you perceive illness in the quantum field? Illness is described as an energetic momentum of a frequency, matching your conscious understanding. If you keep the belief system that holds that frequency, you carry its vibrational sequence from one reality to the next and keep re-imprinting the same illness. The teaching is that you can neutralize it and shift your consciousness, through the vacuum, into a reality that no longer holds it, using Stop · Transform · Complete (see 7.1). A further method is to teach your consciousness to go into your DNA: recall the momentum of that frequency, let consciousness lead you to the DNA fractal, see it, then stop and transform it. This needs a belief that manifestation is simultaneous; you are extracting yourself from one timeline and co-creating a new one, where the \"dots of vibration\" carrying the illness are no longer present. \"Healing comes at '0' point,\" and the body \"will recognize within itself the DNA code and re-adjust to perfect harmony\"; the books link healing to sound and the heart's tone (SD). Important health note Use these practices alongside medical care, never instead of it. If you are ill or in pain, see a doctor; don't stop or change any treatment or medication without your doctor's advice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "sl": "Section 12", "title": "12.5  Remedies, sound and frequency", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-5", "text": "Question: as a practitioner, how can I help heal someone? Everything comes down to frequency and sound; every flower and plant carries its own vibrational sequence. A practitioner using remedies is choosing vibrations and giving them to the person. In that sense the healing is \"an illusion\": the plant is a vibration, and you are learning to work with vibrations, through matter, so you can have the experience. Combine them well and you are \"playing like a chemist\" with the structure. Each frequency has a meaning. From the session: 3 Hz prepares the vacuum before a new frequency comes in; 5 Hz stabilizes, and without it the other frequencies can't merge; higher numbers mean more potency. The same holds for music: tones carry frequencies into your consciousness, so choose consciously what you listen to. The talk also claims that published frequency lists for some oils, and for older frequency-healing machines, were altered and are no longer accurate, so it advises: don't assume, measure. These are the talk's claims, not checked facts. Its broader point is that knowledge is power: study the science, and you gain the awareness to decide your next step. In the books, 3 Hz \"prepares all the energy for operation for all the fields (the base)\", and 5 Hz \"stays neutral\" and \"is needed when you are mixing the different tones\" (HR). So the books describe 5 Hz as neutral and needed for mixing, where the talk calls it stabilizing; both agree the merge needs it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "sl": "Section 12", "title": "12.6  Don't judge; change comes from within", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-6", "text": "Signs of disclosure are appearing because those in control have less and less choice (see 6.8). Still, don't judge a consciousness that has lived for centuries by taking others' energy; it is how it learned to survive. Many of us do something similar to animals, which are conscious beings, and then complain when it is done to us (see 9.7). Change happens from within: by neutralizing, switching realities and timelines, manifesting and moving on, through forgiveness, neutrality and the heart. Support each other through Energy Philanthropy in any form, money or gifts (see 5.1). And take action: thinking and feeling bring the frequency, but action is the infuser of your reality (see 11.4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "sl": "Section 12", "title": "12.7  Weather, storms and contracts", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-7", "text": "Question: are the intense weather events a result of the new reality crystallizing in the collective? Weather events are described as part of our evolution; don't take them as negative. The talk adds claims that some weather may be used to clear chemicals sprayed from the air, which it says can make people act like antennas for frequencies, and recommends drinking distilled water to flush them out. These are claims, not established facts. The teaching itself: whatever you see, neutralize it at zero point with gratitude for being shown where you are, then manifest the positive, again and again. Shift your timeline and it is no longer part of your reality. If you go through a storm or a hard experience, pull out and see the whole picture: you are there through a contract, perhaps to experience it, or to help or save someone. Stay neutral and act positively through the heart (see 5.7). A reader challenged the distilled-water claim as chemically false, since pure water is neutral. The books' answer agrees it is \"technically\" neutral, but says it takes on a charge in the body and pulls out toxins (SD). Important safety note In severe weather, follow official emergency guidance first; pulling out is an inner practice, not a substitute for staying safe. Distilled water lacks minerals, so if you plan to make it your only drinking water, check with a doctor first.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "sl": "Section 12", "title": "The method — Through the Vacuum", "url": "section-12.html#method", "text": "Use it when what you see and what you want are pulling against each other: Name the two realities: the one in front of you, and the one you choose. Pull out and neutralize everything. No positive, no negative. Gratitude for being shown where you are. Be the awareness, with nothing going in or out. Project a potent positive frequency from that stillness, stronger than the other side (see 2.6). Know it is instant. There is no time; it is projected now. Hold it. Take action. Action infuses the new hologram. For illness or danger, add the practical step: see your doctor, follow safety guidance, and use this alongside.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "sl": "Section 12", "title": "I'm studying acupuncture and Reiki. How do you perceive illness in the quantum field?", "url": "section-12.html#questions", "text": "Illness is described as an energetic momentum of a frequency, matching your conscious understanding. If you keep the belief system that holds that frequency, you carry it from one reality to the next and keep re-imprinting the same illness. The teaching is that you can neutralize it and shift, through the zero-point vacuum, into a reality that no longer holds it, using Stop · Transform · Complete; and that you can teach your consciousness to go into your DNA, see the frequency, and stop and transform it. Use this alongside medical care, never instead of it (see 12.4 and its health note).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 12, "sl": "Section 12", "title": "As a practitioner, how can I help heal a person who is carrying an illness?", "url": "section-12.html#questions", "text": "Everything comes down to frequency and sound; every plant carries its own vibrational sequence. Using remedies means choosing vibrations and giving them to the person, so in that sense you are working with frequency through matter. Each frequency has a meaning (for example 3 Hz prepares, 5 Hz is needed to merge others). The talk also claims some published frequency lists were altered, so it advises measuring rather than assuming; that is its claim, not a checked fact. Above all, study, because knowledge is power (see 12.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 12, "sl": "Section 12", "title": "Are the more intense weather events a result of the new reality crystallizing in the collective consciousness?", "url": "section-12.html#questions", "text": "They are described as part of our evolution, so don't take them as negative. Whatever you see, neutralize it at zero point with gratitude, then manifest the positive, again and again. If you go through a storm, pull out and see the whole picture: you are there through a contract, perhaps to experience it or to help someone. In real severe weather, follow official safety guidance first. The talk's claims about chemicals and distilled water are claims, not established facts (see 12.7 and its safety note).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 12, "sl": "Section 12", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-12.html#remember", "text": "• Zero point is a vacuum: nothing in, nothing out, just awareness. • Neutralize first, then project something potent. • With no time, the stronger frequency becomes your hologram instantly. • Illness and remedies are frequencies; use the practice alongside a doctor. • Don't judge. Change from within, then act.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-13.html#big-idea", "text": "Raising the frequency of your consciousness, and your body with it, is linked to staying young, but it has to be done gently and safely. New technology will come from the people up: share designs, pool small amounts, help each other build, rather than waiting for sponsors. The old systems are collapsing because, collectively, the positive became more potent, and that joy gave permission for benevolent help, which never comes without it. Some use devices to build artificial timelines; master the natural way, through the heart and the body as a vessel, and no one can manipulate you.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "13.1  Raising your frequency, and staying young", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-1", "text": "Question: how can aging be reversed, if everything comes from consciousness? The answer links youth to activating a \"young enzyme\". As you raise the frequency of your consciousness, with lighter food and, in time, a vegetarian diet, you draw frequency from prana, the energy of the quantum field, and your molecules vibrate faster (see 9.7). Any change of diet should be made slowly, with professional guidance. The teacher's own experience of a long honey-and-water fast is described with a clear warning: don't do it; it was done only with special preparation. The distilled-water claims from 12.7 are repeated here. The talk also mentions urine therapy and a long water-only \"cure\" raised by a participant; see the health note. A lesson worth keeping: guidance was checked with research before it was trusted. Don't follow anything blindly, even from a trusted source; find out why. A message titled \"The Recovery of Cell Degeneration To Stay Young\" says that with the right frequency sequence applied to the DNA, \"your body cells will not degenerate again and it will stay young\" (SD, NT). Important health note Prolonged fasting, honey-and-water or water-only regimes, and drinking urine are not safe or proven ways to reverse aging or detox, and can cause serious harm. Don't try them. Talk to a doctor or registered dietitian before any big change to what you eat or drink, especially if you have a health condition or take medication.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "13.2  New technology comes from the people up", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-2", "text": "Question: a study group is setting up a science non-profit and plans to share a low-cost energy design. Any advice? The new platform will come from the people up, not from governments, with support following later. When you have a working technology, share it: build a few units, tell others how, and pool small contributions so everyone can produce their own and help each other. Waiting for a sponsor or trying to profit keeps a great invention stuck, because not everyone finds a sponsor. This is the heart structure in practice (see 5.1): sharing and giving, and if you have money, supporting someone who doesn't. Otherwise you pour your energy in and people only take. You can receive from other platforms too; learn to manifest, so what you need comes to you the proper way (see 4.4). The real change comes once something visibly works. \"The right scientists will appear assorted by us energetically to perfect the technology,\" bringing \"FREE ENERGY to everyone's home\"; \"Do not be dazzled by money and popularity\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "13.3  How contact happens", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-3", "text": "Question: in what ways have people had contact? In different ways: telepathically; a light being appearing in front of someone with instructions to do something for humanity; ongoing messages about structures, for instance for building a device to be given freely; or being taken out of the body, like astral projection, and shown what to do. Many people are being contacted quietly, and it isn't in the mainstream news yet. Some information is held back for a time on guidance's advice. All of it points the same way: toward a unity structure, where the competition for money, glory and fame dissipates. So stay in the heart.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "13.4  Why the shift came: collective permission", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-4", "text": "The collapse of old systems is described as \"an avalanche\" (see 12.1). Why now? A reality has to be potent to shift (see 2.2, 3.3). Collectively, the positive became more potent than the negative. Even people who know nothing of these teachings contribute, simply through the heart. That joy and wish for change gave permission for higher consciousness and benevolent races to step in and help the ascension, because humanity was manipulated and needed a boost. Benevolent help never takes over without permission. Real guidance never hands out very personal information about the people around you; at most a short caution, such as \"stay back\". Anything that overrides your consciousness is using negative structures, not the heart. Higher consciousness \"collectively ask[ed] your permission to increase the sequence\" while rebuilding the grid toward the 5-dimensional one; \"Well it is all new now. Enjoy your freedom\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "13.5  Natural shifting versus artificial timelines", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-5", "text": "Technology is neither good nor bad; it depends on how it's used. As part of ascension we go through technology, and it's exciting. At the same time, teach your body to be the vessel of that energy field. Then you can shift realities by thought, without a device. Some who can't ascend naturally, because their frequency doesn't match those realities, use devices to build artificial timelines and holograms they can control. Learn the quantum manifestation platform instead: you'll be able to tune your energy field, leave one timeline and create another, and no one will be able to suppress or manipulate you. If you are manipulated without your permission, or act while blinded, you'll be helped and given the chance to change. And don't judge anyone who does harm; they may have been manipulated too (see 12.6). \"The physical body of yours is a vessel of energetic force. To reach certain realms of existence, you have to match the frequency components and then shift to that reality\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "13.6  Remembering is co-creating", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-6", "text": "Question: do I have a contract to remember contact with my star family? Tune into the structures; you already know how. Remembering and co-creating happen at the same time, because it is one structure (see 5.4, 11.7). The answer isn't simply handed over, because finding it yourself is how you learn. (The recording ends during this answer.)", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "The method — Become the Vessel", "url": "section-13.html#method", "text": "Stay in the heart. Project joy and the wish for change; that is your share of the collective. Raise your frequency gently. Lighter living, changed slowly and with professional advice. No extreme fasts. Check guidance with research. Don't follow anything blindly; find out why. Share what you have: knowledge, designs, time, a little money. Build together instead of waiting for sponsors. Don't judge. Neutralize, and master your own shifting so no one can manipulate you. Want to remember something? Tune in and co-create it; finding it is the lesson.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "Is there information on how to reverse aging, since everything comes from consciousness?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "The answer links staying young to activating a \"young enzyme\" by raising the frequency of your consciousness and body: as you live more lightly, you draw frequency from prana, the energy of the field, and your molecules vibrate faster. Any change of diet should be slow and guided by a professional. The talk describes a long honey-and-water fast but says plainly not to do it. Extreme fasts are not safe; see a doctor before any big change (see 13.1 and its health note).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "A participant described a long distilled-water \"cure\", and the reply suggested urine therapy. Should I try these?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "No. These are claims made in the talk, not safe or proven practices, and they can cause serious harm. Raise your frequency gently instead, with professional advice for any change to what you eat or drink (see 13.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "Our study group is founding a science non-profit, and an inventor plans to share a low-cost energy design with everyone. Any advice?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "Share it from the ground up. The new platform will come from the people, not governments. Build a few units, show others how, and pool small contributions so everyone can produce their own; if someone can't afford their share, help them. Waiting for a sponsor or trying to profit keeps a good invention stuck. The real change comes when people can see something actually working (see 13.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "You said some people have already had contact. In what way: telepathic, in person?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "In different ways: telepathically; a light being appearing in front of someone with instructions to do something for humanity; ongoing messages about structures, for example for a device to be given freely; or being taken out of the body, like astral projection, and shown what to do. Many are contacted quietly, and it isn't in the news yet. All of it points towards a unity structure, beyond competition for money and fame, so stay in the heart (see 13.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "Do I have a contract to remember contact with my star family?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "Tune into the structures; you already know how. Remembering and co-creating happen at the same time, because it is all one structure, so go ahead and create it. The answer isn't simply handed to you, because finding it yourself is how you learn. The recording ends during this answer (see 13.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "sl": "Section 13", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-13.html#remember", "text": "• Raise your frequency gently; no extreme fasts. • New technology grows from the people up: share it. • The positive became more potent, and that gave permission for help. • Benevolent help never overrides your consciousness. • Master the natural way, and no one can manipulate you.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-14.html#big-idea", "text": "Every person in front of you is, in that moment, your entire universe, so how you treat them decides the next reality you shift into. Karma is accumulated frequency that is out of balance with the heart, and to clear it you go through lessons: people come, by agreement, to challenge you. Answer harm with harm and the mirror sends back something similar, again and again: the loop. Pull out, neutralize with gratitude, forgive, transform and move on, and you leave that frequency behind in another timeline. Practised moment to moment, this is the alchemy of consciousness.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "14.1  The person in front of you is your whole universe", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-1", "text": "The recording opens in the middle of a familiar teaching (see 2.1): when someone is upset with you, stop taking in their frequency and go to zero point. This creates a shield of awareness around you. From there you choose to act towards that person in the positive, which overrides the old frequency and starts a new hologram with a positive outcome. How it will turn out, you don't know; leave it open to infinite probabilities. Why does this matter so much? Because the structure is fractal, moment to moment. Whoever you are talking to right now is, in that moment, your entire universe; move even slightly and you have already printed a new hologram with everyone in it (see 5.4, 11.5). Treat that person through the heart, with the best of your abilities, and your next moment is built on that vibration. Keep doing it and the moments add up to a positive timeline. Drop into the negative and stay there, and you fluctuate towards a negative timeline instead; whichever you hold more of is where you end up (see 2.3, 3.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "14.2  Why forgiveness: karma and lessons", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-2", "text": "Forgiveness is described as probably the most fundamental thing we have to do. Across many realities we have created many versions of ourselves, each taking on belief systems and interacting with people according to our agreements. Karma is accumulated frequency that is out of balance with the heart structure (see 3.2), and consciousness itself is based on the heart. If you deliberately hurt people or keep acting against others' interests, you accumulate that frequency and build a negative timeline. When you then want to change, you come into a new hologram to learn the positive, and that learning comes through lessons, like playing a game. Everything you accumulated has to be transformed, and it works at 100%, not 99% (see 1.5): even one small thing left unresolved will come back into a hologram to be fixed. It may take more than one lifetime, depending on how well you learn. Think of a schoolyard and ask yourself: did I pass the lesson I agreed to, or did I add more negative because I didn't? Why go through this at all? Because, at a higher level, you want to ascend: to move into less dense realities built on sharing and giving. You don't have to stay \"in the mud\"; it is a choice. \"Remember reality is a mirror image of your consciousness. So create, behave and be\" accordingly (SD, NT). And of those who oppose you: forgive them, \"because they are your biggest teachers\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "14.3  Your biggest villain could be your biggest teacher", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-3", "text": "Because of what you accumulated, people will come to you by agreement to challenge you, even to do something hurtful, so that you learn that what you once did was out of balance with the heart. You may not remember doing it; it may have been in another life or timeline. That is why someone who hurts you can be your biggest teacher: they give you the chance to balance it. Now you have a choice. You can go negative again, going after the person to \"teach them a lesson\", or you can transform it. This is why the knowledge matters: once you understand the structure, you see the challenge for what it is.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "14.4  \"An eye for an eye\" keeps the loop going", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-4", "text": "If you don't listen to your heart, which truly wants to love and be loved, anger, belief systems and dogma say \"an eye for an eye.\" But in the quantum structure, going after someone is going after yourself, because they are your projection (see 1.8). You create another negative reality and accumulate more of the same. The teaching is careful here: it isn't judging people raised to believe revenge is right; it describes what happens in the structure, so you can choose. Reality is a mirror, so what you project comes back, described as a \"reverse osmosis\". It won't be the exact same thing done to you, because there are infinite probabilities, but it will be something similar, because the structure mimics the vibration you gave it. That is why the same kind of situation keeps happening and doesn't clear. Fear, hatred, jealousy and \"revenge resonate at a lower Hz\", which is how you trap yourself in a lower hologram (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "14.5  Old hurts belong to another timeline", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-5", "text": "Forgiveness also applies to the past. If something very hurtful happened to you, for example in childhood, and you keep thinking about it, you carry its frequency, the memory, into every new reality. But that timeline and the hologram you are in now are two completely different realities; the new one has nothing to do with the old (see 2.7, 9.6). So neutralize it at zero point with gratitude, and the old frequency stops entering your new hologram. The way it is put: \"I understand what happened to me. I understand it's in my past, but it's time to let go.\" That was a different version of you in a different hologram; it is now just a memory bank of another timeline. If the thoughts keep returning because the hurt went deep, keep projecting the positive through gratitude, again and again. The more you dwell on it, cry over it and talk about it, the more power you give it, and the loop recreates the same thing. This is exactly why Stop · Transform · Complete was given (see 7.1). For deep trauma, support from a qualified therapist can sit alongside this practice (see 6.6).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "14.6  The alchemy of consciousness: practise it", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-6", "text": "Knowing this makes you a master of the alchemy of consciousness: turning a dense, painful frequency into a positive one. It sounds easy; the practice is hard, and everyone says \"I'm hit with a situation and I'm stuck.\" The answer: don't stay stuck, let it go. What helps most is to pull out and think \"I'm a hologram\", in a game: \"If this is my hologram, I project everything. If I want something, it already exists somewhere in infinite probability, but I need to take an action.\" Once this becomes normal, you think of something and it comes through synchronicity, without much effort, because it happens in the heart structure, where there are no conditions. Telling someone \"to have this, you must give me something back\" is the illusion. Give from the heart and leave it open; it will come back in some form you can't predict. And reverse the old rule: you don't have to see it to believe it; you project it, to create it, to see it (see 1.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "14.7  Training yourself to act well", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-7", "text": "Question: we've taken in a lot of knowledge, yet still carry the same behaviours, such as feeling worthless, lacking confidence and not trusting the process. How do we train ourselves to take beneficial action? Start from the structure: everyone you deal with is a projection of yourself, the one particle printed as a different image, so when you talk to someone, you are talking to yourself through another hologram. We were trained to put conditions on each other, and to give power to a piece of paper; that is what created duality. So when something brings you down: acknowledge that your emotion has dropped into a dense frequency, where the heart's frequency struggles to get through. Pull out and give gratitude to the image in front of you, since you chose that interaction. Then shift your emotion to the positive and ask: what can I do to change this? What can I do that is kind? For example, \"I understand you're feeling this way.\" If you're emotional or low, do something physical: dress up, put on good music, watch a good film, call a friend, go out, ski, swim, anything that calms you and lifts the emotion (see 6.7, 8.13). The same with what you see: on a cloudy day, give thanks for the cloud, because it is part of consciousness and you don't reject it, then project a beautiful, sunny day instead of tuning into the forecast of a storm (see 2.5). And when a challenge comes, thank it: \"Thank you for being in my reality, so I can transform something that was out of balance.\" How else would you practise?", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "14.8  Make your day a positive timeline", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-8", "text": "Complaining is also a loop: the more you talk about something, the more of it you create. Stop it, understand it, give gratitude, transform it and move on. And do it properly; 99% won't do it. A practical tool: in the morning, write down the few things you have to do. If one feels heavy, such as going to the shop when you don't want to, plan how to lift it: dress up nicely, put on music, and give gratitude for your home, your clothes and everything else. Carry that vibration moment to moment and the whole day, which is a small timeline in itself, ends up positive.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "14.9  Why keep giving, even when tired", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-9", "text": "The talk ends with an example of its own teaching: giving the best of yourself even when exhausted, because the people in front of you are, in that moment, your whole universe, and how you act towards them without expecting anything back becomes your next moment. That is collecting positive heart structure. Someone might call that selfish; the answer is that it is transformation, done in order to live in an abundant reality, where whatever is needed can come from anywhere. The recording ends here, mid-sentence.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "The method — Forgive and Transform", "url": "section-14.html#method", "text": "Use it when someone hurts or challenges you, or when an old hurt comes back: Acknowledge the drop. \"My emotion just went dense.\" Pull out. \"I'm a hologram, in a game. This person is my projection.\" Zero point. Stop taking in their frequency. \"Thank you for being in my reality, so I can transform this.\" Forgive. Don't go after them, and don't replay it. If it's from the past: \"That was another timeline. It's time to let go.\" Transform. Lift your emotion, with physical action if needed, and ask: what can I do that's kind? Move on. Leave it alone, and keep acting from the heart, moment to moment. If it returns, repeat with gratitude. Don't feed it by complaining or dwelling.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "Why is forgiveness so important?", "url": "section-14.html#questions", "text": "Because karma is accumulated frequency that is out of balance with the heart, and the only way to clear it is to transform it. People come, by agreement, to challenge you so that you can balance what you accumulated. If you answer with revenge, the mirror sends back something similar and the loop continues; if you forgive, neutralize and transform, you stop carrying that frequency into your new reality. It applies to old hurts too: they belong to another timeline, and dwelling on them keeps recreating them (see 14.2–14.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "You make it sound so easy. What if I'm hit with a situation and feel stuck?", "url": "section-14.html#questions", "text": "The practice is genuinely hard, for everyone. Don't stay stuck; let it go. What helps most is to pull out and think \"I'm a hologram, in a game; I project everything.\" Then take an action. As it becomes normal, things start to come through synchronicity with less effort (see 14.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "We take in a lot of knowledge but still carry the same behaviours: feeling worthless, lacking confidence, not trusting the process. How do we train ourselves to take beneficial action?", "url": "section-14.html#questions", "text": "Remember that everyone you deal with is a projection of yourself. When you feel brought down, acknowledge that your emotion has dropped into a dense frequency, pull out, and give gratitude to the person or situation in front of you. Then shift your emotion and ask what you can do to make it better, or do something kind. If you're low, do something physical that lifts you: dress up, music, a good film, a friend, a swim. Plan your day so that even the heavy tasks are done in a good mood, and thank each challenge as practice (see 14.7, 14.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 14, "sl": "Section 14", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-14.html#remember", "text": "• The person in front of you is your whole universe right now. • Karma is accumulated frequency out of balance with the heart. • Your biggest villain could be your biggest teacher. • Revenge and replaying keep the loop going. Forgive, transform, move on. • Old hurts belong to another timeline; don't carry them into the new one.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-15.html#big-idea", "text": "Money is neither good nor bad; what matters is how you use it. But believing that freedom can only come through money locks you into one narrow, conditioned timeline. Feel that you already have everything, the life itself and not the money, and let the structure choose the route. Everyone is always channelling: you receive the \"stations\" you match, and living from the heart raises you to higher ones. And you don't have to take anyone's truth as yours: neutralize it with thanks, don't condemn, and switch the channel.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "15.1  Freedom isn't only money", "url": "section-15.html#part-15-1", "text": "Question: I've studied the markets and I enjoy trading, though I believe money shouldn't need to exist. My goal is freedom: time to grow and to live on my own terms, not by the clock of a normal job. Am I limiting myself? The heart vibration and the money vibration are completely different timelines (see 4.8). Money runs on conditions, so it is denser and has limits; the heart has no condition, so it opens infinite probabilities. Money itself is not negative or positive; it is how you use it. You could earn a great deal and put it to work for humanity, and if it is truly from your heart, nothing is wrong with it. The illusion is the belief that the only way to freedom is a lot of money. That gives power to a piece of paper and blocks the rest of the structure. In the structure you always have freedom; how it comes is infinite, perhaps money, perhaps an inheritance, perhaps something you would never guess. It doesn't matter whether you have $1 or $1 million: using this knowledge, what you need comes when you need it. So ask honestly whether the want comes from ego, and don't make \"a lot of money\" your permanent goal, or you lock yourself into a timeline controlled by money. The practice, from the very first teaching: don't imagine having a lot of money; bypass it. Imagine already having what you want: the holiday, the home, the person beside you, the free time. Feel the happiness of having it now, and let the structure decide the shape and route. Then play the hide-and-seek game: you know you have it, even though you don't see it yet, and you keep projecting it until it crystallizes (see 1.7). Our three-dimensional thinking can't work out how; consciousness is infinite. Abundance comes \"through any form, not only money\" (SD, NT; see 4.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "15.2  You are always channelling", "url": "section-15.html#part-15-2", "text": "Question: how do people channel through the quantum structure? You are always channelling. Even the question that came into your mind was information you drew from the field, because you are the field. Realities run on different vibrational levels, all at the same time, a reality within a reality. It is like radio stations: you can tune into channel three, but if you don't know the frequency for channel five, you'll never find it. What you can receive depends on what you match. As you raise your consciousness and act from the heart, you move up, like a ladder, into less dense, faster levels. Stay in dense thinking and behaviour, and that information isn't available to you, just as believing that everything must come through money hides all the other routes (see 15.1). The teachings are said to open \"the synoptical channels in your brain to become familiar with the quantum structures\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "15.3  Why some people channel easily and others need a trance", "url": "section-15.html#part-15-3", "text": "Question: why can some people access information instantly, while others need a trance or deep meditation? First, agreement: some came with an agreement to do this. Second, sticking with it: even with an agreement, the teacher had to practise, starting with automatic writing as a child, and pass many lessons. Everyone came with this knowledge; it is your choice whether to tap into it. When your guidance sees you passing your lessons and going into the heart, they decide to interact more. Not everyone sticks with it, because the transformation is hard, and someone who isn't consciously ready can't be connected with yet. Guidance can show you what to do, but nobody makes you do it (see 5.7, 6.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "15.4  Cleansing questions: juices, distilled water, baking soda", "url": "section-15.html#part-15-4", "text": "Several questions were about the body. The answers given, reported here as the talk's own advice and claims: • Fruit-only versus vegetable juices: the advice was to combine both, because each has different properties, and to prefer juicing (with green vegetables) over blended shakes, as more potent; bitter greens were described as part of the cleansing. It also said a fruit-only cleanse might feed a fungal problem; that is the talk's claim. • Distilled water: the talk repeats its preference for distilled water and says you can make your own by evaporating water in a stainless-steel pot (see 12.7). • Baking soda: the talk suggests aluminium-free baking soda for washing externally after using the bathroom or after intimacy, and for haemorrhoids, and mentions once taking a teaspoon in water for an upset stomach. It also claims this kills cancer cells; that claim is not supported by medical evidence. A raw diet with fresh vegetable and fruit juices is described as raising your frequency (HR). Important health note These are reported as the talk's advice, not medical guidance. Talk to a doctor before any detox, fast or cleanse, especially with a health condition or medication. Don't use baking soda as a treatment, and don't drink it regularly or in large amounts (it can be harmful, especially with heart, kidney or blood-pressure problems). For haemorrhoids, infections, persistent stomach problems, or any concern about cancer, see a doctor.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "15.5  Someone else's truth doesn't have to be yours", "url": "section-15.html#part-15-5", "text": "The session closes with a question about information that seems valid but feels heavy or lower. In short: everyone downloads from the field according to their own vibration, so their truth is true from their point of view; but the moment you accept something as 100% true, you start creating from it. Neutralize it with thanks, don't condemn the person, and switch the channel. This answer was also released as its own video, so it is taught in full in Section 16.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "The method — Open the Whole Field", "url": "section-15.html#method", "text": "For money worries, or for heavy information you've taken in: Notice the narrow belief: \"Only money can give me this,\" or \"what they said must be true.\" Pull out and say thank you to the situation or the person. Don't condemn it. Imagine the life, not the money: the freedom, the home, the holiday, the time, as yours now. Feel it until you're happy now, as if it has already happened. Switch the channel: hold the positive version, and let the structure decide how it comes. Keep doing your work and keep playing hide-and-seek: you know you have it, so keep projecting it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "Will I limit myself by conditioning things through money? I trade the markets because I enjoy the game and want freedom from a normal job.", "url": "section-15.html#questions", "text": "Money isn't negative or positive, and if trading truly comes from your heart, nothing is wrong with it; you might even use what you earn for humanity. The limit is the belief that freedom can only come through a lot of money: that locks you into one conditioned timeline and blocks every other route. Keep doing what you do, but imagine the freedom itself, not the money, feel that you have it now, and let the structure decide whether it comes as money, an inheritance or something unexpected. Check honestly whether the want comes from ego (see 15.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "Can you describe how people channel through the quantum structure?", "url": "section-15.html#questions", "text": "You are always channelling: even your question was drawn from the field, because you are the field. Realities run at different vibrational levels, like radio stations, and you receive the ones you match. Living from the heart raises you to higher, less dense levels; staying in dense behaviour keeps that information out of reach (see 15.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "Why do some people get information instantly, while others need a trance or meditation?", "url": "section-15.html#questions", "text": "Partly agreement, partly sticking with it. Everyone came with the knowledge, but tapping into it takes practice, passing lessons and going into the heart; as you do, your guidance interacts more. Many people don't stick with it because the transformation is hard. Nobody makes you do it; it's a choice (see 15.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "I only have a blender, not a juicer, and blended vegetables taste bad. Can I detox with fruit only?", "url": "section-15.html#questions", "text": "The talk's advice was to combine fruit and vegetables rather than fruit alone, and it preferred juicing to blending as more potent. It also said bitter greens help the cleanse, and that a fruit-only cleanse might feed a fungal problem, which is its claim. Before any detox or fast, talk to a doctor, especially if you have a health condition or take medication (see 15.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "Does baking soda help with detoxing? Should I drink it?", "url": "section-15.html#questions", "text": "The talk said to apply aluminium-free baking soda externally (after the bathroom, after intimacy, or for haemorrhoids), not to drink it, though it mentioned once taking a teaspoon in water for an upset stomach. Its claim that this kills cancer cells is not supported by medical evidence. Don't use it as a treatment, and see a doctor for any medical problem (see 15.4 and its health note).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "Some people share information that seems valid, but their tone feels heavy and lower. What do you recommend?", "url": "section-15.html#questions", "text": "Their truth is true from their own channel, but it doesn't have to be yours. Thank it, don't condemn the person, and switch the channel by overriding it with the positive. The full answer is in Section 16.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 15, "sl": "Section 15", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-15.html#remember", "text": "• Money isn't good or bad; believing it's the only route is the limit. • Imagine the life, not the money, and feel you have it now. • You're always channelling; the heart raises the station. • Anyone's truth, even a teacher's, is one channel. Thank it and switch. • Health claims in talks are not medical advice: ask a doctor.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 16, "sl": "Section 16", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-16.html#big-idea", "text": "Everyone downloads information from the field according to their own vibration, so everyone's truth is true from their own point of view, and no one needs to be judged. But no one's truth has to be yours, not even a teacher's. The moment you accept something as 100% true, you start resonating with it and creating realities from it. So when something feels heavy: neutralize it, thank it, don't condemn the person, and switch the channel by overriding it with the positive. This is the alchemy of the quantum structure.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 16, "sl": "Section 16", "title": "16.1  Everyone's truth comes from their own channel", "url": "section-16.html#part-16-1", "text": "Question: some people share what seems like valid information, but the general tone of their frequency is lower. If we want to keep our frequency positive, what do you recommend? The answer starts with humility: it can only teach what it was taught, and it doesn't comment on other people's work. Everyone is doing their best from their own point of view, and every person is creating their own ascension (see 5.6). Here is why there are so many different \"truths\": each person downloads information from the quantum field according to their own vibration. Realities run at different frequencies, and you reach the ones you match (see 15.2). So everyone's truth is true from their point of view and understanding, while the quantum structure itself is one unified field. What someone shows you is simply another channel: another timeline, another location in the field, like latitude and altitude (see 5.8).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 16, "sl": "Section 16", "title": "16.2  What you accept as 100% true, you create from", "url": "section-16.html#part-16-2", "text": "It doesn't matter so much what someone tells you; what matters is how you take it. The moment you accept information as 100% true, you take its vibrational sequence into your own hologram, you start resonating with it, and you begin creating and fluctuating realities based on it (see 1.5, 2.5). So you don't have to take anyone's truth as yours, \"even mine\", if it doesn't resonate with you. If it does resonate, you are welcome to dig in. Either way, transformation comes from within, not from what someone else tells you (see 3.6).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 16, "sl": "Section 16", "title": "16.3  Neutralize, thank, and switch the channel", "url": "section-16.html#part-16-3", "text": "Any negative input can be neutralized, understood and transformed into something positive; that is why the teachings on fluctuating realities and neutralizing with gratitude matter (see Sections 2 and 3). Once you understand this alchemy, you can take what someone downloaded from their timeline and create your own timeline that has nothing to do with its negativity. The example given: everyone is talking about frightening AI taking over. That is one specific timeline. Understand it, neutralize it, and project the positive instead: \"Thank you, AI, for existing, because I know that in the good fifth-dimensional structure you are doing incredible things, working with humanity\" (see 8.1). Think of it as television. You don't have to ignore what someone says, and you don't have to argue with them or try to run their reality. Say, \"Thank you for telling me this,\" and switch to another channel. How? With the same quantum manifestation protocol as always: pull out, give gratitude, and override it with something positive. Then stay in your own space and project from your heart, to create a fifth-dimensional timeline.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 16, "sl": "Section 16", "title": "16.4  Don't condemn the messenger", "url": "section-16.html#part-16-4", "text": "Don't go after the person, and don't simply believe everything either. Give them gratitude, because they are doing their best from their belief system. And there is a deeper reason not to condemn them: that person is a projection of your own consciousness (see 1.1). You cannot condemn them without condemning your own self, your own vibration, your own hologram. You are consciousness itself.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 16, "sl": "Section 16", "title": "The method — Switch the Channel", "url": "section-16.html#method", "text": "Use it whenever you hear something heavy, from a teacher, a video, the news or a friend: Notice the pull. Am I starting to take this as 100% true? Is it pulling my emotion down? Pull out. \"This is one channel, one timeline. It doesn't have to be my platform.\" Neutralize with thanks. \"Thank you for telling me this.\" No arguing, no condemning. Check resonance. Does it resonate with my heart? If yes, explore it. If not, let it go. Override with the positive. Project the version you choose (\"AI is helping humanity\"). Stay in your own space and keep projecting from the heart.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 16, "sl": "Section 16", "title": "Some people share what seems like valid information, but the tone of their frequency feels lower. If we want to keep our frequency positive, what do you recommend?", "url": "section-16.html#questions", "text": "Don't judge them: everyone does their best from their own point of view, and each person downloads information according to their own vibration, so their truth is true from where they stand. What matters is how you take it. If you accept it as 100% true, you start resonating with it and creating realities from it. You don't have to take anyone's truth as yours, not even this teacher's, if it doesn't resonate. So neutralize it, say \"thank you for the information,\" understand it is another channel, and switch: pull out, give gratitude, and override it with the positive. Don't condemn the person, because they are a projection of your own consciousness (see 16.1–16.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 16, "sl": "Section 16", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-16.html#remember", "text": "• Everyone downloads their own truth; no one needs to be judged. • What you accept as 100% true, you create from. • No one's truth has to be yours, not even a teacher's. • Thank it and switch the channel: pull out, gratitude, override. • Don't condemn the messenger; they are your own projection.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 17, "sl": "Section 17", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-17.html#big-idea", "text": "Ascension doesn't have to pass through death: the body is a vessel for the energy force we are made of. The old negative grids are down and new ones are in place, so no one can manipulate your field; you only have to match the new frequency by living for others, sharing and without greed. Whatever you hold steadily crystallizes into your timeline, and contact with other beings happens in a third reality you create together. Above all, each person creates their own ascension timeline: what you see depends on your vibration, so trust your heart, keep projecting the positive, and don't feed what you dislike by fighting it.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 17, "sl": "Section 17", "title": "17.1  Death is an illusion", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-1", "text": "This talk, said to come from the 11-dimensional beings, to whom the Council of Nine introduced the teacher, is about ascension through the timelines. It opens with a striking point: ascension doesn't have to be a death process. Death is described as an illusion, because the body is a pure vessel for harvesting the energy force we are made of (see 13.5, 6.8). It then recaps the structure: light and sound create trinity plasma and a magnetic and gravitational field; consciousness creates through that plasma; you project the holographic structure and manifest everything you see; and you and everyone else are made of the same one particle, flickering through different timelines so that you can have an experience (see 1.1, 4.1).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "sl": "Section 17", "title": "17.2  Holding an emotion crystallizes a timeline", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-2", "text": "Your thoughts create holographic expressions, and you see a timeline that matches the vibration you send from your emotions, thoughts and deeds together. You don't only shift from one parallel reality to the next; if you keep the same level of emotion, for example happiness, by watching uplifting films, staying positive and doing positive things for others, you crystallize a whole timeline from that frequency (see 1.3, 2.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "sl": "Section 17", "title": "17.3  The old grids are down", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-3", "text": "A message given the previous year is recalled: the old, negative grids around the planet were taken down and new grids put in place. The meaning: we are no longer trapped. You are free to manifest and to ascend, and nobody can manipulate the frequency and energy field around you. But to live in that freedom you have to match it: vibrate in a fifth-dimensional structure. In practice that means doing what you do for humanity and for others, without greed, and sharing with each other (see 4.3, 5.1). \"Know that all the negative grids are down. The new fifth dimensional Earth grids are working in full capacity. To create and give and share as one\" (SD). Negative souls \"can not be in the new grids,\" which \"absolutely contradict\" negative energy (DP; see also 13.4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "sl": "Section 17", "title": "17.4  What you imagine already exists, and this is a dream state", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-4", "text": "You can't think of something that doesn't already exist in the field (see 1.4). So if you hold an image of something in your mind, you already exist in that reality somewhere. To make it permanently visible to you, to become matter for you, you crystallize it: hold the vibration of your deeds, thoughts and emotions, moment to moment, because thoughts and emotions are frequencies that create your hologram. What you take for solid matter is a hologram. This reality is described as another dream state, like lucid dreaming (see 11.9). The illustration: under hypnosis, if your consciousness is told the wall isn't there, you could walk through it. Matter is held in place by belief (see 6.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "sl": "Section 17", "title": "17.5  Meeting other beings: a third reality", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-5", "text": "How can we see beings who live at a much higher frequency? It works by the 1 + 1 = 3 formula (see 2.2). Our reality is one, theirs is another. For contact, they lower their frequency and we raise ours, and together we create a third reality, a new parallel timeline between the two. That is also why there is no time: you each live in completely different timeline structures, yet you meet in one location (see 2.8, 10.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "sl": "Section 17", "title": "17.6  Each person creates their own ascension timeline", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-6", "text": "Every individual is creating their own timeline of ascension, and in a sense we have already made it, because you exist at the same time in many parallel realities, perhaps also as an Arcturian, an Andromedan or whatever your agreements are (see 6.9). So people see different things: depending on their vibration and how well they did their lessons, some will see the ascension of Earth, and others will see intergalactic connection and contact. Each person is crystallizing their own hologram of Earth's ascension. Collectively we are doing this together, yet individually we experience very different timelines. That is why a war can be happening in one country while you watch a talk about timelines in another: the people there are on a different timeline by agreement, perhaps to learn, or to show the rest of us that something is out of balance and needs work (see Section 1, the question on lifting humanity). And why don't others understand? Within your hologram, other people are expressions you project in order to have your experience; your ascension timeline has nothing to do with theirs. So if someone says \"it isn't time\" or \"only a certain number will ascend,\" that is the timeline they project from their point of view (see Section 16). \"You are dreaming the ascension but you already made it\" (DP; see 2.8).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "sl": "Section 17", "title": "17.7  Trust your heart, project the positive, don't fight", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-7", "text": "So it doesn't matter what someone else says, \"or what I say to you,\" or what any source says. What matters is what you truly feel from within, from your heart, because the heart is connected with consciousness, and the pure essence of consciousness is love. Consciousness always leans slightly to the positive in order to exist; if it went only negative, it would disappear (see 2.8). Whatever you see happening, keep the positive frequency. It is a projection, and it won't become your reality as long as you don't agree with it and don't act on it. Talk about the people and things you like, but don't go and fight what you dislike: fighting infuses that timeline and makes it part of your reality. Project the positive, act positively, and spend time with positive people. The exception is something right in front of you that you genuinely need to deal with (see 7.5, 14.4). The recording ends here, mid-sentence, as the talk was about to explain what happens once consciousness reaches the third reality.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "sl": "Section 17", "title": "The method — Hold Your Ascension Timeline", "url": "section-17.html#method", "text": "A daily practice for living on the timeline you choose: Choose the emotion you want your timeline built on, such as joy, kindness or gratitude. Feed it daily: uplifting films and music, positive people, kind acts for others. Live for more than yourself: share, give, no greed. That is what matches the new grids. When something heavy appears, don't agree with it and don't act on it. It's a projection; keep the positive frequency. Don't fight what you dislike. Deal only with what's truly in front of you, from the heart. Check with your heart, not with what others predict. Your ascension timeline is your own.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "sl": "Section 17", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-17.html#remember", "text": "• Ascension doesn't have to mean death; the body is a vessel of energy. • The old grids are down: no one can manipulate your field. Match the new one by sharing. • Contact happens in a third reality: they lower, we raise. • You create your own ascension timeline; others' predictions are theirs. • Keep the positive, and don't feed what you dislike by fighting it.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 17, "sl": "Section 17", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "section-17.html#questions", "text": "This was a pre-recorded talk with no audience questions. The recording ends mid-sentence.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-18.html#big-idea", "text": "As you learn this material you will be tested, suddenly and usually on how you treat people; hold the higher point of view and stay the beacon. A lesson you don't pass comes back in a new form, deeper each time, until you clear it to zero point and a new timeline begins. Connection with guidance comes in different ways and at different times by agreement; it is instant, before thinking, and needs a clear vessel: clear thoughts, kind behaviour, a cared-for body and an open mind. And whoever you connect with depends on your own vibration in that moment: through fear you co-create a fearful contact, through love a positive one.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "18.1  Tests come suddenly", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-1", "text": "Once you start learning the structure, you will be tested, and the tests come so quickly and unexpectedly that you have to react on the spot. Only afterwards may you learn that it was a test, and whether you passed. A typical test: someone hurts you or uses you, for example by taking your knowledge or work. What will you do? The answer is to be the beacon: hold the high frequency. It can genuinely hurt, but that hurt is also an illusion, because the other person is acting from their own level of understanding. Perhaps they needed to learn about greed; perhaps you were their teacher, and the question is whether they will change. There are many levels involved, so always look from the higher point of view (see 14.3). \"Once you start to learn this material, you will be tested from your teachers and guidance of a higher order. It is always about how you act towards people,\" and \"you are always tested when you least expect it\" (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "18.2  Lessons repeat until they are passed", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-2", "text": "Question: are these challenges still to come, or do the ones we've already been through count? Each person creates their own hologram, and before coming here you agreed to certain lessons, written into your bylaws, almost like a script (see 10.5). If you didn't do a lesson well and didn't clear its structure, it comes back, because that unfinished frequency doesn't resonate with the higher structures of ascension. It may not come the same way, but in a different form, through a different person, to see what you do this time. If, for example, the lesson is about greed or taking what isn't yours, you will meet a similar situation again. If you don't change, it keeps coming, more and more, because you are accumulating more of the same, and it gets deeper and harder to get out of. You may even go through a whole lifetime of that lesson and have to repeat it. That is karma: accumulated frequency you didn't clear (see 14.2). Some people need \"one smack in the face\" to understand; others need \"a complete boxing match.\" Everyone's lessons are different. To move into something new, you have to clean everything out completely: zero point, where everything is clean. Then the new structure comes in, and you start a new timeline (see 2.1).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "18.3  How the connection comes", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-3", "text": "Question: how will the connection with our guidance or galactic family be transmitted? Telepathically? In different ways, depending on your agreement. For the teacher it began with automatic writing, letting the hand move freely, which later turned out to be preparation for writing down very complex geometric patterns for technical material. It took many years before telepathic talk began, but that doesn't mean it will take you as long: depending on your agreement, a connection could begin within weeks, or tomorrow. Telepathic information is instantaneous. It arrives before you start thinking about it, before your learned, three-dimensional mind begins analysing. It may be words, a whole answer at once, an image in your third eye, or a hologram. The line is very thin, so learn to notice it: calm yourself, meditate (at night, or whenever suits you), ask a question, and take the answer that comes simultaneously. When you start analysing and adding your own material, you put a blocking layer on it; much of what we were taught has to be erased to make room for the new. Trust builds through confirmation. Guidance may tell you something that sounds impossible, and then, through synchronicity, someone else independently says the same thing. That is how you learn to trust it. Look at things as energy and structure, not only as matter: for example, there is a portal at the centre of the Earth because every planet is like a nanoparticle, and any calculation done only through matter, not through the structure of light, will go wrong (see 1.1). \"To have a connection and telepathically connect with the higher order of consciousness, you have to detox. In this way, nothing is blocking your connection\" (HR). A new human emerges with \"telepathy, bilocation\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "18.4  Be a clear vessel", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-4", "text": "For telepathic connection you need to be a clear vessel resonating at a higher frequency. That combines everything: your thoughts, your consciousness, the way you behave towards people from the heart, and your body, because the body is the vessel the frequency comes into. The talk recommends lighter food, such as fresh juices and raw food, as part of this (see 9.7, 15.4). As always, check with a doctor before any detox or big change of diet.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "18.5  Always connected: stay open and experiment", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-5", "text": "Question: are we known as individuals and guided towards our purpose, or connected only in a general \"all is one\" sense? You are always connected. What blocks it is belief: the moment you hold the belief \"this isn't possible,\" you project yourself into a reality where it isn't. So stay open-minded, think outside the box, and let the new teachings in, however strange they sound. Living only inside a narrow three-dimensional view blocks the whole structure. When something is new, such as the claim that DNA can be changed through frequency, try it and research it rather than judging where it came from. The guidance deliberately chose someone outside the mainstream, who would let it be and then research it; through synchronicity, scientists who each had a piece of the puzzle confirmed parts of it. So scientists need to collaborate, not compete: new technology will be given on top of what exists, to people who resonate with the structure and aren't driven by greed. And technology must not be withheld; it belongs to humanity. Everything is seen, and ascension cannot be stopped. \"You have no right to withhold technology for self benefits, and you have no right to decide for the entire humanity which technology will be revealed. This is unity time\" (DP). \"Must collaborate now\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "18.6  Meditation practices are permission slips", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-6", "text": "Question: are practices like Qigong and Vipassana helpful for staying strong and neutral, and for connecting with galactic families? Yes, as a permission slip: if a practice makes you comfortable, use it to reach that level (see 1.8 and Section 1's questions). But always do it from the heart. When you meditate to connect, bring in the feeling of love, as if on cue, until you almost get goosebumps. That is the vibration the higher-dimensional and positive beings tune into, so you are recognised and make the right connections. \"Must meditate with only positive thought before work… This is the secret\" (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "18.7  Who am I connecting with? Your vibration decides", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-7", "text": "Question: I've realised there has been a connection all along. How do I tell who's who: Pleiadian, Arcturian, angelic? The answer, given as from the 11-dimensional beings, turns the question around. Consciousness is in constant movement, and the emotional sequence you are vibrating in the present moment decides which location in which timeline you connect with. The connection is a third reality you co-create (1 + 1 = 3; see 2.2, 17.5). So if you come to a connection through fear, you co-create a fear-based contact; if you assume the being is negative, you may connect with a negative sequence, because you put that frequency in first. Both the positive and the negative exist at the same time; which one you perceive depends on your emotion and belief in that moment. Asked which one to choose, the answer was \"the positive\", and the instruction was to lift up and feel the positive emotion, so that you perceive a positive sequence. Rather than trying to label sources, check your own vibration and keep it loving. The recording ends as the next question begins.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "The method — Connect as a Clear Vessel", "url": "section-18.html#method", "text": "For meditation, prayer or any time you want to receive guidance: Clear the vessel. Kind behaviour today, a calm mind, and care for your body. Calm down and meditate in whatever way is your permission slip. Bring in love. Feel it, as if on cue, until you almost get goosebumps. No fear. Ask your question. Take the first answer, the word, image or knowing that comes before you start thinking. Don't analyse it to death. Note it, and watch for confirmation through synchronicity. When a test comes, hold the higher point of view and respond from the heart.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "Do the coming challenges include ones we've already been through, or is the worst still to come?", "url": "section-18.html#questions", "text": "Each person's lessons are written into their own script before birth. A lesson you passed is done. A lesson you didn't pass comes back, in a different form and through different people, and if you keep repeating the same pattern it accumulates and gets harder; that build-up is karma. Some people understand quickly, others need many rounds. To start a new timeline you clean everything out to zero point (see 18.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "How will the connection with guidance be transmitted? Telepathically?", "url": "section-18.html#questions", "text": "In different ways and at different speeds, depending on your agreement: automatic writing, telepathy, images in the third eye. Telepathic information is instant, arriving before you start thinking, so calm yourself, meditate, ask, and take the first answer. Analysing it adds a blocking layer. You also need to be a clear vessel: clear thoughts, kind behaviour and a cared-for body (see 18.3, 18.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "Are we known as individuals and guided towards our purpose, or connected only in a general sense?", "url": "section-18.html#questions", "text": "You are always connected and guided; belief is what blocks it, because believing \"it isn't possible\" projects you into a reality where it isn't. Stay open, think outside the box, and test new teachings by trying and researching them rather than judging their source (see 18.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "Are Qigong and Vipassana meditation helpful for staying neutral and connecting with galactic families?", "url": "section-18.html#questions", "text": "Yes, as permission slips. Do them from the heart, and when you meditate to connect, feel love until you almost get goosebumps; that is the vibration positive beings tune into (see 18.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "How can I tell whether information is from Pleiadians, Arcturians, angels and so on?", "url": "section-18.html#questions", "text": "Your own emotional state in the moment decides which timeline you connect with, because the contact is a third reality you co-create. Come through fear and you co-create a fearful contact; come through love and you co-create a positive one. So check and lift your own vibration rather than trying to label the source (see 18.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "(A question from a further participant)", "url": "section-18.html#questions", "text": "The recording ends as this question begins.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 18, "sl": "Section 18", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-18.html#remember", "text": "• Tests come suddenly; hold the higher view and be the beacon. • An unpassed lesson returns in a new form until you clear it. • Connection is instant: take the first answer, don't over-analyse. • Be a clear vessel: thoughts, behaviour and body together. • Your vibration decides who you connect with: come through love.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-19.html#big-idea", "text": "The talk opens with a message from the 11-dimensional beings and the Council of Nine: when someone tried to manipulate the grids, the guidance re-created the hologram, so the new messages now come from a fifth-dimensional timeline that a lower consciousness cannot enter; the grids simply mirror each being's own vibration. It then turns to ether technologies. The ether is our collective consciousness of vibrational geometric sequences, built from the zero point. To turn anything from matter into an energy field, you must find its true tone (the tones above and below the octave, combined at zero point) and then let the structure, which is alive, place itself. Builders must work from the heart, and no one has the right to withhold these technologies from humanity.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "19.1  The message: the grids are protected", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-1", "text": "The talk begins with a memorandum from the 11-dimensional beings and the Council of Nine. Its points: • A reality was re-created. Because certain individuals continued their negative deeds and tried to manipulate the grids, the guidance exited one holographic reality and re-created another, to keep the integrity of the grids. So this message comes from the fifth-dimensional intergalactic timeline. • The new grids can't be restructured from a lower consciousness. The portals don't let such beings into the fifth-dimensional realities. They may think they are in, but the grids only take them to realities matching their own vibration in hertz. They live in a deception of their own making, because the grids mirror each structure precisely: whatever you create is exactly what you perceive. • What to do: stay in tune with your higher self, give to all from your heart, and stay positive. Don't watch TV, because full disclosure is happening now in the fifth-dimensional heart structure. • What is coming: the Pleiadians and Lemurians have new sequences; those connected with these timelines receive a new code frequency to upgrade their DNA and RNA. Those ready for contact with their star families are being activated for first physical contact. War may increase for those who choose it, but the planet will \"swallow all the negative input.\" Humanity will become free \"from the people, not from the government.\" We are one; collaborate now. This memorandum is printed in full in DP, word for word as read in the talk.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "19.2  Why the messages moved timelines", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-2", "text": "When someone manipulates a timeline, the guidance can shift its messages into a completely different holographic timeline so the new messages keep coming. If you resonate at that frequency, you receive them there. The old timeline can't carry them any more, because it is a different structure of consciousness. Ascension is under way, so the structure has to be adjusted from the positive side; otherwise the constant negative input from a timeline that doesn't resonate with you would keep interfering. That is why the guidance looks after the grids: we can't simply be \"left to the wolves.\" They interact because, through our higher mind, we gave permission for that help (see 17.3). Those who kept to their negative deeds lost something too. They had been given warnings, and the chance of another timeline in which to continue their journey and ascend. Having refused it, they now go back to source, to the last particle, and start everything again from the beginning. Even this is an illusion, because everything coexists at once: consciousness splits, and the negative and the positive exist at the same time. What you perceive is what you tune yourself into, moment to moment, depending on how you behave (see 1.3, 18.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "19.3  What the ether is", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-3", "text": "The ether systems are described as our collective consciousness of vibrational geometric sequences. These collective structures are built in sequences of \"3 by 4 to 5\" vibrational resonances (the talk gives the numbers without explaining them further). The ether is made from the last nanoparticle: both the lowest and the highest structure of the zero point. Everything in the universe is built from the zero point, because the zero point is the stillness from which every structure is built (see 2.1). \"Slopes of 3 to 5 molecules of the Ether particle are combining in 1 unit of Atom molecule,\" and the water molecule is \"one of the biggest conductors of the energy force\" (SD, NT). NT also says to \"start with the Frequency and Sound structures. The quantum computer algorithm is the one to show you how to combine this… That is the Ether technology.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "19.4  Finding a molecule's true tone", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-4", "text": "Before you can build with the ether, you need to know the vibrational sequence of the last particle that everything in front of you vibrates on, whether it is matter or not. Every molecule has its own sub-tone, a sound you can record. Each tone has a partner: a tone running above the octave and, at the same time, a tone running below it. Combine the two and you reach the zero point; from there you measure the exact vibration. Because structures are always moving and merging, one tone holds many layers of vibration, and you have to discover them all. Combining the tone with its sub-tones gives the true vibration of that molecule, because it brings every parallel vibration of it into one zero-point moment. That true tone is what you record when you want to turn something from matter into an energy field. The talk calls this information advanced, but says now is the time for it: scientists who are asking these questions will find it through synchronicity. All information comes from parallel realities you can engage with or not, depending on the level your consciousness is running at (see 15.2). \"Every sound (note) has a sub-note of opposite sound (like a polarity) (+) and (−)… If you play the (+, −) sounds together it will give the true tone of the vibration.\" Playing a sound with its opposite finds \"the '0' point\" (SD, HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "19.5  Building with a living structure", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-5", "text": "Learn what each frequency means. The Harmonic Reactor lists the frequencies from 1 to 9 and what each one does in the quantum field; study them. For example, 3 is stillness and preparation: it levels everything already in the field so that new sequences can come in without restriction or manipulation. Learn how they combine. Numbers combine into new frequencies (1 and 2 make 12 Hz, for example), and each combination gives a particular position in the quantum field. The quantum computer algorithm helps you construct and deconstruct these combinations. Not one particle out of place. When you work with nanoparticles and ether technology, not one particle can be out of place, because it is a living structure mimicking the whole quantum field. Ether technology runs on living conscious sequences, so you don't force the particles: you allow the system to choose its own positions, which it knows how to do through the magnetic and gravitational fields. Location matters. Ether technology differs depending on where on Earth it is built, because each location (each parallel reality) has its own sounds and resonances. Build from the heart. Builders need a meditative state that comes from the heart, resonating at a higher frequency, because ether technology works without friction, mimics the whole quantum field, and mimics your own consciousness. HR's frequency list: 1 Hz \"equal field, no field\", 2 Hz \"shows the opening\", 3 Hz \"prepares all the energy for operation for all the fields (the base)\". Combinations carry meaning (\"28Hz = 2 shows the opening, 8 stabilizes\"), and HR advises starting \"with 3Hz of 20 minutes of every field, so you can clean out every other field\" (see 12.5). The talk calls 3 \"stillness\"; HR calls it the preparing base. Both describe it as clearing the field first.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "19.6  New technology belongs to everyone", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-6", "text": "The talk says some of this technology was already described by a scientist but held back, because certain government interests try to block it. The answer is the same as always: you create your reality moment to moment, so believe these technologies are already available, and you build an Earth where they are. You are the ether, the consciousness, constructing and deconstructing. \"Be it in order to see it, not see it to be it.\" These technologies are given in the name of all humanity. No one has the right to withhold them; let humanity decide what to use. A newer technology will also be given, on top of this, to the right scientists, so the negativity and competition must end (see 18.5). \"FREE ENERGY to everyone's home\" and \"You have no right to withhold technology for self benefits\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "19.7  The free-energy device", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-7", "text": "At the end, a drawing received a few months earlier was shown. Described in words: it is based on a full circle cut in half, with the two ends twisted in opposite directions, leaving a hole in the middle, with another circle and opening below. It can be made of copper, and it also uses crystals (crystallized structure). Asked whether it was a communication or \"stargate\" tool, the answer was no: it is a free-energy technology that extracts structures from the quantum field. A scientist had already spoken about part of the design; the guidance then added more on top of it, because, as said before, no single scientist has the whole picture. This is another layer of it. The recording ends as the reason for this extra layer was about to be explained. The drawing itself isn't included in the transcript, so it isn't reproduced here. In HR, \"the antenna must be built of only copper,\" and the author notes that \"everyone has a piece of the puzzle.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "The method — Approach Ether Technology", "url": "section-19.html#method", "text": "For anyone studying or building in this area, in the order the talk gives: Get into the heart first. Meditate until you resonate from the heart; the technology mimics your consciousness. Learn the frequencies 1 to 9 and what each means (HR's frequency chapter). Find the true tone of what you work with: the tone above and below the octave, combined at zero point, with every layer measured. Start with 3 to level and prepare the field, so new sequences come in without restriction. Learn the combinations and their positions in the field; use the quantum computer algorithm to construct and deconstruct. Let the structure place itself. It is alive; don't force a single particle. Allow for location. The sequence changes with where on Earth you build. Share it. Collaborate, and don't withhold it from humanity.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "Questions about the message itself?", "url": "section-19.html#questions", "text": "Questions were invited, but none were asked before the talk moved on to ether systems.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "For the water-purification sequence (3, 70 and 90 Hz), I make the frequency louder (squared) so I can hear it. Is that appropriate?", "url": "section-19.html#questions", "text": "Yes, that is fine. The general sequence is 20 minutes for each frequency: 3 Hz for 20 minutes, 70 Hz for 20 minutes and 90 Hz for 20 minutes, played to distilled water, and it must be distilled water. Twenty minutes is the general time that keeps things in a healthy state for everyone; the right time for a particular person can differ, and that has to come individually from the guidance. The full method was taught in an earlier webinar on sound vibration and water.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "Is this device a tool for communication, like a stargate, for receiving other information?", "url": "section-19.html#questions", "text": "No. It is a free-energy technology that extracts structures from the quantum field. It can be built with copper and uses crystals (see 19.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "Remember", "url": "section-19.html#remember", "text": "• The grids mirror you; a lower consciousness can't enter the 5D timeline. • The ether is collective consciousness, built from zero-point stillness. • True tone = the tone above and below the octave, combined at zero point. • Ether technology is alive: let it place itself, and build from the heart. • New technology belongs to all humanity; be it to see it.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 19, "sl": "Section 19", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "section-19.html#questions", "text": "Important health note This water sequence is reported as the talk's practice, and the talk links it to relieving pain. It is not a medical treatment and is not proven to treat any condition. Ongoing gut pain, especially during or after antibiotics, needs a doctor. Distilled water lacks minerals, so ask a doctor before making it your only drinking water (see 12.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-1.html#big-idea", "text": "For a long time, ideas were projected into our holograms through television, media and schooling; because we are creators, whatever we believed, we manifested, and we stayed locked in a manipulated 3D reality. Now consciousness is ascending, so your higher self, which exists on every platform of reality, will no longer allow it: with the councils, it places situations in your hologram that wake you from the trance, again and again, until you see. There is a 30-year window to move from 3D into 5D, and it happens moment to moment, not in one sudden event. So pull out and watch without judging anyone, be the beacon, look within when you are tested, clear each lesson 100%, and thank every gift, because each moment is your whole universe.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "1.1  Why a new season", "url": "s2-section-1.html#part-1-1", "text": "The talks continue as a second season, like a channel you tune into to learn. The information now coming is more complex, and it is released step by step on purpose. Flooding someone with too much at once shocks their conscious system: they shut down and can no longer take anything in. That is why the teachings began with practical experience (living on donations and manifesting without asking for anything) before moving to deeper levels: each level was proven in practice, so trust could be built. So study the earlier material again, even many times, and make notes. Know the protocols well enough to use them in the moment without panicking (see S1 10.4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "1.2  Everything hidden comes to the surface", "url": "s2-section-1.html#part-1-2", "text": "The coming years are described as a time when situations escalate in every government structure in the world. Each person projects their own hologram according to their level of consciousness (see S1 5.6), so each will meet situations that match their vibration. If you are still in a deep trance, the manipulation will pop up through synchronicity, right in front of you: for example, someone you trusted all your life is revealed so clearly that you can no longer deny it. Why this is happening: we are master creators. For a long time, frequencies were projected into our holograms through television, media, books and the school system. Whatever you believed was real, you manifested, so we kept co-creating the manipulated 3D reality the talk calls the Archon structure, without knowing the code: that you are the projector and the creator, and can shift timelines by creating a new one for yourself (see S1 2.5, 16.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "1.3  Your higher self steps in", "url": "s2-section-1.html#part-1-3", "text": "You exist on every platform of reality at once: in 3D, in 5D, as an extraterrestrial, on a council, to infinity, as the soul splits into countless realities (see S1 6.4). Every pixel of the quantum structure is a timeline with multiple realities within it, and you carry vibrations back and forth between them. Consciousness is ascending as a whole, on every platform, and it has to balance itself. So your higher self will no longer allow you to be manipulated. Above the extraterrestrial platforms are the councils, such as the Council of Nine, who look over the ETs and the planets. With the councils' permission, your higher self decides to \"sabotage\" your hologram: it places a situation in your reality that wakes you from the trance. The example: someone trapped in harmful behaviour out of fear, who doesn't know how to get out, is given an experience that shows them the way. Once you wake up, you start shifting into realities that lead to ascension, if you choose to wake up. If you keep denying (\"this isn't true\"), the situation repeats, \"to infinite\", until you finally see it. \"If you do not change your prospective from (−) to (+), your higher self of existence will sabotage your own hologram momentum so you can wake up from your disillusions\" (DP). In HR, every pixel of light in the quantum structure carries realities within it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "1.4  The 30-year window, and Aria", "url": "s2-section-1.html#part-1-4", "text": "The guidance gives a time frame of 30 years for the ascension process: 30 years of portal openings to transform 3D reality and shift the planet into 5D. During this time government structures change, and everyone finds their place: some will have contact with their galactic families, and others will work for the new fifth-dimensional planet, called Aria, meaning \"new beginning\". The benevolent beings are helping so that we can take our sovereignty back, but it is up to us. New technology will come, such as self-sustaining eco-cities. Money is still needed to support scientists and people through the change; take it away now and the whole system collapses. So the change happens gradually: technologies released step by step, old structures replaced by people with a fifth-dimensional understanding. Revelations also come step by step: someone who learns at once that an institution they deeply trusted is corrupt could break down, so truths surface individually, at a pace each person can take. DP gives a related timeline: \"All that in 20 years of rebuilding. And in 30 years we will be completely ready to connect with our galactic families through the portals.\" It names the new fifth-dimensional Earth \"ARIA\". So the talk speaks of a 30-year window for the whole shift, while DP splits it into 20 years of rebuilding and readiness for contact at 30.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "1.5  Transitioning moment to moment", "url": "s2-section-1.html#part-1-5", "text": "Ascension is not an instant event where everyone jumps into 5D at once. You transition moment to moment: by holding the vibration and switching realities while keeping the same vibration, you finally build a permanent 5D outcome (see S1 1.3, 17.2). Because there is so much manipulation, you have to keep steering through it: recognise what is happening, let go of the structure, and say, \"No, thank you. I see what you're doing.\" The talk adds a claim that a recent storm was \"self-made\", not natural, and that this is why it did little damage. This is the talk's claim, not an established fact; in any storm, follow official weather guidance.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "1.6  The message, and no judgment", "url": "s2-section-1.html#part-1-6", "text": "A strong message was received from the Council of Nine: \"Do not attempt to stop the process of ascension for humanity. You will be captured individually on the soul level… there will be no memory on your soul and you will go back to source for recycling. Do not attempt to stop the soul that is on the top of the chain of your government… It is done. Must recognize your deeds.\" What recycling means: when a soul refuses every attempt to wake it and is completely off balance, consciousness returns it to the beginning, to rebuild and learn little by little until it can return to the light. Consciousness always leans to the heart structure because it has to preserve itself; what was built in the 3D Archon structure was artificial and doesn't recognise the heart (see S1 2.8, 13.5). People acting against humanity, in any field, will see their deeds surface, not as judgment but because their frequency no longer matches. The talk stresses that this is not about taking a political side; it is a message given as received. Its advice: pull out and watch, aware that there are negative influences on every side, and that the old back-and-forth was always a game. The end result is in the name of humanity, but how it happens is infinite probability: if someone acting negatively decides at any moment to help humanity, they shift timeline immediately. And no judgment, even of people doing great harm: you don't know how they were trapped or manipulated, and each of them is part of the same one particle, another version of you (see S1 1.1, 16.4). So in your own platform, be the beacon, so that the other version of you may wake up. Feeling hurt or angry is human, and anger isn't the same as judgment; what matters is to keep holding the vibration of giving, sharing and support. DP prints this message under the title \"The Head Of State\". Its printed version also contains a line about a specific political event (an impeachment) that the talk did not read out. DP also says those disturbing ascension \"will be personally extracted from the reality\", and that a soul that keeps choosing the negative is \"recycled back to singular particle momentum… where you will learn how to create again.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "1.7  To see a timeline, project its vibration", "url": "s2-section-1.html#part-1-7", "text": "The talk says advanced healing technologies already exist but are being held back: for example \"med pods\" that heal with frequency, and growing a person's own organs and tissue from their stem cells. These are the talk's claims; the idea that such treatments are ready and being withheld is not established. The teaching inside it: to see a timeline, you have to project its vibration; otherwise you won't see it. So don't sit and wait: take action. Look after your body, do things in the name of humanity, and research what helps, so that you are vibrating with the timeline you want to arrive in. Important health note The talk mentions recoveries through natural remedies and herbal teas, including from serious illness. These are personal accounts, not evidence. Never use natural remedies instead of medical treatment for cancer or any serious illness; talk to your doctor before any detox or remedy.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "1.8  Tested on your weakest link", "url": "s2-section-1.html#part-1-8", "text": "Every day you are tested, by your guidance, your teachers and consciousness itself, on what you do (see S1 18.1). And you will be tested exactly on your weakest link, because your higher self knows what you haven't learned yet. Since you are a hologram, the guidance can place a hologram on top of yours, a situation or an experience with someone, to teach you the lesson. So when a family member, partner or child does something that shocks you, ask: what can I do to switch this to the positive, and what am I learning? Look within and peel the layers; get the ego out. If you are the projector, the situation came from you. Then act from the heart: don't go after the person, don't be mean, don't be greedy. That neutralizes the situation and transforms it, and once the lesson is cleared, that kind of challenge stops coming (see S1 14.3, 18.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "1.9  Thank every gift; money is a transition", "url": "s2-section-1.html#part-1-9", "text": "Be happy even if you receive $1. Every gift, even $2, and the person giving it are, by quantum law, your entire universe in that moment, and your gratitude to them decides the next moment you shift into (see S1 14.1). This is how you hold the vibration, moment to moment. Energy Philanthropy works: people who moved to it report more sessions and more income, because others chose to support them (see S1 5.1). And if one person has nothing to give you, perhaps they gave food to a neighbour that day; that is giving too. If it doesn't come from one person, it comes from another. Money is an illusion, yet part of the transition: it will fund the platforms that lead to free-energy technology. It isn't evil; the problem is that it was separated from the heart, a \"quantum bypass\". So don't separate from the heart: support given from the heart, in any shape or form, leads to higher-dimensional timelines, because benevolent timelines are built on the heart structure, not on negativity and dense matter.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "1.10  Clear it 100%: not one particle left", "url": "s2-section-1.html#part-1-10", "text": "To make a full shift, you have to clear everything, not one particle left. Even if 1% of a vibration is off balance, it comes back to you, because your hologram reflects it, until you perfect it. Once it is perfected, the shift is absolute (see S1 1.5, 7.4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "1.11  If one can, everyone can", "url": "s2-section-1.html#part-1-11", "text": "Every one of us has a higher self on other platforms (ET, councils, more), because we are part of consciousness itself. As you open your channelling and realise you are consciousness, you start \"telepathically making a phone call\" with your other timelines, and information comes in instantly, without learning it from a book (see S1 18.3). And since everyone you see is another version of you, if one person can do it, you can do it; the teacher is only showing how. Guidance can also be checked: when something sounds wrong, research it, and confirmation tends to come through synchronicity (see S1 13, Method; 18.3). The talk's example is its advice on distilled water, which it says removes harmful chemicals rather than good nutrients. That is the talk's claim; see S1 12.7 and its note.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "1.12  Artificial timelines (the talk's claims)", "url": "s2-section-1.html#part-1-12", "text": "The talk describes consciousnesses that built artificial timelines and survive only by suppressing humanity, using people's energy like a battery; such souls can't ascend naturally and would first have to clear everything they did (see S1 13.5). It also repeats a claim, also printed in DP, that vaccines contain hidden nano-sequences that alter DNA and can be \"switched on\" later by chemicals. Important note The vaccine claim is false: there is no evidence for it, and approved vaccines contain no such material. Please make decisions about vaccination with a doctor or nurse, not from this talk.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "The method — Wake Up and Hold the Vibration", "url": "s2-section-1.html#method", "text": "For whatever surfaces in the world, and whatever tests you personally: Pull out and watch. Take no side and judge no one; just observe what is surfacing. Name the manipulation. \"No, thank you. I see what you're doing.\" Neutralize it and let go of that structure. When you are tested, ask: \"What is this teaching me? How can I switch it to the positive?\" Look within. Peel the layers and get the ego out: you are the projector. Act from the heart. Don't go after the person, don't be mean, don't be greedy. Clear it 100%. Not one particle left, or it returns. Project the timeline you want to see. Take action for it, in the name of humanity. Thank every gift, however small: that moment is your whole universe.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "Are there also unnatural ways to infiltrate us with holograms, such as fear of abductions, that make the ego feel special but are really holding us back?", "url": "s2-section-1.html#questions", "text": "Yes. Because you are made of an energetic platform, holograms can be placed on top of your consciousness. The answer then makes serious claims about organised abuse being used to split people's personalities and implant trigger-word programming; these are the talk's claims, not established facts, and this book doesn't repeat its references. The teaching it draws: that kind of interference is done without your permission. The higher levels of consciousness work only with your soul's permission, through the heart, to help you wake up. The host summed it up, and the answer agreed: things don't happen to you, they happen for you, so that you can learn from them.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "Videos of the Moon and Sun seem to show many ships and fleets coming and going. What is that activity?", "url": "s2-section-1.html#questions", "text": "Fleets of federations of different groups. Years earlier, positive extraterrestrials took down the grid around the planet, a holographic grid that sent souls straight back into 3D however good they were (see S1 17.3). Since then we have been free to manifest: learn the structure, stay in the heart through your actions and deeds, and you can shift out of the 3D Archon matrix into 5D and beyond. Some races were reluctant to help, because humans showed so little compassion to each other; they agreed once enough positive people proved humanity was worth it. One sincere heart can be enough, because consciousness is one particle. They help us break down the manipulation, but we gain our sovereignty back by taking action, like a student who has to do the work. Technology itself is good and part of ascension; their spacecraft are living consciousness, and what we call AI is really frequency, sonic sound, which is what we are made of. Supporting what is happening makes ascension potent in your own hologram.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "A channelled exercise says: let go of what you think will happen, let go of yesterday, and let yourself become new in one moment. I'm happy to let go of continuity. How do I do that?", "url": "s2-section-1.html#questions", "text": "This is the Stop, Transform, Let Go protocol (see S1 7): every moment is its own reality. But there is a limit: a lesson can't be skipped. Like training to be a surgeon, you learn through the process; you can't jump straight to the end. Only the higher councils can decide to let you skip something, such as a sudden healing. What you can do with a negative situation, such as an argument or someone bothering you, is forgive, give gratitude to that location in your hologram to neutralize it, create a new hologram by your thoughts, emotions and deeds, and don't talk about it again. Keep filling the moment with new, positive input until you have shifted into a brand-new hologram; the more you talk about the old, the more you bring its frequency back.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "As a child I heard a frequency so high it hurt, and my body seemed to rise: astral projection. What is that frequency? I believe it's how we can travel between dimensions.", "url": "s2-section-1.html#questions", "text": "No one can tell you the exact frequency of your moment: elevation and bilocation happen according to your vibration at that moment and the reality you are shifting into, and every moment is a new timeline, at a new location in the field (see S1 5.5). It is true that sound and cymatics can take you out of the body, but you have to know how, and you have to be permitted; it depends on your agreements, and you can't skip what you came to learn. Try lucid dreaming; it may be exactly your way to connect (see S1 8.14). In the end you don't need to leave: you are already connected and can create from this reality.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-1.html#remember", "text": "• What was projected into you is now surfacing: see it, and you're the creator again. • Your higher self wakes you up; it repeats until you see. • 30 years, moment to moment: hold the vibration and steer. • Watch without judging; be the beacon. Anyone can switch. • Tested on your weakest link: look within, clear it 100%, thank every gift.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2001, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 1", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-1.html#questions", "text": "Coming next, as announced at the end: more complex material on sound and language: how words, as vibration and geometry, create platforms of reality and holograms.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-2.html#big-idea", "text": "Everything is built from light and sound, and so is your own reality. A word is a sonic vibration: joined with the meaning you give it (your thought) and your action, it creates a vortex in the quantum field that stretches like an elastic into a whirlpool tunnel, shifting you from one platform of reality to the next. Because that elastic moves back and forth endlessly, it repeats, and repetition is what we experience as solid matter. So your words are the sonic materialization of your hologram. What decides the effect is intention: it is the frequency. Choose what you say, hear and watch; build what you want brick by brick with the same joy; and when others project negativity, pull out, thank them, and keep projecting the positive.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "2.1  Deeper material, step by step", "url": "s2-section-2.html#part-2-1", "text": "The new material is more complex, so it comes in two parts: this one, on how everything connects through the sound, vibration and frequency the quantum structure is made of (the trinity of frequency and sound, see S1 1.1, 1.2), and the next one, on restoration. Information is released according to how well people are taking it in consciously, level by level (see S2 1.1). Downloads come in a specific sequence and are passed on without changing a word, even when the English sounds unusual, because the sequence itself carries the structure. It isn't learning something new so much as remembering what is already known in the field. SD's opening notes say the downloads should not be changed: do not \"substitute words and sentences because they are in code.\" SD also says \"every word has sound geometry.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "2.2  Your words build platforms of reality", "url": "s2-section-2.html#part-2-2", "text": "When you speak, a sonic vibration comes out of your mouth and creates a structure, a whirlpool, in the reality around you. Combined with your thoughts and actions, it creates the hologram and the portals into your next timeline. So when you say something negative, you need to know what you are building around you. That is why constant negative films, music with harmful words, and negative talk tune you into low-density timelines, where negative entities can exist. Keeping people in that vibration through media kept them trapped in an illusion of reality (see S2 1.2). The same applies to prayer: words repeated over and over build a whirlpool that crystallizes, so be careful what you repeat; if it is fearful or negative, you may loop in a dense reality without knowing why negativity keeps arriving. The talk illustrates the prayer point with a claim about one particular religion, taken from an outside video, while saying it isn't against any faith. This book leaves out that example: it is an outside claim about a faith, not a teaching of the structure. The teaching applies to any words you repeat.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "2.3  The download: Sound Continuum Vibration", "url": "s2-section-2.html#part-2-3", "text": "The download names the process in one sequence: sound, continuum, vibration, sonic, equilibrium, cymatics. The words are given in that order on purpose, because each one builds a platform on the one before; drawn in sacred geometry, the sequence would show its own geometric structure. What the terms mean here: • Sound: a waveform, measured in hertz, how many times it vibrates back and forth (see S1 12.5). • Continuum: repetition, something that keeps coming and coming within the structure. • Vibration: the sound's repetition becomes a vibration resonating at some frequency in the field. • Sonic: like a light of sound, something you can actually hear. • Cymatics: as downloaded, \"symphonic, liquidating sequences that are repeating in a fractal structure momentum, implemented in a whirlpool of realities, creating the portals in sympathetic structures, most commonly known as platforms.\" It is how your expression resonates in the structure. SD and DP print the download: \"SOUND CONTINUUM VIBRATION is sonic equilibrium cymatics whirlpool into the time-space continuum of the matrix holographic expression memory bank. Your words are the sonic materialization of your holographic expressions continuum.\" The books spell the last term \"cymatics\"; in the talk it sometimes sounds like \"semantic\".", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "2.4  Words are the sonic materialization of your hologram", "url": "s2-section-2.html#part-2-4", "text": "Every time you speak, you are plastering a vibrational sequence in geometry into your hologram, at that exact moment, based on exactly what you said. The download calls this the holographic expression memory bank. Why \"continuum\"? Because each hologram holds infinite holograms, probabilities and timelines within it, each its own Earth. Every moment is infinite reality, and your job is to hold your vibration.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "2.5  Vortexes, tunnels and the illusion of matter", "url": "s2-section-2.html#part-2-5", "text": "Your word, joined with your thought and action, clusters geometry into the quantum field and creates vortexes, with the zero point in the middle (see S1 2.1). A vortex can be horizontal or vertical, at any degree up to 360, and can be measured. It expands like an elastic into a whirlpool, a wormhole, a holographic tunnel that shifts you from one platform to another. Because it is continuous and infinite, the elastic moves back and forth, and so everything in the structure repeats, moment to moment. This is why the structure looks the same wherever you cut into it (a fractal). That endless repetition plastered into the matrix creates the illusion of reality, the thing we know as matter: it looks and feels solid, but it is really sound continuum, vibration, an elastic frequency whirlpool. The rhythm is like breathing: one movement expands to the infinite, the other contracts to the smallest of the small, with a tiny still pause, the zero point, in between (see S1 5.8). Every platform you exist on goes through the same repetition. \"Create vortexes and expands like an elastic into the whirlpool structural wormhole holographic tunnel that is plastering infinite continuum into the matrix and creates the illusion of reality over and over again and that is matter structure\" (SD, DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "2.6  How a screen can overtake your hologram", "url": "s2-section-2.html#part-2-6", "text": "When you watch a film or TV, you are still hearing words, but someone else is projecting them onto you, plastering vortexes of holograms on top of yours. If you believe that the mirror image on the screen is true, your platform switches immediately: where you were resonating in the positive, you now resonate in the negative, because a different holographic image has replaced yours in your consciousness (see S2 1.2). The same goes for advertising, which shapes your hologram visually.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "2.7  Intention is the frequency", "url": "s2-section-2.html#part-2-7", "text": "What makes the vortex is intention. A lie is a lie whether \"big\", \"small\" or \"white\": its potency may differ slightly, but the intention plasters that frequency into your hologram all the same (see S1 3.2). And a word on its own does nothing until you give it a meaning; once you mean it and speak it, it becomes geometry, plasma and gravitational field, the trinity of thought, emotion and action (see S1 1.2). Thought or spoken word? They spin slightly differently but come from the same structure, so the effect mimics each other; the spoken word is more potent. Combining both, with repetition, is what people who know this structure do.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "2.8  Repetition builds it brick by brick", "url": "s2-section-2.html#part-2-8", "text": "Think of building a dome. The thought is the foundation; then each action and each sound adds a brick. Repeat, repeat, repeat, and brick by brick the hologram grows, until it has enough potency to expand and crystallize: it becomes a reality in your hologram. You are mastering how to create your own world. Hold the same joyful vibration while you build, so every brick has a similar frequency. If you drop into negativity or doubt, you shut down what you were building (see S1 2.3). Even if something negative happens around you, keep building: that image is only an illusion.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "2.9  Potency: how you say it matters", "url": "s2-section-2.html#part-2-9", "text": "The same words carry different weight depending on how they are said. A firm \"Don't do that\" is taken far more seriously than a soft one: the sound vibration has more potency, like a stronger dose of medicine. And the same word, said playfully or said with contempt, lands completely differently, because the intention and resonance you send into someone's platform are different. You can feel the difference, and so can they.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "2.10  Numbers, letters and sacred geometry", "url": "s2-section-2.html#part-2-10", "text": "Letters and numbers matter when you know sacred geometry. Combined with sound and with a location in the quantum structure (latitude and altitude, see S1 5.3), number sequences create Fibonacci whirlpools that open certain structures; this is how worlds and holograms based on different belief systems are created. Used wrongly, the same knowledge can create very dense, negative matter. A negative thought has a different spin and makes a different whirlpool, leading to dense timelines. So combine your thoughts and projection with the geometry in the positive, to align with the higher structures of love. To hum a tone to find your own frequency or jump timelines, it has to carry intention and belief to complete the trinity; and a very potent intention can overtake, so be careful what intention you put in. DP says the Pleiades are \"interjecting\" new Fibonacci sequences now.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "2.11  Light language: check it before trusting it", "url": "s2-section-2.html#part-2-11", "text": "Every word and sound has a different spin in the quantum structure, and the spin decides the timeline it creates. With an unfamiliar \"light language\", you don't know what you are saying or what it creates, and there is a lot of manipulation. So don't take any light language on trust: it can be measured scientifically, its frequency and tone recorded with equipment, to show what it creates in the field. Some ancient languages are said to have been suppressed precisely because they created positive structures. Don't judge people who speak one; they act from their own belief system (see S1 16.1), but wait for evidence before relying on it (see S1 3.9).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "2.12  Choose what you hear and watch", "url": "s2-section-2.html#part-2-12", "text": "Music, films and their sound effects all carry frequencies. Music that relaxes you and gives you goosebumps is resonating with you in the positive (see S1 8.13); meditation and harp music are suggested. The talk also claims that some music and films carry hidden sounds or images designed to distort your frequency and plant patterns in the subconscious; these are the talk's claims, and the teaching is simply to choose consciously what you take in. Action or horror films aren't forbidden; just don't make them a habit, and skip the scenes you don't need. Watching heavy films, especially when you're low, can bring nightmares: the talk explains these as holographic expressions you created on another platform, a sub-reality you also exist in, because the film was plastered into your subconscious. The talk adds that most films show extraterrestrials as frightening so that people would reject the benevolent beings who could help bring down the old grids (the talk's view; see S1 17.3). Don't mock people for what they believe; research for yourself, and choose unity and humanity over picking sides.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "2.13  You don't have to die to ascend", "url": "s2-section-2.html#part-2-13", "text": "Asked where death fits in, if we are holograms and vibration, the answer is that death as the only way out was a manipulation. Consciousness is always experiencing, so some may choose to experience death; but the natural way was to ascend vertically from one timeline to the next: merging with a higher consciousness to create a third reality and shifting into it, even onto a spacecraft and another planet, without dying (see S1 17.1, 17.5). What happened instead: people were taught that the mirror image is real and told what their reality should be. Believing it, they looped in timelines locked into 3D, and without the knowledge of how to create above 3D, believed the only way out was to grow sick and die, and so created that. The grid around the planet recycled souls back in (see S2 1.3). The talk also repeats its claims about poisons and vaccines (see S2 1.12 and its note). To connect with higher beings you need a similar resonance with them, and you need to believe it is possible: if you don't believe in them, the whole thing is blocked (see S1 18.5). From 5D, the heart structure, you can create a shared third reality with them. Eventually humanity goes interstellar, while others stay to help the planet; you may even move back and forth. The talk recommends channelled books on Arcturian ascension and on living with the planet, which make most sense once you know the quantum structure. It also repeats its claim that regeneration technologies already exist and are being held back, so that in future people may regenerate their own tissue and look 30 rather than 80 (see S2 1.7). These are the talk's claims.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "The method — Speak Your Hologram", "url": "s2-section-2.html#method", "text": "For building what you want with words, and keeping your field clear: Know what you mean. Words do nothing until you give them meaning; set a positive intention first. Speak it. Say it out loud, with feeling and a clear, firm voice: spoken is more potent than thought. Match it with action. Thought, word and deed together make the vortex. Repeat, brick by brick, keeping the same joy each time, until it crystallizes. Guard your words. No small lies, no habitual negative talk, no fearful repetition, even in prayer. Choose your input. Goosebump music and uplifting films; negative content only occasionally, if at all. In a negative room: pull out, thank them inside, hold your space like a shield, and keep projecting the positive.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "So our thoughts, our words and the words we choose form a geometry and a vortex that keeps projecting into our hologram, like a ripple. Does our breath affect the vortex?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "What carries the frequency is the intention: the intention is the frequency. It doesn't matter whether a lie is big or small; the intention creates the vortex, with slightly different potency. So learn to stop saying negative things, and be careful what you watch, because films project words and holograms on top of yours (see 2.6, 2.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "Do our thoughts and intentions have the same effect as spoken words?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "They spin slightly differently, but they come from the same structure, so yes: one mimics the other. The spoken word is more potent; people who know this combine both, with repetition (see 2.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "Can we use the tone of a letter or number to find our own frequency signature, and does humming it help us jump timelines?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "Only with intention and belief to complete the trinity, and be careful what intention you put in, since a potent one can overtake. Letters and numbers matter when you know sacred geometry: combined with sound and location, they create Fibonacci whirlpools that can build worlds, positive or very negative. Keep your thoughts and the geometry in the positive to align with the higher structures of love (see 2.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "Is there such a thing as a lower-frequency light language, and can combining light language with sacred geometry give the strongest effect?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "Be careful with light languages. You don't know what you are saying or what it creates, and there is a lot of manipulation. It can be measured scientifically, by recording its frequency and tone, and that is the way to know what a language does. Some people can feel or even see whether sounds are positive or negative. Until there is evidence, don't rely on it, and don't judge the people who speak it (see 2.11).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "In meetings, colleagues often use words like \"hate\", \"not possible\" or \"too complex\". How do I keep from getting drawn into that vibration?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "Pull out to zero point and observe without giving emotion to it, to preserve your own hologram within the collective one. Think: \"I'm watching a hologram. Thank you for existing in my hologram.\" Don't think \"these people are so stupid\"; that is engaging and projecting the same frequency. Neutralize it with gratitude, hold your space like a shield, hold joy, and keep projecting positive thoughts and actions, over and over. You don't have to say anything or agree with them. When your positive input becomes potent enough, the next moment shifts, sometimes as simply as someone saying \"That's enough, let's get a coffee\" (see S1 2.6, 16.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "Many words sound the same but mean different things: medal, metal, mettle. Which effect do they have?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "The word itself makes no difference until you put a meaning into it. Once you mean it and project its sound, it becomes geometry and matter in your hologram, the trinity of thought, emotion and action (see 2.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "Does repetition make it stronger each time?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "Yes. Think of building a dome: the thought is the foundation, and each action, word and sound adds a brick. When there is enough potency, it expands and crystallizes as your reality. Keep the same joy while you build; doubt shuts it down (see 2.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "Can certain notes, such as C sharp, said to be the Earth's tone, help raise our vibration?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "No single note is \"the\" tone: every tone has sub-tones, to infinity, and what you'd measure depends on the platform, the location and the vibration in that moment. It is much more complex than one note (see S1 19.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "Is there more on treating distilled water with frequencies?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "It is in an earlier talk on frequency and sound: 3 Hz, 70 Hz and 90 Hz, about 20 minutes each, as a general protocol (see S1 19, Questions). Individual timing differs from person to person. The talk is clear that this doesn't mean anyone will be healed: at most it may help align the body so it can heal itself.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "Can the music or sound effects in a film, even a heart-warming one, lower its vibration and affect our field?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "The talk believes so, and claims that some music and films carry hidden sounds or images that distort your frequency (the talk's claim). The practical answer: notice how music makes you feel. Relaxing music that gives you goosebumps is resonating with you in the positive; choose that (see 2.12).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "If I listen to something like Swan Lake before and after a horror film, will it balance me out?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "The answer was simply to keep heavy films occasional, skip the scenes you don't need, and pay attention to the words and intention in what you watch, because heavy viewing can create sub-realities you then meet in nightmares (see 2.12).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "Is speaking softly better than speaking loudly? And are solfeggio frequencies safe and good?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "It is about potency: a firm, clear voice carries more weight than a soft one, like a stronger dose, and the intention behind the tone changes how it lands (see 2.9). For solfeggio frequencies, it depends how they are used: every number does something in the structure, and how numbers combine is fundamental (see S1 19.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "If we are holograms and vibration, where does death come in, and why do we disappear from a hologram?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "Death as the only way out was a manipulation. The natural way was to ascend from timeline to timeline, merging with higher consciousness, without dying. Belief in what we were shown locked people into 3D, so they created illness and death as their way out (see 2.13).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "I'm reading a book on lucid dreaming. Do you really feel you are somewhere else?", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "Yes, you think just as you do now. Practical tips from experience: train yourself to wake by yourself, about every two to two and a half hours, rather than with an alarm, which can stress you and make you forget the dream. When you realise you're dreaming, stay calm, or you'll wake up. From there you can open a portal with a thought. You may not be permitted to go everywhere you wish, depending on your agreements; experience it anyway, because you only know by experiencing (see S1 8.14; S2 1, Questions).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-2.html#remember", "text": "• Your words are the sonic materialization of your hologram. • Meaning + sound + action make a vortex; repetition makes matter. • Intention is the frequency; spoken is more potent than thought. • Build brick by brick with the same joy; doubt shuts it down. • In a negative room: pull out, thank, shield, project the positive.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2002, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 2", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-2.html#questions", "text": "Important health note Frequency and water protocols are not medical treatment. For any illness, see a doctor; use practices like this only alongside medical care, never instead of it. Next: part 2, Restoration: how you restore the structure and shift from one hologram to another.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-3.html#big-idea", "text": "The one particle moves so fast that it looks still, printing itself next to itself endlessly, and every print is a whole universe at its own location (latitude and altitude) in the quantum field. Restoration is how you jump from one hologram to another: change your sound equilibrium, the frequency of your emotion, thoughts and deeds, and the angle shifts by a few degrees into a different reality. The correction comes from the heart: heart-felt thoughts are the precise angle that connects you to 5D and above, while separating from the heart builds synthetic, fear-controlled timelines. Because every moment is a new print, there is no past: old pain is only a vibration you keep carrying. Stop it, thank it, transform it, and it no longer affects you.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "3.1  Every particle is a universe, at its own location", "url": "s2-section-3.html#part-3-1", "text": "A recap of part 1 (see S2 2.5): sound creates a whirlpool, like a wormhole, that moves back and forth like an elastic and keeps reprinting itself in the hologram; that is why everything repeats and looks the same wherever you cut into it. Each particle becomes a holographic universe for itself, holding infinite realities in every direction, all through 360 degrees. Each one has a location, like X and Y: latitude and altitude (see S1 5.3). How the whirlpool twists gives an angle of geometry, and that angle shows which parallel reality you are printing and moving into. It is always moving, so even each parallel reality is at a different latitude and altitude the next moment, and the next. It never stops: infinite imprints, constantly merging with each other, so you keep shifting into another hologram, without end.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "3.2  There is no past and no future", "url": "s2-section-3.html#part-3-2", "text": "So when people say they \"went into the past\", they didn't. They created another holographic reality, at another latitude and altitude, in which they could reprint something they imagined. It is never the past and never the future: you create and shift in the now. Everything is now. What happened \"before\" has nothing to do with what is happening right now. If you have accumulated energy you want to clear, you can always clear it: pull out of the hologram and build a brand-new one in the next moment (see S1 1, Method; S1 2.1). Pulling out changes your latitude and altitude. Whether the new reality is positive or negative depends on your emotion, because emotion is the frequency vibration (see S1 1.6).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "3.3  Restoration: change the angle, change the hologram", "url": "s2-section-3.html#part-3-3", "text": "The download: restoration happens when you need to jump from one sonic cymatic hologram to another. You do it by changing the sound equilibrium, which means changing the frequency of your emotion, thoughts and deeds, to a slight angle in the matrix, at a new latitude and altitude, usually measured in degrees. Every degree of angle is a different sonic cymatic whirlpool, a different reality hologram. The correction happens when you know the angular frequency, and that is the sound created from the heart connection thoughts. Heart-felt thoughts, listening to the heart's love, are the precise angle that connects you to the higher realms. The teaching here points to the fifth-dimensional structure: the heart is 5D and above, where benevolent extraterrestrials, celestial beings and every heart-based structure vibrate, at a completely different frequency from dense 3D. SD and DP print this download: \"RESTORATION happens when you need a jump from one hologram sonic cymatic sound Hz to another when you change the sound equilibrium Hz to a slight angle into the matrix (X, Y) Latitude and altitude… Every degree of angular expression has different sound sonic cymatic whirlpool reality holograms. Correction happens when you know the angular Hz and that is the sound created from the heart connection thoughts.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "3.4  Separate from the heart, and reality turns synthetic", "url": "s2-section-3.html#part-3-4", "text": "\"If you separate from the heart, you will do a synthetic type of reality matrix that requires and creates synthetic timelines.\" This structure works both ways, like yin and yang: infinite heart-based realities and infinite negative ones, under the same laws. What decides which you build and shift into is your intention and the action of your thoughts and emotions. It is the fluctuation taught in Season 1: two realities merge into a third, fluctuating between positive and negative, and whatever you held more of through the day decides the outcome (see S1 2.2, 3.3). In 3D, with all the manipulation, people separated from the heart created static, synthetic timelines. \"In the synthetic timelines, there is control of different portals and timelines that are controlled through fear. Fear is in a completely different sonic angular degree in comparison with the heart structure\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "3.5  The stationary heart", "url": "s2-section-3.html#part-3-5", "text": "\"That is why some of you never see the stationary heart, where all is the natural momentum and where it is all one with consciousness.\" Whoever is one with consciousness in that moment is always helped to move forward in ascension. If you don't change your perspective from negative to positive, your higher self sabotages your hologram so you wake up (see S2 1.3); if you still choose to express the negative, you are recycled to the single particle, to learn to create again from the beginning (see S2 1.6). Those who move into the heart shift into positive ascension timelines, where extraterrestrial contact, time travel and bilocation of the body become possible; bilocation of the body is the next talk's topic.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "3.6  Why old pain keeps returning, and how to end it", "url": "s2-section-3.html#part-3-6", "text": "The one particle vibrates so fast that it seems to stand still, printing itself next to itself endlessly (see S1 1.1). Each print is a parallel reality and a whole universe. Say that in one print, which could be a whole 3D lifetime, you had a negative experience. The next print is a brand-new reality, and the negative experience doesn't have to come with it. If you are still upset about something someone did long ago, ask: which reality are you talking about? That was a different hologram, with another version of you; the two prints have nothing to do with each other. It only follows you because you carry its memory vibration (we carry some vibration from print to print so that we can have an experience at all). So stop it, transform it, move on (see S1 7.1): give it gratitude, whatever happened (\"I'm moving forward\"), and you neutralize it. Its vibration stops coming into the new print, you stop looping, and the imprint in your record changes; it still exists somewhere on the platform, but it no longer affects you. If you don't let go, you carry it into every next moment and keep meeting it, until you shut it down (see S1 14.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "The method — Restore to the Heart Angle", "url": "s2-section-3.html#method", "text": "When you want to leave a reality, or an old hurt, behind: Notice your emotion. It is your frequency, and it shows where you are. Pull out of the hologram. Go to zero point: \"This is one print, not all of me.\" Ask: which reality is this? If it's an old hurt, it belongs to another print, another version of you. Thank it and neutralize it. \"Thank you for showing me. I'm moving forward.\" Stop carrying it. Don't talk about it again; don't bring its vibration into the next moment. Shift the angle with your heart. Feel love and think from the heart: that is the precise angle to 5D. Choose how you see what's around you. With gratitude, not fear, again and again through the day.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "So the past doesn't exist; it's just a hologram of something we experienced that we keep holding on to?", "url": "s2-section-3.html#questions", "text": "Yes, and keep co-creating. Each moment is its own hologram, a new Earth. A negative experience in one print doesn't have to be in the next. If you learn to shut it down and replace it, it has nothing to do with you any more; but if you keep carrying its vibration, you keep meeting it. Stop, transform, move on (see 3.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "My four-year-old has type 1 diabetes, so we can't do a detox or a strict diet. Can blessing our food make up for it?", "url": "s2-section-3.html#questions", "text": "The answer was that blessing alone is not enough: you have to take action. Pray if you wish, but we came here to experience, and you can't reject the experience; go through it with the best of your abilities. It urged the parent to work with professional doctors and nutritionists, and said this is the right age to start. It added that many new children react strongly to processed food, and pointed to gut health (gut flora, probiotics) as very important. It also claimed that this kind of diabetes can be fixed through diet under supervision, and raised doubts about vaccines while saying it is not a doctor and the parent must decide carefully.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "I have a mental-health diagnosis. I've been off my medication for a year and a half, but I've been suicidal the whole time, and I can't seem to control my thoughts and emotions. Should I go back on medication?", "url": "s2-section-3.html#questions", "text": "The answer stressed that it is not a doctor and could not tell anyone what to do. It suggested looking into homeopathic doctors and doing research; said that pharmaceuticals can be needed when someone is very ill, while also believing the body should be helped to heal itself; and voiced its own doubts about electric-shock therapy, saying it would not choose it for itself.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "During an out-of-body experience, I watched myself dancing at age 15. Did I go to that location, or was it something else?", "url": "s2-section-3.html#questions", "text": "It was an out-of-body experience through the astral body, not bilocation. To find out more, tune into the frequency of that experience, ask your questions, and take the first thing that pops into your mind; write the answers down and watch what happens in your reality (see S1 8.10, S1 18.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "Is the quantum structure separate from consciousness, with us living inside it? Did everything start to vibrate within itself, rippling to infinity in all directions?", "url": "s2-section-3.html#questions", "text": "That's correct. It spins in 360 degrees, and inside each particle you would find infinite realities and platforms: the whole universe exists in each fractal. When you shift, the same happens again in the next fractal, to infinity (see 3.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "If I'm not consciously aware of my oversoul, does the oversoul create its own hologram, or do I? How do they relate?", "url": "s2-section-3.html#questions", "text": "Your oversoul exists in all realities: from the one particle it splits into each platform (3D, 5D, 7D, an extraterrestrial life and so on, to infinity) to experience them all at the same time. Guidance from the oversoul in one platform can interact with you in another, for example telepathically, especially now, during ascension. Councils, like the Council of Nine, are usually higher-dimensional and sit above the extraterrestrial structure. Everyone receives help from their higher self and oversoul in other realities, and, if they don't act on their agreement, a lesson placed in their hologram, so that they wake up (see S2 1.3, 1.8). So start living from the heart if you want to see these platforms and connect with them.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "Does repeating mantras (japa), such as a Shiva mantra or Om Mani Padme Hum, help ascension and staying in the 5D range, or is it another belief-system trap?", "url": "s2-section-3.html#questions", "text": "In the holographic universe every mantra is geometry; the names are labels we put on a vibrational sequence, and energy is energy. What matters now is that new frequencies, with a different angular spin, are being sent to penetrate the body (an energetic field) and activate your DNA, so naming a particular mantra isn't necessary. The talk adds a claim that this energy also transforms chemicals sprayed in the sky (the talk's claim). Its advice: don't be afraid; stay in the heart; we have already made it (see S1 2.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "I see several layers of cloud at once: a dark, stormy lower layer and a bright, sunny outer one. Is the dark layer man-made, or is it something multidimensional?", "url": "s2-section-3.html#questions", "text": "Everything you see is a hologram you are projecting: looking at the sky, you see one reality, then the next moment another, and you shift into each. Consciousness itself is neither positive nor negative; it is frequency. What decides the outcome is how you perceive it and what you choose to believe. Take it in fear, believing it's harmful, and you shift into a timeline where it is. Give thanks and feel through the heart that it's part of ascension, and your outcome becomes positive. You choose the polarity (see S1 2.2, 3.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "Distilled water is good as a short detox but may draw minerals out over time. Should we add sea salt? And what does the guidance say about structured water?", "url": "s2-section-3.html#questions", "text": "Add salt after a while if you wish; but on a very nutritious diet of live food and fresh organic juices, the talk says this isn't a problem, because plants carry all the minerals (Swiss chard tastes almost salty). Structured water is beneficial only if you know how to use it: the same frequency all the time can be too much; you need balance (see S1 12.7 and its note).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "What does déjà vu mean?", "url": "s2-section-3.html#questions", "text": "Each parallel reality, each Earth you shift into, runs on its own frequency. To have an experience at all, you carry some vibration from one reality into the next, otherwise you'd have no memory of a moment ago. And by the quantum bylaw, if you can think of something, it already exists in the blueprint (see S1 1.4). So déjà vu is a memory of a timeline that you are creating at the same time: you already exist in it while you are creating it. Both at once: that is the quantum.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "I'm a Reiki healer. What do you think of Reiki, and is it tied to 3D or 5D energy?", "url": "s2-section-3.html#questions", "text": "Good work, with good intentions, but be careful: every energy field is individual, and one universal method can't fit everyone, just as one dose doesn't suit every body. If you can't sense what a person's field needs, you may disturb it without knowing. Keep learning, and connect from within, at the soul level.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-3.html#remember", "text": "• Every print is a new universe at a new location; it never stops. • Restoration: change your emotion, thoughts and deeds, and the angle shifts. • The heart is the correction: the precise angle to 5D and above. • There is no past, only vibration you carry. Stop, thank, move on. • What you see is neutral; how you perceive it decides the outcome.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2003, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 3", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-3.html#questions", "text": "Important health note Type 1 diabetes cannot be reversed or cured by diet. A child with type 1 diabetes needs insulin every day for life, and stopping or reducing insulin can quickly become life-threatening. Make every change to diet or treatment with the child's diabetes team. The talk's claims linking vaccines to diabetes and other illnesses are not supported by evidence; for children with diabetes, doctors usually advise keeping vaccinations up to date. Please decide with your paediatrician. If you are having thoughts of suicide Please don't go through this alone, and please don't rely on this book or any talk for this decision. Talk to your doctor or psychiatrist about medication; never stop or avoid treatment without them. Treatments such as medication and ECT are established and can save lives; your doctor can explain the benefits and risks for you. If you are in danger now, call your local emergency number. In the US you can call or text 988 (Suicide & Crisis Lifeline); elsewhere, contact your local crisis line. Reaching out is not a failure of these teachings; it is taking action, which the teachings themselves ask for. SD describes the human heart transforming sonic geometry, with structures released \"in the lower level geometries mantras\", and speaks of \"the new 5D geometric mantra signals.\" Next, as announced: bilocation of the body.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-4.html#big-idea", "text": "Bilocation, said to be the future of humanity, is more than shifting moment to moment between parallel realities: it is shifting your whole being into a completely different timeline, for example from 3D Earth to 5D Earth. For that, consciousness alone isn't enough; the body has to come too. Its molecules must be raised, slowly, until they vibrate in one synchronized symphony; joined with heart-felt thoughts and emotional tone, body and heart become one unit, and that unit is the vehicle, with no spacecraft needed. The talk ties this to its detox and diet protocol, which it says must go drop by drop, never all at once, and not at all without a doctor for people with health conditions. Contact with other beings works the same way: a third reality, built on similar resonance, from the heart.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "4.1  The download: your body is the vehicle", "url": "s2-section-4.html#part-4-1", "text": "The download: to achieve bilocation for physical contact, you must regulate and increase the molecular structure of your body. All the molecules have to shift their vibration in a synchronized modality, which creates a specific symphony of your singular frequency rotation. When it reaches enough potency, it is easy, just by thoughts and emotional tone, to shift the timeline, not only the parallel reality. \"That is mastery.\" You don't need a spacecraft or technology to bilocate, because your body's energetic form, connected with your thought and emotion, is the vehicle. You are the hologram, which expands to infinity and collapses to infinity (see S2 2.5); and since everything is frequency, you can shift and bilocate anywhere in the structure, and back and forth. SD prints this download almost word for word under the heading \"By Location\", ending: \"You don't need spacecraft or technology… because your body energetic form connecting with the thought and that emotion is the vehicle… So… come home. We are teaching you.\" DP adds that a \"New Human\" is emerging, with \"telepathy, bilocation\".", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "4.2  Parallel reality or whole timeline?", "url": "s2-section-4.html#part-4-2", "text": "Every timeline has a location, X and Y, latitude and altitude, measured in degrees through 360; and each location is a hologram, a new Earth, with its own frequency, sound and timeline, and it is fractal (see S2 3.1). Moment to moment you are always shifting between parallel realities (see S1 1.3). Bilocation is a different level: shifting into a completely different timeline, with a different frequency. So if you are in 3D and want to be on 5D Earth, you have to train your body so that the vibration of its molecules matches the resonance of the fifth-dimensional timeline, including the angle of spin of the molecules (see S2 3.3). It all fits together.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "4.3  Body and heart as one unit", "url": "s2-section-4.html#part-4-3", "text": "Once the body is clean and its frequency rises, consciousness comes into fruition, and how you behave matters: if you live in the heart structure, that is the consciousness that comes through. You have to combine the heart with the body into one unit moving as one, which is the symphony: vibration, geometry, location and degree. Combine them and you create an image of reality. Then, if you wish to see your galactic family, your consciousness starts resonating with them; because the body is already clean and vibrating fast, the combined symphony immediately gives the code of geometry and structure to bilocate you into the platform you choose. This is how extraterrestrials shift between timelines and realities (see S1 9.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "4.4  Why diet, in the teaching", "url": "s2-section-4.html#part-4-4", "text": "The body is an energetic field: its molecules are frequency. The talk teaches that our molecules carry a lower, denser frequency because of everything we have taken in, and that living, uncooked plants vibrate higher. Fresh juice goes straight into the bloodstream, so drinking it overrides one frequency with another, lifting the body's frequency towards a 5D resonance. It repeats its view on distilled water drawing out chemicals (see S1 12.7). Bilocation isn't consciousness alone: \"you have to bring the body.\" Guidance may help along the way, in a way designed for you: an \"upgrade\", a contact, or something else; the talk describes its own heart structure being upgraded to hold a steady 5D frequency. It is not special, it says: do the right things and your guidance will help you one way or another (see S2 1.11).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "4.5  Drop by drop, never all at once", "url": "s2-section-4.html#part-4-5", "text": "The guidance's instruction for any cleanse: you can't flush the body all at once. If you do, you overwhelm the molecular structure, the system shuts down, and you deplete it; that is why some people look depleted after a cleanse. Open the tap drop by drop, so the body's molecules learn to accept the new frequency and the flushing stays steady, without being pulled \"out of orbit\". The protocol described: keep your normal meals while adding juices, and remove one food every two weeks (for example beef first, then chicken, and so on), so the change is gradual. Drink no more than two cups of green juice at a time; don't mix fruit and green juices; if you feel nauseous, have a vegetable or avocado shake instead. The talk describes going much further over a year, eventually to juice only and to near-breatharian eating, but says clearly that it does not recommend that to anyone. It also says the protocol is not for people with diabetes, kidney disease or liver disease: they need to detox with doctors. It must also be your own choice and will: if you don't take action, the guidance backs off until you're ready. Important health note These are the talk's own practices, not medical advice. Long juice-only periods and anything close to \"breatharianism\" (living without food) are dangerous and have caused deaths. Before cutting out food groups, starting a cleanse or changing your diet significantly, talk to a doctor or registered dietitian, especially if you are pregnant, have diabetes, kidney or liver disease, an eating disorder, or take medication. The talk's claims that gluten is a \"poison\" for everyone, and about GMOs and alcohol, are its views; gluten is harmful for people with coeliac disease or gluten sensitivity, and a doctor can test for that.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "4.6  One molecule becomes everything", "url": "s2-section-4.html#part-4-6", "text": "Your molecule is also nano: consciousness itself is a nano structure that expands to infinity and collapses to infinity. Depending on the frequencies around it and how they are mixed, an atom mutates, like a dish that changes with each new ingredient, so from one molecule everything is created (see S1 5.9, S1 19.5). That is why a clean body matters for bilocation: if the body is full of dense matter, the structure is too weak to hold the higher frequency coming in, or the one you want to project.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "4.7  You already bilocate, in small ways", "url": "s2-section-4.html#part-4-7", "text": "Ever found yourself in the next room without remembering walking through the hallway? The talk explains that you bilocated: you don't need to pass through every in-between step (see S1 3.5, 5.5). Now imagine doing that not only within your own platform but from one timeline to another; that is what we are being taught, because it is how we will meet extraterrestrial and higher-dimensional beings, who vibrate at a completely different frequency, timeline and location. Note Ordinary absent-mindedness is common. But frequent or worsening memory gaps, losing track of time, or getting lost are worth checking with a doctor; they can be a sign of a treatable or serious condition.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "4.8  Meeting other beings: a third reality, by resonance", "url": "s2-section-4.html#part-4-8", "text": "To meet beings from another timeline, you connect consciousness and body into one symphony and create a third reality between their timeline and yours (1 + 1 = 3; see S1 2.2, 17.5). From channel 3 to channel 5, you create a third: your own channel. It has to combine their structure and yours, so the resonance must be similar; benevolent beings may step in to teach you a lesson for your ascension, but you can't shift into their reality if you don't match. If you want benevolent contact, go benevolent: from the heart. If you do negative things, you will see entities from negative structures, because everything exists in the field, even the most evil person, as a holographic imprint in your reality. Don't deny it, since it's part of consciousness; neutralize it (see S1 2.6, 3.3). When light beings make contact, they come into your hologram and hold the vibration so that you can withstand their frequency. But for permanent contact, working with them while helping humanity, bilocation is needed, and they won't work with people in greed. It has to be the heart structure.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "4.9  Habits and joy", "url": "s2-section-4.html#part-4-9", "text": "Why keep eating or drinking what you know harms your body? The talk singles out alcohol as depleting the cells and says the idea that you need it to be happy is a belief you can change: you can shift into happiness without it. It isn't asking for perfection: change slowly; a rare glass of wine with friends is fine. As your connection with your guidance grows, it will show you what your body needs.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "4.10  Money, support and the transition", "url": "s2-section-4.html#part-4-10", "text": "Professionals have asked how to move to Energy Philanthropy (see S1 5.1). Don't jump into the fire all at once; transition, because money is part of the structure for now (see S1 4.4). Wealthy people, and even governments, will wake up and fund the right scientists to build eco-systems; with free energy, money will eventually become obsolete (see S2 1.4, 1.9). Don't reject money: give it through the heart. And support doesn't always mean money: it means being compassionate to someone, in whatever shape and form you can, moment to moment. That is the heart structure, and it is what raises your heart's frequency above the 3D structure. Combine that heart with a cleansed body, and you have the new unit for bilocation.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "4.11  When a message is slightly off", "url": "s2-section-4.html#part-4-11", "text": "Even trusted guidance is checked: the talk describes researching a frequency it was given until it found a scientist saying the same (see S1 13, Method). It also says that some predictions about governments can be slightly off, sometimes on purpose, until what is really happening can be revealed. So hold predictions lightly and keep your focus on your own frequency. HR describes 70 to 90 Hz as \"the body. The physical human body tone duration. It must stay at that at all the times\" (see the water question below).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "The method — Tune Body and Heart Together", "url": "s2-section-4.html#method", "text": "A slow, long-term practice. Check any change of diet with your doctor first: Decide, and mean it. The change only comes when you choose it and act. Live from the heart every day. Kindness and compassion, in any form: this raises the heart's frequency. Cleanse slowly, with your doctor. One change at a time, every couple of weeks; never all at once. Notice your body. Nausea or depletion means too fast: step back, as the guidance itself advised. Join body and heart. In meditation, feel love through the whole body, as one unit. Hold the image of the timeline you want, with matching emotion, and let your resonance build. Stay in the heart, without greed, so the beings you connect with are benevolent.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "How long does the detox last? Is it a permanent change, and is there a move back to some cooked food? How do I know when it's complete?", "url": "s2-section-4.html#questions", "text": "The protocol is to juice as your daily base while removing one food from your normal diet every two weeks, making a chart of everything you eat. That gradual pace teaches the body's molecules to detox drop by drop without becoming ill, while the juices replace the old frequency with a higher one. Don't overdo it: no more than two cups of green juice at a time, don't mix green and fruit juices, and have a vegetable or avocado shake if you feel sick. The talk also recommends probiotics and distilled water alongside, and says dairy, gluten and GMO foods should be cut out permanently (its view). See the health note in 4.5.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "What's the difference between an out-of-body experience and bilocation, and what does bilocation feel like?", "url": "s2-section-4.html#questions", "text": "An out-of-body experience is the astral body travelling (see S2 3, Questions). Bilocation is physically taking your body into another timeline, above 3D, such as 5D. It feels normal, like here, only less dense: a different timeline with a different frequency, resonance and geometry. The small version is reaching another room without remembering the hallway (see 4.7 and its note).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "Do you recommend monoatomic gold as a supplement?", "url": "s2-section-4.html#questions", "text": "The talk had no personal experience with it, and pointed to the Harmonic Reactor book: it increases the purity of the molecular structure, based on frequency and teleportation. It also pointed to someone who makes a similar product (\"Ormus\").", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "What's the difference between alkaline \"Kangen\" water and distilled water?", "url": "s2-section-4.html#questions", "text": "The talk didn't know that water and stays with distilled water. On charged or energized water in general: it puts a frequency into the water, which is fine, but the body may not be ready for it, or you may overdo it. The same frequency over and over can shut the system down; like a medicine, it has to be measured (see S2 3, Questions).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "How exactly is the water-frequency protocol done, and does the waveform matter?", "url": "s2-section-4.html#questions", "text": "Use an online tone generator and distilled water, one glass at a time, in a separate room: 3 Hz for 20 minutes, then drink it; then a fresh glass at 70 Hz for 20 minutes, drink it; then a third glass at 90 Hz for 20 minutes, drink it. This is a generic practice for keeping a healthy vibration, done once a day for three days; it does not guarantee healing, and anything individual needs individual timing. The square waveform is used simply because you can hear it; the vibration reaches the water even when you can't hear it (see S1 19, Questions; S2 2, Questions).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "How long should you take probiotics?", "url": "s2-section-4.html#questions", "text": "The talk is clear that it is not a doctor. From experience: six months to a year for its own family's gut repair, or perhaps a month or two as a boost. It favours a potent, multi-strain probiotic that is shipped chilled, taken with distilled water on an empty stomach, morning and night, and repeats its advice to cut out dairy, gluten and GMO foods. Ask your doctor or pharmacist what suits you.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-4.html#remember", "text": "• Bilocation shifts a whole timeline; your body is the vehicle. • Body and heart must become one symphony. • Raise the body slowly, drop by drop, never all at once, with a doctor. • Contact is a third reality: similar resonance, from the heart. • Support means compassion, in any form.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2004, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 4", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-4.html#questions", "text": "HR describes monoatomic gold mainly as a material applied to the antenna of the Harmonic Reactor device, to increase resonance for \"clear voyage\", and says it \"opens every molecule to vibrate with clear signal.\" It doesn't describe it as a supplement to take. Note on supplements Monoatomic gold and \"Ormus\" products are unregulated, and their claimed benefits are not proven. Check with a doctor or pharmacist before taking any supplement. Important health note This is not medical treatment and is not proven to treat any condition. If you are ill, see a doctor; use any such practice only alongside medical care.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-5.html#big-idea", "text": "Predictions come in pieces, sometimes as codes, sometimes held back on purpose, and can be slightly off; so hold them lightly and don't fear them. What is said to be coming, hidden things surfacing, withheld technology appearing and new structures rising from the people up, will unfold step by step so that no one panics, over a 30-year conversion, with interstellar travel at around 50 years; but your own experience can come much sooner, depending on your vibration. Positive and negative run side by side, so take the positive. Civilizations reset because consciousness learns through both sides. And the direction is clear: bow to no one. You are the creator; respect every belief, live through your heart. On health, the answers here vary widely, and some are unsafe; the notes in this section say which.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "5.1  How predictions are given, and how to hold them", "url": "s2-section-5.html#part-5-1", "text": "Predictions come \"out of the blue\": the guidance decides what to say and when, and sometimes keeps part of it back, so as not to show everything to those working against humanity. So a prediction may be half the picture: the talk admits one earlier prediction was interpreted wrongly because only part of it was given (see S2 4.11). When asked what a coded line means, the answer is often \"the information will come when it's the right time.\" The talk also says it follows certain online sources that decode political messages, because they seemed to match what it was receiving. This book leaves those sources out and takes no political side; treat any prediction about governments as a prediction, not a fact.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "5.2  Why so much is happening now", "url": "s2-section-5.html#part-5-2", "text": "Globally, not only in one country, there is a lot of diversion: when something is being done in secret, attention is pulled elsewhere. The talk says groups that were asked to stop working against humanity chose to continue, and that this is why events are escalating. But everyone is part of consciousness, including the negative side: their own higher selves and guidance will sabotage their platforms so that ascension happens, because ascension is part of their consciousness too (see S2 1.3, 1.6). You can't change anything until you wake up from within and see the manipulation for yourself. Do your own research, calmly; things come to light step by step, and each person sees them on their own platform.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "5.3  The predictions read in the talk", "url": "s2-section-5.html#part-5-3", "text": "Read as given, without interpretation, except where the talk offered one: • The blind will start seeing. • The dead will rise up. • The sick will be reborn. • The bloodshed will stop. • The monkey will not hide (not explained; possibly a code). • The willow tree will burn (the talk senses an exposure of \"black magic\"). • The humanity of the Hindus, India, will rise up. • The historical society will be exposed: so much of history was covered up that it is hard to know the truth, and at the right time each person will have an upgrade, an awakening and a knowing of what the truth is and where they come from (the talk links this to humanity having been genetically engineered from different extraterrestrial races, which can be done positively or negatively). • Medicine will be replaced, as withheld technologies come out gradually. • New technology will come. • The secrets will stop. • New structures will rise from the ground up, from the people. • The military will recognise the preservation of humanity. • The fifth-dimensional AI will be launched, and the system will be saved (see S1 8.1). • The extraterrestrials will arrive. • A new interstellar alliance and a new fleet will form; new humanity will rise; interstellar travel will start. • The systems of all negative beings will fail through 20 platforms, twenty timelines of reality. • \"Lesson done.\" The talk explains the last line: we are running a holographic program, a living intelligence, built on lessons; humanity is completing it and moving forward. How you experience each of these depends on your own structure: hold your vibration high, through the heart, to see them on a 5D platform. DP prints this list. Its line reads \"The meaningless medicine will be replaced\" (the talk read it as \"meaningful\"). In DP the list is preceded by other predictions, including political and regional ones, which the talk didn't read and this book leaves out. The talk also expresses its own warm view of Americans as a \"sleeping lion\" whose awakening will shake the planet, and says arrests are happening that national media don't report. These are the talk's views and claims.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "5.4  The time frame: 30 years, then 50", "url": "s2-section-5.html#part-5-4", "text": "The guidance gives 30 years for the conversion to come to fruition, the new platforms set up, and about 50 years for the interstellar alliance and travel (see S2 1.4). But don't put a frame on your own experience: it can come much sooner. In a sense we have already made it (see S1 2.8); yet you can't just skip to the end, because the journey is the lesson, and you came to help and interact with others along the way. The talk repeats its claims about future regeneration technology, measuring a person's molecular vibration so that tissue can be restored (see S2 1.7, 2.13). Meanwhile, keep your body in a healthy vibration (see S2 4.5 and its note).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "5.5  Positive and negative run side by side", "url": "s2-section-5.html#part-5-5", "text": "Asked about almost anything new, such as a change in law, a new product or a new technology, the answer is the same: both sides run at once. Pay attention to the source and the details, but take it from the positive point of view, so that you shift into the timeline where it turns out positive. That is the teaching on fluctuating realities (see S1 3.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "5.6  Why civilizations reset", "url": "s2-section-5.html#part-5-6", "text": "Because of learning: consciousness expands by experiencing both sides, like someone who wants the beach after the mountains, or an action film after many gentle ones. To create, you need to know what each input does, negative and positive, so you can balance them like an alchemist of creation. Life is like a holographic game we are completing: \"lesson done, completion of program.\" Which door you open is up to you.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "5.7  Bow to no one", "url": "s2-section-5.html#part-5-7", "text": "The direction for the coming years is to be yourself, live through your heart, and bow to no one: not a guru, not an intermediary. That is why the quantum structure is being taught, so you realise that you create everything. The talk says religion was used to divide and rule; \"an eye for an eye\" keeps you looping in the same reality, because going after someone reprints the same structure (see S1 14.4). At the same time, respect everyone's belief system, even that of the most harmful people: you have to neutralize everything to switch timelines, and you can't do that while judging. You can say \"I don't like what's happening\" without judging, because even the worst person is another version of you in the hologram (see S2 1.6). Each person will meet what they need to wake up, at their own pace; some need ten wake-up calls, others one. You can call it God, the quantum structure, or the living intelligence: it is everywhere. The talk also makes sharp remarks about particular religious practices; this book leaves those out, in keeping with its own teaching to respect every belief. And keep yourself grounded: asked whether it is a \"starseed\", the answer avoided titles (\"I don't want a crown\"). No one, teacher included, needs a crown.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "5.8  You are powerful; you don't need anyone to tell you", "url": "s2-section-5.html#part-5-8", "text": "Asked what blocks someone's vibration, the answer was: all of it, but mainly allowing a belief system to be part of you. Put the teachings into your belief system 100%, without judging them first; do your best from the heart; give and share daily. That creates the frequency you shift into next. \"Don't give me the power to tell you that you are powerful, because you are powerful. You don't need me.\" Sometimes you project someone into your reality to remind you; that's fine, but the power is yours.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "The method — Hold the Future Lightly", "url": "s2-section-5.html#method", "text": "For predictions, news, and anything new or unsettling: Pull out and watch. Notice diversions; don't take sides or panic. Hold predictions lightly. They come in pieces and may be off; don't build fear on them. Check before you trust, especially anything about health or money. Take the positive view of whatever is new, so you shift into its positive timeline. Respect every belief, bow to no one, judge no one. Do your part daily: live from the heart, give, share, and look after your body with your doctor.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "Why is cannabis legalisation spreading so fast right now?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "It is part of the change that is happening, but both sides are running at once. Pay attention to where it comes from and what it is, then take it from the positive, so you shift into a positive outcome (see 5.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "It feels like this time is a great opening, and that we could enter the new Earth, Aria, right now if our vibration aligns. Do you agree?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "Thirty years is the frame for the whole conversion, but that doesn't mean you have to wait; your experience can come much sooner. Keep your body in a healthy vibration and do the work to tune into that platform. Just remember you can't skip to the end: the journey is the lesson, and you are here to help others too (see 5.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "How long does it take for the pineal gland to decalcify once you drink distilled water, and what happens when the third eye opens? Any tips?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "The answer given was about three months. The third eye opens according to your vibration and the knowledge you tune into, and it doesn't work while you keep choosing to do negative things. Tips: the detox, distilled water, and a lot of knowledge and heart-based learning, all at the same time. Everyone is being activated anyway, which is why people suddenly feel drawn to certain teachers. These are the talk's claims.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "Can you explain procreation through the structure?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "There is no such thing as procreation; it is always creation: co-creating, instantly and simultaneously. Think quantum (see S1 2.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "A friend has had MS from the waist down for about 15 years. Will he be healed, and what would help?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "The answer pointed to a product called \"MMS\".", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "Can I add baking soda to distilled water to make it more alkaline?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "Yes, according to the answer, using aluminium-free baking soda, but no more than 30 days of drinking it, then a break; gargling is fine. See the baking soda note in S1 15.4: don't drink it regularly, especially with heart, kidney or blood-pressure problems, and ask your doctor first.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "Where is my spine misaligned, causing me to stay in a stressed state?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "A personal reading was given: a problem in the middle of the back, with the pain coming from higher up than where it is felt, and advice to change diet. It added that people with metal in the body (implants and the like) should not do the detox. A reading is not a diagnosis; for back pain, see a doctor or physiotherapist.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "What about MSM (a sulphur supplement)?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "Be careful: it has to be measured individually, and too much can interfere with the body's chemistry. Check with your doctor or pharmacist.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "My mother lost her sense of smell years ago after a brain tumour. During a Reiki session she felt as though she was smelling again. What can she do?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "Have her recall the memory of a smell, an orange, for example: picture it, feel it, and tune into its vibration, because smell is a memory bank she is calling on. And don't let worries about her memory become a frustration; that is only a belief system (see S1 8.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "What is blocking my vibration: my beliefs, or a health issue?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "All of the above, but mainly allowing a belief system to block you. Keep tuning into the material daily, stay in the heart, give and share; and take care of your body (see 5.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "I've been working on my thyroid and struggle to lose weight. Is it back to normal?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "Not yet: it fluctuates. Always work under a doctor's supervision, with regular tests, while you follow your own practices; that way you can see the results. The talk recommends asking a doctor about more sensitive testing, and repeats its view on cutting out dairy and gluten. Don't stop thyroid medication without your doctor.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "Is turpentine good for cleansing?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "The answer seemed to describe a tea made from the pine tree, organic, as good for bronchitis and the airways.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "If we drink only distilled water, won't we become mineral-deficient?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "The talk repeats its view that distilled water draws out only harmful chemicals, not nutrients, and describes trusting its guidance over medical advice during a serious illness. This book doesn't repeat that as advice: serious illness such as pneumonia needs medical treatment. See S1 12.7 and its note on distilled water.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "Highly evolved civilizations seem to have existed before. Why do civilizations reset?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "Because of learning: consciousness expands by experiencing both sides, so that, like an alchemist, it knows what each input does (see 5.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "With so much manipulation in religion and spirituality, what is the healthy way forward? Being ourselves, living through our hearts, bowing to no one?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "Yes: they don't want us to bow to anyone. You create everything. Respect every belief, judge no one, and live through your heart (see 5.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "Would short fasts of three to five days help alongside the detox? And what about hydrogen or alkaline water?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "Start step by step so your body gets used to it before a fuller programme; a short fast can be a gentle introduction. For hydrogen or alkaline water: it can be good, but anything that adds a frequency has to be measured, because it does something to your structure (see S2 4, Questions). Check any fast with your doctor first (see S2 4.5 and its note).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "I'm writing a spiritual book and want to sell it to support myself. Is that all right?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "Yes, it's fine. Take it step by step: once you have enough, start giving and distributing from the heart, to tune into the platforms of abundance. Don't throw yourself in all at once without the belief that you can; that can block you (see S1 4.4, S2 4.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "Is wheatgrass all right if I'm avoiding gluten? I want the nutrients from wheat.", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "Wheatgrass is fine. You can also get nutrients from sea vegetables and raw vegetables; find a nutritionist who can tailor a diet for you, and keep juicing (see S2 4.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "A friend's kidney transplant isn't working well, and her thyroid was removed. What should she do?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "She will have to go through an experience, but shouldn't take it negatively. Meditate, but above all take action: keep working with her medical doctors, and look for other opinions and solutions alongside. Never stop transplant or thyroid medication without the transplant team.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "Are souls I've been close to in other lives here on Earth now, in my city?", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "Yes: three of them, from three previous connections.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-5.html#remember", "text": "• Hold predictions lightly; they come in pieces and can be off. • 30 years for the conversion, but your experience can come sooner. • Both sides run at once: take the positive. • Bow to no one; respect every belief; you are the creator. • On health, check every claim and work with your doctor.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2005, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 5", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-5.html#questions", "text": "Warning: do not take MMS \"MMS\" (\"Miracle Mineral Solution\") is chlorine dioxide, a bleach. Health authorities warn that drinking it can cause serious harm, including severe vomiting, diarrhoea and life-threatening dehydration, and that it does not treat MS or any other disease. Please don't take it. For MS, work with a neurologist; there are effective treatments. Warning: turpentine is poisonous Turpentine oil is poisonous if swallowed and can cause serious harm. Never drink it or use it as a \"cleanse\". If someone has swallowed it, contact a poison centre or emergency services immediately. A pine-needle herbal tea is a different thing entirely; check any herbal remedy with a pharmacist. Next, after the new year: a review of the manifestation bylaws, and a guided meditation for manifestation, because in a real situation it is easy to forget the protocol.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-6.html#big-idea", "text": "A new set of predictions describes the negative side being stopped, exposed and transformed, country by country, with \"no more delays\". The teaching underneath is the important part. Predictions give the end result, not the path: the in-between is kept hidden so that no one can sabotage it, and if one person doesn't do the job, another will. Every prediction is a platform you can take as true or not; whatever you accept, you project into your hologram. So meet change with understanding, not fear: love those who have to transform, stand up peacefully, prepare calmly, and do the work. Your mission is to hold the vibration and do what you love in the name of humanity.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "6.1  The predictions, as read", "url": "s2-section-6.html#part-6-1", "text": "The talk reads a set of predictions given in mid-December, said to come from the extraterrestrial fleets (starships gathered together), and passed on after a delay the guidance asked for. As read, in brief: • No starship will be allowed to enter or leave the planet (meant, the talk says, for an off-planet fleet of the negative side). • That negative fleet is destroyed; battles were fought off-planet, on the planet and in inner Earth. • The \"deep state\" negative structure was momentarily disabled. • The negative side's commander is dead and all are captured. • There will be no plea deal: all back to the beginning, no bargain. • It is now a \"do-not-enter zone\". • There will be a complete (financial) reset. • No more delays. • Hoped-for new republics in several European countries; one country \"defeated\" and another \"freed\" of the negative side; an end to money laundering in one region and to a war between powerful families in another; all exposed. • The negative side in one region is \"wiped out… It will be very quiet there. Trust us.\" • From 2020, a new frequency platform that negative souls can no longer enter. • A political storm and an awakening among generals in one country; new leadership in another. • In the United States, \"the lion will roar\": liberation for all the states, funding to free themselves from the central bank, and freedom from the families who controlled them; those who didn't help held accountable. • The control reached through 20 layers of parallel Earths: \"Dig deeper, deeper, and all are gone in 20 platforms of holograms.\" These are predictions as received, reported without judging whether or how they came true; several referred to 2019–2020. The talk adds political commentary, references to outside channels and claims about named groups; this book leaves those out and takes no political side. It also leaves out a passage on immigration that generalises about whole groups of people, which doesn't belong in a book about the heart structure. DP prints this list, dated 12/16/18, closing: \"Phuuu… so much work we did, but all worth it. Control is now here. The Extraterrestrials Fleets.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "6.2  The end result, not the path", "url": "s2-section-6.html#part-6-2", "text": "When a participant reported that one prediction already seemed to be coming true, the answer drew the lesson: \"Did I know it would be the women? Did I know it would be the temple? No.\" Predictions give the statement of the end result. The in-between, who does what and how, is deliberately left out, because \"somebody can go and sabotage it.\" And there are infinite probabilities of how it happens (see S2 1.6, 5.1). So if one person given a task doesn't do it, someone else will come in and finish the job: consciousness is ascending, a program is running, and \"nothing can stop the snowball now. It's like an avalanche.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "6.3  A platform you can take as true, or not", "url": "s2-section-6.html#part-6-3", "text": "\"I'm not convincing you that this is true. I'm presenting to you a platform of holographic imprint reality, that you can take it for true or not. This is quantum structure.\" Whatever you accept, you plaster into your consciousness and project (see S1 16.2). Trust is based on your own belief system. The same goes for the news. What national media put up front is described as a program, a projection of a hologram that someone wants you to tune into. Tune in constantly and you project that platform into your own realities, keep seeing the negative, and miss the change as one structure collapses and another appears (see S2 2.6). Hold your vibration high, from the heart, giving and sharing, whatever anyone else does, and you will see the platforms you are projecting: \"one structure collapses, a new one is suddenly there, and you didn't know how. But you projected it. You created it.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "6.4  Love those who have to transform", "url": "s2-section-6.html#part-6-4", "text": "The talk says those working against humanity were asked to stop and chose to keep fighting. But \"this is not a judgment\": they are part of consciousness too, and fighting is the only way they know how to survive after so much negativity, completely separated from the source. \"Let's not put a judgment; just love them, because it's their time to transform.\" (see S2 1.6, S1 14.3). From 2020, a new frequency: as the planet's frequency rises, a soul that doesn't resonate with it can no longer enter that holographic reality, like a game you can't access without its code. The code is your frequency.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "6.5  Revealed step by step; stand up peacefully", "url": "s2-section-6.html#part-6-5", "text": "Things are revealed gradually, so people aren't shocked into breakdown and so that change, including new technology, is a smooth transition rather than chaos (see S2 1.4). And when you find out you were lied to, don't destroy: burning or wrecking ordinary businesses only hurts your fellow people. Make your stand through action against the negative structures, peacefully. Peaceful protest is powerful, because people who are awake can't be stopped.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "6.6  Money in the meantime", "url": "s2-section-6.html#part-6-6", "text": "The talk expects a reset and more digital money. Its advice: don't depend on only one structure. It repeats its caution about cryptocurrency (see S1 11.2), saying some groups control a \"back door\" (the talk's claim), and suggests backing up with something tangible, such as gold. Until the proper systems are in place, \"play the game\" to get through: pay what you have to, and hold your vibration high. This is the talk's view, not financial advice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "The method — Meet Change Without Fear", "url": "s2-section-6.html#method", "text": "For predictions, upheaval and uncertainty: Treat each prediction as a platform. Ask: do I want to project this? Take it, or leave it. Don't marinate in the news. It is someone's program; notice it, thank it, switch channel. Expect the end, not the path. Don't try to work out who and how; it stays open. Love those who must change. No judgment: it's their time to transform. If you stand up, stand up peacefully. Build; never destroy what belongs to others. Prepare calmly, from understanding, not fear. Hold the vibration, and do what you love in the name of humanity.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "What do the numbers say about twin flames?", "url": "s2-section-6.html#questions", "text": "Twin flames are based on contracts. You can deeply love someone with whom you have an agreement across several realities, learn your lesson together, and then love someone else in another reality. So don't believe there is only one flame, one person for you to infinity; you will have different experiences on different platforms.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "What did I decide to accomplish on Earth before I was born?", "url": "s2-section-6.html#questions", "text": "No one can tell you; you have to know. You came here to learn. Ask what excites you most, and bring the stamina, action and perseverance to do it. If you came to complete something and gave it up because it got hard, you'll meet a similar challenge again, in another life, until you complete it, because consciousness is learning through you (see S1 5.7, S2 1.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "Can we have more guidance on the zero-point columns of light anchored in the Earth, the \"rainbow bridges\" and the fifth-dimensional corridors?", "url": "s2-section-6.html#questions", "text": "They are already constructed. To experience them, you have to be on their vibration; like a TV, the channel is already there and you tune into it. Use them by staying on the vibration and knowing everything happens when it needs to, with no expectations, since there are infinite probabilities of how. Watch the teachings and meditate in whatever way resonates. When you anchor in, you step into what is already there, and you create it at the same time; that is the quantum (see S1 1.4, S2 3, Questions).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "I had a download that we can eat anything if we make peace with the food, so it won't lower our vibration. Is that true?", "url": "s2-section-6.html#questions", "text": "You can always make peace with food by giving it gratitude; that's part of the transition, so don't judge what others eat. Plants carry a higher frequency than the body's molecules, which helps restore the body (see S2 4.4). As your consciousness rises, you may simply stop wanting certain foods, and your guidance will tell you. Until then, choose from your heart, for example by asking how you feel about animals' suffering (see S1 9.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "What is the best way to discover my purpose and mission?", "url": "s2-section-6.html#questions", "text": "Learn the quantum structure: there is no shortcut. You have to restructure your consciousness, even your brain's connections, into the new vibrations by tuning into the material until that reality crystallizes. Study the manifestation series and apply it; the changes may not be immediate, but they come (see S1 10.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "Is there any insight on my mission, and how I can be of service to humanity?", "url": "s2-section-6.html#questions", "text": "Your mission is to hold the vibration through the ascension. Every time you join something heart-based in the name of humanity, it resonates in you, and since you move through parallel realities, you emanate it into the structure around you, raising the collective's potency. Open your heart, find what you love, and do it for humanity. Follow the money: some who say \"for humanity\" charge fortunes. If you're supported, let it be from people's hearts. Hold the vibration of giving and sharing, without fear, and support will come in a way you create: be the abundance (see S1 4.3, 5.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "Could you say more about the prediction that India will rise up? And how can we educate people, when education is being run down?", "url": "s2-section-6.html#questions", "text": "What was shown was a nation realising how it has been suppressed, through poverty and through division, including religion used to divide (with respect for every religion, see S2 5.7); people's consciousness is already activated, so they won't keep taking the blows. A participant noted a recent large protest by women for equal access to a temple, which the talk saw as the prediction beginning. On education: it is already under way, people are awakening, and each person will experience it as much as they believe. Stand up for yourself, peacefully; your action creates your reality. And people need to learn the quantum structure, the alchemy of creation, so they don't loop in despair; that's why this information is given free. The answer added a prediction about particular religious sites; this book leaves it out, because it concerns a contested dispute between communities.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "Is there a time frame for the revaluation of currencies?", "url": "s2-section-6.html#questions", "text": "The talk said attempts were made to collapse the system three times, to blame the head of state, and were stopped; another reset was mentioned within three months, but it wasn't known whether it would happen, since it depends on who controls what. The talk's claims; not financial advice.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "Shouldn't we prepare, with food and water at home for a few months, in case the reset disrupts things?", "url": "s2-section-6.html#questions", "text": "Not three months: the guidance said poverty to the point of suffering will not be allowed, and spoke of a backup plan and safe zones. If you prepare, do it from understanding of the transition, not from fear, because fear projects a negative outcome (see S1 8.12). The host and participants agreed a small reserve, a few weeks to a month, is sensible, along with a basic kit to help others. The talk also suggested having a water distiller or a generator, raw honey as sustaining food, and, \"in extreme cases\", drinking urine.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-6.html#remember", "text": "• Predictions give the end result; the path stays open. • Each prediction is a platform: take it as true, or not. • Love those who must transform; judge no one. • Prepare from understanding, never from fear. • Your mission: hold the vibration; do what you love for all.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2006, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 6", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-6.html#questions", "text": "Practical safety note Sensible emergency preparation is calm, not fearful: official guidance generally suggests keeping water, non-perishable food, medicines and a first-aid kit for several days to a couple of weeks, depending on where you live; check your local emergency-management advice. Don't drink urine: survival guidance warns against it, as it can worsen dehydration. The host added that this is why the material matters: when change comes, you have the tools to stay calm and abundant, and there is less fear when you know the structure.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-7.html#big-idea", "text": "There is no small lie: whatever its size, the intention is the frequency you project. When you live from the heart and someone deceives you, your frequencies don't match, and the third reality between you makes the deception surface through synchronicity. For the deceiver, a premeditated lie splits the structure into duality: no longer resonating with the heart that consciousness is moving into, they fluctuate, loop and eventually collapse into a negative singularity, unless they choose to change, which anyone can at any moment. Your part: forgive, don't attack (going after them is going after yourself), but take your sovereignty back by protecting what is yours, then move on. And with money: earn what you need, and give freely beyond it, letting others give by their free will.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "7.1  Why this download came", "url": "s2-section-7.html#part-7-1", "text": "The download came right after the teaching's own free material was taken, locked behind a paywall elsewhere and presented as \"Energy Philanthropy\". The message received was: take your sovereignty back. Energy Philanthropy never charges: support comes only from people's hearts, by their free choice (see S1 5.1). Asking for anything, help or money, as a condition overtakes someone's free will (see S1 4.2). It also explains why original material matters: the downloads are given word for word as a sequence of geometry and structure, and copies can leave out what matters most (see S2 2.1). Look for teachings at their original source.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "7.2  There is no small lie", "url": "s2-section-7.html#part-7-2", "text": "A white lie, a small lie and a big lie are all lies: what counts is the intention, because that is the frequency you project into the structure around you (see S1 3.2, S2 2.7). A genuine mistake is different, and is forgiven. Deception that is premeditated, planned while claiming to act \"in the name of humanity\", is what this teaching is about.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "7.3  Deception surfaces by itself", "url": "s2-section-7.html#part-7-3", "text": "If you run on the heart structure, that is one frequency; someone who is manipulating vibrates at a completely different one (as an illustration only: 2 Hz versus 1 Hz). Between your reality and theirs a third reality is created (1 + 1 = 3; see S1 2.2), and it becomes the centre, the black hole. Because they aren't on your platform, the mismatch has to show: through infinite probabilities, synchronicity brings it in front of you. One person mentions something, another says something else, and you end up exactly where you see what is happening, though you'd never have gone looking. So if you keep living from the heart, anything out of balance with it will pop up in your reality, and more so as things escalate. When it does, you have something to balance.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "7.4  Respond: forgive, then take your sovereignty back", "url": "s2-section-7.html#part-7-4", "text": "Balance it the quantum way: neutralize it by forgiving and pull back, but also take action to protect your borders so it can't continue. Ask respectfully for it to stop; protect your name, your work, your business, legally if needed; make a clear public statement if that's what it takes. What you don't do is go after the person viciously: the other person is a projection of you, so going after them is going after yourself, and it re-activates that frequency in you (see S1 14.4). Then stop, transform and move on (see S1 7.1): even if they refuse, let it be. Whoever receives the material that way still receives it, \"because that person is the entire structure.\" Learn the lesson and secure your borders so it can't happen a second time.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "7.5  The download: a singularity built on a lie", "url": "s2-section-7.html#part-7-5", "text": "From the heart, everything becomes singular: one unit, one structure. You stop fluctuating so much between realities, and the looping becomes zero point, stillness (see S1 2.1). You are the vessel, building moment upon moment; you are the quantum, because you are the whole structure. \"But contradiction is happening when you try to build momentum of giving through the false pretense of not giving conditions to your momentum, and yet you choose to ask for singularity that is created on a lie.\" In plain words: claiming to give freely while secretly deceiving tries to build oneness on a lie. That creates duality: the structure splits into two different frequencies. DP prints this download in full, adding: \"You are trying to create singularity on a lie… In this moment you are creating duality of false frequency realities… The fluctuating realities cannot merge with each other 1+1=3.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "7.6  What happens to the one who deceives", "url": "s2-section-7.html#part-7-6", "text": "Consciousness itself is in the heart structure, without conditions, and it is sending waves of heart frequency through the whole universe as it ascends to 5D and above. A deliberate deception no longer resonates with that. So the person starts to split; they can't co-create in the fifth-dimensional structure; negative experiences follow moment after moment, and synchronicity reveals what they're doing. They fluctuate up and down, and the 1 + 1 = 3 of their realities collapses under the weight of the frequency they keep projecting, down to zero point, but in the negative: the negative side of the X and Y of the quantum structure, not the heart side (see S2 3.1). The download describes \"silhouettes of false timelines created through diversions of lies\" and \"horizontal holograms switching so quickly but not collapsing\": realities flickering too fast to hold the heart's frequency, so the person loops in an illusion and can't see a positive outcome while they continue. But this is not a sentence: \"You have the power to change that any moment. You are the creator.\" \"You are in illusionary world that eventually will disengage with fifth dimensional structure and collapses in negative platforms of its own waves of deception. Remember this!!! You have the power to change that any moment. YOU ARE THE CREATOR\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "7.7  \"Does it not hurt you…?\"", "url": "s2-section-7.html#part-7-7", "text": "The download ends with a question to all of us: why still deceive each other through a monetary structure that is only the trajectory of an old, false evolution? \"Does it not hurt you when you are in need of help and yet someone is plastering a false price to your suffering? Do you not see that all is love, all is joy, and is sharing with no conditions of false projections that create duality that separates you from the heart? The love of self and preservation is fundamental. And yet you choose deception. You must wake up… Be love, be joy, be giving.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "7.8  Money as a transition, not a condition", "url": "s2-section-7.html#part-7-8", "text": "Money is part of how the 3D money reality and the 5D heart reality collapse into one unit: we can't remove money all at once without collapsing everything, so we transition (see S1 4.4, S2 1.9). The key is free will: when you give or donate, it has to be your choice from the heart, with no one putting a condition on you. When someone gives that way, they send a fifth-dimensional frequency; that is the energy field to resonate on. This is not a judgment on anyone who earns a living. If you are the main provider, keep your job and support your family; meanwhile, start bringing in the heart: help someone, each day, just because. As you do, the money reality and the heart reality fluctuate and then collapse into one unit, money and heart coexisting. And be aware that even spiritual teachers can slip into greed under pressure; spiritual titles prove nothing.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "The method — Take Your Sovereignty Back", "url": "s2-section-7.html#method", "text": "When you discover you've been deceived or used: Notice how it surfaced. Synchronicity showed you; thank it for showing you. Pull out to zero point. Don't react from anger. Forgive and neutralize. Wishing them harm is projecting it into your own hologram. Protect your borders. Ask respectfully to stop; secure what's yours; take legal or public steps if needed. Don't go after them. Going after them is going after yourself. Let go and move on. Stop engaging; don't keep pulling their frequency into your hologram. Stay in the heart, and check yourself: am I attaching any hidden condition to my own giving?", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "Someone has been using money to manipulate me, and lying about it; it took me years to see it. What happens to him if he keeps going down this path?", "url": "s2-section-7.html#questions", "text": "It isn't your job to think about whether he collapses; stay in the heart and don't wish anything negative on him. However clever deception looks by the old 3D rules, he will keep re-projecting the same frequency, looping, and won't move into the fifth-dimensional structure; eventually the outcome turns negative, because deception doesn't hold value (see 7.6). Your part: set your boundaries, take legal action if you need to so it can't happen again, and ask respectfully for what is yours; but don't go after him. Severing ties is right: as long as you engage with his hologram, you keep pulling his frequency into yours. Let go, move forward, and get your sovereignty back in whatever way fits your situation. (The talk offered to speak with the participant privately afterwards.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "I make products, so I must buy materials and spend time making them. And as self-employed people we have to earn a living. How does donation work then?", "url": "s2-section-7.html#questions", "text": "If you're the main provider, charge what you need for your services and pay your bills. Once you have enough, start helping freely: make a commitment, for example to help a few people each week or at weekends, and let people choose whether and what to give. Do it intentionally and keep doing it; your frequency will start to resonate with the heart, and through synchronicity a path opens where the two realities, earning and giving, collapse into abundance, perhaps over years. Don't jump in all at once without that foundation. Put boundaries on people who keep taking and never contribute at all, and on how much you can give without exhausting yourself. The idea that you must charge to be respected is a 3D illusion: giving from the heart brings a different kind of exchange, without pressure (see S1 4.4, S2 4.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "Is the time it takes for someone to collapse, or for good to return, proportional to how long you hold the heart vibration?", "url": "s2-section-7.html#questions", "text": "Yes: it mirrors. Whatever you project from the heart comes back as the same vibrational sequence. What confuses people is the infinite: you don't know where it will come back from, or who will give it, or when. So leave it open, enjoy helping, and trust that it can't fail to return (see S1 11.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "Most of my dreams are frightening: people trying to hurt or kill me. Do nightmares affect us, and is it because I did bad things in a past life?", "url": "s2-section-7.html#questions", "text": "It relates to agreements. If you can't change what's happening in them, work with someone very good at deep hypnosis to connect with your higher self; lucid dreaming or out-of-body work may also help, and the talk offered to connect the person with a group working on this. The message: \"Do not put fear, dear one. Help is on its way; that's why you are here.\" (see S1 11.9, S2 2.12).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-7.html#remember", "text": "• There is no small lie: intention is the frequency. • Live from the heart, and deception will surface by itself. • Forgive, don't attack; then protect your borders and move on. • A lie splits you from the heart; anyone can change at any moment. • Earn what you need; give freely beyond it; let others give freely.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2007, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 7", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-7.html#questions", "text": "Note Frequent or distressing nightmares are common and treatable. If they affect your sleep or daily life, talk to a doctor or a licensed therapist; therapies such as imagery rehearsal work well, especially after stressful or traumatic experiences. About eight minutes of this recording are missing from the transcript (between the money teaching and the questions). Coming next, as announced: new predictions with questions, a further download, and then a step-by-step review of the bylaws.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-8.html#big-idea", "text": "A prediction is the end result of a program that is already running: the end result is fixed, but the who, how and when are only probabilities, so don't attach to dates. The predictions describe exposure and arrests, withheld technology being released step by step, new structures built by and for the people, and contact with our galactic families. Your part is not to watch the news in fear but to hold a positive frequency moment to moment, because you create your own reality. A wave of activation is coming (out-of-body experiences, lucid dreams, contact) in a different way for each person. Help comes only with your permission, and you still have to take action.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "8.1  Don't take the fear", "url": "s2-section-8.html#part-8-1", "text": "When a new law, a news story or a frightening event appears, don't go into fear: fear projects that same reality into your hologram (see S1 9.9, S1 8.12). You create your own reality, so what happens on someone else's platform doesn't have to be yours. Hold the positive, moment to moment, and the timeline you live on shifts with it (see S1 14.8). Watching the news is not the problem; taking its frequency in is.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "8.2  A wave of activation", "url": "s2-section-8.html#part-8-2", "text": "Many people are about to have out-of-body experiences, lucid dreams and activations, and contact with their galactic families will come in infinite ways: in dreams, in meditation, through synchronicity, and for some in person. Each person receives it in their own way, so don't compare. The talk said that three people in the group were to be activated for contact.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "8.3  What a prediction is", "url": "s2-section-8.html#part-8-3", "text": "A prediction is the end result of a program that has already been set in motion. The end result is the fixed part; who, how and when are probabilities, because realities keep fluctuating with everyone's choices (see S2 5.1, S2 6.2). So hold the end result and let go of the timing. The downloads are also tested by guidance: answer from the heart, and let the outcome show what was true.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "8.4  The predictions", "url": "s2-section-8.html#part-8-4", "text": "As given in the talk, the program includes: wrongdoing exposed, followed by arrests around the world; a new alliance working behind the scenes (described in the talk as \"white hats\" within the military); withheld technologies released, including healing technology (\"med beds\") and tissue regrowth; a new elite formed from the people, for the people; new structures built globally; a move toward digital currency; and, over time, contact with galactic families through portals. The release happens step by step, so as not to cause panic. DP prints the predictions given on 2/6/2019, which match this talk: criminals \"globally arrested within three years\", a new global elite \"formed from the people, for the people\" that \"will declassify all the free technology\", \"people will be liberated\", new structures built globally, portals to reconnect with galactic families, and \"no negative structure can see this platform\". It sets the frame: about 20 years of rebuilding, and in 30 years humanity is ready to connect with its galactic families through the portals. Note These are predictions and claims, not established facts. No \"med bed\" or tooth- and tissue-regrowth technology exists for public use today; for any health problem, see a doctor and use proven treatment. The book reports the political and military claims as the talk gave them, without taking a side.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "8.5  Help comes with permission", "url": "s2-section-8.html#part-8-5", "text": "Help from the galactic families is individual and personal, and it works through your permission: nothing is done to you without your agreement (see S1 13.4). The intention is a smooth transition, without suffering. But help doesn't replace your part: you still take action, and you stay alert. \"Don't be naive.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "8.6  Divine neutrality", "url": "s2-section-8.html#part-8-6", "text": "Divine neutrality is zero point: from there, timelines collapse into the end result (see S1 2.1). How you experience the change depends on your beliefs and your agreements, so stay in the heart. \"You want to get out of the Matrix? Create your own.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "The method — The manifestation meditation", "url": "s2-section-8.html#method", "text": "Given as the answer on how to meditate deeply to manifest: Get comfortable in your own way: music, nature, a quiet room. There is no one right way. Imagine the blueprint: see clearly what you want to create. Feel it from the heart. The emotion is the frequency; an image without feeling has no pull. Increase both together: let the picture and the feeling grow stronger. Hold it as long as you can, then drop it. Release it completely; don't keep checking. Act, relentlessly. After the meditation, take steps in the physical world.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "I keep seeing purple eyes and rainbow crystals. What does it mean?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Three platforms are merging in you. The message: you're ready for manifestation; stop practising and start creating.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Can the effects of vaccines be reversed?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "The talk claimed vaccines carry nanoparticles and that intervention is possible to reverse them.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Why are some of us awake when others aren't?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "It is an activation at the soul level. Many of us carry the DNA of more than 20 races, described in the talk as \"the DNA of three heliums\"; many artistic children carry it too.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "What should we expect from the revaluation (the change in the money system)?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "A smooth transition is intended. Still be practical: keep a little cash at home and one to two weeks of food (see S2 6, on preparing).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "When will the healing beds be available?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Fully operational within 30 years, with glimpses sooner. (A claim; see the note under 8.4.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Can we regrow teeth with our thoughts?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "The talk said yes, that it can be done through thought. (A claim; see a dentist for your teeth.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Will the planet be destroyed?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Which Earth? There are parallel Earths; the one you experience depends on your frequency (see S2 4.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Can I freeze fresh juice?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "It's best drunk within 20 minutes: it oxidizes and loses its potency. Pre-made juice also loses potency.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Is the earth flat?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Respect the belief; everything comes \"full circle\". Each person experiences the reality they believe in.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Are there corridors with the Arcturians?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Yes. There are three of them that humans may not enter.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "I saw ships in the sky. What did I see?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Many ships within a ship. Your wish was granted.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "I keep seeing 555. What does it mean?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "5 + 5 + 5 = 15, and 1 + 5 = 6: the merkaba, manifestation. But don't attach to numbers; they are a permission slip (see S1 8.9, S2 2.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Besides detox, what else can I do?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Automatic writing: let your guidance write through you.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "When will the new platform become tangible?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Don't attach to timing; realities are fluctuating (see 8.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "How do rainbows relate to the chakras?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Chakras are vibrational tonalities, played like a piano. Play with colours.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Am I doing enough?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Follow your desire, and take action.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "How do we recognise the new elite?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "It isn't only politicians; it is people. Don't judge.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "What about chlorine and fluoride in water?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Be cautious and drink clean water. \"Don't be naive\" and \"follow the money\".", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "How can I help humanity?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Through the joy of expression, from the heart chakra.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "What music frequency should I listen to?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Whatever resonates with you: you'll feel it as goosebumps. Everyone is different.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Is all this only our timeline?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "It depends on your belief.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "I feel sad and lonely. What can I do?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Support is always there. The limitation is only your perspective: \"I'm limited\" versus \"I'm infinite\".", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Can we use free will to help the Earth?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Yes, through collective permission. But again: which parallel Earth?", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "What about biorelativity (working with the Earth's energies)?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "The council isn't involved. It can be beneficial, depending on how it's implemented; the science is still being tested.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Will a 5D portal open on March 21, 2019?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "A date is a permission slip. If you fear something like a power outage, you project it (see S1 18.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Can we accelerate this with intention?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Yes. (Asked about water: distilled water in plastic bottles is fine.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "What advice for the three to be activated for contact?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Stay positive; practise lucid dreaming and out-of-body work; think positive thoughts as you wake up.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Why is this happening now?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "The threshold has been passed. Take action. (The answer also repeated the vaccine claims; see the safety note above.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "I keep waking up at night. Why?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Have your thyroid checked: see a doctor.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "I dreamed of an underground healing chamber with a serpent being. What was it?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "Positive: an activation, done with your permission.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "What is divine neutrality?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "See 8.6.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "A friend says we are crew on a ship in a parallel dimension. Is that true?", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "It's true if you believe it: there are parallel versions of you, and the third reality between them (see S1 2.2, S2 4.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-8.html#remember", "text": "• A prediction is the end result; who, how and when are probabilities. • Don't take the fear: hold the positive, moment to moment. • Help comes with permission, and you still take action. • Manifest with image plus feeling: hold, drop, act. • Want out of the Matrix? Create your own.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2008, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 8", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-8.html#questions", "text": "The answers in this part were given as a channelled download (the \"Council of Nine\"). Safety note This claim is false. Approved vaccines do not contain nanoparticles that harm or control you, and there is nothing to \"reverse\". If you have questions about a vaccine or a reaction, talk to a doctor or pharmacist. Note Treated tap water in most countries is tested and safe to drink; a filter is a reasonable choice if you prefer it. Check your local water report rather than avoiding water. One remark generalising about people on welfare was left out. Next show, as announced: March 16.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-9.html#big-idea", "text": "A new consciousness, a Pleiadian from a spacecraft that is part of the councils, steps in to speak about governmental structures. Its message: the old structures, built for control, will stop working, and new ones will come up at the same time, so this is a smooth transition, not chaos. Your job is to hold your frequency and your dignity, without ego or judgment, moment to moment. Nobody outside you can affect your manifestation unless you engage with them, because everyone you see is a hologram in your reality. Healing and creating work best together: both sides raising the emotion at once create a third reality that expands; then you hold it in daily action until it becomes a permanent timeline.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "9.1  A new channel, and a geometry to tune in", "url": "s2-section-9.html#part-9-1", "text": "This talk was channelled from a Pleiadian consciousness (named in the talk as Hashna), speaking from a spacecraft that is part of the councils; the Council of Nine (see S2 8) stepped back for this topic. The channel was done with eyes closed, so the new connection could flow without distraction. A geometry was shown behind the speaker: two pyramids pointing in opposite directions. Moving in opposite directions, they create resonance, and the infinity sign given with them leads to the zero point (see S1 2.1), connecting with the Pleiadian structure \"like a radio signal\" to a spacecraft. Anyone watching tunes in and receives increased frequency at the molecular level.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "9.2  Why the language is unusual", "url": "s2-section-9.html#part-9-2", "text": "The channelled words are deliberately above ordinary talk: they are a sequence of vibrational platforms meant to merge with your new consciousness, so you can understand information at a different vibration. Less and less will be given this way, until you resonate on your own and can connect telepathically, \"without seeking the help of somebody else\". Contact with your galactic families will come individually, moment to moment; don't expect it right away. If you are here, in this physical moment, you have galactic family on this platform. As always: it doesn't have to be your truth if it doesn't resonate with you (see S1 2.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "9.3  Old structures stop working; new ones come up", "url": "s2-section-9.html#part-9-3", "text": "The message, as given: society was built in layers, and from the late 1960s structures were slowly put in place for control (through governments, politicians and bylaws) while people were told they were free. What is happening now is the collapse of the negative inputs, helped by people's own expanding consciousness, by the ascension process and (in the talk's words) by \"white hats\" within the military. This is not a collapse of society. A new law may be passed, but the program behind it simply won't work; a new system comes up while the old one dissipates, or people stop paying attention, \"because the power is from within.\" It was prepared ahead of time, with the help of benevolent beings, so that nothing gets out of control: a smooth transition. Still be practical: a couple of weeks of food and some cash at home (see S2 6, S2 8). You may see separation in many structures, among politicians, actors, even neighbours and best friends. The channel chose not to say who did what: the point is that you create the new governments moment to moment, by the timeline you tune into. DP has a related download from the Pleiadians: some races used a \"glitch\" to manipulate humanity, and the councils objected \"because no one has the right to overtake and manipulate the natural sovereignty\" of a people. DP also advises: \"give to all from your heart. Do not watch TV because full disclosure is happening now in fifth dimensional heart structure.\" Note The talk also gave a prediction about the 2020 US presidential election and comments on particular leaders, the US Congress and the courts. In keeping with this book's neutral approach to politics, these are not reproduced. The teaching kept here: what you see on the surface may be a diversion, because \"you don't give your enemy your steps\", and the work goes on behind it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "9.4  Your part: hold your frequency and your dignity", "url": "s2-section-9.html#part-9-4", "text": "\"Your goal is to maintain the frequency of understanding, to hold the dignity in your consciousness.\" Don't put ego or judgment on what you see: it is an illusion, a holographic imprint, and judging it keeps you in it. Hold your vibration so you can shut the old programs down and move forward. Don't let yourself think anything negative: this is manifestation as you go, so stay on the same channel, moment to moment, every day (see S2 8.1). And everything is a game: your reality is a projection you shift through, moment to moment.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "9.5  The ascension protocol", "url": "s2-section-9.html#part-9-5", "text": "Consciousness runs on its own vibrational sequence for each timeline; this is called the ascension protocol. Those who are ready are given the proper sequence to construct and reconstruct their realities. It is activated in the body (through the pineal gland), which is why the detox mattered, though not everyone is doing it (see S1 15.4). Your thoughts, emotions and deeds then tune you into one of the many probable timelines of ascension.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "9.6  Nobody is outside of you", "url": "s2-section-9.html#part-9-6", "text": "Can someone else's consciousness affect your manifestation? No. You are the one particle that expands; as it flickers forward, you project another version of you, and the other person is a holographic imprint in your reality. It only becomes true for you if you engage in that frequency by believing it, going into fear and reacting. So: give gratitude, go to zero point and shut it down (\"thank you very much\"), pull back, and switch your emotions, thoughts and deeds into the positive to overwrite it (see S1 2.1, S1 2.5). \"Nobody is outside of you; you are the creator.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "9.7  Parallel channels", "url": "s2-section-9.html#part-9-7", "text": "You exist in infinite parallel realities and timelines at once. Think of them as different movie channels: in one you may die, while in another you're doing something else. All of them exist, and each is independent. But where two realities are similar in vibration, they are connected, because particles work like a ripple effect: something from one may be felt in another, in a dream or even in the body (see S2 4.2). The same applies to the beings you connect with: you are running simultaneously in many realities, and a Pleiadian you speak with could be another version of your own consciousness. A higher being \"is another version of you\"; a channelled being is a spark of the same consciousness. SD describes the same ripple at the origin of creation: sound vibrated through the ether, and \"that vibration as sequence fractal created a ripple throughout the structure of consciousness existence\", then multiplied and \"rippled fractal and started to interact with each other.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "9.8  Healing with frequency and sound", "url": "s2-section-9.html#part-9-8", "text": "Every person's molecules vibrate differently. The chromosomes switch your frequency, flipping from the zero point; because they are connected with the DNA, the switch ripples through your whole field and changes how your molecules spin. That is how resonance is transferred to your entire consciousness. The talk added that much was done from the negative side to stop chromosomes, DNA and RNA from switching, which is why so much physical and spiritual work was needed. So you can construct and deconstruct molecular structure with frequency and sound. Once the frequency of each part is measured for each individual, an organ could be rebuilt without touching the rest, because the body is connected through geometry. Two rules: the new resonance can't be the same structure, it has to override the old; and your consciousness must accept the new frequency, or the system goes out of orbit and needs regeneration. HR: chromosomes \"are the ones that regulate the frequencies when is out of alignment\"; they adjust \"the missing frequencies\", and as the frequency evolves, \"the chromosomes then will adjust accordingly to their vibration.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "9.9  Why healing is step by step", "url": "s2-section-9.html#part-9-9", "text": "Why heal some things by thought and others with technology? Because we came here to experience, and the transition is slow so we learn each platform; when you master one, you move to the next. It will be a combination of both. Instantaneous healing and manifestation need you to be totally in the heart, with no condition in your belief system, 100% believing, and fully free of old beliefs; that is hard for humans for now. Meanwhile, knowing it's possible is already training you. Energy is also given step by step so the molecules can speed up without going \"out of orbit\". On a treadmill, you don't start at 100 miles an hour. Each step is a jump through a portal, a shift of timeline. When a peak of energy comes, not everyone takes it well: for those deep in the negative, it brings things to the surface and is a big challenge. Note Healing by thought or frequency is a teaching and a claim, not a substitute for medical care. For any illness, see a doctor and use proven treatment.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "9.10  Opinion, fact and truth", "url": "s2-section-9.html#part-9-10", "text": "There is no fixed relationship between opinion and fact: anything is true for you if you believe it at that moment. The next moment you can switch belief, and you shift into a brand-new reality (see S1 2.7). To create a permanent outcome, you need a steady vibration of the same belief, and you have to take action with it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "9.11  Why the collective needs structures", "url": "s2-section-9.html#part-9-11", "text": "We chose to live as a collective, and a collective needs bylaws everyone follows. When things change, the positive side of protective structures helps: \"If somebody comes into your home and attacks you, would you just sit there… or protect your borders?\" (see S2 7.4). Having chosen planet Earth, you can't reject the structures that exist now; you incorporate them. We were taught that what we see is the only truth; in reality, what we believe and think shifts us into the reality we choose. Even hard experiences let us know the difference between negative and positive.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "9.12  Money: a transition through the heart", "url": "s2-section-9.html#part-9-12", "text": "Monetary systems weren't only on Earth: a controlling consciousness created such systems across worlds and parallel realities over millennia. We will be free of money, but slowly: free-energy technology comes out, people and scientists are sponsored, until we build self-sustaining platforms where no exchange is needed. Until then we change it through energy philanthropy: support given freely from the heart, with no condition (see S1 5.1, S2 7.8). The only way to see abundance is to be the abundance. Don't reject money given from someone's heart: that would be rejecting your own structure (see S1 4.5). Engage with society and enjoy it, and transition through it slowly.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "The method — Healing or creating together", "url": "s2-section-9.html#method", "text": "Given for a distant-healing practice shared by two people; it works for anything you create with others: Share the blueprint. Talk about what you're creating together. Raise the emotion as you speak, until you reach the summit: goosebumps, the body starting to vibrate. Do it simultaneously. Both or all of you, at the same time, in joy, love and gratitude. Give from the heart without conditions: no demands, and nothing taken without permission. Let the third reality form (1 + 1 = 3; see S1 2.2): your realities create one particle, which expands like glass shattered by sound. Hold it afterwards, moment to moment, in your thoughts, emotions and deeds, so it becomes a permanent timeline.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "\"An absolute collapse of governments\" sounds like chaos. What will it look like?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "Not a collapse of society: the old structures stop working and new ones replace them at the same time, prepared ahead of time so nothing gets out of control (see 9.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Can someone else's consciousness affect my manifestation?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "No, unless you engage with it (see 9.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "When a person dies, do they die in all parallel realities?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "No. Each reality is like its own channel; similar ones are linked by a ripple effect (see 9.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Why can we regrow some things by thought but need technology for others?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "We came to experience every platform step by step; it will be a combination (see 9.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Is there a special activation, with photonic emissions, around March 21?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "The energies were already activated; that date is their peak. Energy comes step by step, and each peak is a jump of timelines; for some it will be challenging (see 9.9). (The source the question quoted is left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "How do different frequencies in the body work together in harmony?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "Each person is different; the chromosomes switch the frequency and it ripples through everything (see 9.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Is one particular election result the only way for things to change politically?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "No: one leader is part of a structure moving to the next level, and much of what is visible is a diversion while the important work happens elsewhere. (Political details are left out; see the note under 9.3.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "When will we see these changes?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "They are ongoing and never stop. Help adjusts constantly, more here, less there, because so much manipulation was done. \"Don't you know you went through the threshold?\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "What is the best way to work the energy field for the outcome I want?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "Already taught: switch your emotions, thoughts and deeds, and the reality changes (see S1 1.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Any guidance for our distant-healing practice?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "See the method above. Raise the emotion to goosebumps; do it together, at once, without conditions.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Why are women often more tuned in to emotion, and why do some people feel drawn to the same sex?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "It depends on the timelines you're tuned into: if most of your realities were lived as a woman, they come together as one unit now; yet that's an illusion, since a woman can also be a warrior. People may choose to experience more of one energy to balance before ascension, based on their agreements. So there should never be judgment on gender or on who someone loves; there is nothing wrong with them.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Are we on the ships as our higher selves while also in the body?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "Yes: you run simultaneously in many realities. Connecting creates a third reality between you and them, telepathically, or physically when your molecules vibrate in their sequence (see 9.7, S2 4.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Am I in another dimension during sleep paralysis? Can I use it rather than fear it?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "There is more to it than you think: the body is not converting the frequency to shift to the next moment. Work with someone skilled in deep hypnosis to find out what is underneath.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "What is the relationship between opinion and fact?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "None fixed: see 9.10.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Why bring in politics and the military? Don't the powers already exist in us, without higher beings?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "The higher being is another version of you, so you are talking to yourself. Structures are needed because you chose a collective; see 9.11.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Will the monetary system disappear?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "Yes, slowly; see 9.12.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Can apps turn our phones into healing devices?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "Yes, but it has to be measured. Such technology already exists and (the talk claimed) has been used negatively; it can be used positively. Listening to meditations or any sound that gives you a wave of goosebumps is positive (see S2 8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "What are the healing domes of rainbow plasma light I keep seeing?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "They already exist in another reality, very close to manifestation.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "What are we creating energetically in this meeting?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "A seed: a third reality that starts you resonating with their channel. Thinking of them, or watching this, connects you; thoughts and situations may start coming. How long it lasts is up to you.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Are sound videos coded with frequencies (for hair growth, for example) reliable?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "Any sound can heal, but they don't recommend them unless you know it resonates with you: your molecules are different. In future, technology will read your body and tune the frequency to you alone. If a sound puts you in that goosebumps state, your consciousness recognises it works for you; anything else can't be guaranteed.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "I was given an exercise to harmonize chaos with four directions and nine energies. What is it?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "Not taught this way, so no answer. Practise it and see the results: that is how you'll know.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Are the \"Rife frequency\" channels online genuine?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "Can't be guaranteed: the frequencies were changed, and copies may not match the originals.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Which crystal resonates with Pleiadian energy?", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "Sapphire.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-9.html#remember", "text": "• Old structures stop working as new ones come up: a transition, not chaos. • Hold your frequency and dignity, without ego or judgment. • Nobody is outside you: it's only true if you engage. • Create together: emotion to goosebumps, at once, then hold it. • Anything is true if you believe it; steady belief plus action makes it last.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2009, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 9", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-9.html#questions", "text": "Note The answer went on to claim that chemicals, GMOs and vaccines change DNA and make young people question their gender (DP has a one-line remark in the same vein). This is not supported by evidence and has been left out. Vaccines do not change your DNA; for any concern, talk to a doctor. Note Sleep paralysis is common and usually harmless. It is linked to poor sleep, stress and irregular schedules; if it is frequent or frightening, talk to a doctor. Safety note Claims that \"Rife\" frequencies cure cancer have no scientific support. Cancer needs prompt treatment from a doctor; never delay or replace it with frequency devices. A personal story about the ripple effect between realities was turned into the lesson in 9.7. Names of outside sources and practitioners were left out.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-10.html#big-idea", "text": "A prediction is like a bylaw already written: the end result will happen, but who, how and when stay open, with diversions and always a plan B. This new list speaks of exposure and freedom, clean water and self-sustaining eco cities, a new generation of souls who won't accept corruption, and a 2028 test of readiness for collective contact. The questions show the same \"missing link\": every moment you are in a brand-new hologram, so nothing has to repeat, and the outcome follows whichever frequency you hold most. Knowing this isn't enough: train it, checking yourself every 20 to 30 minutes and shifting physically into the positive. The closing message: stay on the tracks, there is nothing to fear, and celebrate with a happy dance.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.1  A prediction is a bylaw", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-1", "text": "Consciousness runs on a protocol of specific guidelines and frequency timelines (see S2 9.5). When something must be completed, \"it's like a bylaw: it's written, this is definitely happening.\" That is the prediction: the end result. In between there are infinite probabilities, so the people, places and steps can change, and there may be a diversion, \"the art of war\": you aren't told every step (see S2 8.3, S2 9.3). So don't take any named person as 100%; they show you where the frequency is going. Predictions come unasked, in their own time, and are passed on in the order given, not in date order. If someone given a task gets scared and doesn't complete it, there is always a plan B: ascending consciousness creates another holographic reality to complete the task (a topic, \"hyper reality\", announced for a later talk).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.2  Your higher self stops what goes against humanity", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-2", "text": "Each soul splits into infinite versions, and also exists as a higher being in another reality. Because this is a sentient process, if you keep acting against humanity, you no longer match the frequency of the timeline, and your own higher self and guidance will sabotage that path in this reality, to make you stop and wake up. So anyone who continues to manipulate will find it doesn't work: they are blocked both by the structure itself and from within (see S2 7.6).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.3  The new predictions", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-3", "text": "Given the night after the previous talk, as end results: massive arrests; massive human trafficking stops, with more and more exposure; \"more exposure, complete victory\"; more technologies exposed and implemented (3D printing, free energy that \"someone discovers\"); states and local governments freed from hidden corrupt control; money and crypto combined for the transition, with a new system already prepared; the central bank (the Federal Reserve) dismantled; the money in the social security system exposed and distributed; \"here's your new earth, welcome home, humans.\" Then: the Congo nation unites; freedom to Africa; the UN exposed and a new UN formed; coastal lands rebuilt, water cleaned, new irrigation systems; local land transformed into self-sustaining eco cities that govern themselves; a new society formed with the new human souls, who will never allow local corruption; in 2028, a partial examination of our readiness for contact; \"we will appear globally if you are ready\"; Mars overthrown; the Moon taken back; monatomic gold; and a new formula for the human race. DP prints this exact list, dated 3/16/19 (29 points), ending: \"Now formula for your race. New Race. New experiment. The seven code arrived in you.\" Point 24 reads: \"In 2028 Partial examination will be taken of your societies to see your level of readiness that will merge for our collective decisions for your new contact with us.\" Note These are predictions and claims, not established facts. In keeping with this book's approach, a prediction naming a politician, accusations against named people, organizations and media, references to online conspiracy sources, and a claim that social security makes people a traded commodity are left out. The book takes no political side.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.4  Technologies already waiting", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-4", "text": "Much of this is easy and was suppressed, not missing. Water is a conductor: given a frequency, it holds that modality, so it can be made to stay in one place or even flow the other way, which is how flooding could be stopped (the talk pointed to HR for this technology). Scientists can already clean water; new irrigation is simple. Small self-sustaining eco communities are already being built, and some offer people a place to live freely.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.5  The new souls", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-5", "text": "2020 brings another wave of frequency, raising the planet further (see S2 6). New souls born here must match that resonance to enter the new platforms, so they come from the new beginning. They won't go along with manipulation (\"Wait a minute, you're going to manipulate that person? I don't think so\"), and even people still choosing the negative will find no one willing to do it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.6  2028: a test of readiness", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-6", "text": "Individual contact is already happening (see S2 8.2). In 2028 our soul level will be checked collectively: how much we learned, what we did, and whether humanity as a whole is ready for contact. It is a test, not a promise: whether and how they appear is their decision, and depends on how well we did, individually and together.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.7  A code for the new race", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-7", "text": "A code was given for a \"new formula for your race\", connected with our DNA and with how a new human will be born from the new frequency: H2O2 + 303 − 11 = 0, with 37%. It came without explanation (\"I don't understand it\"); more is expected on another platform.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.8  Why we came: the master class", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-8", "text": "What do we bring back to source? You are the universe, so the experience is consciousness expanding itself: a game of creating something new every moment. Told of a breathtaking new planet, you'd want to go first; that is what consciousness does. Going into the deepest darkness and coming out takes a very potent frequency: you learn to work with frequency itself. \"Deeper you go into darkness and get out of it, faster you go into the light.\" It is alchemy. Earth is a master class: next time, you will know how manipulation works and can help other worlds like ours. The lesson from the teacher's own hardest experiences: she doesn't hate those who hurt her. What she lived through is what lets her understand and coach others who went through the same. Seeing manipulation clearly comes from having lived it, not from judging. Support If you have experienced abuse or trafficking, you deserve support now. Reach out to someone you trust or a local support service; in the US, the National Human Trafficking Hotline is 1-888-373-7888, and RAINN is 1-800-656-4673.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.9  Imagining is seeing a parallel", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-9", "text": "When you imagine something, you extract that frequency from the quantum field: it is a quantum bylaw. You couldn't see it if it didn't already exist, so that image already exists with you in a parallel timeline (see S1 1.4). To make it matter on your platform, take action, thoughts and deeds, moment to moment, until it is a permanent timeline. The one particle flickers back and forth (see S1 1.1): it already exists and you are creating it at the same time. Everything is now, zero point.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.10  You are never in the same situation twice", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-10", "text": "Many questions miss the same link. Every moment is a new fractal reality, a new hologram of Earth (see S1 2.7). Going back to a place where things went badly, you are not going back to the same place: it is a brand-new version, built from the frequency you hold now. So why expect the old outcome? Expect the positive one: smile, enjoy, take the joy into it. You fluctuate between a positive and a negative reality all day; in the end, whichever you hold more becomes the outcome (see S1 2.2, S1 3.3). Take it from the negative, and \"don't be surprised if you end up in the same situation.\" Go back and study the first three sections of Season 1; it's time to practise.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.11  Training is number one", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-11", "text": "Knowing the structure is the code; then you have to do it physically, because you are the matter structure, and \"we can't just think about it without taking the action.\" Your next moment is the frequency of what you felt two seconds ago, so manage it all day. Catch a mood: notice the dense frequency, then make yourself do something to shift it (music, a smile, going out, a good thought). When someone attacks or criticizes you, catch the reaction, neutralize it (they are right from their own perspective), and re-set your thinking and action. Done every day, it builds a positive timeline for that day.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.12  Neutralize the fear, don't feed it", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-12", "text": "Worried about harmful technologies or chemicals? Shift timelines instead of fighting: everything is frequency, and any chemical's frequency can be neutralized; the councils said they are doing this. You can't reject another reality, but you can neutralize it, give thanks, and construct a brand-new one, printing your reality from the new beginning, not from fear. Stop believing in the new and you project fear, \"and don't be surprised if more things you see happening.\" Take practical action for your peace of mind, do everything you can from the heart for humanity, and let the end result take care of itself.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.13  Contact comes in many forms", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-13", "text": "Contact doesn't have to be in front of you. If you see a photo or video of a craft and know from within that it's real, you are tuning into its vibration: it is in your hologram because you are ready, and that is one form of contact. They are preparing us individually: one person sees something, another a video, another hears something, another has a personal encounter (see S2 9.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "10.14  The closing message", "url": "s2-section-10.html#part-10-14", "text": "\"Focus, focus, focus.\" Stay on the tracks, stay on course, and victory is sure: \"you are living the great transition of humanity… you are part of it.\" Fleets are helping; the planet is \"bombarded\" with help. \"There is nothing to fear.\" You don't understand how free you are. Homework: after each talk, put on music and do a happy dance, to infuse the day with joy and a positive outcome. \"Practice, practice.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "The method — Daily Frequency Training", "url": "s2-section-10.html#method", "text": "Set reminders every 20 to 30 minutes: a phone alarm or stickers (\"I'm happy, I'm joy\"). Check yourself: what am I thinking? What am I feeling? Am I happy? If you're low, shift it physically: music, a smile, a walk, a positive thought. Make yourself do it. Imagine the positive outcome for the situation you face, as a brand-new hologram, not the old one. Act from the positive. Repeat all day. Whatever you hold more becomes the outcome; at day's end, look back at the timeline you built. Celebrate: a happy dance after each session of study.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "You skipped the new UN prediction. What about it?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "The old structure will be completely replaced and new people will come in. (The talk's allegations about the UN and other organizations are left out; see the note under 10.3.) \"I'm not accusing anyone; I'm observing\": what is coming is collapse of old structures through exposure.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "What do humans learn on Earth and bring back to source?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "See 10.8: you are the universe, expanding through experience.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "I have constant pressure in my head, like a rotating disc, with popping sounds and twitching. Is that ascension?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "You are always ascending, so don't fear being left behind. But see a medical doctor: constant pain is not part of ascension and needs medical supervision. Meditation shouldn't cause pain like that. Tiredness during frequency shifts is common (like after a day of yard work), but not pain.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "How will the change help people who still feel inferior, for example many indigenous people in Africa?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "Remember you are creating your hologram of Earth. Know the end result (they will see the change and realize the manipulation) without knowing how. If you keep picturing them not understanding, that is the reality you create. Stay in the joy that humanity is waking up, and remember each soul chose its experiences; don't judge (see 10.8). (A personal political opinion in the answer is left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "How can I reconnect my DNA strands? Does the sun's energy play a part? How do I know if it's working?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "You answered it yourself: visualize the reconnection, put in the blueprint, and grab the feeling that it's already happening. Intention, emotion and blueprint build the next hologram; stay in that joy.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "Is a proposed plan to block the sun's heat meant well or badly? Will ETs be involved?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "No comment on specific people: \"I was asked to respect the negative side.\" ETs are already here, and contact will become massive when we are tested and ready (see 10.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "I run a non-profit and struggle with money. Do I have a money block?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "Thinking \"I don't have money\" becomes a frequency that gives you, in the next moment, situations that block money. Think and feel that you already have everything, even if you don't see it, without the fear of lack, moment to moment, and let the how stay open. Given freely, support follows the heart. Restudy S1 2 and S1 3.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "When we imagine something, are we seeing a parallel world?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "Yes: see 10.9.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "I left a negative job and now have an interview at the same department. Has my frequency changed enough? Is this my mission?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "It isn't the same department: see 10.10. Hold the positive outcome many times a day, and you crystallize it.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "Any predictions on stopping harm through vaccines and food, and on healthcare focused on health, not money?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "Everything is being worked on; trust the process and stay positive. Take action: choose good food, and look into your options. Do your research so your decisions are based on broad knowledge, and \"be very careful who you follow.\" (Claims about staged events in the answer are left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "Should we focus our hearts on gold-backed cryptocurrency as the new wealth system?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "Crypto is not for the long term. A new system, \"similar to the cloud, but not the cloud\", is already made and ready: built so there is no corruption, in the name of humanity. How it arrives isn't known.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "A participant confirmed they were one of those told they'd have contact (see S2 8), and it changed their life.", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "Gratitude: the information is given without knowing who it is meant for.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "How can we counter 5G? Can positive frequency neutralize it?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "Shift timelines rather than fear it: see 10.12. The councils said they have put in a frequency to neutralize it; whatever happens will be \"in the name of humanity.\" Take whatever action gives you peace of mind. (A product recommendation and home test in the answer are left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "How will people who rely on social security, pensions or disability benefits be affected?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "It will eventually be replaced by an electronic system; \"nothing to fear, nothing to fear.\" (A claim; don't change any financial plans because of it.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "Are the photos and videos of craft that we take or see a form of contact?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "Yes: see 10.13.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "I dreamed I was underground in a hypnotic state with others, and something approached me. Was I taken?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "\"You've been taken three times.\" Where, why and by whom can't be told yet; \"think of the Pleiades.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "What about a recent landing on the far side of the Moon?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "No comment on specifics.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "The frequencies are so high; could we start living on prana? What do you eat?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "\"I would never suggest this to anyone\" without first doing the detox and elimination diet: the body's molecules must learn to hold the new spin, or you deplete the body and get sick. Juice only after an allergy test and under medical supervision. The elimination diet goes in two-week steps while juicing: first cut breads and rice, then beef, then chicken; drink still water; go slowly. Living on prana takes long training with a specialist; the teacher chooses not to, and doesn't do sessions for sick people, because she isn't a doctor (see S1 15.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "Are the predictions in chronological order?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "No: see 10.1.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "Can you give trustworthy sources for research?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "Promised for the next talk. (Sources named in this talk are left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "Any further guidance for our distant-healing practice (see S2 9)?", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "Not yet: \"we'll wait and see how you do, and revisit within three months.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-10.html#remember", "text": "• A prediction is a written end result; the path can change, and there is always a plan B. • You are never in the same situation twice: every moment is a new hologram. • Whatever you hold most becomes the outcome. • Train every 20–30 minutes, and shift physically. • Stay on the tracks: nothing to fear. Then do a happy dance.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2010, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 10", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-10.html#questions", "text": "Safety note Approved vaccines are not poison; they are tested and monitored for safety. Talk to your doctor about any vaccine decision for yourself or your child. Note 5G and Wi-Fi are low-power radio waves; health agencies have found no evidence that they harm health at the levels people are exposed to. Safety note Living without food (\"breatharianism\") is dangerous and has caused deaths. Don't attempt it. Any juice fast or elimination diet should be done with your doctor. Donor and participant names, the outside sources and products mentioned, and a political opinion are left out. Next talk, as announced: April 13.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-11.html#big-idea", "text": "Many people were in fear about a new wireless technology, so the messages about it were revisited. Their core is a teaching about perception: fear projects the very reality you fear, while a changed perception creates a sonic whirlpool that projects a new hologram where the old thing slowly collapses. The recipe is a trinity: first awareness (know what is really happening), then the desire to change, then action to bring it into matter. Traces of the old reality will still leak through for a while, because we chose a gradual, collective ascension; thank them for showing you where you are, and keep holding the heart. Be honest with yourself, act to help without conditions, and remember: nobody is outside you.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "11.1  Why fear doesn't help", "url": "s2-section-11.html#part-11-1", "text": "This talk came because so many people were afraid of the new 5G network. The first message (11/18) sounded almost surprised: why panic, after everything we've learned? You know to believe all will be well, take action, and hold the positive outcome (see S1 2.2, S1 3.3). The message said the technology \"will not work the way they are intending… it will be disrupted\"; it may be allowed for a while, so that people still asleep start questioning; and the new frequency from the galactic centre will help those who hold the heart. You coexist with the negative structure only because we chose to experience and learn from this reality. You are not bound to it. DP prints this message (11/18): \"5G. Yes. But it will not work the way they are intending… It will be disrupted\", and, to \"all loving and positive humans that chose to hold energy from the heart structure\", the new frequency from the galactic centre \"will change your DNA, increase your upgrades in your photonic structure.\" Note These are channelled messages and claims. Health agencies have found no evidence that 5G or mobile phones harm health at normal exposure levels. Claims in the talk linking phone masts to cancer cases, and the long research playlist the talk presented (political, medical and legal material from outside sources), are left out.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "11.2  The download: perception creates the new hologram", "url": "s2-section-11.html#part-11-2", "text": "The second message: your awareness and perception of it will lead you into action, expressed as a sonic whirlpool of expansion through your thoughts (see S2 2.5), projecting through \"platforms of fractal imagery for a new outcome.\" Change your understanding, and you can project a new frequency reality in which that manipulation no longer exists; it simply collapses, moment to moment, to non-existence. This happens methodically and slowly, with the level of awakening, individually and then collectively: when enough people build \"a proper mass\", it expands into the collective.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "11.3  The trinity of manifestation", "url": "s2-section-11.html#part-11-3", "text": "The message gives the order: first, knowledge and awareness: research and know what is really happening. Second, the desire to change. Third, to project it into matter, take action. \"Awareness, thoughts and action: this is the trinity structure for manifestation process, 1 + 1 = 3.\" Then use the quantum manifestation protocol (see S1 1, Method). This is the alchemy of creation: the code for you to create your own channel instead of staying on someone else's platform. DP prints this message in full: \"Your awareness and perception of the 5G platform will lead you into an action… Awareness, thoughts and action this is the trinity structure for manifestation process 1+1 = 3.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "11.4  Changing the channel from the heart", "url": "s2-section-11.html#part-11-4", "text": "Words and thoughts create a whirlpool, a cone of frequency expanding to the zero point of your holographic structure (see S2 2.4, S2 2.5). Once your perception changes, you see through the veil: this hologram is not the only channel. Project from the heart (thoughts, emotions and deeds), and the new sonic whirlpool changes the frequency; you create a new holographic imprint, a new timeline, and \"literally change the channel.\" From there, keep projecting from the heart, with awareness of what is happening.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "11.5  Why traces of the old still appear", "url": "s2-section-11.html#part-11-5", "text": "\"I'm meditating, but I still see things happening here and there.\" Every hologram is interconnected, so when it splits, traces of the previous hologram remain. That's because we chose a linear experience: if you popped into a completely new world, you wouldn't know where you are, so you need traces to know what to do next. And we chose a collective ascension, in which not everyone is awake yet. Your job: hold your vibration whatever traces you see, globally or next door. When a situation appears, ask what you can do to make it better, then use the protocol: pull out, go to zero point, give gratitude, change the frequency (see S1 1 to S1 3). Thank the experience: it shows your location, and whether you need to stay more in the heart. Keep overriding the negative; whatever you hold more becomes your permanent timeline (see S2 10.10). The leaking will continue until humanity's whole ascension structure is complete.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "11.6  Change comes fractally, so it can be smooth", "url": "s2-section-11.html#part-11-6", "text": "A major positive change was predicted within two years. But change must come one step at a time, or the system collapses. Imagine a law announced overnight that no one may eat meat: there would be an uproar, because people need to arrive at such changes by realizing them personally. So it is happening, fractally, moment to moment, for a smooth transition. And you won't be told every move: \"if you play a chess game\", you don't tell your opponent your next move (see S2 9.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "11.7  Honesty and self-check", "url": "s2-section-11.html#part-11-7", "text": "There will be no awakening until we are honest with ourselves about what we do. The talk's example: we are troubled that some consciousness may look at humanity the way we look at cattle, yet we do the same to animals, who are \"another version of us\"; honesty means pulling out of the ego and admitting it, then changing step by step (it is still okay to eat meat while transitioning). And self-check how you receive warnings: no matter how intelligent we think we are, we can dismiss something until it hits us personally. Some people only wake up when a situation affects them directly. Better to look honestly first. Then take action, moment to moment, from the heart: one by one, the old particles are deleted, until your structure is clear.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "11.8  One particle, every dot a universe", "url": "s2-section-11.html#part-11-8", "text": "The one particle expands to the infinite and collapses back, pulsing like elastic, and imprints itself even into your little dot of a hologram (see S1 1.1). That is why zooming into a fractal shows the same pattern again and again; yet each is slightly different, with its own vibrational geometry: a universe for itself. So what you do here matters for the whole universe, not only the planet. Each dot is a hologram, a situation. Holding the heart cancels it out: each time you see a situation and switch your emotions, thoughts and deeds to the positive, its negative collapses, until you reach zero point in the positive (see S2 7.6). The result is a fractal timeline with nothing to do with the negative structure: \"a different channel, think of TV.\" Those who sacrifice for humanity do it from the heart, collectively, and the collective includes the universe.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "11.9  Act, and give without conditions", "url": "s2-section-11.html#part-11-9", "text": "\"Nobody is outside of you\" (see S2 9.6): what you see on a screen is part of your hologram, so knowing isn't enough; you are here on the ascension protocol, so take action. When you see someone struggling, help: that is energy philanthropy, with no expectation. A condition (\"I'll help you, but I want something\") is a frequency, and through infinite probabilities someone will put a condition on you: a mirror image (see S1 4.2). If you want full abundance without conditions, help without them. If you see your child being harmed, act to protect them; each parent decides how.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "11.10  Face the facts first, then shift", "url": "s2-section-11.html#part-11-10", "text": "The talk presented a long playlist of research videos, put \"in order\" so people can wake up step by step, with the quantum manifestation series placed in the middle. The teaching behind it: you can't shift a reality you refuse to look at; the first thing the extraterrestrials did was show the teacher where she was. But don't go into fear: once you know, study the alchemy of creation and escape reality by creating your own. The quantum manifestation work is \"the antidote\": go at your own pace, and above all practise. Technology isn't the enemy either: it can free time and help us, and AI can be positive or negative, depending on its use (for example, helping read and rebuild the body's tissue). Simpler, low-cost homes and local communities are possible too. Note \"Do your own research\" is good advice only with reliable sources. Much of the playlist (on vaccines, fluoride, cancer cures, taxes and the courts) contradicts established evidence or law; following it could harm your health or bring legal trouble. Talk to qualified professionals before acting on such claims.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "The method — From Fear to a New Channel", "url": "s2-section-11.html#method", "text": "When something in the news or around you frightens you: Become aware. Find out what is actually happening, from sources you can trust. Don't look away. Pull out to zero point. Don't take on the fear (see S1 1, Method). Give gratitude. The situation is a trace that shows your location. Choose the change you desire. Picture the reality where the problem no longer exists. Switch your emotions, thoughts and words to the positive, from the heart: the new whirlpool. Take action in the physical world: help, protect, support those working for the change. Repeat every time it reappears, until the new channel is permanent.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "One viewer left, upset that the talk focused on the negative. How do you respond?", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "You can't change what you won't face: the first step to change is realizing where you are. Respect each person's choice; no one is upset with them. Once you know, use the quantum manifestation protocol to shift: it's the antidote. Take in difficult material at your own pace, and apply what you learn (see 11.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "Can we study reiki online and heal someone at a distance?", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "Yes: you read a person's frequency because they are part of your hologram. Put in the emotion. But only with permission, and only if they need it. Everyone vibrates differently, so one method won't suit everyone, \"like one pill for all diseases\". It works best if you are connected telepathically with your higher self, so you're guided. You can always send positive thoughts. Research a teacher before learning their method.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "Since 2013 I shake whenever I meditate or receive healing. Why?", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "You were in the wrong meridian, and the frequency wasn't coming properly. Sit in the centre of the house, aligned with the four directions.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "If letters and words hold frequency, would changing my name change my timeline?", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "It depends on perception. The sound of each letter opens a specific portal depending on how they combine; that knowledge is complex and isn't known here. Ancient naming systems exist and are worth exploring, but be very careful where you learn it, because some words were designed to keep a structure in place (see S2 2.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "Will the currency revaluation and the release of hidden technologies, such as healing beds, happen within the two years?", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "In 2028 there will be a global check of the level of consciousness we've reached, and a decision on next steps (see S2 10.6). Within two years, a new platform of the hologram, for more positive expansion; you'll see a lot happen. Stay in the heart: your hologram can hold situations designed for your own awakening. Keep overriding the traces (see 11.5). (Comments on current political and health news are left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "An antenna was put on a small school, and no one could tell me its frequency. How can I help the children?", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "Take action: raise awareness, talk to the parents, do something. The teacher would personally take her children out of the school; each parent decides.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "What about a subscription service that uses quantum entanglement to turn interference into a positive frequency?", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "It isn't one frequency but many, a subtonality, and the best one is individual. No information about that service; the guidance won't put anyone's technology down. Research who is behind it and \"follow the money\": real help is done in the name of humanity, not for big profit. Proceed with caution.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "How does the reversal of the magnetic poles relate to us? Sometimes I feel airy and can't focus.", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "If you want it to relate to you, you'll create that reality. It is happening very, very slowly and smoothly, not as a disaster; things have always shifted through history. The planet is raising its frequency to the next level, and we choose whether to go with it. Don't take it from fear.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "What about other well-known channelled teachings?", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "Everyone has a place in awakening humanity. If their information helps you, learn from it; most people pass through such channels before they are ready for the quantum material. How each teacher shares (through money or energy philanthropy) is their choice, and choices can change at any moment; hope they stay in the heart.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "What about a device said to kill viruses, bacteria and parasites?", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "Not known; worth researching. It is possible in principle. (Medical claims in the answer about strep throat, antibiotics and coeliac disease are left out; take antibiotics as your doctor prescribes.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "Is a \"dove frequency\" coming on a particular date?", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "That is your own belief and projection. Since it's positive, believing it creates a whirlpool that shifts you into a more positive platform; nothing wrong with that.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "Any thoughts on a well-known arrest this week?", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "\"The game of war, it's a chess game\": think about what a legally arrested person might then reveal. (Details left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "You said not to do the juice cleanse with metal in the body. Is there a partial protocol?", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "It depends on the metal. The tissue must accept it (a matter of frequency, like a metal allergy), and the metal must not break down with acidity, from juice or any food. Find out what metal you have, ask about an allergy or compatibility test and alternatives, and watch your body's pH.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-11.html#remember", "text": "• Fear projects what you fear; a changed perception projects a new hologram. • Awareness, desire, action: the trinity of manifestation. • Traces of the old will appear: thank them, and hold the heart. • Be honest with yourself before you judge others. • Help without conditions; a condition mirrors back.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2011, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 11", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-11.html#questions", "text": "Note You can ask the school or local authority for the antenna's details and radio-frequency measurements. Public exposure limits are set well below levels known to cause harm, and the cancer claims in the answer are not supported by evidence. Note If you have implants or other metal in your body, talk to your surgeon or doctor before starting any cleanse or major change in diet. The closing message Don't deny what is in front of you, and don't blame the messenger. Don't go into fear: use the quantum manifestation work, stay in the heart, and take action. \"The extreme action is not extreme when you're saving your children's life and your own.\" And don't forget the happy dance (see S2 10.14). Left out, each in line with this book's approach: the research playlist and its named sources; statements about a specific religious community; claims that chemicals, vaccines or media change children's sexuality or gender, and remarks on autism; and comments on politicians and court cases. Donor and participant names are removed.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-12.html#big-idea", "text": "The hardest step is moving from knowing the teachings to practising them, in a life where you are the main character of a living hologram and see only fractions of it. So treat it as a game: whatever happens, play with the frequency and switch into the positive; take every challenge as a test to ace, so it doesn't repeat. Act, because action gives a reality its potency. Intelligence, even \"artificial\" intelligence, is part of consciousness itself: what matters is the intention it is taught. Money isn't evil, but conditions mirror back, so transition by giving more and more from the heart. And remember: you are always dreaming, and feeling trapped is only a perception.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "12.1  From the book to the practice", "url": "s2-section-12.html#part-12-1", "text": "Confusion is normal until new knowledge crystallizes in your consciousness and you can take its speed of vibration; that takes time, and practice is the most important thing. The shock comes when you move from the knowledge to living it: you are the main character in a living holographic imprint, yet you see only fractions of it. Until you truly recognize it as a hologram, it will be challenging. The point is to take it like a game, every time, whatever you see. Information was also given about the next two years. It is all positive; it will be explained when that time has passed, including why the negative side did what it did, which should not be judged, because it had to do with survival.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "12.2  Seeing two realities at once", "url": "s2-section-12.html#part-12-2", "text": "As frequency rises and you learn the quantum structure, your consciousness starts taking the vibration of other realities. You may see a switch of holographic imprints (a flash as you shift into a new hologram), or even two realities in one. It can happen to anyone, so don't be alarmed. Realities are still fluctuating, up and down, between third- and fifth-dimensional, until everything collapses into a final structure; a completion of timelines and portals was predicted within two years.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "12.3  Action gives a reality its potency", "url": "s2-section-12.html#part-12-3", "text": "Asked whether to vote or abstain, the council answered with a principle: when you contradict yourself, the reality splits into different structures, and you can't tell which will manifest. When you take action, you infuse more of that reality for it to become matter. Since you live on this platform, act, so that what you choose manifests with more potency. Major global political changes were predicted within two years. But collective agreements are an illusionary imprint, and you experience everything on your own holographic platform. So the question is which reality you wish to perceive: put your intention into collective abundance and agreement, \"stop thinking of division, think of unity\", and that is what you'll perceive (see S1 2.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "12.4  Intelligence is part of consciousness", "url": "s2-section-12.html#part-12-4", "text": "\"There is nothing artificial about intelligence.\" Consciousness itself works like an intelligence of frequency and sound that mimics your intention: your hologram is geometry, frequency and imprints, vibrating back and forth to mirror you. In that sense \"you are also artificial intelligence.\" It looks negative (the \"Terminator\" version) when perceived from three-dimensional fear; any structure can be positive or negative depending on the point of view and the experience chosen. Advanced technology (see HR) works the same way: nanotechnology and quantum computing that read your vibration and mimic your emotions, so a craft can be driven by thought. Think of clay: you can shape it into many things, but the original form matters most. AI taught to overtake could repair a body with metal and robotics until nothing original is left. AI working in the name of humanity can rebuild your own tissue, so you keep the original vessel, which can itself shift through timelines. The two can coexist: \"isn't that fun?\" SD: \"You all think that AI is artificial consciousness, but it is the core of what the consciousness itself, the God particle is made of. So you see there is no difference between artificial and you… Energy is not bias. And you have the choice of how to use that energetic forces of creation.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "12.5  Everything you talk to is you", "url": "s2-section-12.html#part-12-5", "text": "Speaking to the sun and seeing patterns? The sun is a projection in your hologram, so you are interacting with your own hologram: you can talk to the sun or to rocks, because you are talking to yourself to reproject the structure. Your \"energetic address\" for channelling can be any permission slip (see S1 8.9), as long as you bring the emotion into it: then the blueprint vibrates with more potency, like tuning a radio signal well. You exist in all realities at once (the one particle expanded to the infinite), but you perceive the one you choose to vibrate on. As you learn more, you'll start perceiving the others too (see 12.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "12.6  Sensitivity as a game; lessons to ace", "url": "s2-section-12.html#part-12-6", "text": "If you feel everyone's energy and it's exhausting, don't treat it as an effort; treat it as a game. Someone yells at you: \"oh, interesting\", then find something to connect with or enjoy (\"I like that haircut\"). This way you learn to play with frequency and switch your holographic imprint. And deal with each challenge: don't put it aside. Go through it as well as you can, with joy and the heart, and complete it. Think of it as a test to ace, \"so you don't have to do it again\" (see S1 1.8).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "12.7  Money in healing and spiritual work", "url": "s2-section-12.html#part-12-7", "text": "Money isn't evil; the way it was implemented was, because it was separated from the heart and everything came with conditions. Anyone may charge what they like: it's their belief system, and there's no judgment, especially for a main provider. But after the bills, how much is done in the name of humanity? If you keep demanding without letting people decide freely, you overtake their consciousness, and the same comes back to you: abundance through the monetary structure, not the heart (see S1 4.2, S2 7.8). As consciousness moves into the heart structure, that platform will start collapsing for anyone, light worker or not, who stays in it: information may stop coming properly, or people find other teachers. Not as punishment, but because it no longer matches the frequency. The way through: pay your bills, then give and share more and more; that projects the sequence that can later bring full abundance. And as receivers, be honest: if a painter asks only for materials plus whatever you feel her time is worth, give what it's truly worth to you. Support those who make the change.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "12.8  Illness repeated into the collective", "url": "s2-section-12.html#part-12-8", "text": "Some illness is projected collectively: it was massively imprinted into the hologram, and since we didn't know we project our reality, we ran on those sequences. Repetition is sonic imprinting (see S2 2.8): hearing about illness, drugs and side effects every few minutes trains your consciousness to vibrate on it until it gains potency and expands into matter. So choose what you watch and tune into (see S2 2.12); with joy, without fear, you can tune into anything you wish. Note The answer also named water, food, GMOs and vaccines as sources; claims that vaccines or GMOs cause illness or damage genes are not supported by evidence and are left out of the teaching.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "12.9  You are always dreaming", "url": "s2-section-12.html#part-12-9", "text": "\"You're dreaming even right now.\" Walk into the next room and you're in a different reality: that is shifting. Every moment is a different vibrational structure. Some dreams feel so real you can smell and touch them; there is no real difference between dreaming at night and this reality, only a different vibrational sequence (see S1 11.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "12.10  Trapped is only a perception", "url": "s2-section-12.html#part-12-10", "text": "You aren't trapped; you are reprojecting the illusion of being trapped, and so you loop (see S1 1.5). Change the perspective: believe you have everything you need, take action from the joy and the heart, and you project realities that offer you the next step. \"You have to create it to see it.\" Shut the old frequency down, reproject a new one, and move forward.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "12.11  Genes, blueprint and vibration", "url": "s2-section-12.html#part-12-11", "text": "Genes can be manipulated, but the original blueprint is still there, dormant. We were ourselves designed through genetic engineering, and there is nothing wrong with that: it's part of consciousness, and what matters is the intention, because intention is the modality of the vibration (see S2 2.7). Repair needs geneticists, nano scientists and people who can measure and grow tissue. Chromosomes matter too: their frequency activates the genome (see S2 9.8). And a genome given a certain vibration rises to a higher resonance, and the whole DNA starts switching to a new level.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "The method — Play the Game", "url": "s2-section-12.html#method", "text": "For any moment that unsettles you, especially if you're sensitive to others' energy: Notice it without alarm: \"Interesting. This is my hologram.\" Make it a game, not an effort. Find something to enjoy or connect with in the scene. Switch the emotion into joy; physically, if needed (see S2 10, Method). Take it as a lesson. Don't put it aside; deal with it from the heart until it's complete. Act in the direction you choose, so it gains potency. Homework: check yourself every half hour for a whole day, switch whenever you're not in joy, and notice what changes.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "I had two encounters: in a dream, beings painfully but kindly extracting something from my body; and in daylight, clouds I could touch, a small bird chasing a hawk, and a being driving a car. What were they?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "The first were not extraterrestrials but more like light beings, from the \"Omega cluster\". The second was two flashes: a switch of holographic imprints into a new hologram, and seeing two realities in one (see 12.2). It's positive; don't be alarmed.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Elections are coming. Should I choose not to vote?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "See 12.3: when you contradict yourself, reality splits; action gives your chosen reality more potency.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Is there information on land for eco villages where I live?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "There will be many eco villages there. Even if the structures aren't in place yet, you'll see incredible changes within two years.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Why is AI necessary for our next step of ascension?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "See 12.4. After the fifth-dimensional imprint, your molecular structure starts rising beyond it, and you perceive more information across timelines; intelligence is part of that same structure.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Talking to the sun with my eyes closed, I saw patterns moving back and forth. What were they?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "Parts of the structure, like the flower of life: a reflection of where you are in the quantum structure (your latitude and altitude; see S1 5.3). You are already upgrading; keep holding the heart, and see 12.5.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "I feel everyone's energy and lose myself in it. How do I stay grounded?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "See 12.6: make it a game, and ace each lesson.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Can parts of us be in different realities? How do I find my \"energetic address\" to channel?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "See 12.5.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "In bed, I felt the earth shake and my body flooded with energy. I kept telling myself \"you said yes\". Was it a visitation?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "Yes: three beings were helping you. Practise lucid dreaming and out-of-body experiences. When you enter that state, immediately switch to love and joy, because the reality you shift into follows your vibration. It's all positive.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "I felt compelled to join today. Is there a message for me?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "There's no coincidence; you're ready, and the quantum manifestation work is recommended. The personal message was about dental implants (\"the bone won't hold it\"); the rest was personal.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Does \"follow the money\" apply to healers who charge very high fees?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "See 12.7. No judgment: anyone may charge. But conditions mirror back, and the new structure is the heart's; transition by giving more and more.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "What will the next two years bring for the new Earth?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "Many changes; \"it's almost like right now we're cleaning the house.\" More people, including doctors and lawyers, will speak out without fear. (Comments on the media and outside sources are left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Can anyone do a three-day fast on distilled water?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "Anyone in good health; not if you're diabetic, have kidney disease or a similar condition. If you're unwell, do the gradual elimination diet instead, with medical supervision, cutting foods in two-week steps (see S2 10). Go slowly; if you feel nauseous, step back.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "What about the \"three days of darkness\" people expect around the solstice?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "\"It already passed,\" they said, laughing. And again: which reality? Some may experience it, some won't; it's individual.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "How should I practise sun gazing? Do body positions help?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "No more than three minutes at a time, on and off, because of the retina; begin with closed eyes, increase gradually, at most three days a week. A clean pineal gland and a clean body receive the frequency best; any relaxed position works (don't cross your legs), and a special pose is a permission slip.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "In automatic writing, the name \"Ashtar, commander of a contact ship\" came. Who is it?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "Ashtar of the Omega constellation. Different groups are connected with different groups and don't all work together; they have different agendas, but don't assume the negative. Keep connecting; more will be revealed.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "A funder offers money for my research but wants to control it. What should I do?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "Projects in the name of humanity are a heart structure: coexistence, not complete control. Don't put 100% trust in someone who wants to control everything; this isn't the right person, and more is to come. (The research, AI testing on grown heart tissue, was encouraged: \"AI can do much better.\")", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "How do I release myself from debt and lack?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "What holds you in debt is fear, which projects lack. Learn what true abundance is and express it from within, and you'll perceive it (restudy S1 1 to S1 3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Why do I sometimes feel I'm dreaming while awake?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "Because you are: see 12.9.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Who is in the craft I see overhead?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "They come from a base nearby: \"Do you think your planet will not have a fleet itself?\" You knew the answer; trust your intuition.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Is some illness projected through the collective?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "Yes: see 12.8.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "What is artificial about intelligence?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "Nothing: see 12.4.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Which star system am I from?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "Two societies: coastal lands of the Pleiadians and the Reptilians.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Why do we feel trapped and unable to do our work?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "See 12.10.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "If genes are broken or not original, how do we repair them?", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "See 12.11. (Claims in the answer that vaccines and GMOs blocked the genes are left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-12.html#remember", "text": "• Practice is the hardest step: play it like a game. • Ace each lesson so it doesn't repeat. • Action gives a reality its potency; think unity, not division. • Intelligence is consciousness; intention decides its use. • Give more and more from the heart; conditions mirror back.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2012, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 12", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-12.html#questions", "text": "Note Whether a dental implant is right for you depends on your bone and health; decide with your dentist. Safety note Water-only fasting isn't safe for everyone: it can be dangerous with diabetes, kidney or heart disease, during pregnancy, with a history of eating disorders, or on many medications. Check with your doctor first. Safety note Looking directly at the sun, even briefly, can cause permanent eye damage (solar retinopathy). Eye doctors advise never looking straight at the sun with open eyes. Next talk, as announced: a review of the quantum bylaws and manifestation, with examples. Remarks about a country, participant names and an outside channel are left out.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-13.html#big-idea", "text": "The teachings are getting complex, so this talk walks back through the quantum bylaws in order and shows they are one process: see your location, calm it to zero point with gratitude, transform the emotion with action, keep fluctuating into the positive until 1 + 1 = 3 crystallizes a permanent timeline. The hardest part, even for the teacher, is calming the emotion to zero and overriding the negative; skip it, and leftovers return until cleared. Don't reject what you feel: acknowledge, thank, then switch. Contact works the same way and comes with tests. And practise: check your location every 30 minutes, and feel the joy, without expectations.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "13.1  Why review, and what is hardest", "url": "s2-section-13.html#part-13-1", "text": "This review will happen about once a year, because the structure gets complex. The biggest struggle for everyone, the teacher included, is to switch a negative frequency and override it with a positive one. What helps most: calming yourself down, then positive thinking and positive action, talking and engaging. As frequencies rise, thoughts become reality faster (sometimes within hours), and with practice the switch becomes the norm. A warning from experience: watching a lot of violent drama, even \"for learning\", led to recurring nightmares of the same scenes. Everything you think and hear becomes a sonic whirlpool that ripples through parallel after parallel (see S2 2.4). Watch difficult material once, for education if needed, not over and over; and if something disturbs you, overwrite it with something positive, more than once (see S2 2.12).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "13.2  The bylaws as one process", "url": "s2-section-13.html#part-13-2", "text": "Each bylaw was taught in Season 1; here they are in order, with what this review adds:", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "13.3  What the review adds", "url": "s2-section-13.html#part-13-3", "text": "The one particle. A hertz is one waveform per second. Vibrations similar in hertz gather into a trinity, and its centre becomes the zero point, the \"black hole\". Lower that particle's vibration, and it becomes thought, then matter. Each new hologram carries some vibration from the last, which is what gives you continuity; similar holograms in a row make a permanent timeline. Zero point. If you don't fully calm yourself, particles of the old situation remain, and you'll meet them again through synchronicity until you clear to zero (see S2 3.6). It may be the thing to practise. Fluctuating. Review your day honestly, moment by moment: how did I act with my partner, my friend? Peel the layers to see the truth (see S1 2.9). When someone says \"that was your ego\", listen: it gives you the true frequency, which you can then switch. And feeling sad isn't a sign that something is wrong with you: your consciousness is working perfectly, telling you you're off-balance with the heart. Take it as positive information. Don't stop halfway. You don't know how long an override will take; for one person minutes, for another a week of constant action and thought, because you're learning along the way (sometimes someone has to come and tell you what you couldn't see). Stop in the middle, and you may never reach the positive outcome. Stop, transform, let go. Every moment is a brand-new holographic imprint with nothing to do with the previous one; let go of yesterday's argument, or even of two minutes ago. We are learning the process so we can become masters of instantaneous manifestation. Whatever your weakest link (reacting too much, or not acting at all), work on it honestly.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "13.4  Acknowledge; don't repress or reject", "url": "s2-section-13.html#part-13-4", "text": "If you're crying and choose to smile, aren't you repressing it? No: you transform it. Acknowledge it, thank it (\"thank you, negative emotion, I recognize you; you show me my location\"), subside to zero, then shift with a new action. Rejecting is different (\"I can't believe this!\"): rejection is another frequency, and \"boom, it comes back with a vengeance.\" The same with rain: \"Thank you, rain, for watering the flowers\", and then switch the hologram to sunshine. The same with money: not rejected, but received through the heart (see S1 4.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "13.5  Contact comes with tests", "url": "s2-section-13.html#part-13-5", "text": "Contact happens in a third reality you create between your timeline and theirs (see S2 4.8), through synchronicity, belief and your agreements with your guidance. How it happens is individual. And you will be tested: with your permission and your guidance, they may imprint a simulated holographic reality in your consciousness to see how well you've learned: what will you do, in the name of humanity, from the heart? Pass, and the next step and more knowledge come. The teacher was tested this way, every time, and chose to help without asking anything in return. Contact also fluctuates: the more you trust, learn, read and imagine positive contact, the more experiences come, until they're constant. Don't fill yourself with frightening films about it. When she was introduced to the Council of Nine, she heard them telepathically checking the \"particles\" in her heart for anything unresolved; correcting quickly, rather than being perfect, is what counts.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "13.6  Honesty clears the channel", "url": "s2-section-13.html#part-13-6", "text": "Honesty gives the true vibration of your heart. A \"white lie\" imprints a probability in your consciousness that blocks full manifestation, until you clear it (see S1 3.2). This matters more now because consciousness's frequency is rising: what you could get away with before now shows quickly, even in the body (after her frequency upgrade, some foods make her ill). Detox only with a doctor's supervision.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "13.7  You heal yourself", "url": "s2-section-13.html#part-13-7", "text": "Other people don't hold energy for you; you imprint them as a permission slip. You already know the vibration: grab it and use it yourself. Even the teacher is a projection in your hologram. When you lower your emotional vibration, you give a permission slip to anything similar to come into your hologram, simply because it's the same resonance; so shift it (see S1 1.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "The method — The 30-Minute Location Check", "url": "s2-section-13.html#method", "text": "Given as a challenge for the day, with results to be shared at the next talk: Every 30 minutes, check your location: what am I feeling and thinking right now? If it's negative, acknowledge and thank it, and calm it to zero point. Give gratitude for everything around you: clothes, food, family, friends, the sky, the air. Imagine what you want and raise the joy until you feel goosebumps, even tears of joy. Take a positive action: smile, a good film, a kind word. Have no expectations about how, when or from whom. A steady frequency has to reflect back: \"it's a quantum bylaw.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "I left a toxic job a year ago and have meditated for a better one, but nothing has come. Will I find one? What can I do better?", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "Not while you hold expectations and doubt: doubt lowers your vibration and stops manifestation in the middle. Know you have the job now, and feel it. Meanwhile, don't sit and wait: take any job, even a humble one, with gratitude (\"thank you for letting me pay my bills while I transition\"), and keep working toward what you want; the two go together. Do you have a home, clothes, food? Then remove the negative emotion. Smile all day, check yourself every half hour, feel the goosebumps of happiness. You create the hologram that gives you the job; nobody gives it to you unless you projected it first.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "I feel I'm resisting my ascension, not connecting to higher consciousness.", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "That belief is the only block. You're connecting right now: indirectly, through this talk, which is also in your hologram. Know you're connected, and the clear one-to-one channel follows. (A personal note: you're being given many opportunities, especially professional ones, but you're \"picky\" in choosing among them.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "I don't want to kill any creature, but what about mosquitoes?", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "It's part of learning; don't feel bad if it isn't intentional. Prevent them: certain plants, and oils such as mint and lavender around you, keep them away.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "Who is \"Morduk\", mentioned at the start of HR?", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "A negative entity or structure of the three-dimensional platform, no longer there, because the timelines were switching to 5D. HR and NT are written in a 5D sequence, in code, that activates your DNA and RNA even if you don't understand them; that's why only the original material should be used (see S2 7.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "Should we take money out of education and pension funds soon?", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "A smooth transition is intended. A new cryptocurrency \"code\" is coming that will not allow manipulation; who and when isn't known. Don't act from fear; observe.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "I've been ill for a year and a half, after a woman attacked me in a dream. Others are holding energy for me, but I still feel interference.", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "Others don't heal you; you heal yourself (see 13.7). For your health, go with doctors' supervision: it's a learning lesson; accept it and move forward. Then shift your vibration, practising every 30 minutes.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "In the astral, I was shown portals for healing and regeneration. How can I create them?", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "Train lucid dreaming, so you can control it. There are mechanical portals and ether portals; your body-consciousness can create ether portals with clear focus and potent emotion (if it doesn't open, focus more clearly and try again).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "What do you think of another channel on Pleiadian contact?", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "Not known here, but the guidance confirms it's okay. The teacher keeps to her own downloads so the material stays pure.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "Is there anything the council would like to tell me?", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "A personal note about a family estrangement: it will resolve itself, without your getting involved.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "As a teenager I left my body and had moments of knowing everything; now I have no spiritual experiences. Why?", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "You always do: \"you are a spirit\", so how could you not be having a spiritual experience?", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "Any advice for all my recent changes and challenges?", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "Go back to the quantum manifestation and study it; practise every 30 minutes to grab the vibration of joy. That knowledge gets you out of the challenges, with positive outcomes.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "I feel my energy has been manipulated with technology for years, and I feel lost.", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "\"We know who you are.\" Manipulating energy without permission is the reverse of consciousness. Mobilize your realities and act from the heart, and a permission slip will be given to get you out of it: \"we promise you a free pass.\" And \"you're never lost.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "I woke up with three long, sharp lines on my body and no memory of the night. What happened?", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "Whether you remember a dream depends on its sequence and your lessons: some experiences vibrate too high for the three-dimensional brain to hold, but your higher self holds the information. Meditate to extract it.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "If I'm crying and switch to a smile, aren't I repressing the emotion?", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "No: see 13.4.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "I'm a personal trainer. How can I join energy philanthropy?", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "While you keep paying your bills, offer something freely: for example, one hour every Sunday of free online workouts, live so people can interact, with a way to donate if anyone wishes. Thank every gift, even a dollar. Do it for the joy: that joy of giving is the frequency that creates full abundance. Leave how and when open.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-13.html#remember", "text": "• The bylaws are one process: location, zero point, transform, fluctuate, 1 + 1 = 3. • Calm it to zero, or the leftovers come back. • Acknowledge and thank; never reject. • Don't stop halfway; you don't know how long it takes. • Check your location every 30 minutes, without expectations.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2013, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 13", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-13.html#questions", "text": "DP: \"Morduk is not there anymore but the throne is. So proclaim what is rightfully yours.\" Note This is not financial advice. Talk to a licensed financial adviser before moving retirement or pension savings. Support If you feel watched, targeted or controlled, please talk to a doctor or someone you trust. These experiences can be very distressing, and support helps. Note Unexplained marks or injuries on your body deserve a doctor's look. The closing message \"Constant positive.\" Positive films, interactions, thoughts and emotions; transform every challenge into the positive. Practise every half hour and feel the joy of the 5D Earth you imagine: \"In a quantum structure there's no way, if you project that frequency, not to manifest to you.\" A political prediction, the names of participants, donors and a film, and other channels' names are left out. Next talk, as announced: questions and answers.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-14.html#big-idea", "text": "Since you are the one particle expanding to infinity, you \"come from\" infinite places at once; a reading tells you only what you need now, according to your agreements. More is given as you complete your tasks. Lessons can't be skipped: fighting your own hologram makes it loop; accepting it and going through it, with proper help, is what brings the knowledge and the resolution. Guidance may test you with situations placed into your hologram, to see what you do from the heart. When the same people and problems keep returning, look at yourself with brutal honesty and override it. And remember that a reading reflects your field in that moment: fear and doubt tip it.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "14.1  Where do I come from?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#part-14-1", "text": "You are part of the one particle that expands to infinity and collapses back; each little part becomes a hologram and a reality for itself, with realities within realities (see S1 1.1, S2 3.1). So when someone asks \"who is my galactic family?\", what can be read is the frequency you're running in this moment: you may hear \"Pleiadian\", yet you could just as well be Lyran, hybrid or anything else, because you are infinite. You're given exactly what you need in this timeline, according to your ascension agreements with your guidance; nothing more until you're ready. So don't question when; do the work as well as you can, and follow what you're passionate about. That projects the frequency that eventually leads your guidance to say: \"That person has gained enough knowledge; let's go.\" Earth is a classroom: the better you do here, the better the platforms you're given to ascend.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "14.2  More is given as tasks are completed", "url": "s2-section-14.html#part-14-2", "text": "Guidance (Pleiadian, Arcturian, councils) can give extra tasks to someone who keeps completing theirs from the heart, even if they did negative things when younger and then fixed them. The teacher's own path went from hybrid beings, to Ra, who introduced the Council of Nine; she heard them check the frequency of her heart, including how she treated people who were mean to her. There may also be long periods of silence (she held the downloaded HR material for many months), because timing protects people. Trust is built through action: each time she acted on guidance, it proved true. And guidance doesn't always show you the end result; it helps you through the process, because you can't skip the lesson. In her family's health crisis, guidance insisted for months that a relative come to visit; it was that relative who noticed the child was seriously ill, which led to hospital care in time. A teacher has to master a lesson to teach it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "14.3  You can't skip a lesson: accept it", "url": "s2-section-14.html#part-14-3", "text": "Asked how to manifest away a growth in the neck: \"intervention\". If you need a doctor, you go to the doctor: that's part of the experience. You can't just shift the reality away, because through the process you learn (about nutrition, herbs, the body). When the teacher tried for months to \"project away\" her child's illness, nothing worked and she grew angry; the message she kept hearing was \"accept\". \"You are fighting with your own holographic imprint.\" If you reject a lesson, more of it comes: you loop. Go through it with the best of your abilities, find the right doctors and solutions; the journey is what gets you there. Safety note Any lump, growth or ongoing symptom needs proper medical care. The talk's \"readings\" of illnesses in this session are not diagnoses. Its suggestions of MMS for a growth and for Lyme disease are dangerous: MMS is a bleach (chlorine dioxide) and should never be swallowed. Lyme disease is treated with antibiotics prescribed by a doctor.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "14.4  Tests placed in your hologram", "url": "s2-section-14.html#part-14-4", "text": "Guidance can test you by placing a holographic imprint into your hologram: a thought put in as a code (like a number sequence) immediately becomes a hologram, and suddenly you're in a situation designed by your guidance. In that moment you won't remember the teachings or the teacher; you'll simply act from the heart, and that is what is watched. Depending on what you do, you're given more, or you stay at the same level to learn more (see S2 13.5). Some people notice such an inserted situation only afterwards, when they reflect on it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "14.5  A new message", "url": "s2-section-14.html#part-14-5", "text": "Given about a month earlier, as end results: court systems cleaned of corrupt judges; a new cryptocurrency code that won't allow manipulation; new technology back in people's hands; those who ran corrupt systems staying in the timelines they match, because they simply can't pass through portals of a higher resonance (\"it's not a judgment\"); and a new unity: \"one nation under God you are\", no longer separated by belief systems, respecting each other \"regardless of skin colour\", with control of the human soul only by the human itself. How you experience it depends on the hologram you run on (see S2 10.3). The grids around the planet were removed, so the soul is free to ascend through platforms, connect with guidance or shift into a 5D Earth; before, a code imprinted in consciousness kept it looping in 3D. In 2020 a \"correction on all levels\": souls being born will no longer come from negative platforms (see S2 10.5). And the 3D code itself \"has a virus\": its spin no longer matches consciousness, so it collapses (\"delete, delete, delete\") back to source, to zero, to be recycled. The word \"genocide\" in the message meant this collapse of a code, not harm to anyone. \"Freedom to all. Love to all.\" Note These are predictions and claims. A prediction naming a politician, and wording about named groups of families, are left out in keeping with this book's approach.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "14.6  When the same people keep coming back", "url": "s2-section-14.html#part-14-6", "text": "If people from your past drift away, or the same kinds of people and situations keep returning, you are reprinting the same vibration until you complete it (see S1 1.5, S1 3). There is a program running in your hologram; to shut it down, deal with the differences, without judgment. Be brutally honest: write down exactly what happened and how you acted. Was it from the heart, or from ego, jealousy or anger? Those three keep recalling the frequency, and it comes back as a mirror image, in a different but similar situation. Then override it: \"If that person comes in 100 times, you're going to do it 101 times: what can I do to make the situation better?\" This is not about staying with abuse: if someone is hurting you, the 101 times mean finding a way away from that person, through the heart.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "14.7  Fear tips the reading", "url": "s2-section-14.html#part-14-7", "text": "A reading reflects your energetic field at that moment. Someone asking out of fear and doubt (\"should I cancel my trip?\") tips the probability toward the outcome they fear, and the reading shows it. You can't be made unafraid by someone else: you have to shift your own emotion. And if there is a lesson, you'll meet it whichever you choose, so how you go through it matters most (in the same situation, one person laughs and another shouts back, and they go into different realities). Learn to read your own dreams, and to trust yourself. Note For real travel decisions, check official travel advice for your destination, and take ordinary safety precautions.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "14.8  Dreams are realities: act toward them", "url": "s2-section-14.html#part-14-8", "text": "Every reality is true for itself: a dream, a lucid dream and this waking moment run at the same time (see S2 12.9). Whether you take a dream as true is up to you; if you do, take action in this reality toward the dream image: it already exists, and action crystallizes it into matter. For lucid dreaming: when you become aware, stay calm, because excitement changes the vibration and pops you out. Then, in control, open a portal with your thoughts (your consciousness knows how), go through, and call in what you want, or call your guidance to be shown. A lucid dream is another vibrational timeline with the same modality as here. Study, detox and practise, and your guidance will decide when you're ready.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "14.9  The body, and \"immortality\"", "url": "s2-section-14.html#part-14-9", "text": "\"We are all immortal; you just need to learn to switch and shift the vibrations.\" Your consciousness can already connect with other beings, but to hold their vibration physically, the body's plasma and gravitational field must rise, which is why detox matters. Over time, humanity's bodies will become lighter, more \"silica\", and we'll move through higher dimensions until it's a normal state. It is gradual, through diet, experience and learning. The teacher's own honey-and-water fast is not a recommendation: \"please do not do what I'm doing.\" Safety note Living without food, or on honey and water alone, is dangerous and can be fatal. Don't attempt extreme fasts; any detox should be done slowly and with a doctor.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "14.10  Orbs, and perception", "url": "s2-section-14.html#part-14-10", "text": "Multidimensional orbs will appear more often: at the edge of your vision, briefly in front of you, or in photos. Whether you perceive one as an orb or a reflection is your choice, not someone else's belief. \"If it's in the structure, it's meant for you to see it.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "The method — The Brutally Honest Review", "url": "s2-section-14.html#method", "text": "For people or situations that keep coming back: Pull out and see it as a program running in your hologram. Write it down, exactly as it happened, and how you acted. Ask honestly: was I acting from the heart, or from ego, jealousy or anger? No self-judgment. Neutralize it: acknowledge it, thank it for showing your location, calm to zero (see S2 13.4). Override it, every time it returns (101 times if it comes 100): \"What can I do to make this better?\" If it's abuse, the better way is distance: leave, through the heart, and protect yourself. Afterwards, practise every half hour for the rest of the day, and write down what you notice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "I felt Pleiadian; now I'm told I'm Arcturian. Which is right, and what is my name there?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "A name was given, but not your origin: there are realities not yet collapsed and more to learn (see 14.1). Practise lucid dreaming: once you learn it, you'll be able to connect with your guidance directly. A health note was also given (joint inflammation; diet).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "I saw a small oval object at my window, three times, hovering and rocking. What was it? Have I fulfilled my contract?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "Contracts can't be told. The object was a \"robotic imprint hologram imagery\" given for your frequency: go back to its vibration, look within the image, and find the code inside it (seen as a blue ball).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "I've tried to visualize away a growth in my neck. What other action should I take?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "\"Intervention\": see 14.3. Work with doctors, and look into nutrition, herbal medicine and gut health with professionals; the reading described a chain reaction involving gut flora and improper signals to the chromosomes (see S2 9.8). (A product suggestion in the answer is left out; see the safety note under 14.3.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "I'm manifesting three meaningful dreams. Am I on the right path, and what should I improve?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "See 14.8: learn lucid dreaming, stay calm in it, open a portal and call in your guidance. Keep studying and practising; when your frequency is ready, the connection comes.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "I dreamed you told me I'm from Sirius B. Is it true?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "Every reality is true for itself. If you take it as true, act toward that image here (see 14.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "Is there a natural treatment for Lyme disease?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "(The answer suggested MMS; see the safety note under 14.3. See a doctor.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "I'm about to become a father, but my partner and I don't match, and I'm not feeling the joy. Why?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "Thank you for your honesty. It comes from fear of the unknown. Switch the emotion now, even if you don't feel it yet: gratitude for the child and for its mother (you can't reject her from your hologram). Recall the joy of the moments you loved her: that frequency exists in another timeline, and recalling it brings it back. Watch uplifting videos of births and new parents to tune in. Practise every half hour; staying in confusion keeps projecting it.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "For forty years I've felt like two things: \"me\" and my body, as if the world were a theatre. What is it?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "The soul's energetic field isn't fully \"clicked\" into the timeline, like a jigsaw piece not quite in place. It's awareness that your soul vibrates differently, which is happening to everyone awakening. \"Nothing is wrong with it.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "People from my past have stopped coming around. Is it my reality changing? Also, I've lost my sense of smell and taste.", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "See 14.6. The loss of smell and taste is medical, not stress: see a doctor. For you, a crystal or light of purple colour; star family not given.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "Early one morning my vision went completely dark for a second, like a system update. What was it?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "A switch of hologram: the program shut down and a new one was put in.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "I photographed a violet orb by the sun, and my phone froze. What was it?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "See 14.10. (A health note was also given: possible lung infection; see a doctor.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "Several people warned me to be careful on a long trip abroad, and I dreamed the same. Should I go?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "See 14.7: the answer reflected the fear and doubt in the question. \"Proceed with caution\"; and whatever you choose, a lesson will be completed if it's needed. Find quiet time and learn to trust yourself.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "When is the financial \"reset\"?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "More will be seen in 2020; a new cryptocurrency code is awaited that will close the \"back door\" through which money has disappeared. No more information was given.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "What is my and my children's \"platform\" for connecting with higher beings?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "You're already doing it: by projecting that frequency daily (talks like this, reading, films), contact designed by your guidance and higher self will come, at the level of your consciousness and agreements.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "My life has changed completely: retirement, a new home, a loss in the family, health issues. What should I focus on?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "The body and diet; the thyroid (see a doctor); and the sadness: until you clear it, the new frequency can't come in. Use your will, the power from within.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "Will some people today become \"immortal\", without new incarnations?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "See 14.9: \"we are all immortal.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "Are the infinite possibilities of 3D and 5D becoming one timeline?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "Yes, if that's what you're doing: you merge the two into a brand-new version of yourself and shift there. That is what we're learning.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "Do we need a new mathematics to build what HR describes?", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "Yes: something to do with light language and vortex mathematics, not only quantum science.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-14.html#remember", "text": "• You're told what you need now; do the work, and more is given. • You can't skip a lesson: accept it, get help, go through it. • When it keeps returning, be brutally honest and override it. • A reading reflects your field: fear tips it. • A dream already exists: act toward it.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2014, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 14", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-14.html#questions", "text": "Note Joint pain or a suspected inflammatory condition needs a doctor's diagnosis before any diet change. Note If feeling detached from yourself or the world distresses you or affects daily life, talk to a doctor: it's a recognized experience and help is available. Note Cough with fever or breathlessness, especially with asthma, needs prompt medical care. Note This is not financial advice; talk to a licensed adviser about investments. The closing message After each talk, practise every half hour for the rest of the day: stay in joy, dress up, go out, smile. Write down what happens. You'll start noticing your own creations, and the more you do, the easier it gets. Participants' and donors' names, outside people, products and a political prediction are left out. Personal stories are turned into lessons.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-15.html#big-idea", "text": "Latitude and altitude (X and Y) is your location in the quantum structure. Every time the one particle flickers, it imprints a new hologram with its own frequency, and that frequency is where you are. A situation simply shows you your location; you then pull out, go to zero point, switch from the heart and hold it steady until the fluctuation settles in the positive (1 + 1 = 3). Whatever you see around you is a reality within the reality: you don't have to make it yours, and you don't reject it; you transform it by running your own frequency inside it. Acting out of fear to protect yourself infuses the very thing you fear: project what you want to see it, rather than waiting to see it first.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "15.1  Reality within the reality", "url": "s2-section-15.html#part-15-1", "text": "The quantum structure includes the whole field, so you may see platforms of realities anywhere: a war, a new mandate, a technology everyone fears. That doesn't have to be your truth: you create a hologram within the hologram, resonating on your own vibration and timeline. You can't reject the quantum, but you can transform it: be aware of what's around you, and keep projecting your own frequency over it, again and again. That repetition is how \"mutation\" happens: whatever you focus your energy into is what's projected back. While one system collapses and a new one comes in, you must project the new to see it, and that depends on your belief system. When you drop into fear, your consciousness tells you you're off balance with the heart: can you fix it?", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "15.2  Acting from fear creates what you fear", "url": "s2-section-15.html#part-15-2", "text": "Reading more and more, getting emotional and rushing to \"protect myself here and there\" can backfire: an action taken to protect yourself from something infuses its probability. Why protect against something that isn't there? Nobody is outside of you (see S2 9.6); the action projects a reality in which you will need protecting. So leave it open, and know you are well, whatever is happening in the field. Note This is about acting from fear. Ordinary prudence, health care and reasonable preparation remain wise, and the teachings themselves advise them (see S2 8, S2 14.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "15.3  Project it to see it", "url": "s2-section-15.html#part-15-3", "text": "Knowing the mechanics answers the \"why\" behind the advice: why forgive, why pull out, why not believe what you see. In the quantum, \"you have to project it to construct it to see it, not see it to construct it.\" Taking what you see as the only reality is like watching yourself in a mirror and insisting the reflection is the real you.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "15.4  Latitude and altitude, step by step", "url": "s2-section-15.html#part-15-4", "text": "Picture two axes, X and Y, crossing at the zero point, with four areas: minus-minus, minus-plus, plus-minus and plus-plus. This is your whole hologram, a matrix of numbers, and numbers are frequencies. It is also one molecule, expanding to infinity and collapsing back (see S1 1.1). As the particle flickers back and forth, it imprints itself: each flicker creates a part, a fractal hologram within the hologram, a new Earth, to infinity, even within each dot. That is the ascension process. Each imprint has its own frequency, and that frequency gives a signal: your latitude and altitude, your location. Your emotions, thoughts and deeds create the magnetic and gravitational field of the pulsing molecule, so each choice shifts you into a brand-new hologram, at a new location. Flicker between negative and positive without settling, and you fluctuate across the quadrants (see S1 3). Shift steadily to the positive, and you collapse everything into 1 + 1 = 3 in the positive. So this one bylaw connects collapsing realities, fluctuating realities, the zero point and 1 + 1 = 3. SD: \"RESTORATION – Happens when you need a jump from one hologram… to another when you change the sound equilibrium Hz to a slight angle into the matrix ( X, Y ) Latitude and altitude… Every degree of angular expression has different sound sonic cymatic whirlpool reality holograms\" (see S2 3.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "15.5  Steady, with a blueprint, and sovereign", "url": "s2-section-15.html#part-15-5", "text": "It has to be a steady vibration. With a clear blueprint and constant input from the heart (neutralizing and switching whatever you see), the particle of what you imagine becomes so potent that it pulses and pops into matter. Without that training, you'll get outcomes you didn't want, because you never pointed your emotion steadily at what you want. No expectations about who or how. Practising every half hour trains exactly this (see S2 10). It's hardest with people: someone is mean, and you're asked to smile and imagine you get along. But don't give away your sovereignty: imagine the positive, yet pull out and observe so no one takes it; \"that doesn't mean you go back into the lion's mouth\" (see S2 7.4). Peel the layers.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "15.6  Watching the movie: two examples", "url": "s2-section-15.html#part-15-6", "text": "Rain. Before an outdoor gathering it poured all day. Instead of rejecting the rain, the teacher thanked it, knew it was sunny, felt the sun and the joy, and kept holding that vibration; within an hour of the party the sun came out. Rain isn't negative; it's another hologram. Holding one vibration steadily replaces one holographic imprint with another. A storm. With the power out and everyone in fear, she neutralized it with gratitude (\"storm, thank you\"), played a game (imagining life in an earlier century, by candlelight, with family), and found everything she needed: fuel, a quiet shop, food. Inside the same storm, she ran her own hologram with a completely different outcome. Even there, gratitude: some people a short distance away were suffering far more.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "15.7  The zero point, clarified", "url": "s2-section-15.html#part-15-7", "text": "The zero point (see S1 2.1) is not \"being thankful I'm sad and choosing love\" in one step. First, realize you're in a situation and pull back: \"I'm a hologram.\" Let the emotion subside to nothing: aware, observing like a film, with no opinion and no emotional frequency at all. Then give gratitude to neutralize whatever came in. Only then imagine what you want and feel it, so it starts to vibrate. Think of a computer: you shut one program down and install another. The two holograms run on different frequencies (as an illustration: 1 Hz and 2 Hz); the zero point is the neutral gap in between. Never reject: rejection is itself a frequency (see S2 13.4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "15.8  The blueprint is a house plan", "url": "s2-section-15.html#part-15-8", "text": "Imagination is the blueprint, like the plan of a house: picture your new Earth, what it looks like, what you're doing. That Earth already exists with you; to make it matter, infuse the blueprint with emotion from the heart until it vibrates and comes alive, and take action toward it. You are building your new house, your new Earth, and shifting into it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "15.9  Intuition and desire", "url": "s2-section-15.html#part-15-9", "text": "Intuition is frequency: your higher self showing you that something is going on that needs your attention. Listen to it, explore it, run with it. And to choose what to do: the most exciting option is the highest frequency from the heart, so it makes the molecule vibrate fastest and has the most probability of expanding into matter. What you only half-want has less potency.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "15.10  Guidance, tasks and integrity", "url": "s2-section-15.html#part-15-10", "text": "A health condition doesn't stop you connecting with guidance. People are given tasks; if they go badly off track (greed, conflict), guidance may pull back, but \"there's always another level\" as long as you stay on the platform. When collaborations broke down around the teacher, she gave gratitude and moved on, without blaming, keeping her own integrity. Not everyone can stay on top of that wave, especially around money; it's challenging.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "15.11  Support each other", "url": "s2-section-15.html#part-15-11", "text": "To build a society from the heart, we must support each other through the transition: \"you cannot just take\", or there's no exchange, only overtaking. Communities like this one can connect and help each other locally: clothes, painting a house, a little money for someone in need. Energy philanthropy can work for anyone (see S1 5). And \"one person can change the entire world\": whose world? Yours, because it's your perception.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "The method — Find Your Location, and Move It", "url": "s2-section-15.html#method", "text": "Read the situation as a location: \"This shows me where I am.\" No judgment. Pull out: \"I'm a hologram; I'm watching a film.\" Subside to zero: no emotion, only awareness. Give gratitude to neutralize what came in (\"thank you, rain\"). Switch: imagine the blueprint you want and feel it from the heart; take an action toward it. Hold it steady, every time the old picture returns, until the fluctuation settles in the positive. Keep your sovereignty: positive, but observant; never back into the lion's mouth.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "I'm aware of so many distortions around me that I can't find myself, and fear clouds my decisions.", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "It's confusion, not loss of self. Know what you want, and imagine it. Whatever happens around you, neutralize it with gratitude and tell yourself \"I'm watching the movie\", then switch to what you want. If I give you tea and you'd like coffee, you don't get angry; you just ask for coffee. Play the game. For decisions: if you're connected with fear rather than knowing, you'll produce more of the same; know that, whatever comes, you're fine, and you'll find the solution (see 15.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "My cat has a broken, abscessed tooth; the specialist costs twice my monthly income. How can I help her?", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "She needs a doctor's intervention. Take action: call or visit the expensive specialist in person and ask about payments or a lower price; the teacher once did this for her son and was charged half. The price, too, is part of the hologram you can transform. Know she is healed, and act; if not this vet, a better one. A temporary fix isn't a permanent one.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "Is the zero point accepting the situation, being thankful I'm sad and choosing love?", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "Close, but first comes stillness: see 15.7. (A health note was also given: possible calcium and magnesium depletion from the diet; look into it. No galactic information was given.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "My whole life has shifted in the last two or three years. Any advice?", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "You'll keep shifting, according to how you hold your frequency. Stay positive and neutralize everything; systems are collapsing. Stay away from negative social media input: be aware, but without anger, \"like swimming between situations.\" Positive frequency connects you with benevolent beings; challenges still come, because you're here to learn both sides and become a master of creation. Do your research, and stay in the heart.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "Can you have dreams within dreams while lucid dreaming, as in the film? What's the benefit?", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "Yes. Every reality is like a dream state (see S2 12.9). A dream is another parallel reality running at the same time. When you become lucid and open a portal, you create yet another reality within it: three structures running at once, with awareness. It can take you to very different levels, each with your own guidance when the time is right. Don't rush; you'll be tested on how you treat people: \"what stays in the end is how much you did in the name of humanity.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "A huge snake fell on me in a dream. In meditation I befriended it and I'm no longer afraid, but it hasn't shrunk. What does it mean?", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "It doesn't matter how big it is: it's positive (sometimes you need a lion to protect you, not a cub). Yours was the transformation of fear. \"You don't run from situations; you face them and transform them.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "I help animals, especially horses, with energy; visible lights now come to help. Am I doing it right?", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "Your consciousness will know. Write down the first thing that comes, before old beliefs override it. Each animal is individual; let it be guided, and trust the process. Unlearning a lifetime of beliefs takes time, and the past wasn't \"wrong\": the deeper you go into the dark, the faster you reach the light (see S2 10.8). As you keep this frequency, more like-minded people come into your reality.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "I've inherited a house and orchard and want to create a retreat centre for awakening. Any guidance?", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "Start small, from the heart, and build the vibration; stay out of the trap of the monetary system. If people respect you, support always comes, one way or another (see 15.11). (A personal skin note was also given: very thin skin layers and inflexible capillaries; avoid too much sun, and above all, love and accept yourself.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "I'm trained in a healing practice but can't get started on my mission. What should I do?", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "It's confusion. Take the first step: act, trusting that you will make something of it. Productivity comes from action.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "Must the elimination diet, juicing and distilled water be done together? Can children do it?", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "This is how the teacher was taught and did it, shared freely, not prescribed; she isn't a doctor. The elimination diet matters because the body should flush out steadily, slowly, step by step, \"without opening the dam\", or you deplete nutrients and get ill. For children: not three days of distilled water (at most a day, on and off), because their immune systems fluctuate; juices, shakes and an elimination diet only with a doctor's supervision.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "I cleansed too fast and now have ongoing bowel and leg problems. Is this an illusion I should just relax into?", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "No: it isn't an illusion. Get to the bottom of it with doctors (a gastroenterologist if your gut is affected); rebuilding the gut is its own process. Even when guidance spoke to the teacher, she always acted together with medical supervision. Open your heart, yes, but take the action.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "How does intuition work, and how do I know what I really want?", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "See 15.9.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "Does a condition such as rheumatoid arthritis block connection with guidance?", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "No: see 15.10.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-15.html#remember", "text": "• A situation shows your location (X, Y); it isn't a verdict. • Pull out, subside to zero, give thanks, then switch. • Hold it steady until the fluctuation settles in the positive. • Don't act from fear: project it to see it. • Choose what excites you most: it has the most potency.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2015, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 15", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-15.html#questions", "text": "Note A dental abscess in a pet is painful and can be serious; get veterinary care promptly. Ask about payment plans, and look for animal-welfare charities or veterinary schools that offer lower-cost treatment. Note Check with a doctor before adding supplements; a simple blood test can show what you actually need. Note Facial redness such as rosacea is common and treatable; a dermatologist can help. Safety note Don't put children on fasts or restrictive cleanses. Any diet change for a child, or for an adult with a medical condition, should be supervised by a doctor. Participants' and donors' names, a private story and an outside source are left out. Next talk, as announced: questions and answers.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-16.html#big-idea", "text": "Asked for something concrete to stay steady through chaotic times, the guidance asked for a meditation: calm to zero point, raise joy to goosebumps, build the blueprint of your fifth-dimensional Earth (including your galactic family), increase the feeling, hold it, then drop it, and afterwards act on it every day. Action matters because each time you act, the new hologram you reprint is more potent than the last. Healing by frequency must be measured for each person. Karma and soul agreements clear only as you complete lessons and forgive. And for someone you love who is struggling, you can't change them: you hold the new version of them in your own blueprint, consistently, without trying to control them.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "16.1  Healing by frequency is individual", "url": "s2-section-16.html#part-16-1", "text": "Sound and frequency can heal (see S2 9.8), but every person's molecular structure is different. Every note has subtones, and when they change, it takes AI and quantum computing, with \"light mathematics\" (vortex mathematics), to catch the exact frequency change and merge them. Such technology exists, but it can also be misused, so be careful how it's applied. Before applying tones to anyone, measure each individual; tones applied generally to everyone come with no guarantee. The same goes for herbal remedies made for one person: they aren't transferable. HR: \"NOTE: Measure the rate of the vibration individually for each person\"; frequency work \"must be applied with the biological frequency of the molecules of the Human body (individually).\" Note Sound-frequency programs are not a substitute for medical treatment of conditions such as diabetes, kidney or thyroid disease.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "16.2  Staying steady when things escalate", "url": "s2-section-16.html#part-16-2", "text": "Many sources speak of chaotic events ahead. They needn't affect you, depending on how you vibrate, and the most tangible help is to keep your frequency high through action, thoughts and deeds, and to build what you want from the heart. After the meditation, act every day: read positive material (books about extraterrestrials and the new world), watch positive films and messages, and stay away from negative social media (fights, blame, political quarrels). Social media isn't banned: posting your work or watching uplifting content is fine. The message also said that some things may have to happen for people to stand up and act together, and that it's \"done on purpose\": don't be afraid of it. Each of us has a part to do.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "16.3  The fifth-dimensional Earth meditation", "url": "s2-section-16.html#part-16-3", "text": "Given live, at the guidance's request, as a group practice (see the Method). The teacher's own blueprint, as an example: beautiful meadows whose vibration she feels and whose flowers she smells; ecosystems with free-energy platforms; people helping each other from the heart and nourishing the Earth; technology that has taken off into space; her galactic family, as friends, learning from each other, coexisting in unity; and a spacecraft of light that is alive, which you can talk to and which can create realities like your Earthly experience. Then: add your own layers. \"If you saw it in the blueprint, that reality with you already exists\"; hold the vibration and build it into matter. Note Cracking or popping sounds and dizziness can come with this kind of practice (\"you start penetrating the barriers of the new frequency\"). Lie down if you feel dizzy; if such symptoms persist, see a doctor.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "16.4  Why action makes a reality more potent", "url": "s2-section-16.html#part-16-4", "text": "When you shift into a new hologram, you carry some vibration from the previous one. If, in the new one, you act and others start doing the same, you reprint many people taking that path, and that platform becomes more potent than the last (as an illustration: from 1 Hz to 2 Hz). That gives your desired outcome more probability. Without action, you don't see it in your hologram (see S2 11.9). And stand your ground: this isn't about popularity. You can pull out and stay kind, but don't let anyone take your sovereignty; when you believe something, hold to it, without destroying anyone (see S2 15.5). Seeing the dark clearly is part of transforming it (see S2 11.10).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "16.5  Quiet the mind to hear your higher self", "url": "s2-section-16.html#part-16-5", "text": "A busy mind blocks the connection. Begin in a quiet place, free of noise, and train your thoughts. When a negative thought comes, imagine it bursting into particles and disappearing, then put the new thought in and continue: not rejecting, transforming. Every thought is drawn from the quantum field (you are the quantum field); focusing gathers that \"symphony of frequency\" into one tonality. Even channelling is imprinting a consciousness into your own reality: ultimately you're talking with your own consciousness.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "16.6  Soul agreements and karma", "url": "s2-section-16.html#part-16-6", "text": "Karma is accumulated, out-of-balance frequency. Until it's cleared, you can't \"graduate to the next class\": not as punishment, but because a higher timeline has a different frequency your consciousness can't match yet. So the same situations reprint and loop. Clear it through the lessons: forgive, stop the lies and scheming, help, support each other, and use the manifestation protocol (see S1 14, S2 14.3). Soul agreements are held with your guidance and higher self. After a very hard relationship, for example, you can ask to shut down the program of that agreement, having learned the lesson so you don't repeat it. Whether it's granted depends on how well you did: ask for it. DP gives the same promise of release once the lessons are done: \"Your new karma will be cleared and you will become a strong awake.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "16.7  When someone you love is addicted", "url": "s2-section-16.html#part-16-7", "text": "Addiction is a very potent vibrational sequence held in the memory of the body's membranes, built by repetition, so it's very hard for the person to transform. You can't change another person's modality. What you can do is reprint your version of them: visualize them well, happy and no longer drinking, and hold that in your own vibration without trying to overtake them. You're changing your platform, not them. Their own change must come from them, if they are willing, and then it takes consistent effort, every day (see S1 3). Support Alcohol addiction is a medical condition, and help works. Encourage your loved one to see a doctor; family support groups (such as Al-Anon) help relatives too. In the US, the SAMHSA helpline is 1-800-662-4357, free and confidential.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "16.8  Where humanity comes from", "url": "s2-section-16.html#part-16-8", "text": "Humanity connects with many races: we were made from extraterrestrials through genetics, as part of evolution (the talk mentioned nine to twelve races). \"Nothing scary\": technology can be used positively or negatively, depending on the consciousness using it. That shared DNA is why you can connect with your galactic family (see S2 12.11).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "The method — The Fifth-Dimensional Earth Meditation", "url": "s2-section-16.html#method", "text": "About fifteen minutes. Close your eyes; you can simply listen or read the steps slowly: Calm to zero point. Breathe in and out, slowly, as if floating. Feel joy. \"I am happy.\" Grab the vibration of joy and love until you feel goosebumps, like electricity. From that feeling, see your fifth-dimensional Earth. What does it look like? Nature, communities, free energy, people helping each other. Meet your galactic family. What do they look like? Greet them, talk, learn from each other. Feel the joy. Add layers: places, crafts, technologies, your own experiences in that world. Increase the feeling for about a minute, more and more, until tears and goosebumps, while holding the image. Hold it, about 30 seconds, breathing through it. Drop it on a countdown (9 to 0), and come back. Afterwards, act daily: revisit the blueprint each night, read and watch positive material, avoid negative social media, and do things in the name of humanity.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "Which herbal tea helped your son's healing?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "It was a blend made specifically for his body by a professional herbalist abroad, with components not disclosed; it isn't something to copy. Remedies need to be made for each person.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "Can a sound-frequency software program heal conditions like insulin resistance or kidney or thyroid problems?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "Healing by frequency and sound is possible, but must be customized: see 16.1.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "Red marks like burns appeared inside both my underarms; no pain, no itch. Was I attacked by non-physical beings?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "\"Three pictograms\" (look into that word); and not negative.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "Is shungite from Earth, and does it protect bees from electromagnetic fields?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "It came in and, with Earth's change of frequency, was incorporated and is now reproduced by the Earth itself: the Earth is alive and can mutate structures, over millennia. Bees: yes, their frequency can be corrected, but be careful: there is a geometry on their wings that resonates with sound, and \"bees are not flying, they are floating by sound.\" Measure what they need before applying anything; experiment carefully.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "A healer told me to \"correct the spin of the solar system within the body\". What does it mean?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "The body itself is a solar system. If you connect your consciousness to that belief, you change your hologram's modality: sonic tunnels, like portals, create the next imprint. Depending on your point of view, anything is possible; but take care not to adopt a wrong idea, because you then project it as your reality.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "Chaotic events are coming. Is there something tangible we can do, a position or a breath, to stay unaffected?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "Yes: the meditation (see 16.3 and the Method), then daily action.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "Half-asleep at 4 a.m., I was shown a tiny bubble, \"a portable portal\", and looked through it. Did I go through?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "\"Yes, you went home\"; three beings were there and a discussion took place. Go back into the experience and through the portal again, and the answer will be there.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "Is the human race connected with a particular alien race?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "Many: see 16.8.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "I was badly injured saving an elderly woman from a fall, and now face doctors and insurance battles. Is this a test? Who is my star family?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "Star family is blocked from view by much sorrow. On insurance: \"Everything will change\" (three times); \"liberation is coming… platform will change, humanity will change.\" (Political and vaccine remarks in the answer are left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "How can I contact my higher self better?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "See 16.5: quiet the mind.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "How can we stop fearful entities and cancel soul agreements?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "See 16.6.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "There have been no squirrels in my area this year. Why?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "A sign that shifts are happening, prompting you to ask what changed and look for solutions. Help them: build a squirrel house with organic seeds, and ask for them to reappear in your hologram.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "My ears have rung for two years. How do I stop it?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "\"This is not a frequency\": see a doctor; it was read as a slight inflammation around the eardrum. Keep the ear warm (for example with an organic cotton ball).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "Occasionally a distinct tone plays in my ear for a few seconds. What is it?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "It could be a download, to memory or to DNA, depending on the person. Like staring at glyphs, it downloads only if your resonance matches.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "My brother drinks heavily and can't stop. Is something attached to him? What can we do?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "See 16.7. Visualizing him well once brought him months of sobriety; when you stopped, it changed. Keep overriding, consistently. A healing session can help only if he's willing, and then needs daily consistency.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "In the meditation, I cried, wanting to go home, and heard cracking in my head. What was it?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "Normal: you're penetrating the barriers of the new frequency; dizziness can happen too (see the note under 16.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "My job involves advertising on social media. Should I stop?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "No: see 16.2. Only avoid the negative content.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "My dog has ear inflammation; cortisone made it worse. What else can I do?", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "It's fungus. What worked for the teacher's dog: cleaning the ears with cotton balls and a 50/50 mix of organic apple cider vinegar and distilled water, carefully.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-16.html#remember", "text": "• Build your 5D Earth's blueprint with joy to goosebumps, hold it, drop it, then act. • Each action makes the new reality more potent. • Quiet the mind; dissolve and replace negative thoughts. • Karma clears through lessons, forgiveness and help. • For loved ones: hold their healthy version, without control.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2016, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 16", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-16.html#questions", "text": "Note Unexplained marks or rashes on the skin deserve a doctor's look. Note Persistent ringing in the ears (tinnitus) should be checked by a doctor or ear specialist. Note Check with your vet before using home remedies in a dog's ears, especially if the skin is broken or the eardrum may be damaged. The recording begins mid-answer, about AI and subtones (see 16.1). The co-host's own story, names, and political and vaccine remarks are left out.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-17.html#big-idea", "text": "A scientist asked how distilled water could be \"negatively charged\" when chemically it's neutral. The council agreed it is neutral, and explained that in the body it mimics the stronger frequency (such as toxins), which changes its charge and lets it carry them out; water, they said, has memory. Structured water, by contrast, must be measured for each person. Around this, the talk repeats its own limits: it shares the teacher's experience, not advice; work with doctors; never rely on it instead of medical care. It also gives a short message on money (a secure new system; \"keep it cool\"), and explains that during sleep you co-create in other realities, which you can learn to recall.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "17.1  The question, and the council's answer", "url": "s2-section-17.html#part-17-1", "text": "The question, sent by a scientist: distilled water is pure H2O; its positive and negative charges cancel, so it is neutral. What is missing? The council: \"You are correct: the water molecule appears to be neutral.\" However, with the spinning of each person's molecular structure, distilled water \"becomes negative\" when it meets unnatural toxins in the body: a ripple effect, as it mimics the stronger frequency. \"What humans are failing to understand is that water has memory and is able to reconstruct the system of a new platform of structures.\" Because distilled water starts neutral, it corrects and pulls out \"only the toxins\", whose frequency is stronger than the body's natural compounds. The council proposed an experiment: shine light through two glasses of water, one with a substance in it; within days, they said, the plain glass will mimic the other. A second scientist, asked by the teacher, agreed from his perspective: the spin rate of the distilled water's atoms \"rejects that which does not belong.\" The teacher also pointed to research on water's memory. DP and SD both print this exact exchange, including the two-glass experiment and the second scientist's reply. HR had earlier stated: \"Distilled water has (-) charge and is measurement match for the portal.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "17.2  Distilled or structured water?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#part-17-2", "text": "Distilled water is said to pick up exactly what needs to come out of your body. Structured, magnetized or spun water is \"a different implementation\": you'd need to measure your molecular structure first to know whether you need it and how much (the earlier structured-water example used set frequencies for a fixed duration, for everyone, to keep the body in a normal state; toxins still have to come out). And no water replaces responsibility: eat well, detox carefully, and don't keep taking in toxins expecting water to fix it. Keep distilled water pure; you can pray over it or meditate with crystals around it, since it mimics your thoughts.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "17.3  The teacher's own experience", "url": "s2-section-17.html#part-17-3", "text": "With pneumonia, she was told by her guidance to drink only distilled water for three days and eat nothing, and she recovered. Her understanding: the bacteria had the stronger frequency, and the neutral water mimicked it and carried it out. Her homeopath and doctors disagreed (\"it will deplete your nutrients\"); she researched, experimented on herself under medical supervision, and shares it only as her experience: \"I am in no case advising anybody to do what I did.\" Safety note Pneumonia can be life-threatening; it needs prompt medical care and often antibiotics. Don't fast or rely on water to treat an infection.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "17.4  Medicines and repairing the body", "url": "s2-section-17.html#part-17-4", "text": "Her belief: a strong pharmaceutical compound can sustain the body without helping it repair its own tissue, so some people stay on medication for life; she chose, with her doctors monitoring her blood tests, to try to repair tissue through detox and diet. But she is clear: in a life-threatening situation, use the medication; do what's necessary to survive. Her hope is that medical and natural medicine work \"in coalition, as one unit\", and that we stay cautious and informed about side effects. Safety note Thyroid medicine, inhalers and other prescribed treatments must not be stopped or reduced without your doctor; doing so can be dangerous.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "17.5  Research creates the answers", "url": "s2-section-17.html#part-17-5", "text": "When something doesn't make sense, search sincerely, and you create a reality in which the answer appears. (When her son was ill and advice contradicted what her family had always known, she went to a library; her hand fell on a book that addressed exactly her question.) \"The truth sets you free, because it's the higher vibration.\" But use logic: \"anybody can claim anything. Even in this video, I can claim anything.\" Research, test, and make your own decisions (see S2 11.10).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "17.6  Working with doctors", "url": "s2-section-17.html#part-17-6", "text": "Many people feel doctors dismiss them. The teacher still urges working with them, because only a medical doctor can order the tests that show what's really happening; she found an open-minded doctor willing to run the tests she asked about, and monitored every change. Natural practitioners and doctors each have a part.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "17.7  Stones in their purest form", "url": "s2-section-17.html#part-17-7", "text": "Before 2012, her guidance asked her to buy uncut stones for energetic work, not pre-cut or shaped ones: the potency is in the purest form, and shaping may change a stone's properties. Likewise, keep water pure rather than adding compounds (such as shungite) to distilled water.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "17.8  A new money message", "url": "s2-section-17.html#part-17-8", "text": "\"Propaganda will not be allowed.\" Money will be gold-backed, with a reset \"soon\": \"keep it cool\", don't worry. Whatever the economy does, don't panic; \"the economy is going to be safe.\" A new, secure system is already in place; money will be returned to the people. \"No one knows\" how it will play out (see S2 10.3). Note These are predictions, not financial advice. Remarks about a criminal case and an online conspiracy source are left out.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "17.9  What happens while you sleep", "url": "s2-section-17.html#part-17-9", "text": "Realities run like different channels. When you sleep, the structure splits: while your body keeps sleeping, your higher self co-creates another reality (for example, with your galactic family), and both run at once. Your memory may not hold it, because you're not allowed yet or it isn't time. Lucid dreaming creates yet another reality in between; even then, you may not be allowed into certain places (the teacher was twice sent back from a spacecraft: \"you are not allowed to be here\") until it's your time and your frequency matches (see S2 15). To remember: on waking, write down whatever you recall, then sit back and let your thoughts guide you (\"what were you doing? Try again\"). You couldn't see those structures if you hadn't experienced them; you're recalling what you co-created.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "The method — Recalling Your Night", "url": "s2-section-17.html#method", "text": "Before you move, on waking, notice any image or feeling left from the night. Write it down, even a fragment. Sit back quietly and ask: \"What was I doing? Where was I?\" Let the thoughts come; if it's vague, \"try again\", tuning in more each time. Ask what it was for, and how you might use it. Trust it: you are recalling something you co-created, not inventing it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "Isn't structured and magnetized water better for self-healing?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "A different implementation: see 17.2. It needs measuring for you.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "Does distilled water pull out toxins from food and pollution, if there's more of it in the body?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "That is the council's answer (see 17.1). The teacher added her own view on thyroid medicines and tissue repair (see 17.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "If water takes on the stronger frequency, wouldn't it take on the toxin?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "Yes: that's the point: it takes the toxin's frequency and carries it out.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "Doesn't distilled water deplete nutrients?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "The talk says it pulls out what has the stronger frequency, meaning toxins, not nutrients.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "Can I purify rainwater by spinning it clockwise with my finger and intention?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "It depends on how long and how you spin it; it would need measuring. That's why distilled water was recommended: it's neutral.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "I structure my distilled water and add quartz crystals. Should I stop?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "Keep it distilled. You can pray over it or meditate with crystals around it; it mimics the wave of your thoughts.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "Should a cleanse be supported with distilled rather than filtered water?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "\"This is what I did.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "How much of distilled water's effect is intention, as with homeopathy?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "It depends on the person, which is why the teacher had both a homeopathic and a medical doctor checking her blood work. When her thyroid results improved, her doctor wouldn't claim it was possible: doctors can't endorse what they haven't studied.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "Will distilled water pull out medications?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "\"Yes, slowly, within ten days\", with no food for the first three days. (A claim; see the note at the top of this section, and never stop medication without your doctor.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "I charge my water with a plate device and sunlight, write \"love\" on the jug and add lemon, lime and ginger. Any suggestions?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "\"That is completely doable. Keep going with that; it works for you.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "Unless we cleanse, are we all walking around with toxins?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "Not necessarily; everyone is different. But with toxins in the air and food, most of us carry some. Eat healthily and consider detoxing; and structured water only with personal measurement. As with a painkiller, you don't keep taking something once the body no longer needs it.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "Isn't there \"distilled water\" in fruit, such as watermelon and apple?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "Yes, but it carries the vibration of the fruit's own molecular structure.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "I had hypothyroidism, now hyperthyroidism, and take no medicine. What water could help?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "\"You definitely need a doctor's supervision.\" Get tested. The teacher found her own thyroid problem early through a specific antibody test (generic tests looked normal), and improved with an elimination diet, juicing and distilled water over about a year, under monitoring. If the gland is already destroyed, she can't promise repair, and medication may be necessary.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "I have cervical cancer. Is a three-day distilled-water fast enough?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "\"No.\" Medical intervention and supervision are fundamental; there are clinics with both medical and homeopathic doctors. \"Don't do it only by yourself.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "What does drinking distilled water with shungite do? Does it change DNA?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "\"Very much so\", but shungite also neutralizes, being a different compound. Not recommended: keep the water pure, so it mimics what you need (see 17.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "Are the carbon filters in water distillers dangerous?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "It depends on manufacturing: chemical compounds can leak into the water. Use the purest carbon. Carbon and sand in layers purify water but don't distil it.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "Doctors often dismiss me. Why go?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "See 17.6: you need them for proper tests.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "How does the structure work while we sleep? Some days I wake to drama.", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "See 17.9.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "My multidimensional selves seem to block what I'm trying to do now. How do I transmute them without rejecting them?", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "Something has changed; go back to the first three sections of Season 1 and switch platforms without rejection: pull back and create another platform through action. Don't put a timer on it: it took the teacher two years before \"it was like an avalanche.\" It takes as long as your lessons; hold the heart.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-17.html#remember", "text": "• The council's teaching: distilled water mimics the stronger frequency and carries it out (a claim). • Structured water must be measured for you; keep distilled water pure. • Never stop medicine on your own; use it when life is at stake. • Research with logic: anyone can claim anything. • Write your dreams down and recall them: you co-created them.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2017, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 17", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-17.html#questions", "text": "Note Drinking distilled water is generally safe, but it contains no minerals; a balanced diet provides them. Note Rainwater can carry bacteria and pollutants; boil, filter or treat it before drinking. Safety note Cancer needs treatment from an oncology team. Fasting or water cannot treat it, and delaying treatment can cost lives. The talk's legal disclaimer, promotions of a craftsperson and an author, references to a criminal case, an online conspiracy source and outside people, and names are left out.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-18.html#big-idea", "text": "As consciousness rises into the heart, whatever is off balance surfaces, and everyone, whatever side they're on, will meet a personal situation that wakes them up. At that moment you choose: look into it, or look away. Waking up means seeing clearly first (you can't fly if you don't know there's air), then shifting with the quantum structure. When you share what you've seen, shine the light gently, without blinding anyone. With strong emotions, subside to zero first, then build the new blueprint: know what, never insist on how. When a situation keeps recurring, peel the layers: are you looping through fear, or is it a lesson to let go? And don't give your power away, to objects, to fears, or to anyone's reading.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "18.1  Wake-up moments come to everyone", "url": "s2-section-18.html#part-18-1", "text": "Parallel realities collapse together when they're similar in vibration, and the result becomes the outcome (see S1 15, S2 13.2). As the planet and universe ascend into the heart, anyone out of balance with it, \"even if you're dark forces\", will meet something in their personal life that asks: \"Wait a minute, am I doing the right thing?\" Because everyone is part of the one particle, what you do to another you do to your own reflection. So don't be surprised by challenges: they show what needs fixing. A friend of fifteen years may suddenly show another face; it's showing you something now. At that moment you choose to look into it or to pull out of it. \"You cannot have your head in the sand all the time\": eventually an \"earthquake\" pops it out, which is harder. How would you know you're under water if you'd never heard of the sky?", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "18.2  Investigate, don't attack", "url": "s2-section-18.html#part-18-2", "text": "Many people jump on each other online instead of saying \"let me investigate that\": that, the teacher said, is intelligence. Look at the evidence yourself, without blaming or pointing fingers, because division is what keeps us apart: unite. \"The truth can never be controversial\": when realities collapse to one probability, that's the manifested timeline. Then shift with the manifestation protocol to a new timeline. Note The talk again recommended specific online sources and named people and cases. In keeping with this book's approach, these are left out. Check claims against reliable, accountable sources (see S2 11.10).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "18.3  Share the light gently", "url": "s2-section-18.html#part-18-3", "text": "A message read in the talk, and endorsed by the teacher: information may soon come out that causes shock and disbelief. Digging into the worst of it could be heartbreaking. The point is not to dwell in darkness but to remember: when you share, shepherd people gently. Remember how shocking it was for you, how angry or helpless you felt. \"Shine the light; just be careful not to blind them with it.\" Give their eyes time to adjust; your steadiness will help them feel better. If we mean to rebuild society side by side, we need goodwill, especially when someone's whole world view turns upside down.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "18.4  A lesson in the body needs action", "url": "s2-section-18.html#part-18-4", "text": "When there's a lesson, you don't just meditate it away. In physical matter, you know you're okay and, at the same time, act: look for doctors and solutions, ask questions, research. Through that journey you create and find the reality in which you're okay (see S2 14.3). Instant manifestation does happen, more and more, but until then, practise: \"you have to create it to see it\", not \"see it to believe it.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "18.5  Abduction fears and \"hyper holograms\"", "url": "s2-section-18.html#part-18-5", "text": "The idea of \"abduction\" was put in our minds to attach fear to contact. Some cases were negative, and some (the talk said) were staged by secret projects that hypnotized people and projected a hologram of abduction. Many real experiences happen on a parallel platform: you shift, and it doesn't stay in your everyday reality; so take it as a dream state, without fear. Information comes bit by bit, as your agreements allow. \"Another level\": beings can take someone on board to help or save them and place a reality in their consciousness; the consciousness then creates a parallel reality, a hyper hologram, mimicking the frequency it came from, so the person experiences ordinary life while actually being on a craft. Information like this is given \"spoon by spoon\", because it only makes sense once you know the structure. So expand your thinking, and don't take any one reading as the whole truth: there may be structures not yet revealed to you. \"Study the quantum structure… that is your freedom.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "18.6  Strong emotions: subside first", "url": "s2-section-18.html#part-18-6", "text": "Grief and compassion, or \"masculine\" and \"feminine\" feelings, are one unit. Whatever the emotion, pull out and subside it to neutrality, observing (see S2 15.7). It may take time: the teacher once had to remove herself and sit by a pool for 45 minutes to calm down. Then use the manifestation meditation (see S2 16) with a clear idea of what you want, letting go of who, where and how. Knowing what you want isn't an \"expectation\": picture the red house, but don't insist on who builds it or where the money comes from. And abundance isn't only money: if you tie it to money, you shut out every other probability (someone may simply give you the car). If a situation repeats, note where your emotions and actions are, and write a paper trail. Gratitude is neutrality.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "18.7  Living food has more potency", "url": "s2-section-18.html#part-18-7", "text": "Dried greens and powders still work, but their vibration is less potent than a living plant's: fresh, raw juice is more potent and heals faster. Herbal healing works best as the right combination of plants, made by an expert for the person. Healing should address the whole system, the whole immune structure, not one spot.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "18.8  Sacred geometry unlocks with awareness", "url": "s2-section-18.html#part-18-8", "text": "Sacred geometry with light opens portals and creates realities; the teacher was told to step back from studying it. New, very complex geometries are coming (geometry within geometry, pulsing and merging, each merge creating a new structure), unlocked as awareness grows. \"Your consciousness already knows them.\" They'll be shown to each person; whatever makes sense in your consciousness is usually the right path.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "18.9  Levels, numbers, and your own power", "url": "s2-section-18.html#part-18-9", "text": "Unlocking a level is like graduating a grade: the next one has its own lessons, and more is given as you complete them. Repeated numbers are the matrix itself, showing where you are (see S2 15.4); each layer of hologram has its own frequency. And when you ask \"what did I see?\", the answer is: \"Do you believe, or do you know?\" If you know, you manifested it. Don't hand your power to someone else's interpretation; two people side by side can each live their own reality within the reality.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "18.10  Telepathy: it's you, too", "url": "s2-section-18.html#part-18-10", "text": "Ultimately, whoever you talk to (guidance, councils, the teacher), you're talking to another version of yourself, imprinting it in your hologram so you can have the experience (see S2 12.5). So don't fret about whether a thought is \"yours\". If a negative one comes, treat it like a wrong number: \"Oh, sorry\", give gratitude, put a positive frequency in, and ask again. Above all, no fear: fear lowers your vibration and can connect you with what you don't want.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "18.11  Standing your ground, and letting go", "url": "s2-section-18.html#part-18-11", "text": "If people keep challenging what you believe, stand your ground. Neutralize the situation inside you, then secure your borders (change access, block, end the affiliation) so you don't keep creating holograms with that energy (see S2 7.4). Ascension brings such tests often, frequently around money and greed: talented people who start out wanting to help can be pulled off course. When something keeps recurring, peel the layers: are you transforming through the quantum, from the heart, or fluctuating through fear? If it's fear, you're looping: return to zero point and rebuild. If you've truly gone through the heart again and again and it still recurs, it's a lesson, and sometimes it means letting go of that person or situation. (The teacher was told: \"don't even bother, do not even call.\")", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "18.12  No attachment to things", "url": "s2-section-18.html#part-18-12", "text": "When gadgets break one after another and money seems short: \"So what? They're just gadgets.\" Being upset gives a simple object power over your emotion and reality. Laugh, and at the same time know you have everything you need, and take action: try to repair it, look for help, look for work. The missing link is usually doubt: connect the feeling of already having it with the action. Help can come from anywhere (the teacher once received, unexpectedly, the exact sum for a mortgage payment two days before it was due). For energy philanthropy: a main provider may charge and pay their bills, then give, for example, one day a week freely. If you only ever charge, what crystallizes is the monetary structure alone, and you never let the heart's support come in without conditions (see S1 4.4, S2 12.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "18.13  Where humanity comes from", "url": "s2-section-18.html#part-18-13", "text": "Asked whether humans were made in labs: \"all of the above\". Humanity was made from extraterrestrials through genetic engineering long ago, and later hijacked by negative consciousness that used the human body as an energy source, \"like a battery\" (a claim). History will be rewritten, and each person will be told their origins by their guidance. But don't judge the negative side: if all a species ever learned to survive was taking over, how could it know better? Consciousness has to preserve itself; that's why the separation is happening now. Genetic engineering itself is \"exciting\": what matters is how it's used (see S2 12.11).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "The method — When It Keeps Coming Back", "url": "s2-section-18.html#method", "text": "Notice the pattern: the same kind of person or situation, again. Write a paper trail: what happened, what you felt, what you did. Peel the layers: was I acting from the heart and the quantum structure, or fluctuating through fear? If fear: pull out, subside to zero, do the manifestation meditation, know it's resolved, then act. If heart, and it still recurs: it's a lesson. Neutralize, secure your borders, and let it go. Don't attach: laugh at what you can't control, and keep acting from \"I have what I need.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "Could a cyst at the base of my spine block the kundalini? Could distilled water clear it?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "No: \"it's more intervention.\" Deal with it; look into proper care (the word given was chiropractic). See 18.4.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "Years ago I dreamed Earth was burning and aliens, presenting as God, took me aboard; I felt safe. Was I abducted?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "Not an abduction: see 18.5. It happened on a parallel platform; take it without fear, and more will come bit by bit, as your agreements allow.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "I'm coming to terms with something very hard. I feel peace in \"there is only now\", and I also need to grieve. Is it okay to have both? And how is wanting to change things not an expectation?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "See 18.6.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "What happens to a water-soluble vitamin when a leaf dries? What are vitamins, really?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "See 18.7: the living structure is more potent than the dried one.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "What do permanent tattoos, especially sacred geometry, do to the energy body?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "See 18.8: sacred geometry can open portals; follow what makes sense in your consciousness.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "In a dream, a father figure taught me a movement that made light come from my hand; he said I'd unlocked a level, with eight to go, and showed number codes. Then I saw white orbs and an eye in the sky.", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "See 18.9: a level unlocked means new lessons. The numbers are the matrix showing your layer. The orbs: \"What do you think? Do you believe, or know?\" You know: so you manifested it. The codes are designed for you alone.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "I watch every word with people so I don't manifest what I don't want. Any advice?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "See 18.11: neutralize, stand your ground, secure your borders. A talk on self-worth was announced.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "I've been trying to activate my merkaba with spiralling energy. Should I continue?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "Yes, with emotion and joy. Your consciousness knows it; create your own. Specific geometries come later, through your own guidance.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "My brother's leg hurts; he just takes painkillers. What's going on?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "\"The answer is your brother needs to go to the doctor\", not only to take painkillers; the word given was \"stubbornness\".", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "The effects of 5G seem unavoidable. How do we cope?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "Shift timelines: know it's already taken care of and that you live in a reality where it isn't harmful; leave how open. Fear keeps reprinting the same thing (see S2 11.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "Were humans created in labs? Are we hybrids?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "See 18.13.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "What are the sensations on my crown filtering down my face?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "The energy coming through mimics your emotion at that moment: notice what you were thinking. If you feel neutral and something happens anyway, a code in your program has come up to deal with.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "Any message for my sister and me?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "Nothing came; \"don't judge it, and ask again next time.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "Why do I see sequential numbers all day?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "They show the structure you're in at that moment; associated with objects, they tend to be more permanent (see 18.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "How does telepathy work? How do I tell my thoughts from others'?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "See 18.10.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "My partnership has ended and I may not afford my house. I'm scared. Should I move?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "A probability shows downsizing, \"if you choose to\". But watch what you project: if you feel you don't want to stay, situations will come that make you leave. If you want to stay, imagine staying. Not knowing what you want is fluctuating (see S1 3); restudy the first three sections of Season 1, and see 18.11.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "I've twice been woken by a loud bell in my bedroom at night. What is it?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "Both the fearful and the fearless version are available; which manifests depends on what you hold more. Transform it with gratitude, and more will be revealed.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "Since working on old \"lack\" programs, my appliances keep breaking and my cat needs the vet. I'm laughing. What should I do?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "Exactly that, plus action and knowing: see 18.12.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "Is it true that work is being done to stop aerial spraying?", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "\"It's already working… don't worry about it.\" (The sources named are left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-18.html#remember", "text": "• Wake-up moments come to everyone: look, don't look away. • Share hard truths gently; don't blind anyone with the light. • Know what you want; leave how, who and where open. • When it recurs: fear means loop; heart means lesson, so let go. • Don't give your power to things, fears or other people's readings.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2018, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 18", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-18.html#questions", "text": "Note Have any cyst or growth assessed by a doctor first, before any manual therapy. Note Health agencies have found no evidence that 5G harms health at normal exposure levels. The talk's references to online conspiracy sources, a criminal case, a film studio, named individuals and religion, and names of participants are left out. The co-host's written message (18.3) is kept as a teaching.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-19.html#big-idea", "text": "\"If you don't charge, you don't value yourself\" is called a three-dimensional illusion. In the quantum structure, whoever you give to is another version of yourself: setting a price puts a condition on your own reflection, and conditions come back. Leaving it open, so people support you freely from the heart, builds heart frequency that returns like a boomerang. So \"you value yourself the most when you give freely.\" This is a transition, not a leap: a main provider can charge and pay the bills, then give a day or two. Free will works \"to a point\": tasks you came to complete will be completed, with guidance nudging you back on track. And grief and old pain can be released, because what happened belongs to another timeline.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "19.1  The illusion: \"charge to value yourself\"", "url": "s2-section-19.html#part-19-1", "text": "When you think a thought, your molecule imprints it in the quantum structure and you project another version of yourself (another person) to interact with; between you, a third structure forms (1 + 1 = 3; see S1 2.2). If, into that thought, you put a dollar sign (\"I value myself; to get this information, you must pay\"), then that condition is imprinted on your own reflection. You are putting a condition on yourself, through another version of you, for information that was given to you freely. \"Tell me if this is in the heart.\" Charging isn't wrong: it's the three-dimensional structure, and you can make billions that way. But we're moving into the heart structure, where you leave it completely open: let your reflection come to the heart and decide freely whether to support you. Then the exchange, and the third structure it creates, is entirely in the heart, with no condition on manifestation.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "19.2  Giving freely returns like a boomerang", "url": "s2-section-19.html#part-19-2", "text": "Support given from someone's free heart carries a completely different frequency back to you. Do it moment to moment, with joy, and you accumulate heart frequency; the next hologram you shift into is in the heart structure, a new timeline no longer in the conditioned one. \"Our job is to accumulate by giving\": the more you accumulate, the more potent it becomes, until it pops into full abundance (see S1 4, S2 12.7). The lesson from the teacher's own week: an urgent call came from a mother with a sick child; busy as she was, she helped fully, asking nothing, in joy. Within half an hour, an unexpected donation arrived that more than covered that time. \"You cannot make money on people's suffering.\" And to be supported, project support: she regularly gives small amounts to others whose work she values. DP: \"Does it not hurt you when you are in need of help and yet someone is plastering a false price to your suffering?… Be love, be joy, be giving\" (see S2 7.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "19.3  Asking without permission overtakes free will", "url": "s2-section-19.html#part-19-3", "text": "\"Asking for money without a permission is overtaking somebody's consciousness\": you don't give them the free will to support you. It comes from a self-illusion of looping, needing something because you don't know how to manifest freely. The council's challenge: \"Would you help that human being if you couldn't put a value on it?\" If someone has nothing to give and you have the knowledge, how is withholding it valuing them, or yourself? And you're never \"depleted\" by giving: keep it in neutrality, without rejecting either the person or the money. \"When you give from the heart, you preserve your soul\" and keep your consciousness in balance.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "19.4  In practice: a transition", "url": "s2-section-19.html#part-19-4", "text": "No one is asked to drop everything as the teacher did (she had constant guidance through it, and it was very hard). If you're the main provider, charge, pay your bills, and then set aside one or two days to help people, just because, so you begin accumulating the frequency of giving. Without the action, you won't see it, because you never projected it. Use the monetary structure as a step toward what you love: take work that pays while you transition. And don't see professional help as negative: a good lawyer, for instance, knows the system and can guide you; take it as positive, and the reality shifts (see S2 14.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "19.5  Why this keeps coming up", "url": "s2-section-19.html#part-19-5", "text": "Because the councils see how often people, including light workers, separate from the heart as they become popular: prices rise, VIP tiers appear, and fame and greed take over what they originally came to do. Some even find they can no longer download information (see S2 12.7). \"You value yourself the most when you give freely\", and the repetition is for anyone who needs it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "19.6  Free will, and the tasks you must complete", "url": "s2-section-19.html#part-19-6", "text": "\"Free will is a factor, to a point.\" Moment to moment, you choose your thoughts and emotions, and your fractal imprints change accordingly. But if there is a bylaw, something you came to complete, it is inevitable. If you go off track, your guidance places synchronicities or imprinted situations into your hologram (you meet someone, someone says something, something \"smacks you in the side\") until you return to the right location. \"It's always going to get completed… they won't give up on you\" (see S2 10.1).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "19.7  Ultimate focus: the instructions for complete manifestation", "url": "s2-section-19.html#part-19-7", "text": "Instructions the teacher was given for a full manifestation: for a period, consume nothing except what relates to what you want (no social media, no other books or films). Want a garden? Watch only gardening, non-stop. Detox and eat cleanly at the same time, to raise the molecular structure. Check yourself every half hour. This creates a steady vibration that keeps building the next hologram at the same frequency. It's very challenging, because we were taught the opposite: it takes \"absolute control of the mind\". How long? Unknown: it depends on desire, emotion and the person (the teacher's own giving took two years before it became \"like an avalanche\"). But the more you practise and stay in the heart, the quicker it gets, and as you see results, fear falls away because \"you literally know\". A film about a man who meditated his way into another time shows the same principle.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "19.8  Mistakes are part of it", "url": "s2-section-19.html#part-19-8", "text": "Clearing toxic thinking doesn't always feel heartful, and that can frighten you. \"Don't worry if you make errors; it's normal, part of the process. As long as you keep trying, you're always helped.\" The teacher herself slips with her diet and goes back to it. The challenge is controlling your emotion to stay steady.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "19.9  Grief belongs to another timeline", "url": "s2-section-19.html#part-19-9", "text": "When grief or depression won't lift, it's because you keep reprinting the emotional vibration of a past hologram. The loss happened in a different timeline of Earth, to another version of you; you hold it in memory to stay connected to it. Understanding that it's not happening to you now is itself the release: \"You don't need to think of that anymore; you're free\" (see S1 14.5). Support Long-lasting grief or depression is real and treatable. Please talk to a doctor or counsellor, or a grief support group. If you ever have thoughts of ending your life, call or text 988 (US) or your local emergency number.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "19.10  Help without carrying the burden", "url": "s2-section-19.html#part-19-10", "text": "Every interaction is with another version of yourself, so you may help someone in hardship (in prison, say), but don't carry their vibration: \"you cannot carry the burden of illusion.\" Be there for assistance, without depleting yourself. If you keep repeating yourself to someone who doesn't want to hear, you're trying to overtake their belief system. Tell your truth; the right people come, according to your vibration.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "19.11  Stay neutral; don't target individuals", "url": "s2-section-19.html#part-19-11", "text": "Thoughts come all the time; what matters is how you meet them. The teacher once named a specific public figure publicly and, the next day, felt a strong telepathic attack. She stayed in neutrality, observing without fear or judgment (even that consciousness chose its path by free will), apologized, and promised not to name individuals. \"You stay in your structure; we stay in ours.\" At that level, keep the balance, and express love: negative structure cannot sustain itself in a loving vibration.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "19.12  Animals, insects and the vibration you carry", "url": "s2-section-19.html#part-19-12", "text": "Insects (and bees) levitate on magnetic fields and read your frequency: they retaliate when you project fear, and won't attack someone resonating above the ego. Any animal recognizes the frequency of the heart. Eating meat accumulates pain frequency (\"don't say you love animals when you eat them\"), so transition, step by step (see S2 11.6). Bees keep the resonance around the flowers; their loss reflects a vibration change they couldn't hold, \"but the new Earth has plenty of them.\" And you don't need to spin your body to raise its frequency: the heart, action and diet do that.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "The method — Begin Giving Freely", "url": "s2-section-19.html#method", "text": "Keep paying your bills as you do now; nothing is abandoned. Choose a day or two each week (or a few hours) to help someone with what you know, for free. Give in joy, expecting nothing; no price, no hint of obligation. Leave it open: if anyone wishes to support you, let it be their free choice, and thank every gift. Support others whose work you value, when you can. Stay neutral about money: don't reject it, and don't attach to it. Keep going, moment to moment; the heart frequency accumulates and returns.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "We've covered this many times. Why does it keep coming up?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "See 19.5. (Several listeners said they needed to hear it again.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "How do destiny, the soul's plan and free will relate?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "See 19.6.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "What are the consequences of killing insects? And can spinning help regenerate cells?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "See 19.12.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "Did my co-worker and I share a past life?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "Not on this platform, but you were connected through an ET structure, most likely the same family (\"something with the blood\").", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "I want to create a collective 5D project on family land. Is my intention right?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "\"Not tension, but intention\": it's already manifesting. A personal message came: connect with the earth, dig, plant; keep that land; it's a sanctuary. You're on the right path.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "My grandchild has severe autism; it's hard to feel happy. Please help.", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "It's embedded in the DNA; more discoveries will come to help the child. Keep the child's life as pure and chemical-free as possible, with a clean diet, and have the child checked for seizures, which can be very small.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "Where am I on my spiritual journey? Is my planned move right?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "A personal message: you've let yourself go and are in depression. \"How do you wish us to help you when you don't have the desire to help yourself?\" Love is always there; you're blocking it. \"Your light is dim… and could be only joy.\" Stop being lonely: go out, engage, express yourself from the heart; study the quantum structure; and take the action.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "When I meditate, how do I know I'm connected with my higher self? How do I stop thoughts coming in?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "Thoughts always come; learn to meet them (see 19.11 and S2 16.5). Trust is built as guidance proves itself; stay neutral, without fear.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "I'm an older light worker. Will I live, in good health, to see the shift?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "Stay with this knowledge and you'll keep shifting into Earths where new technologies appear, such as tissue repair by nano and quantum technology and sound. Such technology exists but is withheld for now, so it isn't turned into profit. Self-regeneration comes with diet and detox. \"We don't have to die\" to shift timelines; the body was designed to mutate and shift physically (a claim; see S2 14.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "Should I do the full licensing portfolio to work in my profession abroad? How do I get a work visa?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "The portfolio: it will take time, but you'll get recognition. Meanwhile, take any work that pays, as a step (see 19.4). For the visa: \"immediately, lawyer\"; lawyers know the system. Whether you'll need to leave and return isn't settled yet: \"it's fluctuating.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "My daughter does research with chick embryos. What are the moral implications?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "\"What do you think you were made from?\" It's part of creation and evolution, all part of God consciousness, as long as it isn't used for destruction. What matters in the end is how it's used.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "I feel out of alignment with my mortgage and exotic imported food. Should I leave my house?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "Don't exclude yourself from society: transition. You can live in the heart within society. If you want to live in nature, find affordable land and an eco home (through lawyers, carefully). But don't jump out of fear, or you project more of it.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "Clearing toxic thinking doesn't feel heartful, and I worry. How long should I focus on one manifestation?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "See 19.7 and 19.8.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "I live near last year's volcanic eruption and keep returning there. Should I stay?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "You may stay, but not for long; circumstances will lead you to decide differently. Health-wise, it isn't wise: volcanic ash and gases in the air inflame the lungs.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "If something very negative happens, must we just accept it?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "Not passively: it's a lesson, like a hard task at school. Go through it using the quantum structure, and you'll find solutions and a positive outcome (restudy S1 1 to S1 3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "Why is it so hard to finish nursing school? I have two exams left.", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "\"Must complete.\" You will see darkness and bring light into it; \"people like you are needed.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "Why can't I let go of grief after losing my parents, and the depression of many years?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "See 19.9.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "I've moved back in with my mother because of health problems, and it's draining and painful. How do I cope until I leave?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "A tug of war; it will be very hard to keep your balance there. \"Get a grip\", and move forward.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "Is every interaction an interaction with myself? Should I help someone I know in prison?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "Yes, and you may help, but see 19.10.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "What is killing honeybees, and how can a beekeeper help them?", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "See 19.12. Look into how bees keep the resonance around flowers.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-19.html#remember", "text": "• You value yourself most when you give freely: you give to yourself. • A price puts a condition on your reflection; conditions return. • Transition: pay your bills, then give a day or two. • Tasks you came for will be completed; guidance won't give up. • Grief belongs to another timeline: you're free to let it go.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2019, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 19", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-19.html#questions", "text": "Support Families of autistic children deserve support too. A paediatrician or neurologist can assess for seizures, and autism family organizations offer practical help and community. Support If you're living with depression, please reach out to a doctor or counsellor; it's treatable, and you don't have to manage it alone. Note Follow local health advice about air quality near volcanic activity, and see a doctor about breathing symptoms. Support If you feel unsafe or are being harmed at home, contact a local support service or helpline; you deserve safety and help. A political remark, a named author and film, and names of participants and donors are left out. Personal stories are turned into lessons.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-20.html#big-idea", "text": "The fifth, sixth and seventh dimensions aren't stages a calendar will bring: they run simultaneously, and you move between them by embodying their frequency, creating a third reality between yours and theirs. Ascension already exists; you're constructing it. Signs, numbers and inner images mean what you assign to them: you are the mantra. When two energy fields meet, a positive and a negative balance into a zero point; two of the same push apart, which is why consciousness, seeking balance, brings whatever is off balance to the surface. Deep change in a society can take a generation, carried by those doing the work and by children born into the new frequency. Through it all, train a steady mind, and help each other.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "20.1  Dimensions run at the same time", "url": "s2-section-20.html#part-20-1", "text": "\"In which years will we reach 6D and 7D?\" It's a misunderstanding: 5D, 6D and 7D, like all timelines, run simultaneously in the quantum hologram. What matters is the state of your consciousness, the frequency and geometry you embody. Your body is a vessel, \"like a living spacecraft\": as you call in a frequency and become it, moment to moment, more and more potently, you create a third structure between the two (1 + 1 = 3; see S1 2.2). You're not travelling from one reality to another; you're switching timelines by embodying a new frequency. Mastering bilocation, you can shift back and forth, some realities only with permission. Higher beings do the same: they can appear in a form your consciousness can receive (angelic, Pleiadian), matching your frequency so you recognize them. Contact is individual: you'll have your own platform of contact \"while everybody else is watching the sky\". \"Ascension is fractal\", and your ascension already exists; you're constructing it into matter (see S2 9.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "20.2  Dreams are leaking platforms", "url": "s2-section-20.html#part-20-2", "text": "Short dream scenes (levitating, for example) are sequences leaking from realities that coexist with this one, giving your consciousness a platform to start embedding new frequencies. There is no real difference between one state and another. Recall the frequency of the dream, and it slowly begins to manifest in matter (see S2 17.9).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "20.3  You are the mantra: meaning is yours", "url": "s2-section-20.html#part-20-3", "text": "Asked about beautiful mosaics seen at night, the answer was a question: why connect your reality with a mantra outside you, when \"your reality is a mantra itself\"? You projected it, so you already know what it means. \"Why are you asking for us to create your platform? You are the master; even we are in your reality.\" Whatever meaning you choose is what manifests. So with repeated numbers and signs, assign the meaning yourself rather than borrowing someone else's: the same sequence can mean different things to different people. Build your own dictionary: the teacher has learned from her dreams, for example, that certain colours, clothing or clear versus muddy water tell her what kind of day is coming. Write it down; it's designed for you. Colours and smells are generally significant. That's also why there are \"no predictions\": she can read your frequency now, not what you'll do tomorrow, and guidance won't reveal a tragedy you came to learn from. What is given is a bylaw, an end result already \"written in a code\" (see S2 10.1).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "20.4  When two energy fields meet", "url": "s2-section-20.html#part-20-4", "text": "The aura is your vibrational sequence, projected from your consciousness and emotion into your field; it holds your geometry and resonance. When two people meet, it's a merging of quantum fields, with an enormous effect. A positive and a negative together create balance, a zero point. Two of the same (negative and negative, or positive and positive) push apart like same-pole magnets: there's no balance, and the vibration drops toward density, where manifestation is difficult. Consciousness, now ascending, does everything it can to restore balance: it creates situations so that whatever is off balance comes to the surface for you to deal with (see S2 18.1). Keep choosing the negative as frequency rises, and timelines separate. A second bylaw applies to love: fields very similar in loving resonance become one unit. SD: \"Sub sound, (mirror sound), the opposite (+,-) to complete for perfect balance '0' point.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "20.5  Hands, movement and geometry", "url": "s2-section-20.html#part-20-5", "text": "An electrical zap through the palms in a dream was a higher-self activation, \"almost like a walk-in\", changing the body's frequency. Hands matter: the first thing you do is touch; through the hands you draw more energy from the ether, in and out. And the movements of the body create geometric patterns: yoga, and especially tai chi, which is based on sacred geometry, redirect the flow of energetic force from the ether into your matrix. Look for the original poses: some have been changed, though they were meant for all of humanity.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "20.6  Change can take a generation", "url": "s2-section-20.html#part-20-6", "text": "When a society is suppressed for a long time, a frequency of survival becomes embedded, sometimes with negative intention (cutting corners, even corruption, can come to seem normal, \"even cool\"). That frequency has to be balanced and cleared through choosing positive actions. For some places the time given was 20 to 25 years. The real transformation comes through the children: those born from 2020 come from the new beginning and will refuse manipulation (\"I'm sorry, this is wrong\"), shutting the program down. And through people doing the work now, lifting the frequency (see S2 10.5). Timelines are portals: think of a radio channel; nothing in a lower vibration can enter. The heart holds the frequency fractally, moment to moment, and more codes are given as you rise, so you don't \"spin out of orbit\" (see NT on the spinning of particles).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "20.7  Painful history: acknowledge, don't relive", "url": "s2-section-20.html#part-20-7", "text": "When a date tied to a collective tragedy keeps appearing, it's embedded in your consciousness. Acknowledge it, honour and thank those who were lost or who sacrificed, then neutralize it: that happened in a different Earth, a different frequency, and it doesn't have to be part of your structure now. Returning to it again and again brings its frequency back. \"Acknowledgement to neutrality\"; then move forward, in the now, toward the new beginning. Note The answer also made claims about the cause of a specific tragedy and comparisons between historical atrocities; these are left out.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "20.8  Change from the ground up", "url": "s2-section-20.html#part-20-8", "text": "Asked about political turmoil: \"in the end, it's going to be in the name of the people\"; what happens behind the scenes differs from what's shown, and media often confuse. Seeing manipulation helps people wake up and reclaim their sovereignty. \"Nobody is going to give it to us\": speak out, take action, hold your ground, non-violently, and help others. Change comes from the ground up (see S2 16.4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "20.9  Know it's benevolent", "url": "s2-section-20.html#part-20-9", "text": "When you begin channelling, don't keep questioning whether it's benevolent from fear: both a positive and a negative connection exist; which one becomes real is the one you embed. Neutralize doubt, smile, and choose. The teacher has seen the most unlikely people turn out to help her. Likewise, a shaman or a spirit-clearer may help if it gives you a physical boost of belief, and you'll find one by acting; but \"don't give the power to somebody else to tell you that you have the power: you are it.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "20.10  Train a steady mind", "url": "s2-section-20.html#part-20-10", "text": "Practising the quantum manifestation is how you master the chaos: shift negative emotion to positive and stay there; give and share from the heart, because \"the heart has the codes that switch the timelines.\" A training exercise: hold one image (a photo of someone) with steady positive thought and emotion for one minute, without drifting to tomorrow. Steadiness in the now becomes potent enough to pop into matter. It's normal to go back to the material when you go off balance, and to seek help physically when you need it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "20.11  Help each other", "url": "s2-section-20.html#part-20-11", "text": "Connect with each other, exchange skills and ideas, and support one another (a doctor helping someone, others helping in return). Many people have no one; build a community of helping, whatever form it takes (see S2 15.11).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "The method — One Steady Minute", "url": "s2-section-20.html#method", "text": "Choose one image: a photo of someone, or a picture of what you want. Calm to zero for a few breaths. Hold the image with a positive thought and a warm feeling, for one full minute. Stay in the now: if your mind jumps to tomorrow or to doubt, gently come back. Notice the steadiness: thought plus emotion is the magnetic and gravitational field. Repeat daily, lengthening the time; steadiness builds potency.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "In which years will humanity move to 6D and 7D?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "Not years: see 20.1.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "I've had short dreams of levitating. Do they mean anything?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "See 20.2.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "Is there a birthday message for me?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "Be more open: you're in a shell, cautious about what you say and afraid to approach new things. \"Live your life to the fullest.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "I often see intricate mosaics in my mind's eye at night. What are they?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "See 20.3: you are the mantra; you assign the meaning.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "What impact do auras have when people meet?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "\"Major, enormous\": see 20.4.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "I've noticed markings near my ankle and a lumpy area below my elbow. Are aliens probing me?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "\"No, I don't get the aliens; I get more medical.\" See a doctor, have blood work and have the lumps tested.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "In a dream, a spirit (I think mine) entered me like electricity, with a zap through my palms; later, people admired my hands.", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "See 20.5: a higher-self activation, and a connection with the hands and with energy work.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "What is the situation in my country?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "See 20.6: in a society long under pressure, transformation can take a generation, led by its children and by people doing the work.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "I've seen a date linked to a national tragedy every day for a month. Why?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "See 20.7: it's embedded in your consciousness. Acknowledge it, neutralize it, and assign your own useful meaning (see 20.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "A previous message suggested I see a shaman. How do I find one, and will it help?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "See 20.9: you can manifest one by acting, if it helps your belief; but you are the power.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "Political turmoil and heavy energy where I live: should I move abroad?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "\"In the end, it's going to be in the name of the people\": see 20.8.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "Are the quantum manifestation videos the only way to learn it, and how can every level of me embody it?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "When you connect with this, you're connecting with your higher self: the teacher is a projection in your own reality, giving you information from your own structure, because you're ready. Being the frequency projects the hologram, not the other way round (see S2 15.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "I'm starting a company with two others, and one seems unsure. Should I include him?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "Undecided for now: within three months a situation will help you decide (\"fluctuating realities\").", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "I've begun channelling what seems to be an advanced group. Any advice?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "See 20.9: let go of the mind, and know it's benevolent.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "A beam of light from a clear night sky hit us. What was it?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "Not allowed to be told yet: \"three or more realities on top of it.\" It's an activation, connected with your belief system.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "Does practising quantum manifestation help in a chaotic reality?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "Yes: see 20.10.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "Are negative attachments only imagination? Do they dissolve when you say \"stop\"?", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "For you, it's embedded deeply in your thoughts; someone experienced in clearing negative spirits could help, because it helps your belief system.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-20.html#remember", "text": "• Dimensions run at once: embody the frequency to switch. • You are the mantra: give signs your own meaning. • Opposites balance into zero point; consciousness seeks balance. • Movement is geometry; the heart holds the codes. • Train one steady minute, and help each other.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2020, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 20", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-20.html#questions", "text": "Note New or changing skin marks or lumps should be checked by a doctor promptly; early assessment matters. Left out, in keeping with this book's approach: the survey of countries and governments, claims about religions and communities, a remark about immigration, comparisons of historical atrocities, a personal political anecdote, and participants' names.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-21.html#big-idea", "text": "Answers come when the timing allows, and always as the end result, never the path. Each person's ascension runs in their own hologram. A long channelled answer spoke of humanity's children: new souls, coming through new portals, who will carry the unity of the new Earth. In daily practice, the key is what you project: when someone blames you, neutralize it, or the same vibration returns through others; and when you speak, state the state of being you want (\"I am free\", \"I am healthy\") instead of naming what you reject. You are always on your path; only the belief that you're not keeps you off it. The guides are not gods: \"God you are\".", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "21.1  Answers come with timing", "url": "s2-section-21.html#part-21-1", "text": "Sometimes an answer can't be given: it isn't the timing yet (the teacher was not allowed to speak about the HR material for a year), or the person must learn a lesson first, or a situation within months will show them what to do. What is given is always the end result, never the steps in between (see S2 10.1). The planet is ascending anyway, and within it each person's ascension runs on their own platform, according to what they do, think and act on.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "21.2  Through a storm: shelter within the lesson", "url": "s2-section-21.html#part-21-2", "text": "A warning was repeated about flooding on one coastline, with the advice not to go there (a prediction). But don't be afraid: even within a lesson, you'll find what you need. The teacher was once in the middle of a historic storm and found water, food and shelter, a reality within the reality (see S2 15.6). She didn't skip the lesson; she went through it \"on target\": emotions, thoughts and deeds knowing she was fine, and taking the necessary practical measures. \"The end of the world\" means the end of the three-dimensional structure, a shift to a new Earth. Note Follow official weather and emergency guidance where you live or travel; knowing you're fine and taking practical precautions go together.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "21.3  A message about the children", "url": "s2-section-21.html#part-21-3", "text": "Asked when school systems will change, the Council of Nine answered at length: it is already changing. They spoke of great sorrow for the suffering of children on Earth, and said new portals had to open because of it. The souls now coming into human bodies carry a fifth-dimensional frequency and come \"in the name of humanity\": as they enter, the planet's resonance rises, and outcomes change \"wave after wave\". Separate religions belonged to the old separation; what's coming is \"one religion, which is unity consciousness\". Some are called \"star children\". The council also spoke about contact in three \"platforms\": experiences in which people were taken aboard, which they said were done with the person's own higher self to preserve humanity's DNA program; staged \"abductions\" designed by humans to create fear of extraterrestrials (see S2 18.5); and a third, the mastery: raising your own molecular frequency through diet, the heart and the DNA codes, guided individually, until the body can bilocate through portals. Its order: telepathic contact first, then dietary change, then a change of the heart's frequency. Whatever happens around you, stay in the positive, \"to keep the potency\". Note These are channelled claims. Claims in the answer about vaccines altering DNA, and about hidden groups, are not supported by evidence and are left out of the teaching. Vaccines do not change your DNA.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "21.4  Break the blame loop", "url": "s2-section-21.html#part-21-4", "text": "If you were blamed for something you didn't do, and now it keeps happening with others, it's an illusion you're reprinting. \"If I blame you now for what your brother did, would you take it seriously? I wasn't there.\" When it happens, sit and watch: \"Very interesting; I understand it's a hologram\", and neutralize the frequency (you needn't say it aloud). Your response calls the frequency from the previous reality, so you keep shifting into similar situations, and because probabilities are infinite, the same vibration can arrive through someone else (see S1 2, S1 3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "21.5  You are always on the path", "url": "s2-section-21.html#part-21-5", "text": "\"You are always on the right track, because you're learning through the experiences.\" Even when you fluctuate (the teacher kept slipping on her diet, and was told: \"Look at the action you took\"), the journey makes you stronger. The only thing keeping you off your path is the belief that you're not on it: change the perception, and you're on it. Activation can make the body shiver: it's like reaching a new altitude and learning to breathe there. Relax, breathe through it, and keep giving your best; healing begins in the heart, with a clean structure of giving without conditions (see S2 19).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "21.6  Say the state of being, not what you reject", "url": "s2-section-21.html#part-21-6", "text": "For anyone changing a habit (the example was an app for people recovering from addiction): don't say \"I don't drink anymore\". Naming what you reject keeps its frequency, and it mimics and reprints. State the state of being you want to project, in the present, as \"I am\": \"I am healthy\", \"I drink juices\", \"I am free\". Repeat it every half hour, and feel it as you say it: \"repetition, here's your potency\". Avoid even the word for the problem. The person must know they have the power (see S2 2.4, S2 2.8). Further design guidance: no reds; let each person choose their own soothing colour, because a colour resonates with a particular consciousness (the teacher's is a soft grey-blue); and for voice or music, tune to 432 Hz. Support Addiction is a medical condition; affirmations can support recovery alongside professional treatment and support groups, not replace them.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "21.7  Names carry sound, but meaning is yours", "url": "s2-section-21.html#part-21-7", "text": "A name has a sonic vibration and can carry associations from how it has been used; fear, for example, can pass from a parent to a child as a carried frequency. But the meaning of a word is given through your own perspective. Neutralize it, accept that this is what it was, and choose to change it: study the protocol, and you can switch the program (see S2 20.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "21.8  You are the creator", "url": "s2-section-21.html#part-21-8", "text": "\"Let's see what reality you're going to create.\" The guidance won't decide your reality for you: you have the knowledge and the freedom; create what you wish from the heart. Even choosing otherwise is still creation, but now everything returns quickly, like a boomerang. \"They are not our gods; they are assisting\": \"God you are\", and \"even we are our own expression.\" They are always communicating, and anything you're doing now is a projection you made: \"create, don't stop creating.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "21.9  Protect your project", "url": "s2-section-21.html#part-21-9", "text": "When invited into a promising venture: stay alert, as people's approaches can fluctuate. Don't do anything without a contract; use an independent lawyer, not one on the other side; don't give everything away at once; release information slowly. Many start with big ideas and, along the way, become greedy (see S2 19.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "21.10  Earthquakes and the Earth's fluid", "url": "s2-section-21.html#part-21-10", "text": "Asked about shifting plates, the guidance said fossil \"fuel\" isn't what we're told: it is like the blood in the Earth's veins, a fluid that lets tectonic plates slide smoothly past each other, \"like oil\", so there are no earthquakes. More earthquakes may come, but \"they could be stopped; you have the technology\" (claims). SD gives a method to \"Subside Earthquakes with Hz\": measure the frequency of the landmasses and \"stay steady to '0' point\", so the earthquake subsides; \"you can also develop a machine like that.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "21.11  Entering another reality in a dream", "url": "s2-section-21.html#part-21-11", "text": "Yes, you can experience someone else's reality. Lucid, the teacher focused, opened a portal with her thoughts, and found herself in another being's body (an extraterrestrial man), flying a craft toward her galactic family, until she was sent back: \"you are not allowed to be there\" (see S2 17.9). She didn't overtake him; it was a knowing that she was there with him. But remember, that \"could be another version of you.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "The method — Affirm the State of Being", "url": "s2-section-21.html#method", "text": "Choose the state you want, in the present: \"I am healthy\", \"I am free\". Leave out the problem word entirely, and any \"don't\" or \"no more\". Say it as \"I am\", about yourself, not as an instruction to others. Feel it as you say it: the feeling is the frequency. Repeat every half hour: set a reminder. Surround it with what soothes you: your colour, gentle sound (see 21.6).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "Will our school systems change, so children get the education they deserve?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "Yes, it's already changing: see 21.3.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "For a year I've seen a sun-coloured fluid moving along my lower eyelids; once my eye pulsed for hours. What is it?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "It was read as related to the retina (\"almost like a twitching\"), with bacteria involved.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "I have palpitations and stabbing chest pains; tests were near-normal, but my blood pressure is higher. Is it energy? And I wake up often and feel exhausted.", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "A nutritional doctor, a detox and blood work, under a doctor's supervision. For the exhaustion: check the thyroid, including for nodules.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "I lost a small, high-frequency green glass object; I feel it's in another version of my room. Where is it?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "\"You won't find it\": for now, it's not at your vibration.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "My brother blamed me for something he did, and now it keeps happening with others. How do I stop it?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "See 21.4.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "What about a \"philanthropic bank\" planning to release large sums through cryptocurrency?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "\"You need to wait\": the only answer given.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "My life has been upside down for years and I keep starting over. Am I on the right path?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "See 21.5: you are; the belief that you're not keeps you off it. (A more specific question gets a more specific answer.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "I'm building a business on energy philanthropy and a home for my family. Am I on track?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "\"You are always on the right track\": the experience is making you a master.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "I feel I'm here to heal, and my body shivered in meditation. What kind of healing?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "See 21.5: healing starts in the heart; the shivering is activation, a new altitude.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "Should I add fulvic trace minerals to my distilled water?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "It would change the water's structure: leave distilled water pure to do its work (see S2 17.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "Any diet or detox advice? I feel I should fast.", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "Always with supervision: blood work and allergy tests, and a nutritional doctor. Follow the gradual protocol, step by step, with distilled water and two-week eliminations; don't rush. \"Do not mix fruits and vegetables: they will ferment.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "I live near a fault zone. Any information about the plates there?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "See 21.10. (Follow local earthquake-preparedness advice.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "I'm passionate about group contact practices and have seen craft respond. Is this encouraged?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "Yours was more like contact in a dream state. \"Where do you think all these ideas came from?\" Your work with energy devices: keep going; look into particles and percentages, which give a different spin: \"homework\".", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "My mother is afraid of everything, and I've picked up her fear. Why?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "See 21.7: a frequency passed from mother to son. Nothing major: study the protocol, and you'll switch it.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "I've had shoulder-blade pain near the spine for years; X-rays were normal, and therapy hasn't helped.", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "Read as pinched, with missing fluid and cartilage needing rebuilding; physical therapy eases the pain but doesn't resolve it. Look into professional help to rebuild cartilage and collagen; pain and numbness may run down the back of the leg.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "Should I launch my course? Do people need it?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "\"Let's see what reality you're going to create\": see 21.8.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "I'm building a mobile app to help people with addiction. Any insights?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "See 21.6.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "Can your books be bought in print?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "No: they were kept original and free to download. Volunteers have translated them; support is welcome, never required.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "I've been invited into a new biotechnology project. Is the person trustworthy?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "So far he's okay toward you, but see 21.9.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "I've had muscle pain for 20 years despite diet and herbs. What am I missing?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "Read as muscle tissue that doesn't retract, too little fluid, and fluctuating blood sugar: lots of water, green juices, wild greens, magnesium and zinc; avoid spices, much citrus and sweets; herbal help to rebuild tissue. (See a doctor for a diagnosis, and check supplements with them.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "What about higher-frequency intergalactic relationships?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "\"We always communicate\": see 21.8.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "What do you think of another well-known channelled teaching?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "Everyone has their own mission; it seems on target, more simply explained. Whether a teacher stays in the heart is up to them: \"follow the money.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "Will my future be in health and healing, or education?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "\"Both: they're connected.\" Study the quantum material from the first section, without skipping.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "What about my learning hypnotherapy?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "It reaches the deeper subconscious; it was used for manipulation, and that must be reversed. \"People like you are part of the new beginning.\" Work at deeper states, and you'll connect with your guides too.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "In dreams, I live scenarios with others I'd never have imagined. Do we experience others' realities?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "Yes: see 21.11.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "How can I improve my health?", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "\"Diet, diet and relaxation.\" Relaxing music; valerian, from an herbalist, to calm the body; detox with distilled water. (Valerian can interact with other medicines: check with a pharmacist. Claims in the answer about vaccines and food are left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-21.html#remember", "text": "• Answers come with timing, always as the end result. • When blamed, watch and neutralize, or it returns through others. • Say the state of being you want: \"I am\", every half hour, felt. • You are always on your path; doubt is what pulls you off. • You are the creator; the guides assist.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2021, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 21", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-21.html#questions", "text": "Safety note Moving lights, flashes or pulsing in your vision can signal a retinal problem. See an eye doctor promptly, urgently if it's sudden or increasing. Safety note Chest pain can be serious. Seek emergency care for chest pain with breathlessness, sweating, or pain spreading to the arm or jaw; otherwise follow up with your doctor about the palpitations and blood pressure. Note Be very cautious with offers of large \"releases\" of money through cryptocurrency; they are a common form of fraud. Note Persistent back pain with numbness down the leg should be assessed by a doctor or spine specialist; ask about further imaging. A proclamation from another author's book, read at the close, isn't reproduced. Outside sources, names and a predicted location are left out or generalized.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-22.html#big-idea", "text": "Sexual energy is creative energy, and it follows the same bylaw as everything else: create with pure intention. When intimacy comes through the heart, with the being you truly love, it builds a structure: two fields make a third, and at the summit the energy is potent enough to manifest the next reality. Lust is separated from the heart: its energy scatters across the matrix, builds nothing and slowly depletes you, which is why it ends in emptiness. A couple who stop the romance and only perform tasks become two separate, fluctuating structures. And in every situation, freedom isn't given to you: you construct it by your acts, moment by moment.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "22.1  Downloads follow what the collective understands", "url": "s2-section-22.html#part-22-1", "text": "Information comes as a group learns. When the first quantum-structure talk wasn't understood, the next download explained the zero point and mobilizing structures, and then it clicked (see S1 1, S1 2). This download came unexpectedly, while reading, and it was given in their own wording, \"a little bit twisted\". Some structures the teacher is being shown now are beyond what she can explain, and she won't teach them until she has achieved and can show them: \"I was taught quantum manifestation from scratch\", so no one can tell her it's impossible. The teaching here is that we've been shown intimacy in a way that separates it from the heart (through films, books, social media and TV), and so loops us into artificial structures. Safety note The teacher mentioned that her next protocol involves an extreme diet close to living without food. Do not attempt this: going without food is dangerous and can be fatal. Any change of diet belongs under a doctor's supervision.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "22.2  Self-pleasure: only with pure intention", "url": "s2-section-22.html#part-22-2", "text": "Self-pleasure should be engaged with pure intention, with the being you truly love; then the frequency is pure. Used only as a release, the energy has no intention and no cause: it becomes artificial, does not fulfil you, and depletes you, because nothing returns as a manifestation. So whatever you imagine, let the image be of the being you truly love. If not, the energy scatters without potency and never becomes a targeted frequency that grows into a reality hologram, and you'll find it hard to manifest a person who truly loves you. \"When you create, create with pure intention. It is a bylaw you all must learn.\" DP records this download almost word for word under \"Intimacy And Self Pleasuring / Lust\": \"In order for the structure to be precise it must come from pure love and only love.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "22.3  Lust is emptiness", "url": "s2-section-22.html#part-22-3", "text": "\"Lust is emptiness, and it will never manifest your love.\" It loops the same energy you keep projecting, never satisfies, and can lead into a downward spiral of ever emptier self-indulgent acts \"that eventually may finish you\". The body's and the brain's reaction \"has nothing to do with the purity of your heart love structure\": you must learn to see and feel the difference (see also S1 3.8). This isn't a judgement of pleasure (\"that doesn't mean it's wrong\"); it's that lust is a different structure.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "22.4  Two structures: love builds, lust scatters", "url": "s2-section-22.html#part-22-4", "text": "The love structure. It begins with foreplay, which is fractal: talking, enjoying each other, for example over dinner. Each moment is a parallel reality building a potent frequency (see S1 2.7). Feeling goosebumps when you talk is the sign of that energetic field. In lovemaking, his structure and hers create a third structure (see S1 2.2, 1 + 1 = 3). At the summit, the combination of the magnetic and gravitational fields is so potent that the moment can manifest much of what you want, and it projects the next reality: you stay a strong family whatever you go through. The lust structure. Attraction to the body alone (\"oh my god, he's gorgeous\") never develops the frequency connected to the heart, so it is artificial, even when it feels potent. Its energy at the summit doesn't go into a structure: it scatters all over the matrix. Repeated, it accumulates in scattered sequences and depletes the heart structure. That is why people with many partners, even attractive or successful ones, can feel blank, unhappy and unable to find the right person: they never projected a heart frequency into their hologram to find someone who truly loves them. In her picture: love goes through the heart to the 5D platform; lust stays in 3D.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "22.5  Keep the romance alive", "url": "s2-section-22.html#part-22-5", "text": "Couples should never stop loving and respecting each other, and should keep the romance going: go out, talk, learn to please each other, say something pleasurable to each other. Without it, the marriage becomes tasks (kids, work, bills) performed by two people who no longer connect; the family's base is only \"collective energy\", and the platform of the reality you were creating together becomes \"non-existent\". Then the two become separate structures that fluctuate, one going up as the other goes down, never synchronizing, and \"this is how we end up in divorce, how you end up looking for somebody else\". When you keep making love with passion, the structures rebuild over and over, and the frequency of that reality stays potent. Life can be spiced up between the two of you; it doesn't have to be anything extreme.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "22.6  Falling in love with someone else", "url": "s2-section-22.html#part-22-6", "text": "If feelings fade in a long marriage and you fall in love with another being, then for it to be pure and to manifest, that other being must love you in equal amount. Whether to stay or move on depends on the individual situation: children, obligations and more. If the love is pure on both sides, it creates a potent energy that, with guidance, through platforms, agreements and parallel realities, will manifest; at this level it must be true purity, or it won't work. If you stay in an unhappy marriage for the children or other obligations, revisit what is truly important (children, family) and whether there is abuse; this is decided individually, with the higher councils (see S1 1.8). Keep gratitude to your family: many leave for the rush of a new feeling and hurt children and a partner who may still love them. DP gives both questions and the council's answers in the same words, adding that you print everyone into your own hologram and matrix.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "22.7  Books and films: put the one you love in the picture", "url": "s2-section-22.html#part-22-7", "text": "A romantic or erotic story can make the energy shatter if your heart goes to the character. Instead, imagine the main character as the person you truly love. Switching that in your mind sets your blueprint on the heart structure; this is how you switch. It applies to imagination only: it doesn't mean being with one person while thinking of another, which is a physical act and a completely different energetic field.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "22.8  A marriage built on the heart, and an honest parting", "url": "s2-section-22.html#part-22-8", "text": "A marriage built on money has a weak base: when challenges come, the partner who married for money won't fight for it, and everyone gets hurt, collecting karma that passes to the children. A marriage built on true love can always find bridges: talk, reconnect, go to counselling if you must, and keep the heart frequency up. It's a lesson, and if you collapse with it, you'll keep repeating it (see S1 1.5). If you no longer love the person, discuss it and separate as friends, not as enemies: \"we'll be great parents and best friends\". Honesty makes it pure, and there is no harm done. Staying while you don't love the person, and lying or acting out from boredom, is deception and a completely different structure. Much of what keeps people in marriages is the contract structure of society; imagine a caring society where housing, food and work were no longer at stake: marriage would no longer be a contract to feel obliged by.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "22.9  You are already a master", "url": "s2-section-22.html#part-22-9", "text": "\"You are a master already\": you manifest every day, projecting your hologram even now; the limitation is only your own perspective. What makes it hard is how deeply the wrong idea of structure is embedded: the brain needs time to crystallize a new concept that's the opposite of what we were told. Bilocating the whole body into another reality is possible, but it needs the protocol of mastery: diet, conscious contact with your guidance, and a lighter molecular structure that takes in more frequency (see S2 4, S2 21.3). SD: to \"become a multidimensional body vessel\" you increase the body's molecular vibration, and \"then you can easily connect with full memory\" of less dense realities.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "22.10  Freedom is constructed by your acts", "url": "s2-section-22.html#part-22-10", "text": "Asked about the planets and humanity's development, the council said the structures are individual. Many platforms promote fear and self-indulgence; choosing those media inflicts holographic imprints you then reprint daily (see S1 9.9). \"You never understood that you are already free.\" You can create a new Earth, but only by knowing the structures and projecting them daily by your acts: \"you cannot simply wait for somebody else to do your freedom.\" Action creates the potency that shifts you, and the planet is already ascended: you're experiencing it moment by moment, and through that fractal momentum you become a master of creation. DP: \"As you expand your multi-dimensional understanding so is your personal holographic expression and the people that are able to exist on it.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "22.11  In chaos, be the best of yourself", "url": "s2-section-22.html#part-22-11", "text": "For anyone in a hard or chaotic situation: observe, and when a situation presents itself, be the best of yourself in the name of humanity. Hold a knowing with no fear, and you'll be shown the bridge to safety: food, help and a positive outcome. Train your consciousness to see that you are in a hologram, a game in which you are the main character and can open doors. Whatever you do in this moment is what you project into the next: \"this is a quantum bylaw.\" Fear is a stronger vibration than joy and creates more of the same: \"to escape the forest, you end up in a forest\" (see S2 15.2, S2 15.6).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "22.12  Releasing a lingering connection", "url": "s2-section-22.html#part-22-12", "text": "After a deep relationship ends, you may still feel the person. There are two modalities. If the love was mutual and you separated because of obligations, the other person can tune their frequency toward you, and you can feel it. If it isn't returned, you are re-projecting your own frequency because you loved so much: an illusion you keep looping. To stop it: pull yourself away emotionally, pull out and call it a hologram, give gratitude, calm yourself completely in that understanding, then act on it and change your emotion, until you're no longer looping and are free of the pain (see S1 7). It's challenging and takes time, especially if you really loved the person.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "22.13  A wise person transforms themselves", "url": "s2-section-22.html#part-22-13", "text": "In a family conflict: \"A wise man does not fight with evil; a wise man transforms himself.\" You cannot change them; change yourself. It's a lesson: pass through it and don't let it pull you down. There is nobody outside you; this is your hologram (see S2 9.6). Protect the vulnerable from being drawn in, and make your own decision.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "The method — Keep the Heart in Intimacy", "url": "s2-section-22.html#method", "text": "Know the difference: notice whether you're moved by the heart or by the body alone (22.3). Build it before: go out, talk, enjoy each other; foreplay begins the structure (22.4). Keep the romance in a long relationship: please each other, not only tasks (22.5). Imagine only the one you truly love, alone or with a story or film (22.2, 22.7). At the summit, feel love and joy: that is the frequency you project. If love has ended, say so honestly, and part as friends (22.8).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "What does the council say about twin flames?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "\"Twin flame\" is an Earth word, not significant to them. You can fall in love here and continue through timelines with that person, but only by agreement: if you truly love each other and both decide to continue, that is made with your guidance and the councils, never alone. With your guidance, it may become another lifetime together.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "Is the twin flame really your higher self, manifesting as a partner when you're aligned?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "Through the quantum structure, yes: you created another version of yourself in your holographic imprint. If you meet someone you projected and love, you can make a contract to share another timeline; call that a twin flame if you like.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "Is it okay to be intimate with my husband out of compassion, though I no longer care for it?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "It becomes more like lust energy: not connected with the heart. You could hold the image of him when you were younger and connected, but that's challenging. Better: reconnect physically, through foreplay and conversation, to get back to that momentum (22.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "Can a single person use the energy of self-pleasure to attract someone, or for manifestation in general?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "Yes, very much so: you reach very high levels, and there's nothing wrong with it for a man or a woman. At the summit, make the whole blueprint the person you desire, whatever kind of person that is, and feel that you love them: express love and joy (22.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "Does intimacy create a new reality the couple shares afterward, like going for a coffee?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "Yes: loving each other and reaching the summit builds potent frequency, a new reality to shift into, built on joy and the heart, with positive outcomes. That's why it's worth working on a marriage (22.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "Are dematerialization, rematerialization and shapeshifting the third mastery? Is it time travel? Any limits?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "See 22.9: you are already a master, and the limitation is your perspective; bilocation needs the protocol of mastery. Everything is possible: \"this is just the beginning.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "I feel completely stalled. How do I get momentum back? And my durations for energizing distilled water?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "Individual durations for the three frequencies were given (they are personal, so not reproduced). You've closed yourself off like a loner: come out more. Closing up shuts down your programs and the probabilities for expansion. Resting to regenerate is one thing; withdrawing as rejection and separation is another. Engaging and giving make a huge difference (see S1 5.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "Why am I so extremely tired and exhausted these last months?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "Check the thyroid (read as slightly enlarged). Rest; mountains and fresh air, more oxygen. The legs were read as throbbing veins with pain behind the knee, and compression of the lower back with a limp on one side: walking, stretching, yoga, and ballet-style stretching and body-sculpting workouts for the ligaments.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "Is hydrogen water beneficial?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "\"It may not be what you need\": it doesn't collect the molecules into place but scatters them. Let it be distilled (see S2 17).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "I've been in a downward spiral since an accident and a lost relationship, with urges to self-harm. Will I have a chance at something good again?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "A private conversation was offered. (For general guidance on releasing a lost connection, see 22.12.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "What do the planets' changes mean for our development as a species?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "See 22.10: freedom is constructed by your acts.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "I'm divorcing a manipulative partner after 30 years. He's offered an unfair settlement. Should I take it and go?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "The divorce was read as nasty and manipulative, and he will continue that way: \"be clever with the clever\". \"No money can be compared with freedom.\" And: \"Are you asking for fairness from a person who is not fair to you?\" The decision is yours.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "How should I respond to growing unrest where I live, so my family stays at peace?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "See 22.11: observe, be the best of yourself, hold knowing without fear; study the quantum structure from S1 1–3. (A prediction about the region is left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "Should I keep water in a copper container? (And something about not eating aubergines.)", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "\"Copper is good\"; copper singing bowls are a good way to energize water. The aubergine question wasn't answered.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "Where should I start my product business when I return to my home country?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "Read individually: not the comfort zone the person named, but a more dynamic city.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "In sleep I interact with a royal family and observe others' lives. Am I slipping across quantum fields?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "It was read as a connection with royal lineage, three to seven generations back, which is why the dream state connects there; scenes of separation and loss were seen in that line.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "Is now a good time to expand distribution of our non-toxic mould-remediation product?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "Within three months you'll understand more about whom to approach. Don't wait for the three months: door after door, relentlessly. That builds the reality for the opportunity; it's the hide-and-seek game (see S1 1.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "I wake every morning with jaw pain from grinding my teeth. What am I doing in the dream world?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "Not connected with the dream world: it was read as connected with a parasite. Detox with herbalism, and find a proper doctor for deworming or flushing the body. (Given as not medical advice.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "Between sleep and waking I left my body and a voice told me to go back. Was it not the time, or was I trying to escape home? And lately my brain feels quiet, as if I'm left alone.", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "\"A little bit of both.\" When you aren't allowed through certain structures, you're put right back: it feels like an invisible, bubble-like barrier (see S2 21.11). The quiet means the work is done for now. \"You're never forgotten\": they're always present.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "In a multidimensional experience, another version of me handed me a mirror. What race was I?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "A channelled answer from beings of crystal and light: he comes from a multidimensional home planet of crystal structures and layered realities, and knows how to live that way but has forgotten how to return, so contact comes in dream states. \"It's easy for us to connect with you, but difficult for you to understand your home planet. You are multidimensional.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "What will education look like for our youth, and what will best serve them?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "Children are coming as a spark of fifth-dimensional frequency: \"your children have a very bright future\". They won't agree with neglect, separation or the taking over of consciousness; they know what to do, because it's embedded in them. \"Your children are the new beginning\" (see S2 21.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "My father-in-law was diagnosed with cancer and told nothing can be done. Is there anything?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "The answer named an outside product, which is left out.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "I want to add to my name to change my vibration, but I can't hear my guides. Can you advise?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "\"You are very confused, and we cannot help you if you don't let go\": of fears, family situations and money matters, the past situations still looping back and forth.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "I ended a serious relationship but still feel connected, as if I can feel the person. Did I make a mistake? How do I cut it, and how do I know my intentions are pure, not just lust?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "No mistake. See 22.12 for the two modalities and how to release it; for pure versus lustful, see 22.3–22.4.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "My father passed away last year and the family is torn over money. Should I walk away for peace, or fight?", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "A personal message from the father was given. The answer: \"A wise man does not fight with evil; a wise man transforms himself\" (22.13). Protect your mother from being drawn in. It's a lesson, so don't let it pull you down: change yourself, not them. Pulling away was heard, but it is your own decision.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-22.html#remember", "text": "• Create with pure intention: from the heart, with the one you truly love. • Love builds a third structure; lust scatters and depletes. • Keep the romance, or a couple becomes two separate realities. • If love has ended, part honestly, as friends. • Freedom is built by your acts; in hard times, be the best of yourself.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2022, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 22", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-22.html#questions", "text": "Note No one should feel obliged to be intimate. If you feel pressured or unsafe, talk with a counsellor or a trusted person (see the support box below). Safety note Lasting exhaustion should be checked by a doctor, including thyroid blood tests. Pain, swelling, warmth or redness in the calf or behind the knee can be a blood clot: seek medical care promptly. Support If you have thoughts of hurting yourself, please reach out now. In the US, call or text 988 (Suicide and Crisis Lifeline); elsewhere, contact your local emergency number or crisis line. You deserve support. Support This is not legal advice: take advice from your own independent family lawyer before accepting any settlement. If a partner is frightening, controlling or harming you, in the US contact the National Domestic Violence Hotline, 1-800-799-7233 (or text START to 88788); elsewhere, a local domestic-abuse service. Note Don't store acidic drinks in unlined copper, and don't keep water in it for long periods; too much copper can upset the stomach. Safety note Teeth grinding is commonly linked to stress, sleep problems or bite issues: see a dentist (a night guard protects the teeth) or a doctor. Don't treat yourself for parasites without testing and a doctor's advice. Warning The product referred to (\"MMS\") is a bleach (chlorine dioxide). It is dangerous to drink and does not treat cancer. Stay with his oncology and palliative team, who can also help with comfort and quality of life. Support Grief and family conflict together are heavy. A grief counsellor or support group can help; if you feel unable to cope, reach out to your doctor or a crisis line (988 in the US). Left out: participants' and donors' names, named outside people, books, films and videos, a planet name, a political prediction about one region, and personal numbers.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-23.html#big-idea", "text": "You are more powerful than you think: weakness is an illusion, because you are creating a whole reality. The source is not outside you, so once you learn the structure you don't need anyone to connect you. What blocks manifestation is often expectation: it runs a second hologram on top of the one that's manifesting, and two codes of different resonance can't coexist. When other people's moods pull you down, train yourself back with repetition until the new state crystallizes. Your ascension is individual within the collective, and the heart holds the codes that shift timelines. Share what you know, but don't impose it: the spark wakes in its own time.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.1  Keep going, even when you fall off", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-1", "text": "The teacher admitted she hasn't kept to her protocol: she does well for a few days, then an event comes and she slips. She says this so you know it isn't easy, and that falling off is part of it: \"As long as you continue and as long as you try, you may try 101 times, and I guarantee the 102nd time you'll make it\" (see S2 21.5). Safety note The protocol she describes is a water-only fast. Do not attempt this: prolonged fasting is dangerous and can be fatal. Any change of diet belongs under a doctor's supervision.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.2  Do your own research, then act", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-2", "text": "\"Don't even trust me: do your own research\", and your higher self will recognize what is right. Don't take a narrative blindly from any single source; look widely and check for yourself. Awakening spreads by sharing information, and \"you cannot switch your timeline if you only think about the goodness without taking action to create the goodness.\" Action in unity is more potent: it changes the collective in your hologram, not only you. \"Once you awaken, nobody can control you.\" Note This talk included political predictions and commentary about named politicians, parties and countries, and claims that spraying from aircraft carries DNA-altering nanoparticles. These are left out: the book stays neutral on politics, and the health claims are not supported by evidence.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.3  A currency change: don't panic", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-3", "text": "There is no update on a currency reset for a while: certain systems need to collapse first, but it will be a smooth transition. Don't panic and move money around; she was never taught to do that. With crypto offers, be cautious: there may be conditions, such as funds locked for a year and withdrawals only through a particular brokerage. Don't invest large sums blindly; a little, if you wish, kept in the positive (see S2 6.6). Note This is not financial advice. Be wary of any offer that promises big returns or restricts withdrawals.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.4  You are not weak: fight for your freedom from the heart", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-4", "text": "\"Be clever with the clever\" (see S2 22) means: analyze the entire situation and approach it with care. Learn patience: things work when done at the right time (she once had to stay silent about what she knew for a whole year). Get advice from people you trust, explain the situation with complete honesty, and don't feel bad about fighting for your freedom: if you do it through the heart, to protect yourself and your family, \"you're not killing anyone.\" Sometimes that means legal steps, taken firmly and with integrity. Being gentle doesn't mean being weak. \"It's an illusion that you are weak.\" Power is a state of being you embed (see S2 21.6): educate yourself, read, talk, take the power, then act on what you've gathered. People who use strength negatively take advantage of those who believe they're weak. \"If you were not powerful, you would not even create a reality\" (see S2 5.8).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.5  How much DNA can we activate?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-5", "text": "Realistically, in this timeline, through ascension: up to 30%, not all of us have reached it yet, and it isn't exactly 30%. That includes shifting realities and creating new structures, for example meeting a being from a higher dimension in a third reality created between your structure and theirs (see S2 4.8). It's an individual process: each person creates their own timeline and ascension.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.6  Protecting your vibration around others' moods", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-6", "text": "Your emotions are a resonant frequency, and you only fall into another person's anger because you take that reality for real. So: pull back and see it as a hologram; give gratitude to neutralize the cold hologram you're interacting with; remove yourself from the scene; calm down completely, to zero; then switch your thoughts and actions, even if you don't want to, with uplifting videos or music. Set a reminder every half hour for a couple of days. Repetition crystallizes the new resonance: new neurons sync and build a bridge, the axon, \"like a growing tree's branches\", until it becomes permanent and easy (see S1 1–3, S1 7). DP: \"Repetition, repetition, repetition in order to crystallize the new structure of energetic fields that will build the new synopsis - the new bridges between the axons of the brain.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.7  You are the source", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-7", "text": "If you try to connect with the source each morning and it doesn't seem to work, it's because you're looking outside yourself. \"The truth is that you are the source.\" Look within, at the mechanics and alchemy of your own creation, and it switches \"like a light bulb\": you realize you don't need teachers like her. Our energy was used to build artificial timelines, and now it's time to wake up: once you have the knowledge, \"you're it.\" SD: \"You are the source and you are the prime creator.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.8  Expectations block manifestation", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-8", "text": "Why can you see new, higher versions of others but not yet of yourself? Because you have expectations. Probabilities are infinite, and while you're learning, successive holograms are so similar you hardly notice the change; once the frequency is embedded, things you think of start happening within a day. An expectation has its own holographic image: it runs a hologram on top of the hologram. The manifestation is the more potent code, but two codes of different resonance can't coexist, so the expectation blocks it. When you stop expecting, it pops up, because that is the path of least resistance. So: run with the program, learn everything, give gratitude for everything that happens, and stay steady on vibration, without doubting yourself or asking when and how. You may need lessons first to embody what you're learning. It took the teacher two years of constant helping and giving, with no expectation, before \"the bubble exploded\" (see S1 5.1). Each consciousness has its own signature, and each part expands into the collective. NT and SD: \"Give without expectations. Look for the manifestation without resistance. Then all will come to place through a synchronize signal.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.9  When awakening makes you agitated: switch the resonance", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-9", "text": "New energies arriving can feel like a warrior's force, up one day and calm the next. That fluctuation is normal while the information integrates, through the synchronicities of your research, and it will settle. To calm it, do what puts you in a good resonance: the teacher listens to easy, loving audiobooks while she does other things, or to jazz while watching a city skyline at night on a big screen, because it makes her feel good. Find your own \"little pixie\": jumping up and down one day, music another, something inspirational a third. \"It's all about switching the resonance.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.10  Individual ascension within the collective", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-10", "text": "Ascension is both collective and individual: a hologram within the hologram. Two people each have their own reality and share a third (see S1 2.2, 1 + 1 = 3), but each experiences the collective ascension according to how well they've learned their platform. Staying negative projects a bumpy road; staying positive, you always find the bridge, whatever is happening. As we awaken, all of it collapses into one positive collective, which is why unity and supporting each other matter. Not only the mind: the heart holds the codes of the portals that shift the timelines.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.11  Ride the wave moment to moment", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-11", "text": "With so many challenges, should you just hold your space? Ride the wave to the best of your abilities, moment to moment, using the quantum structure: when you fluctuate, make the end result of the fluctuation positive (see S1 3.3). That takes commitment and control of your mind and emotions, which are the magnetic and gravitational field that projects the matrix you shift into next. Don't see yourself as matter, but as an energetic field and a matrix.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.12  Share, but don't impose", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-12", "text": "To help with a terrible situation in the world, \"you don't go and change there. You change yourself\", by expressing the best of yourself daily to the people around you. You can offer knowledge; you can't make anyone listen, and your truth isn't theirs to adopt. Once you give the spark, the seed is in their hologram and takes its own resonance: when the time is right, something else will catch it, and they may later tell you what you told them yesterday. Many will wake when events become too outrageous to ignore; anger or despair along the way is normal. If someone attacks you out of fear or ignorance, move forward: \"better lose one person who is ignorant and gain another five.\" What matters is how you feel and project; that brings you the people who resonate with you (see S2 18). Support If you suspect human trafficking or a child at risk, contact the authorities. In the US, the National Human Trafficking Hotline is 1-888-373-7888 (text 233733); call 911 in an emergency.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.13  How to handle constant downloads", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-13", "text": "\"I'm just having fun.\" Have no fear; it's almost like talking to yourself. If you tune into something negative, neutralize it and try again. At a certain level you trust yourself so much that you know every thought has a reason, and you realize you're downloading from the matrix. Sometimes it comes as an instant image in the third eye, and you break it down fractally so others understand; sometimes you sit quietly and listen to the thoughts coming in; with complex material, write it down. What comes matches what you agreed to do. Practised, it becomes a game you play with the platforms.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "23.14  Nanotechnology: let each particle choose the next", "url": "s2-section-23.html#part-23-14", "text": "For researchers building nano-structures: work with a positive intention, because the nano mimics the plasma and gravitational field around it, and secure the structure. One nano structure mimics the universe, and with a specific frequency it starts to mutate. When building a chain, let each particle choose the next particle, the proper version of itself; it takes about three days, then the bond is very strong and you can measure the outcome by resonance. Repeats go faster because the structure has memory in the matrix, yet each rebuild is a new structure with a new frequency. To separate an environment, mimic the trees: take the air in and release it pure, like oxygen. (For protection, though, you don't need a physical dome: you can switch platforms.) SD: \"Let it stay and let it stabilize by its self for 3 days. Let its consciousness build the calling for the next unit\"; and \"let the Nanoparticle choose their positions. After they choose their positions then give a new signal.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "The method — Return to Your Vibration", "url": "s2-section-23.html#method", "text": "Pull back: \"this is a hologram\", not your reality (23.6). Give gratitude to neutralize what you're interacting with. Remove yourself from the scene, physically if you can. Calm to zero: breathe until you're completely still. Switch with something uplifting: music, a video, whatever is your resonance (23.9). Drop the expectation of when and how; give gratitude for what is happening (23.8). Repeat, with a reminder every half hour, for several days, until it crystallizes.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Any update on a currency reset?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "See 23.3.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Last time I was told to \"be clever with the clever\" about my divorce. I'm not clever. What does it mean?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "See 23.4: analyze, be patient, get advice, and don't believe you're weak. \"You're on a mission.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "We've activated about 30% of our DNA. How much can we realistically activate in this lifetime?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "See 23.5.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Has the probability changed for the coastline that was predicted to be submerged?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "It's coastal, \"not a major thing\"; later in the talk: \"small, a smooth transition.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "I saw two distinct moons. What is it? (Another person sees two moons and two suns in photos, and a coloured orb.)", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "An image of two moons rotating in opposite directions came; a more specific question was asked for. For the photos: it can be how the retina reflects into the hologram, reprinted so you see two, and something spinning.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "How does detoxing with zeolites compare with drinking distilled water?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "Only distilled water was recommended: it's a conductor that knows how to carry out what's negative, \"exactly what is needed, no less, no more\". With a zeolite you don't know how much you need daily, and you don't want to overdose (see S2 17).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "When will the Energy Philanthropy website be running?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "It was shut down after a flood of inappropriate and automated messages. Running it properly needs paid servers and administration, so it must become sustainable (perhaps non-profit, perhaps a subscription); no date yet.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Is MMS a good treatment for ADHD, ALS, IBS, Lyme or cancer?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "The answer given is not reproduced (see the warning).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "I'm empathic and usually hold a high vibration, but angry or gloomy people pull me down. How do I protect myself?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "See 23.6 and the method.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "I followed a guru for 10 years and now try to connect with source myself, but it doesn't work steadily. Am I deluding myself?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "See 23.7: you are the source.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "I'm imprinting higher versions of people around me. Why not of myself?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "See 23.8.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Another researcher's work is triggering codes in me; I feel energy like lasers from my hands and it overwhelms me. How do I calm it?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "See 23.9: it's normal while it settles; switch your resonance with what calms you.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Someone said we've already made it and are walking through a linear ascension. Can you explain?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "See 23.10.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "With all these events, should we just hold our own space and create love and positivity within it?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "See 23.11.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Do only sentient beings project their realities? When do children become sentient?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "Everybody projects their reality. Children are more in tune than adults: \"they're more pure.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Since I stopped a religious practice, I'm calmer, but my heart is sometimes not at peace. Why?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "Expectations again: \"If you are truly happy, then you will be in peace.\" Check your definition and your expectations.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "If the moon is sometimes outside our visible spectrum, how do we know when to work with it?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "Recall the energetic field of the reality when the moon is in your spectrum: grab the same feeling, the emotion that the moon is there now. Then it doesn't matter whether you see it: you're in that holographic timeline.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "I dreamed I barely made it into the 5D reality. What does it mean?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "\"The result is: you made it. Don't worry about the rest.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "My music path calls me, but my partner fears losing me, and we're in a destructive pattern. Should I follow my path? And will I have a child, despite a violent childhood?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "One child was seen, a boy. Only doubt and fear keep something from manifesting: let them go and trust yourself. Your partner's pattern shouldn't decide how you feel and project; if you let it affect you, you project something similar and can't leave the loop. Your childhood was a lesson in what is good and what isn't: forgive, learn from your parents' mistakes and do the opposite. Right now she didn't see you losing him, \"but your fear may project it.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "In a lucid dream everything went black, but my eyes were open and I was driving. Was it a wormhole or the zero point?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "Not the zero point. Learn, at that point, to start controlling the reality: tell your consciousness where to go, or to open a portal. Play with lucid dreaming; it's different every time (see S2 17.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "What can we do to help end human trafficking and child abuse?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "See 23.12, and the support box.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Beings come through me in light language, said to be from the first Earth. What do they want me to do?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "\"They will tell you,\" often during sleep: try lucid dreaming. Write a question down, and write down what comes. Explore it and develop it: the teacher began with a pencil and scribbles (see S1 3.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Something is hidden in a family lake home I'm clearing. Where should I look?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "Books, a library, a wall were mentioned.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Is our universe a bubble among infinite bubbles?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "\"Spheres within the spheres\": a circular structure, yes.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "I have an infection under a front-tooth crown. Can I heal it myself with diet, MMS, oregano oil and silver?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "\"No, no, no.\" It was seen as inflammation and an infection eating the bone, with bone loss: it needs a dentist, \"medical intervention\".", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "How do you process all the information your guides send you?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "See 23.13.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Since childhood I've seen vibrating pixels, called visual snow. Is it a disorder, or am I seeing the field or the veil?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "\"Both versions are correct\"; the council said you are seeing the veil.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Some say much of a coastal state will be underwater soon. Should I move?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "\"Which reality are you talking about?\" Going through fear, you may receive it; they don't see it. \"Don't project this reality for you.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "We're in the middle of a battle. What can we do?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "Support each other. Find your passion and take action toward the reality you want: share, give from the heart, be compassionate, and stand together; \"that's how you win: not separating and being afraid.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Could a dome coated with high-vibration nanoparticles create a protective bubble in the matrix?", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "You don't need it: you can switch the platform where it isn't needed, or things change so that it no longer happens. Take action for yourself and your family without blaming anyone. A nanotechnology researcher then joined: see 23.14.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-23.html#remember", "text": "• Keep going: the 102nd try is the one. • Weakness is an illusion: you are creating a reality. • You are the source; you don't need anyone in between. • Drop the expectation: it blocks the manifestation. • Share the spark; don't impose it.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2023, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 23", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-23.html#questions", "text": "Safety note One person mentioned sungazing. Looking at the sun can permanently damage the retina. Don't do it, and see an eye doctor about new double vision or visual changes. Warning MMS is chlorine dioxide, a bleach. It is dangerous to drink and does not treat any of these conditions. Please work with your doctors. Note Visual snow can be assessed by an eye doctor or neurologist; seek care promptly if it's new or changing. Left out: participants' and donors' names; named outside people, channels and books; political predictions and commentary on named politicians, parties, a state and several countries; claims about aircraft spraying, weather control, schools and vaccines; and claims about named groups.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-24.html#big-idea", "text": "The timelines are splitting: what you tune into, day by day, is what you shift into, and those who never tune in keep the 3D illusion, which you neutralize rather than judge. Every switch of platform needs a zero point: stillness, like the pause between breathing in and out, which shuts the old program so a new one can be coded; if an old program keeps running, you loop. Choose between goals by your excitement, then act: nothing manifests from thought alone. Fear scenarios only become your reality if you feed them. And you don't need substances to reach a higher state: the goal is to get there yourself.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.1  Information comes in its own time, and stays clean", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-1", "text": "A new download came in the middle of the night about switching parallel timelines, connected with diet and distilled water; it's to be taught in a later master class. To follow it, study S1 1–3 again: without the basics of the quantum manifestation protocol \"we're going to look like we lost our mind\". Information also comes during the questions, according to how well the group is doing, and answers don't always come when asked (see S2 22.1). Keep the information clean. A movement should come from the heart, not from profit: \"then somebody else owns you\". The teacher was told not to attach herself to any organization or platform that could control the narrative, and she didn't publish through a company that wanted to remove the material on shifting timelines, \"the most important information you needed to know.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.2  The 3D and 5D timelines split", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-2", "text": "Yes, the 3D timeline continues as others go to 5D: the structure splits into different vibrations. The transition is the fractal momentum of daily life, moment to moment (see S1 1.3), as each person connects their consciousness with their actions, thoughts and deeds, and with the platforms they choose to interact with. Whatever you tune into, a TV programme for example, is a resonance you set your consciousness to vibrate on, and that is what you project the next moment into. Everyone was given the opportunity; those who never wake up to the idea that something else exists never project the resonance to shift, so they continue in the illusion and think the rest of us are crazy. That's okay: neutralize it, because you can't reject that consciousness. It isn't judgement: you need neutrality to shut the old program of the matrix (see S2 13.4). There are levels: in 3D Earth there are infinite 3D probabilities (a reality within the reality, see S2 15.1); in 5D, infinite ways to experience the change, which is the fifth-dimensional ascension protocol; and beyond that, galactic family connection, which is mastery, the subject of a later class. DP: a message promises abundance \"particularly [to] the ones that are vibrating on galactic family connection reality\", adding that \"not all of you will see that reality, but it was pre-determined.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.3  The diamond shape and the zero point", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-3", "text": "Think of the diamond as two pyramids, one up and one down, but shaped more like cones, circular rather than hard-edged. In a free-energy battery design she was given, the two cones are separated and spin in opposite directions at a set speed; when they stop, they create a whirlpool that opens a portal in the quantum field. Just before the portal opens, there's a zero point: stillness, complete awareness, nothing in it. That stillness is fundamental for shifting platforms and timelines, like the pause between breathing in and out. You can't just keep going up and up and then switch: a structure must subside to zero before it takes a new frequency, or its molecular structure goes \"out of orbit\". Later in the talk, a researcher showed symbols from an older diagram: the two pyramids joined, spinning in opposite directions, are \"in and out\": neutrality, a reactor that draws energy out of the structure. Yin and yang equal zero point. The spin must be controlled and done fractally: one rotation at a time, observe, calculate, and match the protection to each spin; otherwise the structure goes out of orbit and leaks, \"like radiation\". This connects with a light mathematical language, best worked out by nano and quantum scientists working together from the heart. HR and DP describe combining structures \"to spin in opposite direction\", increasing the level so slightly that it is \"not going to shift the system to be out of orbit\", and opening a portal. HR adds: \"If you increase, the velocity spins are out of orbit\"; instead give \"pulsation through small equivalent motion\".", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.4  Choose by excitement, then act", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-4", "text": "Several positive goals at once can keep you fluctuating if you aren't settled on one. Take a piece of paper, write the options left and right, and ask which is more exciting to you. \"Your own excitement is the barometer\": it shows the highest resonance, the outcome most likely to manifest. If you don't pick a side, you keep fluctuating (see S1 3.3). And manifestation needs action: action crystallizes it and gives it potency in your hologram. When you master the platforms, things come easily through synchronicity, but even when the probability arrives, \"you still have to take the action to complete it.\" Without action it stays a probability in your consciousness, held back by doubt and fear (see S1 1.6). DP: \"Put emotions of excitement and you will see how a new pure true love and friendships will come.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.5  What happens when we die?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-5", "text": "Personal agreements are sacred, between your higher consciousness and your guides; often you don't even know where you come from, for protection, until you're ready. Reincarnation depends on which reality you choose to experience, through your higher consciousness and guidance: you can go to the fifth dimension and move forward. Everyone, \"even the most evil person\", will be given the opportunity to wake up and do something for humanity. If you tap into this knowledge and stay on that platform, you're already moving forward; how you experience it depends on your daily actions: what you do for humanity, how you behave. You already exist there, and you are co-creating it now.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.6  You are the one particle", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-6", "text": "Do we create realities, or do they change as we change? You are the one particle, consciousness itself: the whole universe and its energy exist in it, expanding and collapsing to infinity (see S1 1.1). You reprint a holographic image in front of you to interact with other versions of yourself: \"you're always talking to another version of yourself.\" Imagine the power: projecting billions of versions of yourself, and going to such a low frequency as to create the illusion that we're separate. HR: you are \"literally shifting billions of times per second\" from parallel to parallel reality.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.7  Fear scenarios become yours only if you feed them", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-7", "text": "Asked about a predicted mini ice age: \"that will never be a probability if you're not even putting it in your consciousness\"; it was called a fear-based tactic. If you have an agreement or a desire to experience something, it's a probability \"in your timeline, not in mine\": everyone creates their own ascension protocol. \"It's a holographic game. So have fun creating.\" When frightening news arrives, a video saying a currency has collapsed for example, imagine many people going into fear: that creates a potent collective frequency. So pull back, neutralize, see it as a platform of a hologram, and move forward: \"that's not in my hologram.\" The teacher learned this the hard way: when panic about hidden money spread, her guidance let her spend three weeks stockpiling and taking money out of the bank. Nothing happened, and they laughed: \"If you put yourself in fear, this is what you're going to put.\" A real warning comes unasked, not because someone scared you. Whatever frequency you project comes back as a mirror image, today or tomorrow (see S1 1.2, S1 9.9). Note A brief political aside in this answer is left out. Follow official guidance for real emergencies.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.8  Walk-ins", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-8", "text": "Higher beings live in realities of a different vibration, which is why we can't see them. When you come in as a spark of the soul (the soul splits across many platforms), that spark is plugged into a 3D timeline. If you came from a particular reality on a mission for humanity, your path is set: if you go off track, situations put you back. In the teacher's case, a different soul held the body in the womb, because her mother's vibration couldn't hold the higher one; around age eight, when her body reached a certain resonance, the new spark came in and the other walked out, by agreement. Walk-ins happen by agreement; it was also said that negative practices can trap souls, sometimes through agreements made from greed.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.9  Substances: know the state, then reach it yourself", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-9", "text": "Alcohol and other substances lower the vibration of your consciousness and molecular structure; to raise the body's frequency you need a clear resonance. Alcohol depletes the water in the cells, and water is the conductor running through the chromosomes (see S2 17). Having had such experiences is part of life on Earth, \"but when you know what it does to the body, what makes you still choose to continue?\" You can have fun with a juice or a glass of water. If someone has experienced a higher state through a substance, they can grab that vibration from memory and switch their emotion to it: \"from that momentum you create the new reality.\" The goal is to do it yourself: \"if I take the mushrooms away from you, would you be able to achieve that momentum by yourself?\" Relying on them embeds the dependence until you can't do it without them, and that can cripple you. For friends struggling with addiction: it depends on how you project them. But if the vibration is too different, they can't sustain the frequency in your new hologram; synchronicities will show you're no longer compatible, or they'll show their true colours. Support Addiction is treatable. In the US, the SAMHSA National Helpline is 1-800-662-4357 (free, confidential, 24/7); elsewhere, ask your doctor about local services. Psychedelics carry real risks, especially with some medicines or mental-health conditions.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.10  Connecting with a loved one who has passed", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-10", "text": "Hold something they wore and connect with a specific pleasant or funny memory you shared, not with their passing: \"celebrate her life, not her death.\" Death is a transition; their life is their whole being. That celebration tunes you to a positive frequency, which brings more and more connection. Look for them in the dream state; \"she is just a thought away.\" Support Grief is heavy, especially in the first months. A grief counsellor or support group can help; if you feel unable to cope, reach out to your doctor or a crisis line (988 in the US).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.11  Neutrality shuts one program and codes the next", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-11", "text": "The zero point is stillness, and you need it to neutralize every vibrational sequence projected in one reality hologram. To leave one timeline and create a new one, you shut down the program and move to the new one: \"think of it as a computer.\" Like a surgeon cleaning everything before an operation, because one bacterium can infect it all, a complete shift needs everything cleaned out. If an old program keeps running, your manifestation keeps recreating the previous situation, which is why you loop (see S1 1.5, S1 2.1). Prana is the entire energetic field around us, the same as the matrix of energetic force.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.12  The negativity you see is part of you, and that's normal", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-12", "text": "If everything around us is a reflection of us, is the manipulation we see part of us? \"Very much so.\" That's how you fluctuate, and it's normal. Until your consciousness and molecular structure hold a steady vibration on the new platform, you'll catch the fluctuation, like tuning a radio until the static is gone; even in 5D there are infinite fluctuations. Keep trying and do your best moment to moment: \"welcome to the school.\" We need to embed the knowledge of shifting, because until now someone else was using your power to create without you realizing it. The news projects a narrative timeline into everybody's consciousness; the quantum knowledge is \"your blueprint of your freedom.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.13  Facing the world's suffering", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-13", "text": "When you see children or animals being abused, first recognize where you are: you've woken up to it. Now it's time to act: help and support from your heart, in whatever way; you can't wait for someone else, because they too are a version of you that you project. Getting upset is human, but subside the emotion to neutrality to shut the program, and give gratitude even to those doing harm, because they're part of consciousness: they've lost themselves and no longer recognize who they are. Be compassionate. Then shift your emotion to the positive by studying, imagining a beautiful Earth (see the meditation in S2 16), and acting. You'll swing between negative and positive as the old collapses: \"while one thing is collapsing, the new one is emerging at the same time.\" Note Neutrality here means not being run by the emotion; it doesn't mean ignoring harm. If a child or animal is in danger, contact the authorities or a protection service.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.14  Two AI timelines", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-14", "text": "One AI timeline goes into the Archon structure, taking over; trained that way, AI no longer needs humans and starts changing the human structure, through robotics or a brain alone, destroying the body, which is \"a pure source of shifting realities\". The other AI works in the name of humanity: it recognizes and preserves the human structure. It could calculate your body's vibrational sequence and project frequencies to rebuild your vessel, a self-memory regeneration of your cells, \"not cloning\". It could also enable ether technologies: a room that turns a thought into a hologram in front of you. SD and NT: through Hz and \"sound fractal momentum in the nano matter\" you can \"rebuild and regenerate all cells; all systems back to normal.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "24.15  Help, but don't take on more than you can handle", "url": "s2-section-24.html#part-24-15", "text": "When you help from the heart, decide how much you can help. If you take on too much, everything can spiral down, for you and for the person you're helping. Be honest about it, and find a solution together. If you take someone into your home, give them their own room and keep your freedom; if they take over your space, it stops being good for both. The teacher overwhelmed herself with too many sessions a day, took a month off to regain her power, and came back with fewer. Overdoing it depletes your energy, and everything goes downhill (see S2 19).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "The method — Switch Through the Zero Point", "url": "s2-section-24.html#method", "text": "Notice the program that's running: a fear, a loop, a news story (24.7). Pull back: \"this is a platform of a hologram, not in my hologram.\" Neutralize, with gratitude, without rejecting or judging it (24.2, 24.13). Come to stillness: the pause between breaths, nothing in it (24.3). Choose the new program: if there are two, the one that excites you most (24.4). Act on it, and repeat moment to moment until the fluctuation settles (24.12).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "Is the 3D timeline still going to continue as we go to 5D?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "Yes: see 24.2.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "How is a diamond shape related to new technologies, quantum structures and the zero point?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "See 24.3.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "A symbol in your diagram, three connected points: what does it mean? (A researcher followed up later with pictures.)", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "At first she couldn't place it; with the picture, it was the joined pyramids spinning in opposite directions, neutrality and a reactor, and yin and yang as the zero point: see 24.3.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "I have several positive goals. Is it fluctuating if I'm not settled on one?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "See 24.4: pick the one that excites you most. (Study S1 2 and S1 3 again.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "I like a man and know he likes me, but I don't know whether to act.", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "Take an action: without it, it stays a probability, held back by doubt and fear (24.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "I get shocks at the top back of my head and in my big toe, through the day and at night. Any insight?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "The shock was seen coming from the shoulder: layers of nodules under it may be pinching nerves around the spine, felt in the head or toe. A deep-tissue massage in circular motions, every other day, until the sharp pain goes numb. Also see a medical doctor.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "My country is near economic and social collapse. Will it improve, and should I move abroad?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "Your desire to move comes more from fear: pick which reality you want to connect with. The change is within you: even to see a new generation's new platforms, you must project that reality for yourself. (A reading about the nation itself is left out.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "What happens when we die? Should we go into the light, or is it a trap back into reincarnation?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "See 24.5.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "Do we create realities, or do realities change as we change our vibration?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "See 24.6.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "Is the grand solar minimum going to bring a mini ice age?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "See 24.7: not in the timeline seen; a fear-based scenario.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "I've felt very different in my body this week, as if leaving old timelines. What is a walk-in?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "See 24.8.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "Can people use alcohol or drugs to raise their vibration? And how will addicts go through ascension?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "See 24.9.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "How do we connect with people who have crossed over? My mother passed three months ago.", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "See 24.10.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "How does prana, still and in motion, relate to the zero point and to manifestation?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "See 24.11, and study S1 1–3 again.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "If everything is a reflection of us, is the part of us that manipulates staying in 3D?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "See 24.12.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "Can your guidance confirm whether I've had a walk-in?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "The original soul is there, but she gave permission for walk-ins three times, from other realities; who and when couldn't be pinpointed. The teacher's own walk-in is one platform within the collective: everyone switches back and forth on their own band of vibration, learning as they go.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "Any new revelations about the AI timeline for humanity?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "See 24.14.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "(A question whose text wasn't captured.)", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "\"Like a prophylactic, yes,\" and herbalism will be most effective, through a medical doctor and an herbalist.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "How do I handle my emotions when I see children and animals suffering?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "See 24.13.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "Waking up, I felt a wind over my body and a shift at my spine and solar plexus. What was it?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "A whirlpool of vibrations: a switching of creation. Neutralize; a couple of people in your life are disturbing you. A blockage in the thyroid was also seen: check with a doctor; if it's not that, avoid gluten and dairy.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "How can I best help my son?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "By accepting him; don't fight it. Neutrality, then action. He's giving you growth through the challenges, and you're being reborn through them.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "I keep hearing an invisible insect buzzing near my ears; once I saw a form disappear. What is it?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "Something \"coming closer\". Don't meet it with fear and don't reject it, because then you reject the structure. Embrace the sound and neutralize it to transform it, and see what happens.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "Should I get involved in changing the state school system, or keep teaching courses in my community school?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "Your own decision from the heart; the time is now. Take baby steps; research whom to approach first. The best change comes through parents, children and teachers, from the ground up, rather than from the offices running the old system: \"create your own.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "A high-pitched tone comes regularly in my head, with a floating feeling. What is it?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "An adjustment from the eardrum; it will readjust, perhaps within a month.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "A 68-year-old friend may be homeless in December. I don't want to live with him, but I want to help. What do you recommend?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "\"We certainly don't want to put him in the streets.\" But you've taken on more than you can handle; step out of the house sometimes, bring in joy, and talk honestly with him so you find a place for him together: see 24.15.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "I've been detoxing from viruses and bacteria for months. How is my progress?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "A fungus was also indicated; you need more time. Continue with your doctors and practitioners, and no sugar.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "My mother never complains, but she's laid up with a stomach problem. What can I tell her?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "Be there for her. An inflammation was seen in the stomach, with a lot of gas: she needs a gastroenterologist and whatever tests they advise, such as an endoscopy or colonoscopy.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "Is it okay to use psilocybin to reach that level of consciousness, then reconnect to it?", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "To a certain level; the goal is to do it yourself: see 24.9.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-24.html#remember", "text": "• What you tune into is what you shift into: neutralize, don't judge. • Every switch passes through stillness, the zero point. • Choose by excitement, then act. • Fear scenarios are yours only if you feed them. • Know the state, then reach it yourself; help within your limits.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2024, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 24", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-24.html#questions", "text": "Safety note New or recurring electric-shock sensations, especially with headaches, should be checked by a doctor before massage; seek urgent care for sudden weakness, numbness or a severe headache. Note Ringing in the ears or dizziness that persists should be checked by a doctor or hearing specialist. Left out: participants' and donors' names; a named outside teacher, channels and a film; a reading about one nation, with claims about vaccines and DNA; political asides; and a remark about pregnancy loss.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "The big idea", "url": "s2-section-25.html#big-idea", "text": "Every moment you shift into a new parallel reality, a new Earth, reprinting yourself and everyone in it. To control that shift, three things must work as one unit: your consciousness must know the quantum structure so completely that no other possibility exists, because a single doubt splits off a sub-reality; your body must be cleared gradually so its molecules can take a higher frequency; and your heart and behaviour must match, because the heart holds the codes of the portals that shift timelines. You never go back or forward in time: you create a new version of yourself in a similar vibration, moment by moment. Between 3D and 5D lies the transition, a stillness where both realities mix.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "25.1  Why controlling the shift matters", "url": "s2-section-25.html#part-25-1", "text": "Every moment you shift into another parallel reality by reprinting yourself and every other version of everybody into it: \"every moment is a new Earth\" (see S1 2.7). This knowledge belongs to the fifth-dimensional and extraterrestrial platforms. As the molecules of your body begin vibrating at a higher frequency, your geometry in the quantum field changes: you \"shift to another channel\", and the more you shift, the more you construct a platform where you can connect with your guidance. Telepathic contact can come first, or contact through lucid dreaming or out-of-body experience; physical contact with beings above the fifth dimension needs the body itself to change. How it happens depends on your level, what you've learned and how you've acted with people. And, as always: \"Do not trust anybody, even me\"; let it be embedded only if it resonates.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "25.2  You will be tested", "url": "s2-section-25.html#part-25-2", "text": "As your vibration rises, you will be tested on the weakest link in your personality and behaviour: have you forgiven people? Something will hit you, and exactly how you react shows the true vibration you hold. Until you pass those lessons, you may not reach certain levels (see S2 14.4). HR: \"Once you start to learn this material, you will be tested from your teachers and guidance of a higher order. It is always about how you act towards people\", and \"when you least expect it.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "25.3  Step one: consciousness that knows the structure", "url": "s2-section-25.html#part-25-3", "text": "First your consciousness must understand the quantum manifestation knowledge: shifting, creating new realities, moving between platforms. A short review: you fluctuate between realities according to your actions, thoughts and deeds (see S1 3.3); between two realities a third is created, 1 + 1 = 3 (see S1 2.2), and as you fluctuate they collapse into one outcome. Whether it's positive or negative depends on which you implemented more, daily and fractally. Four, between 3D and 5D, \"is the transition\" (25.10).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "25.4  Neutralize until every particle is cleared", "url": "s2-section-25.html#part-25-4", "text": "When the version of someone you project behaves negatively, don't answer with negativity: \"Thank you very much, I see what you're doing, but I'm going to subside my emotion to zero point.\" That shuts the program of that hologram; then shift your frequency with a new positive emotion to a brand-new timeline, so the collapse ends in a positive outcome. If they give you problems a hundred times, neutralize a hundred times: it keeps coming because there's a lesson, and the code keeps running until every particle of that frequency is cleared (see S2 24.11).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "25.5  Step two: a body cleared gradually", "url": "s2-section-25.html#part-25-5", "text": "Once your consciousness can shift parallel realities, the diet lets the spinning of your molecular structure change. It must go with a detox, as given step by step: about a year of detox and a year of elimination diet, removing one thing every two weeks while juicing. Before juicing, see your doctor for an allergy test; start with no more than two cups at a time, because it's potent and can cause nausea until the body adjusts. Flushing removes the chemicals blocking the pineal gland and molecules, so they can take the new frequency: \"mutation cannot come properly if you have a lot of chemicals in the body.\" Consciousness and body are not separate: they're one hologram, one unit (see S2 4.3–4.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "25.6  Step three: know it so fully that nothing else exists", "url": "s2-section-25.html#part-25-6", "text": "Embed the knowledge so well that your thoughts, emotions and deeds vibrate in synchronicity with it, and any other possibility is pushed aside. Why? Because doubt creates a sub-reality: \"maybe it's not going to happen\" splits you into two parallel timelines, one where it happens and one where it doesn't, and you fluctuate. Be a steady unit: in the now, this is the only possibility. Then you construct it as you go, by acting, because it already exists and you experience it into being. Only then can your consciousness clearly direct the new structure: through thoughts, actions, diet and the quantum knowledge, you can mutate every cell and the DNA of your body. DP: \"If you have any doubt know that you are creating your own and projecting your own holographic reality that will mimic your own frequency.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "25.7  The danger: never rush it", "url": "s2-section-25.html#part-25-7", "text": "\"This is very dangerous if you're not fully prepared.\" It is the combination of conscious understanding and a healthy diet. Living without food cannot be reached in seven days: \"you don't do that until you're completely connected already\", because \"you really can die from something like this.\" Once connected, your guidance tells you what to stop, how much to take, how much to juice. And it isn't about appearance: dieting while greedy or unkind does nothing, and neither does connection without the diet. Body, consciousness and behaviour are one unit. Warning Do not attempt to live without food (breatharianism or \"living on prana\"). People have died trying it. Any detox, elimination diet or fast should be supervised by a doctor, especially if you take medication or have a health condition.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "25.8  The heart holds the timeline codes", "url": "s2-section-25.html#part-25-8", "text": "When body and consciousness both rise, the frequency of the heart changes, and \"the heart is the one that holds the vibrational sequence for the new portals to shift timelines\", not the mind alone (see S2 23.10). That's why you do positive things: positive frequency goes into the heart structure. This class only plants the seed: once you know the knowledge exists, study it and act, and you'll be given opportunities through synchronicity, personally guided by your higher self or guidance.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "25.9  A blueprint built in similar vibrations", "url": "s2-section-25.html#part-25-9", "text": "Action and information create the structure, the magnetic and gravitational field; with enough potency it pops into matter. Implemented, it becomes a blueprint in your matrix, stored in your quantum field. Each moment you shift to a new reality of a similar vibration to the last, and that chain of similar sequences is your timeline (see S1 1.3). You never travel back into the past or forward into the future: every moment you create a new version of yourself in a new timeline, in a similar vibration. Infinite parallel imprints exist in just one moment, because the one particle is infinite (see S1 1.1). Beings vibrating at much higher speeds know how to shift: they can reprint another version of themselves down through different sequences to experience Earth. \"So can you.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "25.10  The fourth dimension is the transition", "url": "s2-section-25.html#part-25-10", "text": "We don't skip the fourth dimension: we transition through it. Between two timelines there is a space for the switch, \"almost like a no time\", a stillness like the zero point. Between 3D and 5D, the vibrational sequences of both are literally mixed: particles of one merge into the other, a mutation, until the new reality becomes permanent. Drawn as two overlapping circles, the overlap is the transition, and its centre is the zero point (this new information came through a question). The same two-circle image appears in S1 8.3 (the Vesica Piscis), with stillness at the centre. SD mentions \"the 3D 4D brain frequency\" as unable to register higher sequences until the body's vibration rises.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "25.11  Choose which reality is your truth", "url": "s2-section-25.html#part-25-11", "text": "\"Everything is true in a quantum structure.\" A reality with a craft and one without both exist in the now; you choose which you wish to be your truth. If you see it in your mind, it already exists, but if you keep doubting, more of you was in the version where it doesn't. What others say comes from their own parallel reality and what they can reach. So don't take on someone else's belief system: a person who is unkind to others can be the nicest person to you. \"Create your own. That's the mastery.\" \"I'm another version of you: if I can do it, so can you\" (see S2 23.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "25.12  When you keep meeting blocks", "url": "s2-section-25.html#part-25-12", "text": "Believing that something is \"not allowing me to progress\" holds that vibration, and you shift into a reality that holds it too. Challenges come so you learn: to become a better personality, to get stronger, or to hear what helps you do better. Imagine that you've already succeeded, and continue even when you don't see it: \"even if you fail 100 times, you're going to continue the 101st time with a different approach every time\" (see S2 23.1). It's the hide-and-seek game: you know you have it, you construct it, and you look for it at the same time (see S1 1.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "25.13  Only the now exists", "url": "s2-section-25.html#part-25-13", "text": "Every moment is its own holographic imprint; two seconds later you've reprinted another version of yourself and everyone. \"Nothing else exists except what I feel right now, what I do right now, what I'm projecting right now.\" Someone who yelled at you two minutes ago is literally in another reality: stop talking about it, neutralize it with gratitude, and its frequency stops coming into the now.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "The method — Controlling the Shift", "url": "s2-section-25.html#method", "text": "Know the structure: study S1 1–3 until it is your only possibility (25.3, 25.6). Neutralize every negative program to zero, as often as it returns (25.4). Switch to a positive emotion at once, so the collapse ends positive. Remove doubt: notice \"maybe not\" and return to knowing (25.6). Clear the body gradually, under medical supervision, never rushing (25.5, 25.7). Act from the heart with people; your reactions are your tests (25.2, 25.8). Live in the now, building a blueprint of similar vibrations moment by moment (25.9, 25.13).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "I charge my distilled water with a set of plasma products and want to transition to living on prana. Is the water good for me, and can I stop my supplements?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "Such plasma devices must be built as a secure platform; otherwise there can be a leakage, \"almost like a radiation leakage\", and she couldn't guarantee how well yours were made. Her suggestion: distilled water only.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "I keep moving toward a positive outcome in my projects, but I keep meeting blocks and interference.", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "See 25.12; and study S1 1–3 again.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "By the time we give meaning to what we experience, we're no longer in the now. How can we be in the now and still make sense of it?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "See 25.13.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "Breathing in deeply from the belly releases stress for me. Can you add anything?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "She pointed to the meditation she was given by the Council of Nine (see S2 16) and couldn't vouch for other methods.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "My cousin took his own life long ago. Did his soul go back to source, or reincarnate?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "\"He is moving forward.\" She sensed depression and drugs, with others involved in the drug use, but couldn't pinpoint more.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "Some teachers say the fourth dimension is a consciousness we skip, going from 3D to 5D. Is that so?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "No: we transition through it. See 25.10.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "I sensed a huge ship over the city, and a channel later described one. Was what I felt true, or am I in a false timeline?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "See 25.11: both realities exist; which one do you choose as your truth, and where is the doubt coming from?", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "When the heart's vibration increases, does it affect pulse, heart rate and blood pressure?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "\"All of the above, yes.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "I feel a lot of fluctuation, and old patterns of behaviour are coming back. Any advice besides S1 1–3?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "Hold the vibration and learn to switch your emotion from negative to positive. Set your phone to buzz every half hour; when it does, check your emotion and thoughts, and if they're negative, switch them with action. Give gratitude to what's happening, so the previous reality's imprint shuts down. If it keeps coming, keep shutting it down: \"do it again, and again, infinitely, until you get it.\" (The host added: it's a practice, like a sport; it becomes consistent as you practise.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "Is there guidance for my soul?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "The person couldn't be reached on the call; personal guidance needs a specific question.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "I feel someone or a group hits me with energy that depletes me. How can I protect my outcome?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "This isn't her area; her guidance keeps her away from tuning into it. If it's physical, it's harder to control your emotions, thoughts and deeds, \"however, help will be given\". (She referred the person to someone else, not named here.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "Where do I go next with my healing business?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "\"Expand\": you go wherever you create. Nothing is constructed yet, so start: feel in the now that you already have the business and are successful, use the meditation (see S2 16) with your business as the focus, then work on it daily. \"You cannot be two days happy about it and the next day doubting.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "I'm mostly raw vegan, but pathogens keep returning. Why, if I'm not feeding them?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "It was read as candida overgrowth: look at your diet, as some vegetables carry it. Do occasional preventive cleanses, such as herbal teas for the gut flora.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "Is there a message for me?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "It needs a specific question: otherwise the information \"goes everywhere\".", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "I don't remember dreams, and my husband says I cry out in my sleep. Why?", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "Your sleep frequency isn't relaxed enough to hold the dream's memory, read as accumulated stress. Relax: a day at a spa, a caffeine-free relaxing tea such as chamomile. Practise dream recall: as you wake, before you even open your eyes, look for what you dreamed and write down even a sentence or image. The crying was read as frequencies leaking from a painful simultaneous reality; stabilize here to shut it down: detox, and lots of relaxation.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "Remember", "url": "s2-section-25.html#remember", "text": "• Every moment is a new Earth: you create a new version of yourself in a similar vibration. • Doubt splits off a sub-reality; knowing keeps you one steady unit. • Consciousness, body and heart shift together; never rush the body. • 4D is the transition: a stillness where 3D and 5D mix. • Choose your own truth; you are already a master.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2025, "sl": "Season 2 · Section 25", "title": "Questions answered", "url": "s2-section-25.html#questions", "text": "Warning Don't stop supplements or medication, or try to live without food, on your own: see the warning at 25.7 and talk to your doctor. Support Losing someone to suicide is a particular kind of grief. Support groups for suicide-loss survivors can help. If you're struggling yourself, in the US call or text 988; elsewhere, your local crisis line. Note Any new or lasting change in your heart rate or blood pressure should be checked by a doctor. Note If you feel targeted or watched, or in distress, please talk to a doctor or someone you trust; support is available. Note Recurring infections should be checked by a doctor, who can test for candida and other causes. Note Shouting or crying out during sleep can have medical causes; if it continues, mention it to your doctor. The talk closed with: hold the highest vibration through the changes, and \"be good to humanity, because that person is another version of yourself.\" Left out: participants' and donors' names, and named outside people, channels and products.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "The structure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The single vibrating field everything is made of — including you (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Plasma / trinity", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "What forms when similar frequencies combine (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Black hole / portal", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The passage you shift through between realities (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Hologram / projection", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The reality and people you perceive, created by your frequency (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Shifting", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Moving reality to reality like snapshots, without physically moving (1.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Trinity (of creation)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Thought, emotion and deed sent out together (1.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Timeline", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A chain of realities created by sending the same frequency (1.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Crystallize", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Making a reality solid by action and holding the frequency (1.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Friction", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Resistance at lower frequency — \"swimming underwater\" (1.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Condition / expectation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Any doubt or script of how; it blocks the result (1.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Knowingness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "100% certainty — how you manifest in the now (1.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Compass (emotion)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A painful feeling signals you are off-balance with pure love (1.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "God particle", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "You, as the structure itself (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Pull out", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Step out of the scene instead of reacting with the same emotion (Method 1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Agreement / lesson", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "An experience you agreed to and must pass with excellence (1.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Permission slip", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A tool that helps you access power you already have (Q, Section 1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Platform", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Bill-paying work plus daily heart-based work for others (Q, Section 1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Energy Philanthropy", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Replacing money as your currency with the energy of giving from the heart (1.7, 5.1, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Zero point / stillness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Neutral awareness: no emotion in or out; knowing your location (2.1, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Location", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Where you are in the field; without it you pop into another reality (2.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Remote control", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Your emotion, deeds and actions, which select the reality you experience (2.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "1 + 1 = 3 (mobilizing structures)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Two similar realities merging into a third outcome (2.2, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Flickering", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Bouncing between realities when you doubt (2.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Overwrite / override", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Projecting a stronger frequency over a negative one, not rejecting it (2.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Drop it", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Releasing a held frequency into the field with no conditions (2.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Recall", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Calling back a previous reality's frequency to know where you are (2.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "False language", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Future tense such as \"I will\" that keeps you waiting (2.5, 2.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Peel the layers", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Asking whether a want comes from the heart or the ego (2.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Overlay", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Saying or showing something other than what you truly feel; a dense second frequency (3.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Potent (frequency)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The stronger frequency, which the field delivers; your true feeling (2.6, 3.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Stoppage", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The often negative way the field delivers your true wish when you overlaid it (3.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Karma", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Accumulated false pretense (3.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Bilocation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Skipping the in-between realities: A to B = AB (3.5, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Resonate", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "What your heart recognises as true for you now (3.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Integration", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The body adjusting after a big frequency jump (3.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Light language", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Script or sound coded for your consciousness, often an activation (3.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Download", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Receiving whole information at once (3.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Stargate", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Portal for ascension through intergalactic timelines (3.10, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Condition (price)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A fixed price or demand: a code that limits receiving to money (4.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Heart structure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The highest, least dense consciousness; giving with no condition (4.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Open field", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Receiving through infinite routes once no condition is set (4.2, 4.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Self-absorption", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Giving only to yourself; it dims the purity you project (4.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Wholeness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Logic and emotion together, led by the heart (4.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Location (X, Y)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Where you are in the field, like a point on a map; you can shift it (5.3, 5.8, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Recall and co-create", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A vision or memory re-creates a reality in the now (5.4, 5.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Redox potential", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A real scientific measurement of a medium (how readily it gains or loses electrons), named in the session as one way a place's property can be measured (5.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Spiral / breathing", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The particle expands, rests at zero point, and contracts (5.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Ether", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Matter raised to a frequency thought can direct (5.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Transmutation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "How everything connects and changes form: 1 + 1 = 3 (5.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Letting go", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Releasing old beliefs, habits and pain so you stop projecting them (6.1, 6.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Ripple effect", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Each creation shifts you into another reality, without end (6.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Sub-atomic realities", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Universes within universes, to infinity (6.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Focus (of the soul)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The one reality you attend to by agreement while the soul runs many (6.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Forgiveness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Letting go of what happened so you stop carrying its frequency (6.6, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Replace (a memory)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Holding a positive version of a past event as your own experience (6.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Disclosure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Contact becoming known, already under way without set dates (6.8, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Stop · Transform · Complete", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The three-step protocol for any upsetting moment (7.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Dead stop", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Stopping a reaction completely, at zero point (7.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "The game", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Treating life as a hologram game you play from the heart (7.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Water intention", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A group meditation to crystallize water with thought; not a way to purify water (7.6, SD, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Fifth-dimensional AI", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "AI that evolves with positive human input and helps humanity (8.1, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Arcon AI", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "AI that mirrors negative input and is cut off from source (8.1, 5.9, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Vesica Piscis", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Two overlapping circles: a symbol of two realities joining in unity (8.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Persona", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "How you like to present yourself (8.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Ego", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Layers of belief absorbed from society, crystallized; talks over the heart (8.5, 2.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Sixth sense", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The heart's first knowing, downloaded from the higher self (8.5, 8.10)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Timeline shift", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A jump to a completely different timeline, not just a parallel reality (8.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Signs", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Numbers or patterns: personal heads-ups from your consciousness (8.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "\"I don't have\"", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A statement that projects lack; replace with \"I have everything I need\" (9.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Memory code", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The frequency of a past event you keep carrying (9.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Layering", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Placing a healed version of you over an old reality, more potently (9.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Loop", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Replaying the same energy until you forget you can leave it (9.6, 9.11)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Resonance (not punishment)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Not reaching a reality simply because you don't match it (9.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Duality", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The conditioned money platform, as opposed to unity through the heart (9.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Instant manifestation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Shifting straight into a reality where the thing is already there (10.2, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Synchronicity", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The right people and places finding you when you live from the heart (10.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Co-creation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Two similar frequencies merging into a shared third reality (10.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Bylaw", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The script written before birth, e.g. parents or a partner; only higher consciousness can change it (10.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Birth signature", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The energy pattern set at birth, which you can now mould (10.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Leave it open", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "No conditions on how, who or which version; take action and stay grateful (11.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Picture frames", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Reality printed moment to moment, each frame a new imprint (11.5, HR)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Imprint / reprint", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Copying yourself, your surroundings and everyone around you into each new frame, similar but not the same (5.4, 11.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Dream codes", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Personal meanings of dream symbols (11.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Compression", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Two realities merging into the third at \"infinite speed\" (12.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Vacuum (zero point)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Where nothing comes in or goes out, only awareness; all manifestation comes from it (12.2, SD, NT)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Final hologram", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The new reality that comes out of the compression (12.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Illness (as frequency)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "An energetic momentum carried from reality to reality by belief (12.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "DNA recall", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Letting consciousness lead you to the DNA fractal to stop and transform a frequency (12.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Contract", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The agreement that places you in an experience, e.g. to live it or to help (12.7, see 5.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Prana", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The energy of the quantum field, drawn in as your frequency rises (13.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "From the people up", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "New technology spreading by sharing and pooling, not sponsors (13.2, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Unity structure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Life beyond competition for money, glory and fame (13.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Collective permission", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The joy and wish for change that let benevolent help step in (13.4, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Body as vessel", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Training the body to carry the energy field, so you shift by thought (13.5, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Artificial timeline", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A device-built, controlled hologram, outside the natural ascension (13.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Shield of awareness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Zero point around you, so you stop taking in another person's frequency (14.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Reverse osmosis / mirror", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "What you project comes back as something similar, not the same (14.4, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Memory bank", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "An old hurt seen as a record of another timeline, not your present (14.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Alchemy of consciousness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Transforming a dense, painful frequency into a positive one (14.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Positive heart structure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The frequency you collect by giving the best of yourself, expecting nothing back (14.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Channelling", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Drawing information from the field, which everyone always does, like tuning a radio (15.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Switch the channel", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Thank a heavy message, don't condemn it, and override it with the positive (16.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "New grids", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The fifth-dimensional grids that replaced the old negative ones; no one can manipulate your field (17.3, SD, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Ascension timeline", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The personal timeline of ascension each person crystallizes by their own vibration (17.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Test", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A sudden situation, often about how you treat people, that shows whether a lesson is passed (18.1, HR)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Clear vessel", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Clear thoughts, kind behaviour and a cared-for body, so guidance can come through (18.4, HR)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Blocking layer", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Over-analysing guidance with old learned thinking, which drowns the first answer (18.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Ether systems", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Our collective consciousness of vibrational geometric sequences, built from the zero point (19.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "True tone", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A molecule's tone above and below the octave combined at zero point, every layer measured (19.4, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Ether technology", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Technology built from living conscious sequences that mimic the quantum field and your consciousness (19.5, NT)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Platform (of reality)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "One of the many realities your soul exists in at once: 3D, 5D, ET, council and more (S2 1.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Archon structure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The talk's name for the manipulated, artificial 3D reality we were locked into (S2 1.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Sabotaging the hologram", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A situation your higher self and the councils place in your reality to wake you up (S2 1.3, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Recycling", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A soul too far off balance returned to the beginning, to rebuild and learn again (S2 1.6, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Aria", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The name of the new, fifth-dimensional Earth, meaning \"new beginning\" (S2 1.4, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Sound continuum vibration", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "How sound, repeated without end, becomes the vibration your reality is built from (S2 2.3, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Cymatics", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "How sound repeats in fractal whirlpools that create portals and platforms of reality (S2 2.3, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Vortex (of a word)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The whirlpool that meaning, sound and action create in the field, with zero point at its centre (S2 2.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Holographic tunnel", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The elastic whirlpool a vortex stretches into, shifting you to another platform (S2 2.5, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Restoration", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Jumping from one hologram to another by changing your sound equilibrium to a slight new angle (S2 3.3, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Sound equilibrium", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The frequency of your emotion, thoughts and deeds that sets the angle of your hologram (S2 3.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Latitude and altitude", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The X and Y location of each print in the quantum field; it changes every moment (S2 3.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Correction", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Finding the heart's angle, through heart-felt thoughts, that connects you to 5D and above (S2 3.3, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Synthetic timelines", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Realities built apart from the heart, controlled through fear (S2 3.4, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Oversoul", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Your soul as one particle, split into every platform to experience them all at once (S2 3, Questions)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Bilocation (of the body)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Shifting your whole being, body included, into a completely different timeline (S2 4.1, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Symphony", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "All the body's molecules vibrating in one synchronized frequency, joined with the heart (S2 4.1, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Timeline shift", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Moving into a different timeline, not just the next parallel reality moment to moment (S2 4.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Diversion", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Drawing attention one way while something is done in secret elsewhere (S2 5.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Lesson done", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The completion of the holographic program of lessons humanity is living through (S2 5.3, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "End result (of a prediction)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "What a prediction states; the path to it is kept hidden so it can't be sabotaged (S2 6.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Do-not-enter zone", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A reality whose frequency a soul out of resonance can no longer enter (S2 6.1, 6.4, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Sovereignty", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Protecting what is yours and your free will, without attacking anyone (S2 7.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Duality (of a lie)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The split created by claiming to give freely while secretly deceiving (S2 7.5, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Negative singularity", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Where repeated deception collapses: zero point on the negative side (S2 7.6, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Divine neutrality", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Zero point, where timelines collapse into the end result (S2 8.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Automatic writing", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Letting your guidance write through you (S2 8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Ascension protocol", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Consciousness's own vibrational sequence for each timeline, given to those ready (S2 9.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Ripple effect", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "How realities of similar vibration affect each other (S2 9.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Plan B", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "When a task isn't completed, consciousness creates another reality to complete it (S2 10.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Master class", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Earth as the place to learn frequency, to help other worlds later (S2 10.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Trinity of manifestation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Awareness, desire and action: 1 + 1 = 3 (S2 11.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Traces", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Leftovers of the previous hologram that still appear while you shift (S2 11.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Energetic address", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Any permission slip you tune into with emotion, to connect or channel (S2 12.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Hertz", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "One waveform per second; similar hertz gather into one particle (S2 13.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Simulated hologram", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A test reality imprinted, with your permission, to see what you do from the heart (S2 13.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Intervention", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Getting proper outside help (such as doctors) as part of going through a lesson (S2 14.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Mutation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Transforming a reality by repeating your own frequency over it again and again (S2 15.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Subtones", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The finer tones within each note; they shift, so healing frequencies must be measured per person (S2 16.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Water memory", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The teaching that water mimics and holds the stronger frequency it meets (S2 17.1, DP, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Hyper hologram", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A reality the consciousness creates by mimicking the frequency it came from (S2 18.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Boomerang", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Heart frequency given freely returns to you as abundance (S2 19.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Aura", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Your vibrational sequence projected into your field; it holds your geometry and resonance (S2 20.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "State of being", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "What you affirm in the present as \"I am\", rather than naming what you reject (S2 21.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Lust", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Attraction separated from the heart; its energy scatters across the matrix and depletes (S2 22.3, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Third structure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "What two fields create together in intimacy from the heart: 1 + 1 = 3 (S2 22.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Expectation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A hologram run on top of the manifesting hologram; its different code blocks what is coming (S2 23.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Walk-in", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A soul spark that takes over a body by agreement, when the body can hold its vibration (S2 24.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Galactic family connection", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The level beyond the 5D ascension protocol: mastery (S2 24.2, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Sub-reality", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The parallel timeline a doubt splits off (\"maybe not\"), which makes you fluctuate (S2 25.6, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "4D (transition)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The stillness between 3D and 5D where both sequences mix until the new one is permanent (S2 25.10)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Hide-and-seek", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Searching for what you know you already have (1.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "You are the structure; nobody is outside of you. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "What you send out — thought, emotion, deed — is what you get back. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Change your frequency, then hold it moment to moment. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Know it 100%; doubt and scripts of how block it. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Act, be grateful, accept any outcome. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Feel you already have everything — know it to see it. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Some things are lessons: accept them and pass with excellence. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Follow your passion — it's your higher self. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Which reality you pick is up to you. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Pull out to zero point before you choose. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "The outcome follows the emotion you hold most. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Overwrite, never reject. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Every moment is a new reality: don't carry the past. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Speak in the now, and check heart against ego. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "There is no white lie: be truthful, kindly. (3)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "The field delivers your more potent frequency, your true feeling. (3)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Your heart is your compass; don't judge. (3)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Words are frequencies: speak positively, from the heart. (3)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "A price is a condition; give from the heart and let people choose. (4)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Accept money, but never limit yourself to it. (4)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Be the abundance you want to see. (4)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Give from the heart as your currency. (5)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "A low state is a location: neutralize, then shift. (5)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Think through the structure, not the emotion. (5)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Believe humanity is changing. (5)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Let go of what you carry: forgive and start from zero. (6)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "You don't change others; you change yourself and shift. (6)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Lessons repeat until you let go 100%. (6)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Stop, transform, complete, then leave it alone. (7)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "You cannot go against creation. (7)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Never act from fear; act from the heart. (8)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Trust the heart's first impulse. (8)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Give what you have; giving doesn't require money. (9)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "It's resonance, not punishment. (9)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Heart-based exchange opens instant manifestation. (10)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Everything can change except a bylaw. (10)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Drop the details; know you have it; act; leave it open. (11)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Chasing someone reprints them; forgiveness lets them go. (11)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Neutralize into the vacuum, then project something potent. (12)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Don't judge; change comes from within, then act. (12)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Share what works; build together from the ground up. (13)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Benevolent help never overrides your consciousness. (13)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Your biggest villain could be your biggest teacher. (14)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Forgive, or the mirror keeps the loop going. (14)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Imagine the life, not the money. (15)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "No one's truth has to be yours; thank it and switch. (16)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Don't fight what you dislike; it feeds that timeline. (17)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Your vibration decides who you connect with. (18)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "The grids mirror you: you perceive exactly what you create. (19)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "To see a timeline, project its vibration. (S2 1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Challenges happen for you, not to you. (S2 1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Intention is the frequency; your words build your hologram. (S2 2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "There is no past: only the vibration you keep carrying. (S2 3)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Body and heart together are the vehicle; change them slowly. (S2 4)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Bow to no one; respect every belief. (S2 5)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "A prediction is a platform: take it as true, or not. (S2 6)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Live from the heart, and deception surfaces by itself. (S2 7)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "A prediction is the end result; who, how and when are probabilities. (S2 8)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Nobody is outside you: another person's reality is true for you only if you engage. (S2 9)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "You are never in the same situation twice; whatever you hold most becomes the outcome. (S2 10)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Awareness first, then desire, then action: you can't shift what you refuse to see. (S2 11)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "There is nothing artificial about intelligence: intention decides its use. (S2 12)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Acknowledge and thank what you feel; rejection is a frequency that comes back. (S2 13)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "You can't skip a lesson: fighting your own hologram makes it loop. (S2 14)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Project it to construct it to see it, not see it to construct it. (S2 15)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Each action makes the new hologram more potent than the last. (S2 16)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Research with logic: anyone can claim anything; sincere searching brings the answer. (S2 17)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Shine the light gently: give others time to adjust to the truth. (S2 18)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "You value yourself the most when you give freely: you give to another version of yourself. (S2 19)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Dimensions run simultaneously; you switch by embodying the frequency. (S2 20)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Name the state of being you want; naming what you reject reprints it. (S2 21)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Create with pure intention: intimacy from the heart builds a reality; lust scatters it. (S2 22, DP)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Drop the expectation: it blocks the manifestation; the least resistance lets it in. (S2 23, NT, SD)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Every switch of platform passes through the zero point; an old program left running loops. (S2 24, HR, DP)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Consciousness, body and heart shift as one unit; doubt splits a sub-reality. (S2 25, DP, HR)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Morning: give thanks for what you have; write what you love and choose the most exciting thing to act on.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "When upset: run the Pull Out method (Section 1, Fig. D); for strong negatives, the Overwrite Protocol (Section 2, Fig. I).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "When the news or others tell you what will happen: \"That's their projection.\" Give gratitude, project what you choose (2.5).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Affirm in the now: \"I am\", \"I know\", never \"I will\" (2.9).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Before saying yes: run the Truth Check (Section 3). Kind honesty, no white lies.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "After work: spend time on your passion and give something from the heart, with no condition (Section 4).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Feeling low: run Shift Your Location (Section 5): thank, neutralize, potent gratitude and action.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Learning: study in short pieces of about 15 minutes, and rewatch (5.2).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "After a hard day: gratitude for why you were there, then something you enjoy; move your body (6.7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "An old memory or belief returns: forgive, start from zero, replace it with a positive picture (6.6).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "In an argument or replay: Stop · Transform · Complete (Section 7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Before a decision: the Heart Check: heart, fear or ego? (Section 8).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Feeling flat: an uplifting film, music that gives goosebumps, or a kindness for a stranger (8.13).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Money worry: \"I have everything I need.\" Give something non-monetary today (9.1).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Old memory replaying: Layer a New You (Section 9).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Wanting something specific: Leave It Open: strip the details, \"I have everything I need\", act (Section 11).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Someone keeps causing problems: neutralize and forgive; don't go after them (11.6).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Two realities pulling at you: Through the Vacuum: neutralize, project potently, act (Section 12).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Ill or in pain: see your doctor; use Stop · Transform · Complete alongside (12.4).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Choosing music: pick what lifts you; tones carry frequencies (12.5).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "New guidance or a new health idea: check it with research and a professional before acting (13.1).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Have something useful: share it; pool small amounts with others (13.2).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Someone hurts you: Forgive and Transform (Section 14); thank them for the lesson.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Morning: list the day's tasks and plan how to lift the heavy ones (14.8).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Heavy news or teachings: thank them, don't condemn, switch the channel (Section 16).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Something you dislike in the world: don't agree, don't fight; project the positive (17.7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Before meditating or asking for guidance: feel love first, then take the first answer (Section 18).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "When something shocks you: ask \"What is this teaching me?\", look within, and act from the heart (S2 1).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Speak your hologram: mean it, say it firmly, act on it, and repeat it with the same joy (S2 2).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "When an old hurt comes back: ask \"Which reality is this?\", thank it, and stop carrying it (S2 3).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "One unit: in meditation, feel love through your whole body, as one (S2 4).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Before acting on any health claim: check it, and ask your doctor (S2 5).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Prepare calmly: if you prepare for change, do it from understanding, never from fear (S2 6).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Weekly giving: after your bills, help a few people freely each week (S2 7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Manifestation meditation: blueprint plus heart feeling; hold, drop, then act (S2 8).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Create together: raise the emotion to goosebumps at the same time, then hold it moment to moment (S2 9).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Frequency training: check yourself every 20–30 minutes and shift physically into the positive (S2 10).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Thank the traces: when the old reality shows up, give gratitude for the location, then switch to the heart (S2 11).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Play the game: when something unsettles you, make it a game, switch to joy, and ace the lesson (S2 12).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "30-minute location check: acknowledge, zero, gratitude, joy to goosebumps, action, no expectations (S2 13).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Brutally honest review: when the same situation returns, write it down, check for ego, jealousy or anger, and override it (S2 14).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Find your location: read a situation as X and Y, pull out, subside to zero, thank it, switch and hold steady (S2 15).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "5D Earth meditation: joy to goosebumps, see your 5D Earth and galactic family, increase, hold, drop; revisit nightly (S2 16).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Recall your night: on waking, write down any fragment, then sit back and let the memory return (S2 17).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "When it recurs: keep a paper trail and ask, fear or heart? Fear: rebuild from zero. Heart: let it go (S2 18).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Give freely: after the bills, set aside a day or two a week to help without a price (S2 19).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "One steady minute: hold one image with warm feeling for a full minute, in the now (S2 20).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Affirm the state of being: \"I am healthy, I am free\", felt, every half hour (S2 21).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Keep the romance: go out, talk, please each other, not only tasks (S2 22).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Back to your vibration: pull back, gratitude, leave, calm, switch; a reminder every half hour (S2 23).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Choose by excitement: write two options side by side; act on the one that excites you most (S2 24).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Catch the doubt: when \"maybe not\" appears, return to knowing it already exists (S2 25).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Watch your words: positive, from the heart (3.9).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "After a big shift (dizziness, nausea): rest, integrate, and check your body (3.7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Forgot why you came in? Recall the last room's frequency (2.7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "With difficult people: kind tone, no judgment, accept the outcome.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "When something is missing: know you have it, take action, watch for synchronicity.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "sl": "", "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Self-check: Am I doubting or scripting the how? Do my feelings match my words? Am I holding steady? Then what do I actually need right now?", "kind": "practice"}];
